e=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"334\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:250.8pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Adam Ken<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Round of Interview <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"334\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:250.8pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Screening Round<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interview Date and Time<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"334\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:250.8pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">04/29/2026 - 10:00 to 10:30 AM EST</span><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"334\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:250.8pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Microsoft Teams meeting<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Join:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/232783573537150?p=Hx119SsShvSj57cTJh\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/232783573537150?p=Hx119SsShvSj57cTJh</a><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Meeting ID:&nbsp;232 783 573 537 150<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Passcode:&nbsp;9uS7W3Da<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"334\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:250.8pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">NA<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"334\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:250.8pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The\r\n  Business Analyst for the O-EYE platform plays a critical role in building and\r\n  managing the data foundation that powers analytics, reporting, and AI-driven\r\n  insights. This role focuses on extracting, transforming, and structuring data\r\n  from diverse university systems and client environments to enable\r\n  benchmarking, decision support, and intelligent automation.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  The position sits at the intersection of data, analytics, and AI, supporting\r\n  the development of a unified intelligence layer across institutional systems.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Key\r\n  Responsibilities:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">1.\r\n  Data Acquisition &amp; Integration<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Extract and consolidate data from multiple sources including Student\r\n  Information Systems (SIS), CRM platforms, application systems, and\r\n  operational tools<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Support ingestion of data into centralized data lake or warehouse\r\n  environments<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Ensure data consistency, normalization, and traceability across sources<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Work with technical teams to streamline data pipelines and ingestion\r\n  processes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">2.\r\n  Data Preparation &amp; Modelling<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Clean, transform, and standardize raw datasets for analytical use<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Design and maintain data models aligned with reporting, benchmarking, and AI\r\n  use cases<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Develop reusable and scalable datasets for ongoing analysis and dashboards<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Ensure data integrity, governance, and documentation standards.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">3.\r\n  Analytics &amp; Insights<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Conduct exploratory data analysis to identify trends, patterns, and anomalies<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Support cross-institutional and departmental benchmarking initiatives<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Generate actionable insights to inform operational and strategic\r\n  decision-making<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Translate business questions into analytical frameworks.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">4.\r\n  Reporting &amp; Visualization<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Develop dashboards, reports, and visualizations for business and executive\r\n  stakeholders<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Present complex data in a clear, concise, and consumable format<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Enable KPI tracking, performance monitoring, and outcome measurement<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Continuously improve reporting frameworks based on stakeholder feedback.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">5.\r\n  AI Enablement<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Prepare structured and high-quality datasets for AI/ML models and LLM-based\r\n  applications<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Collaborate with AI and engineering teams on prompt engineering and data\r\n  pipelines<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Ensure data readiness and quality to support reliable AI-driven outputs<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Contribute to the evolution of O-EYE’s intelligence and automation\r\n  capabilities.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Required\r\n  Skills &amp; Qualifications:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Technical\r\n  Skills:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Strong proficiency in SQL for data extraction and manipulation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Experience with Python (pandas, NumPy, or equivalent data processing\r\n  libraries)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Familiarity with data visualization tools such as Power BI, Tableau, or\r\n  similar<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Understanding of ETL processes, data pipelines, and data lake/warehouse\r\n  architectures<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Exposure to cloud-based data environments is a plus.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Analytical\r\n  Skills:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Strong problem-solving and critical thinking abilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Ability to work with incomplete, inconsistent, or complex datasets<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  High attention to detail with a focus on data quality and accuracy<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">·\r\n  Ability to derive meaningful insights from large datasets.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Collaboration\r\n  &amp; Communication:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times 