o-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:43.85pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"288\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:216.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:43.85pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#A64D79\">&nbsp;<b>Interview\r\n  JD</b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"288\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:216.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:43.85pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\n  font-family:-apple-system;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#111111\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n  color:#111111;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">DevOps Engineer (AI Platform)<br>\r\n  </span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in;background:yellow\">DevOps Engineer (AI Platform)This role would\r\n  be more on the implementation side focusing on implementing and operating the\r\n  platform. They will handle LLM model onboarding configs, manage deployments\r\n  using Helm/ArgoCD. They will also help maintain CI/CD pipelines&nbsp;Key\r\n  skills to look for:Basic to High level understanding LLM integrationLLM\r\n  Fundamentals:LLM API familiarity (understanding tokens, TPM/RPM\r\n  limits,context windows, model versioningProgramming Python: (for Gateway\r\n  configurations, hooks, and custom callbacks)Working knowledge of\r\n  KubernetesHelm and ArgoCD / GitOps experienceDocker and CI/CD pipelinesAWS /\r\n  cloud deployment exposureYAML-based configuration management</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:#111111;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;background:yellow\"> </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:#111111;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">This role would be more on\r\n  the implementation side focusing on implementing and operating the platform.\r\n  They will handle LLM model onboarding configs, manage deployments using\r\n  Helm/ArgoCD. They will also help maintain CI/CD pipelines<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Key Skills To Look For </b>Basic to High level understanding LLM\r\n  integration<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  LLM Fundamentals:LLM API familiarity (understanding tokens, TPM/RPM limits,<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  context windows, model versioning<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Programming Python: (for Gateway configurations, hooks, and custom callbacks)<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Working knowledge of Kubernetes<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Helm and ArgoCD / GitOps experience<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Docker and CI/CD pipelines<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  AWS / cloud deployment exposure<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  YAML-based configuration management</span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:-apple-system;color:#111111\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-04-29', '21:15:00', '21:45:00', NULL, NULL, 30, '2026-04-29 13:17:23', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-160@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
