ce with insider risk or similar role\r\n  monitoring for digital risks such as abuse, fraud, intellectual property\r\n  theft.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  color:black\">·</span><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:black\">Demonstrated experience with UEBA/UBA, DLP,\r\n  EDR, and SIEM tools.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  color:black\">·</span><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:black\">Effective communication, interpersonal\r\n  skills, and ability to work with partners across the business.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  color:black\">·</span><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:black\">Self-sufficient, motivated individual with\r\n  the ability to calmly operate in high stress environment to meet goals in a\r\n  timely manner.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  color:black\">·</span><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:black\">Proficiency in Microsoft Office suite to\r\n  analyze data, collaborate with peers, and communicate findings.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Base Pay Range: $90,400.00 - $153,700.00 Annually</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-04-29', '22:30:00', '23:30:00', NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 15:22:05', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-166@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
