amily:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;Zoom</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:211.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview&nbsp;Link</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\"><a href=\"https://expedia.zoom.us/j/93620621398?pwd=NHVSp0HtaCQaF1VVOpNG6f5n7qGHVP.1\" target=\"_blank\">https://expedia.zoom.us/j/93620621398?pwd=NHVSp0HtaCQaF1VVOpNG6f5n7qGHVP.1</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:211.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview&nbsp;JD</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:-apple-system;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Expedia Group brands power\r\n  global travel for everyone, everywhere. We design cutting-edge tech to make\r\n  travel smoother and more memorable, and we create groundbreaking solutions\r\n  for our partners. Our diverse, vibrant, and welcoming community is essential\r\n  in driving our success.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Why Join Us? </b>To shape the future of travel, people must come first.\r\n  Guided by our Values and Leadership Agreements, we foster an open culture\r\n  where everyone belongs, differences are celebrated and know that when one of\r\n  us wins, we all win.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We provide a full benefits package, including exciting travel perks, generous\r\n  time-off, parental leave, a flexible work model (with some pretty cool\r\n  offices), and career development resources, all to fuel our employees\'\r\n  passion for travel and ensure a rewarding career journey. We’re building a\r\n  more open world. Join us.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Introduction to Team </b>Our Technology Team partners with teams across\r\n  Expedia Group to create innovative products, services, and tools to deliver\r\n  high-quality experiences for travelers, partners, and our employees. A\r\n  singular technology platform powered by data and machine learning provides\r\n  secure, differentiated, and personalized experiences that drive loyalty and\r\n  traveler satisfaction.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  This iOS Engineer III role is part of the Package Shopping team which sits\r\n  within our Technology division. Package Shopping owns the packages (flight +\r\n  hotel + other) shopping flows and pricing logic that unlock higher-value,\r\n  higher-margin bundled trips across our brands and B2B partners. As an iOS\r\n  Engineer II, you will build and enhance native mobile experiences that make\r\n  it easier for travelers to discover, compare, and book these bundled trips,\r\n  directly improving package conversion and overall trip value.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>In This Role, You Will </b></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:-apple-system\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Design, build, and\r\n  maintain iOS application features and components that are reliable,\r\n  performant, and aligned with product and customer needs.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Implement clean, testable\r\n  Swift code, including system design (LLD), API integration patterns, and data\r\n  modeling to support scalable mobile experiences.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Collaborate with\r\n  cross-functional partners to decompose problems, define technical approaches,\r\n  and deliver high-quality solutions across multiple product areas or domains.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Diagnose and resolve\r\n  complex issues in iOS applications, improving stability, performance,\r\n  observability, and overall operational excellence.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Safely integrate and\r\n  operate AI/ML‑enabled solutions that improve outcomes, including features\r\n  powered by recommendations, personalization, or intelligent automation.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Demonstrate familiarity\r\n  with AI-driven systems, tools, or workflows and applying AI/ML concepts to\r\n  real world products, using them to enhance iOS user experiences where\r\n  appropriate. <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Minimum Qualifications </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:-apple-system;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New 