e=\"width: 262.7pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 18.5pt;\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"349\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 261.9pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 18.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:18.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"350\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 262.7pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 18.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Infosys , India</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"349\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 261.9pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 18.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">May 2020 – Jun 2023</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">________________________________________________________________________________<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"1\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</span></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">About the job<br>\r\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><br>\r\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\ncolor:#424242;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Essential Functions </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:#424242;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">As defined under the Americans with Disabilities Act,\r\nthis classification may include any of the following tasks, knowledge, skills,\r\nand other characteristics. This list is ILLUSTRATIVE ONLY and is not a\r\ncomprehensive listing of all functions and tasks performed by incumbents of\r\nthis class. Work assignments may vary depending on the department’s need and\r\nwill be communicated to the applicant or incumbent by the supervisor.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Examines,\r\n     screens and reviews plans and specifications for complex residential and\r\n     simple commercial construction, alteration, repair, demolition, moving or\r\n     proposed new uses of primary and/or appurtenant structures for compliance\r\n     with County building codes and related codes, laws, ordinances and\r\n     statutes;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Determines\r\n     code compliance of proposed residential structures relative to building\r\n     use and occupancy, fire protection and safety from permit applications,\r\n     plans and specifications;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Performs\r\n     analysis of permit applications, plans and specifications for such factors\r\n     as lighting, ventilation and living space;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assists\r\n     consulting engineers, architects, owners and contractors in the\r\n     interpretation of provisions of the County building and related codes,\r\n     laws, ordinances and statutes;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Reads,\r\n     interprets and applies applicable provisions of codes, laws, ordinances\r\n     and statutes;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Prepares\r\n     and maintains manual and computer-based files of materials reviewed and\r\n     related materials;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assists\r\n     the public by explaining the construction permitting and plans review\r\n     processes;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assists\r\n     other staff and subordinates by interpretation of the applicable codes,\r\n     laws, ordinances and statutes;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Identifies\r\n     discrepancies or potential conflicts in applicable codes, laws, ordinances\r\n     and statutes for supervisory or managerial attention and decision;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Prepares\r\n     routine, recurring and special reports for management;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">May\r\n     supervise, train and evaluate staff, make effective recommendations on\r\n     hiring, termination and related personnel activities;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">May\r\n     perform remote inspections as needed. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\ncolor:#424242;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><br>\r\n<b>Minimum Qualifications Four years of experience as a contractor, engineer,\r\narchitect, or as a superintendent, foreman, or competent mechanic in charge of\r\nconstruction, construction plan reviewer or construction project manager.\r\n(Relevant experience and/or education from an accredited college or university\r\nmay be substituted.) Or One year of experience with Pima County as a Building\r\nTrades Plans Technician. or closely related position as determined by the\r\ndepartment head at the time of recruitment. Qualifying education and experience\r\nmust be clearly documented in the \"Education\" and \"Work\r\nExperience\" sections of the application. Do not substitute a resume for\r\nyour application or write \"see resume\" on your application. Preferred\r\nQualifications: (Be specific in describing your experience in your application.\r\nEnsure the descriptions provided illustrate your competencies, specifically\r\naddressing the required and preferred qualifications.): </b></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ICC\r\n     certification as a combination residential plans examiner or related\r\n     certification(s).</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n     with the application of building codes.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n     with structural engineering principles to include load paths.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n     with Microsoft Office.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#424242;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n     with GIS and inspection software.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#424242;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with\r\n     zoning/grading regulations</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-04-29', '00:30:00', '01:00:00', '2026-04-29 23:00:00', '2026-04-29 23:30:00', 30, '2026-04-29 19:08:31', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-171@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
