(173, 5, 55, 4, 1, 4, 'FW: Interview Support - 2nd Round - Jyothi Swaroop Illipilli - ML Quality Assurance Engineer - 04/30/2026 - 11:00 AM to 11:45 AM EST - DERQ', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear Team, <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">One of our candidates, </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Jyothi Swaroop Illipilli- </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">AI/ML Engineer</span></b><span style=\"color:black\">, managed to secure the interview with </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">DERQ</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"> f</span><span style=\"color:black\">or the post of </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">ML Quality Assurance Engineer</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">.</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><br>\r\ncandidate and Interview detail along with the resume used in the applications,\r\nare attached. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"><br>\r\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">This Interview is\r\nreceived in candidate’s personal Email ID.</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o