ss=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The\r\nactual location of this job is in Vacaville, CA. Relocation assistance is\r\navailable for eligible candidates and their families, if needed.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Today,\r\nLonza is a global leader in life sciences operating across five continents.\r\nWhile we work in science, there’s no magic formula to how we do it. Our\r\ngreatest scientific solution is talented people working together, devising\r\nideas that help businesses to help people. In exchange, we let our people own\r\ntheir careers. Their ideas, big and small, genuinely improve the world. And\r\nthat’s the kind of work we want to be part of.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The\r\nFinancial Business Analyst plays a pivotal role in maintaining the&nbsp;\r\nintegrity&nbsp; of&nbsp; financial&nbsp; customer&nbsp; program&nbsp;\r\ndata&nbsp; within&nbsp; our&nbsp; integrated&nbsp; program management,&nbsp;\r\nsupply&nbsp; chain,&nbsp; and&nbsp; finance&nbsp; systems&nbsp;\r\nthroughout&nbsp; the&nbsp; Sales&nbsp; and Operations (S&amp;OP) cycles. They\r\nleverage their expertise in IT systems such as SAP, IBP, Business Warehouse\r\n(BW), Planview (PV), and Power BI (PBI), along with an understanding of\r\nS&amp;OP processes and agile stakeholder management, to identify and resolve\r\ndata integrity issues. With an operational excellence mindset, they actively\r\ncontribute to the improvement of PM-related processes and systems, rolling out\r\nglobal changes, supporting&nbsp; training&nbsp; and&nbsp; deployment&nbsp;\r\nof&nbsp; global&nbsp; tools&nbsp; and&nbsp; implementing&nbsp; local solutions\r\nas required. As&nbsp; an&nbsp; extended&nbsp; member&nbsp; of&nbsp; the&nbsp;\r\nPM&nbsp; management&nbsp; team,&nbsp; the&nbsp; Financial Business&nbsp;\r\nAnalyst identifies&nbsp; and&nbsp; communicates&nbsp; necessary&nbsp; actions&nbsp;\r\nto&nbsp; drive&nbsp; completeness&nbsp; and accuracy&nbsp; of&nbsp; data,&nbsp;\r\nboth&nbsp; within&nbsp; the&nbsp; PM&nbsp; team&nbsp; and&nbsp; across&nbsp;\r\nother&nbsp; departments&nbsp; for escalation.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">What you will get:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The\r\nfull-time base annual salary for this position is expected to range\r\nbetween&nbsp; $101,000 to $161,000. In addition, below you will find a\r\ncomprehensive summary of the benefits package we offer:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Performance-related bonus</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Medical, dental and vision\r\ninsurance</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">401(k) matching plan</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Life insurance, as well as\r\nshort-term and long-term disability insurance</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Employee assistance programs</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Paid Time Off</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">What you will do:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Deliver monthly S&amp;OP standard\r\nwork including revenue predictions, snapshot locks, and deferred analysis with\r\nmeticulous attention to detail in SAP and Planview.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Align with Finance to ensure\r\nprecise revenue recognition and adherence to both financial regulations and\r\ncontractual obligations.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Collaborate with Project Managers\r\nto ensure program financial data is accurately recorded and serve as the main\r\npoint of contact for financial audits.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Facilitate proactive site\r\nprofitability meetings and drive data-driven corrections to ensure the accuracy\r\nof financial planning and target setting.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Coordinate with Global Billing to\r\noptimize WBS master data and invoicing precision, focusing on eliminating data\r\ninaccuracies through system-led interfaces.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Lead the adoption of globally\r\nstandardized tools and processes through personal application, training, and\r\ncoaching of the PM organization.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Support the PMO by trending errors\r\nand identifying high-precision, data-driven solutions to improve the delivery\r\nof standard work.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">What we are looking for:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s degree in Life Sciences,\r\nFinance or Business.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Power BI strongly preferred for\r\ntranslating complex data into clear, actionable business insights and relevant\r\nKPIs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Expert in SAP and Excel, with\r\nadditional experience in Planview to ensure high-quality data integrity for\r\nexecutive decision-making.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Exceptional attention to detail and\r\nan analytical mindset capable of navigating ambiguity to drive precise process\r\nimprovements.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong business acumen used to\r\ninterpret profitability drivers and translate strategic data needs into\r\nachievable objectives.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Skilled facilitator who effectively\r\nresolves conflict and clears roadblocks while managing the multiple demands of\r\ndata integrity.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Results-oriented professional with\r\nclear communication skills to translate technical data and monitor progress\r\ntoward on-time delivery.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">About Lonza</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">At\r\nLonza, our people are our greatest strength. With 30+ sites across five\r\ncontinents, our globally connected teams work together every day to manufacture\r\nthe medicines of tomorrow. Our core values of Collaboration, Accountability,\r\nExcellence, Passion and Integrity reflect who we are and how we work together.\r\nEveryone’s ideas, big or small, have the potential to improve millions of\r\nlives, and that’s the kind of work we want you to be part of.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Innovation\r\nthrives when people from all backgrounds bring their unique perspectives to the\r\ntable. At Lonza, we offer equal employment opportunities to all qualified\r\napplicants regardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual\r\norientation, gender identity, age, disability, veteran status, or any other\r\ncharacteristic protected by law. If you’re ready to help turn our customers’\r\nbreakthrough ideas into viable therapies, we look forward to welcoming you on\r\nboard.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-04-30', '01:00:00', '01:30:00', '2026-04-30 08:00:00', '2026-04-30 08:30:00', 30, '2026-04-30 15:50:00', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-180@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
