nd;mso-element-anchor-vertical:\r\n  paragraph;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#576871;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\">-<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"123\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:92.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\">Joining Detail<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"499\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:374.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\">Hi Rutuja Dukhande,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\">Your 30 Minute Meeting with Zaruda LLC at 04:00pm\r\n  (Eastern Time - US &amp; Canada) on Thursday, April 30, 2026 is scheduled.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\">Location:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\">This is a Microsoft Teams web conference.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\">You can join this meeting from your computer, tablet, or\r\n  smartphone.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\"><br>\r\n  <a href=\"https://calendly.com/events/e2aaac54-2f03-429e-ae67-19126a17fbb5/microsoft_teams\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">https://calendly.com/events/e2aaac54-2f03-429e-ae67-19126a17fbb5/microsoft_teams</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\">This event should automatically show up on your calendar.\r\n  If needed, you can still add it manually:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\"><a href=\"https://calendly.com/invitees/b518cc9e-cc5e-454a-8a59-b03755ddef52/ics\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Add to Calendar</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"123\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:92.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\">Job\r\n  Description: <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"499\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:374.5pt;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">The Role<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">We need a mid-senior\r\n  .NET developer who can do two things well: build production applications\r\n  inside a highly collaborative team that mob and pair programs daily, and\r\n  bring real AI-assisted development expertise that elevates the entire team\'s\r\n  output. You won\'t just use Claude Code and GitHub Copilot — you\'ll help\r\n  establish how the team uses them for code generation, refactoring, testing,\r\n  and collaborative sessions.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">This is a hands-on\r\n  build role with a leadership dimension on AI tooling. If you\'ve already\r\n  integrated AI coding tools into your daily workflow and can show others how\r\n  to do the same, you\'ll move fast here.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">What You\'ll Do<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Build and ship web\r\n  applications using .NET / .NET Core. Participate in mob and pair programming\r\n  as a core daily practice. Drive adoption and best practices for AI coding\r\n  tools (Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, or similar) across the team. Use AI tools\r\n  to accelerate code generation, refactoring, debugging, and testing. Manage\r\n  CI/CD pipelines and work items through Azure DevOps. Design backend APIs and\r\n  integrate them with frontend and mobile layers. Deploy and maintain\r\n  applications on Azure.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">What You Need<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">5+ years of full stack\r\n  development with .NET / .NET Core. Hands-on experience with mob programming\r\n  and/or pair programming. Proficiency with Azure DevOps (pipelines, repos,\r\n  boards). Demonstrated, practical use of AI coding tools — Claude Code, GitHub\r\n  Copilot, or similar — in real development work, not just experimentation.\r\n  Ability to guide and mentor others on AI-assisted development workflows.\r\n  Strong collaboration skills — you\'ll be working closely and continuously with\r\n  other engineers.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">What Sets You Apart<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Experience\r\n  establishing AI-assisted development practices for a team or organization.\r\n  React experience. Android or iOS application development. A GitHub portfolio\r\n  showing real, shipped applications. Track record of improving team velocity\r\n  through tooling or process changes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Compensation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Competitive. Discussed\r\n  during the interview process.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Zaruda LLC is an equal\r\n  opportunity employer. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"123\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:92.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.25in;mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:\r\n  9.0pt;mso-element-wrap:around;mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;\r\n  mso-element-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"499\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:374.5pt;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-04-30', '01:30:00', '02:15:00', '2026-04-30 23:00:00', '2026-04-30 23:30:00', 45, '2026-04-30 16:05:56', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-183@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
