">Passcode:&nbsp;98mZ2Ud2<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Position:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;Data Engineer<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Location:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">On-site at U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service (USFWS)\r\n  offices, in Falls Church, Virginia, or Ft. Collins, Colorado<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Clearance:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Clearable (Public Trust)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Objective:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The\r\n  primary objective of this engagement is to ensure the continued enhancement,\r\n  as well as maintenance and operational support of ECOSphere, which includes\r\n  its seamless integration with other systems/applications, by leveraging the\r\n  expertise of highly qualified technical professionals. The focus is to ensure\r\n  ECOSphere remains a secure, scalable, and efficient system that serves both\r\n  internal USFWS users and the public.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:16.0pt;\r\n  margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Requirements/Skills:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with the design and implementation of&nbsp;ETL/ELT pipelines for\r\n       large-scale data ingestion<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\n       proficiency with&nbsp;Python, SQL, and Spark<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       building pipelines in&nbsp;Databricks or distributed data processing\r\n       platforms<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with the implementation,&nbsp;data validation, monitoring, and automated\r\n       pipeline orchestration<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       building and managing&nbsp;Lakehouse architectures<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with data optimization&nbsp;data storage, partitioning, and performance\r\n       for analytics workloads<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with the Integration of data from&nbsp;multiple enterprise systems and\r\n       external partners<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       in data implementation, quality frameworks, and monitoring systems<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Ability\r\n       to support&nbsp;high availability and reliability of enterprise data\r\n       pipelines<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with data modeling in complex data environments<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Candidate\r\n  Should Demonstrate:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Ability\r\n       to work in&nbsp;mission-driven scientific and regulatory environments<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       collaborating with&nbsp;biologists, analysts, and federal program staff\r\n       (helpful but not required)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Understanding\r\n       of&nbsp;data governance and interagency data sharing<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-05-01', '20:30:00', '21:00:00', '2026-05-01 01:00:00', '2026-05-01 01:45:00', 30, '2026-05-01 14:13:53', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-185@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
