family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">What do you know about&nbsp;Ally&nbsp;as a company and\r\n  what interests you about working here?&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">What makes you an effective communicator?&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Tell us more about&nbsp;Niranjan Akkanapally.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Give us your elevator pitch - walk me through your career\r\n  progression&nbsp;and how you got to where you are today?&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">What excites you about this role?&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Tell us about the size of the environments you have\r\n  worked in.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Walk\r\n  us through a time you deployed and configured Dynatrace from scratch in an\r\n  AWS environment. How did you set up alerting thresholds, and how did you use\r\n  it to identify and resolve a production issue that wasn\'t visible at the\r\n  infrastructure level?</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">How\r\n  have you defined and implemented SLIs and SLOs for a banking or\r\n  high-availability application? What happens when you\'re burning through your\r\n  error budget too quickly, and what steps do you take to course correct?</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Describe\r\n  how you\'ve structured Terraform modules across multiple environments like\r\n  dev, QA, and prod. How do you handle state management, and what does your\r\n  workflow look like when a change needs to go through a GitLab pipeline before\r\n  hitting production?</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Walk\r\n  us through how you handle a P1 in a live production environment. Who do you\r\n  engage, how do you communicate with stakeholders, and what does your\r\n  post-mortem process look like to prevent recurrence?</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">You\'re\r\n  brought in and told the Deposits application stack is significantly over\r\n  budget on AWS. What is your process for identifying waste, and what specific\r\n  levers — autoscaling, instance rightsizing, Spot, reserved capacity — would\r\n  you pull first and why?</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Walk\r\n  us through how you\'ve developed and tested a REST API in Java Spring Boot.\r\n  How do you structure the application, how do you validate that the API is\r\n  functioning correctly end to end, and how do you ensure it\'s production-ready\r\n  from a reliability and observability standpoint before deployment?</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Asked\r\n  about Terraform, incident management, P1s, P0s, how do you rectify issues,\r\n  handle bridge calls.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">How\r\n  do you provision infrastructure from scratch, what monitoring tools have you\r\n  worked on, what is your experience with Dynatrace, OpenTelemetry, and GitOps?</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Will\r\n  ask about Java, asked about deployments, deployment issues, working with\r\n  developers, and debugging&nbsp;yourself.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent: