ackground-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Key Accountabilities</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in;list-style-position:initial\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Expert level knowledge of sales\r\n     systems including development abilities within Salesforce.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong project management\r\n     capabilities including exceptional communication skills &amp; a bias to\r\n     urgency combined with a high level of organization.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong reporting &amp; analytics\r\n     capabilities with the ability to utilize the information to influence\r\n     decision making for the team and across the organization.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><spa