mily:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Configure and maintain\r\n  Azure API Management (APIM), including backend routing, policies, and\r\n  subscription management<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Maintain APIM configuration\r\n  for backend setup and policy updates, following established patterns and\r\n  change controls<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Support API versioning for\r\n  non-breaking changes and coordinate breaking changes that require new\r\n  versions<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Implement throttling and\r\n  rate limiting per subscription and operation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Maintain APIM API\r\n  definitions and ensure OpenAPI specifications stay in sync with deployed\r\n  endpoints<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Monitor and troubleshoot\r\n  API health and performance using Application Insights and APIM analytics<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Support external partner\r\n  onboarding by provisioning APIM subscriptions and maintaining required\r\n  mappings/records<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Maintain GitHub Actions\r\n  workflows for build/test, OpenAPI generation, and multi-environment\r\n  deployments<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Use deployment slots with\r\n  controlled production swap patterns<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Support deployments across\r\n  DEV and PROD environments by following the established release process<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Troubleshoot deployments\r\n  and improve deployment automation scripts<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\">Your special skills:</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Familiarity with\r\n  authentication/identity such as Managed Identity and common credential flows\r\n  used in Azure<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Familiarity with AI‑assisted\r\n  development tools to support coding, testing, refactoring, and documentation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Familiarity with cashing\r\n  strategies such as in-memory and Redis<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\">Prerequisites for success:</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">High School diploma\r\n  required<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Three (3) years of\r\n  experience in a modern .NET software engineering position with one (1) year\r\n  of experience building and supporting workloads on Azure Functions required<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Intermediate knowledge of\r\n  C# / .NET 8, PowerShell 7+, and JSON/YAML for configuration Intermediate\r\n  knowledge of Azure services used in production such as Functions, API\r\n  Management (APIM), Azure SQL, Key Vault, and Application Insights<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Intermediate knowledge of\r\n  Visual Studio 2026 or VS Code, Git &amp; GitHub (Actions, OIDC), Azure CLI,\r\n  Postman or similar API testing tools<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Intermediate knowledge of\r\n  SQL, including writing queries and working with stored procedures to support\r\n  API data access<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\">We saved the best for last.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><br>\r\n  In exchange for the dynamic contribution you’ll bring to our team, we offer:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Competitive salary<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Medical, dental, vision and\r\n  life insurance<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Short and long-term\r\n  disability coverage<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">401(k) plan<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">3 weeks paid time off in\r\n  your first year + paid holidays<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Discounts on braces and\r\n  clear aligners for you and your family members<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\">Why Smile Doctors?</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><br>\r\n  As the nation’s leading Orthodontic Support Organization, Smile Doctors is\r\n  shaping the future of orthodontics through strategic partnerships with top\r\n  local doctors. We provide best-in-class support services so our partner\r\n  orthodontists can focus on what they do best — driving extraordinary\r\n  treatment outcomes and providing patients with an unmatched experience.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  With hundreds of partnered practices across the nation, our synergistic\r\n  approach has made us the fastest-growing organization in our industry and\r\n  produced an ever-expanding need for top talent as we continue our\r\n  unprecedented trajectory. To us, there’s no such thing as “top of our game.”\r\n  We’re always climbing higher — together. And as our business grows, there’s\r\n  plenty of room for our team to grow their careers, too.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Our dynamic support services team is comprised of world-class professionals\r\n  whose diverse experiences drive innovation and development. Together, we are\r\n  committed to passionately helping others achieve their best, most confident\r\n  smiles.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <i>This is the perfect opportunity to grow with an expanding organization!\r\n  Apply today!</i><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\"\r\n o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" filled=\"f\"\r\n stroked=\"f\">\r\n <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\r\n <v:formulas>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\r\n </v:formulas>\r\n <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\r\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"Picture_x0020_3\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\r\n alt=\"\" style=\'width:.5pt;height:.5pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/Admin1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif\"\r\n  o:href=\"cid:image001.gif@01DCD916.94F62720\"/>\r\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img border=\"0\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAgAAAAAEC