ans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Required Qualifications:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Bachelor’s\r\n       degree or foreign equivalent required from an accredited institution.\r\n       Will also consider three years of progressive experience in the\r\n       specialty in lieu of every year of education.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Candidate\r\n       must be located within commuting distance of&nbsp;<b>Richardson, TX or\r\n       Raleigh, NC or Hartford, CT&nbsp;</b>or be willing to relocate to the\r\n       area.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">At least 4\r\n       years of experience in Information Technology<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Experience\r\n       in AI, data engineering, creating data pipelines and processing huge\r\n       volume of data.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Experience\r\n       in Machine learning engineering /MLE, data science and data engineering\r\n       with a proven track record of delivering impactful solutions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Candidates\r\n       authorized to work for any employer in the United States without\r\n       employer-based visa sponsorship are welcome to apply. Infosys is unable\r\n       to provide immigration sponsorship for this role at this time<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Preferred\r\n  Qualifications</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Good\r\n       understanding of Agile software development frameworks<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Strong\r\n       communication and Analytical skills<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Ability to\r\n       work in teams in a diverse, multi-stakeholder environment comprising of\r\n       Business and Technology teams<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Experience\r\n       and desire to work in a global delivery environment<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\"><i><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The job entails sitting as well as working at\r\n  a computer for extended periods of time. Should be able to communicate by\r\n  telephone, email or face to face. Travel may be required as per the job\r\n  requirements.</span></i><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Along with competitive pay, as a full-time Infosys employee you are also\r\n  eligible for the following benefits :-<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Medical/Dental/Vision/Life\r\n       Insurance<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Long-term/Short-term\r\n       Disability<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Health and\r\n       Dependent Care Reimbursement Accounts<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Insurance\r\n       (Accident, Critical Illness, Hospital Indemnity, Legal)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">401(k) plan\r\n       and contributions dependent on salary level<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"skipproofing\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Paid\r\n       holidays plus Paid Time Off<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">About Us</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br>\r\n  Infosys is a global leader in next-generation digital services and\r\n  consulting. We enable clients in more than 50 countries to navigate their\r\n  digital transformation. With over four decades of experience in managing the\r\n  systems and workings of global enterprises, we expertly steer our clients\r\n  through their digital journey. We do it by enabling the enterprise with an\r\n  AI-powered core that helps prioritize the execution of change. We also\r\n  empower the business with agile digital at scale to deliver unprecedented\r\n  levels of performance and customer delight. Our always-on learning agenda\r\n  drives their continuous improvement through building and transferring digital\r\n  skills, expertise, and ideas from our innovation ecosystem.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-05-01', '01:30:00', '02:30:00', '2026-05-01 20:00:00', '2026-05-01 21:00:00', 60, '2026-05-01 14:59:55', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-199@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
