pan style=\"font-size:\r\n  12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Aug 2022 - Present</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:13.1pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"380\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 285.1pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 13.1pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\"><span style=\"color:black\">IBM</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"380\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 285.1pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 13.1pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\"><span style=\"color:black\">Jul 2019 - Jul 2021</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;background:yellow;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job Description:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The Opportunity</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Adobe\r\nis looking for hands on senior engineers who have architected, developed and\r\ndeployed large scale applications. Senior engineers should demonstrate a strong\r\nfocus on customers, curiosity about new technologies, and a collaborative\r\nattitude. Person should be able to lead a technical feature, provide guidance\r\nto other engineers and able to set standards on software engineering processes.\r\nPerson would get opportunity to work on scale of Fortune 500 companies with\r\ninnovative technologies.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">What\r\nyou\'ll do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Define, drive and implement a variety of\r\nnew services and components that will enhance Adobe RTCDP and RTCDP\r\nCollaboration like service.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Mentor junior engineers and create a\r\nhighly performing team. Collaborate closely with other partners like\r\narchitecture and product management and collaborating teams to ensure\r\ntransparency at every stage of development.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Innovate and be curious. Open to\r\nintroduce new technologies and processes. Encouraging process improvements.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">What\r\nyou need to succeed</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Collaborative attitude to ensure team\r\nand product success.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Proven experience building highly\r\nperformant, sophisticated, and extendable middle tier, backend and data\r\napplications.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Hands-on expertise in Java and/or Scala.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor\'s or higher degree in Computer\r\nScience</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4