oman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Have shipped and validated production\r\nquality applications.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Clear technical communication and\r\nextensive documentation.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bonus</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience in Adobe technologies like\r\nAdobe Experience Platform</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Hands on experience on Customer Data\r\nPlatforms, Marketing platforms and CRMs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:AdobeClean-Regular;\r\ncolor:#4A4A4A;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Exposure to generative AI technologies\r\nand machine learning.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-01', '02:30:00', '03:00:00', '2026-05-01 21:00:00', '2026-05-01 21:45:00', 30, '2026-05-01 15:04:22', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-200@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(201, 13, 44, 16, 1, 4, 'FW: Interview Support - Shubh Soni - 05/01/2026 - 3:30 PM – 4:00 PM (CST)', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Please revert to this email as confirmation of receipt\r\nand acknowledgment.</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Candidate Details<br>\r\nCandidate Name:&nbsp;</b>Shubh Soni<b><br>\r\nCandidate Contact Number:&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;+1 (678) 488-7508<b><br>\r\nCandidate Whatsapp Number:&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;+1 (678) 488-7508<br>\r\n&nbsp;<br>\r\n<b>Note:</b><br>\r\n<b>Candidate Name</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; Shubh Soni<br>\r\n<b>Candidate Technology</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;Data Analyst<br>\r\n<b>Email&nbsp;</b>-&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:shubhsoni.devs@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#E3E3E3;background:#282A2C\">shubhsoni.devs@gmail.com</span></a><br>\r\n<b>Candidate Number -&nbsp;</b>&nbsp; &nbsp;+1 (678) 488-7508<br>\r\n<b>Present Location with zip code</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; Dallas, TX 76013<br>\r\n<b>Company Name</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#1F1F1F\">Acadia Pharmaceuticals Inc</span><br>\r\n<b>Interview Date &amp; Time</b>&nbsp;- Friday, May 1 • 3:30<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM – 4:00<span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM CST<br>\r\n<b>Round Of Interview</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; 5th round<br>\r\n<b>Interview Person</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;&nbsp; Cassandra Downs,&nbsp;AD, Commercial\r\nAnalytics<br>\r\nI<b>nterview Type</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp;Teams Meeting<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Meeting Link -</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MjkwMjc5MzAtOWU4NS00ZDliLWIyZjItOTI2ODE0OTFjMDJm%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22c37cad7e-5494-4cfa-9408-1c58ddb20b37%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22ec676e7a-a099-4ddb-b4d5-cbc84c48188a%22%7d\">https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MjkwMjc5MzAtOWU4NS00ZDliLWIyZjItOTI2ODE0OTFjMDJm%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22c37cad7e-5494-4cfa-9408-1c58ddb20b37%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22ec676e7a-a099-4ddb-b4d5-cbc84c48188a%22%7d</a>\r\n<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Interview JD</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">About the job<br>\r\nAbout Acadia Pharmaceuticals<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAcadia is committed to turning scientific promise into meaningful innovation\r\nthat makes the difference for underserved neurological and rare disease\r\ncommunities around the world. Our commercial portfolio includes the first and\r\nonly FDA-approved treatments for Parkinson’s disease psychosis and Rett\r\nsyndrome. We are developing the next wave of therapeutic advancements with a\r\nrobust and diverse pipeline that includes mid- to late-stage programs in\r\nAlzheimer’s disease psychosis and Lewy body dementia psychosis, along with\r\nearlier-stage programs that address other underserved patient needs. At Acadia,\r\nwe’re here to be their difference.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease note that this position can be based in San Diego, CA OR San Francisco,\r\nCA OR Princeton, NJ. Acadia\'s hybrid model requires this role to work in our\r\noffice three days per week on average.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPosition Summary<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe Sr. Analyst, Data Science transforms complex, high-volume data into\r\nactionable insights that support informed decision-making across the\r\norganization. Applying advanced statistical methods, machine learning, and\r\nrigorous analytical approaches, this role partners with product, engineering,\r\nmarketing, and operations to address high-impact business questions. The focus\r\nis on producing reliable, decision-ready analyses that connect data to\r\nmeasurable outcomes and guide strategic execution.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPrimary Responsibilities<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDesign, develop, and implement predictive models and machine learning\r\nalgorithms to solve complex business problems<br>\r\nAnalyze large, complex datasets to uncover trends, patterns, and opportunities\r\nfor optimization, including Medical Claims, Procedure, HUB, SP, SD, LTC and\r\nPrescription data sets<br>\r\nEnsure data accuracy and integrity by performing regular system audits and\r\nresolving discrepancies to maintain reliable datasets for analytics and\r\ndecision-making<br>\r\nConduct A/B tests, statistical analyses, and causal inference to evaluate\r\nbusiness initiatives and product changes<br>\r\nTranslate business needs into data requirements and collaborate with data\r\nengineering to ensure high-quality data availability<br>\r\nCommunicate data-driven insights and recommendations clearly and effectively to\r\nboth technical and non-technical stakeholders<br>\r\nDevelop dashboards and data visualizations to monitor key performance\r\nindicators (KPIs) and business health<br>\r\nStay current with industry trends, tools, and best practices in data science\r\nand analytics<br>\r\nOther responsibilities as assigned<br>\r\n<br>\r\nEducation/Experience/Skills<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBachelor’s degree in Statistics, Computer Science, Data Science, Mathematics,\r\nEconomics or a related field. Targeting 3 years of progressively responsible\r\nexperience in data science or an advanced analytics role, preferably in a\r\npharmaceutical or biotech environment. An equivalent combination of relevant\r\neducation and experience may be considered.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey Skills:<br>\r\n<br>\r\nProficiency in Python or R for data analysis and modeling<br>\r\nStrong SQL and Snowflake skills and experience working with large-scale data\r\nsystems<br>\r\nExperience with statistical modeling, machine learning, and A/B testing\r\nmethodologies<br>\r\nExcellent communication and presentation skills<br>\r\nAbility to work independently and manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced\r\nenvironment<br>\r\nExperience with cloud platforms such as AWS, GCP, or Azure<br>\r\nFamiliarity with data visualization tools like Tableau, Power BI, or Looker<br>\r\nKnowledge of modern ML frameworks (e.g., scikit-learn, XGBoost, TensorFlow)<br>\r\nBackground in a specific domain (e.g., fintech, e-commerce, healthcare) is a\r\nplus<br>\r\nAbility to manage multiple priorities and work cross-functionally in a\r\nfast-paced environment<br>\r\nMust be able and willing to travel on occasion&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-01', '02:00:00', '02:30:00', '2026-05-01 22:00:00', '2026-05-01 22:30:00', 30, '2026-05-01 15:11:47', 3500.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-201@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(202, 13, 44, 16, 1, 4, 'FW: Interview Support - Shubh Soni - 05/01/2026 - 4:00 PM – 4:30 PM (CST)', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Please revert to this email as confirmation of receipt\r\nand acknowledgment.</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Candidate Details<br>\r\nCandidate Name:&nbsp;</b>Shubh Soni<b><br>\r\nCandidate Contact Number:&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;+1 (678) 488-7508<b><br>\r\nCandidate Whatsapp Number:&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;+1 (678) 488-7508<br>\r\n&nbsp;<br>\r\n<b>Note:</b><br>\r\n<b>Candidate Name</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; Shubh Soni<br>\r\n<b>Candidate Technology</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;Data Analyst<br>\r\n<b>Email&nbsp;</b>-&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:shubhsoni.devs@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#E3E3E3;background:#282A2C\">shubhsoni.devs@gmail.com</span></a><br>\r\n<b>Candidate Number -&nbsp;</b>&nbsp; &nbsp;+1 (678) 488-7508<br>\r\n<b>Present Location with zip code</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; Dallas, TX 76013<br>\r\n<b>Company Name</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:#1F1F1F\">Acadia Pharmaceuticals Inc</span><br>\r\n<b>Interview Date &amp; Time</b>&nbsp;- Friday, May 1 • 4:00<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM – 4:30<span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM CST<br>\r\n<b>Round Of Interview</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; 6th round<br>\r\n<b>Interview Person</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; John Ridge,&nbsp;VP, CIAO<br>\r\nI<b>nterview Type</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp;Teams Meeting<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Meeting Link -</b><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_OWYwMWZmYTAtMWU0NC00YzgyLWFkMmQtNTMwZmQ0NTBlZWU2%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22c37cad7e-5494-4cfa-9408-1c58ddb20b37%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22ec676e7a-a099-4ddb-b4d5-cbc84c48188a%22%7d\">https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_OWYwMWZmYTAtMWU0NC00YzgyLWFkMmQtNTMwZmQ0NTBlZWU2%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22c37cad7e-5494-4cfa-9408-1c58ddb20b37%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22ec676e7a-a099-4ddb-b4d5-cbc84c48188a%22%7d</a>\r\n<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Interview JD</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">About the job<br>\r\nAbout Acadia Pharmaceuticals<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAcadia is committed to turning scientific promise into meaningful innovation\r\nthat makes the difference for underserved neurological and rare disease\r\ncommunities around the world. Our commercial portfolio includes the first and\r\nonly FDA-approved treatments for Parkinson’s disease psychosis and Rett\r\nsyndrome. We are developing the next wave of therapeutic advancements with a\r\nrobust and diverse pipeline that includes mid- to late-stage programs in\r\nAlzheimer’s disease psychosis and Lewy body dementia psychosis, along with\r\nearlier-stage programs that address other underserved patient needs. At Acadia,\r\nwe’re here to be their difference.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease note that this position can be based in San Diego, CA OR San Francisco,\r\nCA OR Princeton, NJ. Acadia\'s hybrid model requires this role to work in our\r\noffice three days per week on average.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPosition Summary<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe Sr. Analyst, Data Science transforms complex, high-volume data into\r\nactionable insights that support informed decision-making across the\r\norganization. Applying advanced statistical methods, machine learning, and\r\nrigorous analytical approaches, this role partners with product, engineering,\r\nmarketing, and operations to address high-impact business questions. The focus\r\nis on producing reliable, decision-ready analyses that connect data to\r\nmeasurable outcomes and guide strategic execution.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPrimary Responsibilities<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDesign, develop, and implement predictive models and machine learning\r\nalgorithms to solve complex business problems<br>\r\nAnalyze large, complex datasets to uncover trends, patterns, and opportunities\r\nfor optimization, including Medical Claims, Procedure, HUB, SP, SD, LTC and\r\nPrescription data sets<br>\r\nEnsure data accuracy and integrity by performing regular system audits and\r\nresolving discrepancies to maintain reliable datasets for analytics and\r\ndecision-making<br>\r\nConduct A/B tests, statistical analyses, and causal inference to evaluate\r\nbusiness initiatives and product changes<br>\r\nTranslate business needs into data requirements and collaborate with data\r\nengineering to ensure high-quality data availability<br>\r\nCommunicate data-driven insights and recommendations clearly and effectively to\r\nboth technical and non-technical stakeholders<br>\r\nDevelop dashboards and data visualizations to monitor key performance\r\nindicators (KPIs) and business health<br>\r\nStay current with industry trends, tools, and best practices in data science\r\nand analytics<br>\r\nOther responsibilities as assigned<br>\r\n<br>\r\nEducation/Experience/Skills<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBachelor’s degree in Statistics, Computer Science, Data Science, Mathematics,\r\nEconomics or a related field. Targeting 3 years of progressively responsible\r\nexperience in data science or an advanced analytics role, preferably in a\r\npharmaceutical or biotech environment. An equivalent combination of relevant\r\neducation and experience may be considered.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey Skills:<br>\r\n<br>\r\nProficiency in Python or R for data analysis and modeling<br>\r\nStrong SQL and Snowflake skills and experience working with large-scale data\r\nsystems<br>\r\nExperience with statistical modeling, machine learning, and A/B testing\r\nmethodologies<br>\r\nExcellent communication and presentation skills<br>\r\nAbility to work independently and manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced\r\nenvironment<br>\r\nExperience with cloud platforms such as AWS, GCP, or Azure<br>\r\nFamiliarity with data visualization tools like Tableau, Power BI, or Looker<br>\r\nKnowledge of modern ML frameworks (e.g., scikit-learn, XGBoost, TensorFlow)<br>\r\nBackground in a specific domain (e.g., fintech, e-commerce, healthcare) is a\r\nplus<br>\r\nAbility to manage multiple priorities and work cross-functionally in a\r\nfast-paced environment<br>\r\nMust be able and willing to travel on occasion&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-01', '02:30:00', '03:00:00', '2026-05-01 23:00:00', '2026-05-01 23:45:00', 30, '2026-05-01 15:12:51', 3500.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-202@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(203, 22, 78, 23, 1, 4, 'Practice Manager position - Friday, 5/1 at 3pm CT', '<div>Hi Lohith,&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>I appreciate you working with me to get this interview coordinated. Your 30 minute video interview regarding the Practice Manager position has been scheduled for Friday, 5/1 at 3pm CT and will take place via MS Teams.  &nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>You will be speaking with AJ Senff, SVP, Operations EM&nbsp; and the Director of Operations.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Please confirm that this time will work for you!&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>If you already have a Teams account, you will be asked if you want to go to the application or use the web browser to log into the meeting. PLEASE USE THE WEB BROWSER INSTEAD OF YOUR PERSONAL TEAMS ACCOUNT.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>PLEASE NOTE: Sound Physicians does not permit the use of any AI interviewing or notetaking tools during the interview process. If you have questions or concerns about this, please contact the recruiter with whom you are working prior to your interview.&nbsp; &nbsp;</div>', '2026-05-01', '01:30:00', '02:00:00', '2026-05-02 00:00:00', '2026-05-02 00:30:00', 30, '2026-05-01 15:19:52', 5000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-203@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
