\r\n    font-family:Roboto;color:#222222\"><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/yqb-qegb-sqs?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#70757A\">meet.google.com/yqb-qegb-sqs</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"4\" style=\"width:3.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"904\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:677.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:\r\n     1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 21.0pt 0in\">\r\n      <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n      color:#222222\">NA<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"4\" style=\"width:3.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"904\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:677.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About Reducto<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Reducto helps AI teams ingest real world enterprise data with state of the\r\n  art accuracy.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  The vast majority of enterprise data — from financial statements to health\r\n  records — is locked in unstructured file formats like PDFs and spreadsheets.\r\n  We train vision models to read those documents the way a human would, and\r\n  make it possible to build products, train models, and automate processes at\r\n  scale.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We’ve grown incredibly quickly, growing revenue by 8x YOY, and now work with\r\n  hundreds of companies ranging from leading AI teams (Harvey, Vanta, Scale),\r\n  through to enterprise (FAANG, top 3 trading firm).<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We\'re raised over 100M from world class investors like A16z, Benchmark, and\r\n  First Round Capital, and are hiring a Support Engineer.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We Would Love To Meet You If You<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Communicate clearly and empathetically with developers and\r\n  non-technical users.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Are excellent at systematic debugging (HTTP, JSON, auth,\r\n  retries, idempotency, webhooks).<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Are comfortable reading/writing code (Python or TypeScript\r\n  preferred) to create minimal repros.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Have strong product sense: you don\'t just fix symptoms —\r\n  you propose changes that eliminate whole classes of issues.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:20.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Thrive in\r\n  a high-ownership, early-stage environment and bias toward action.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The Core Work Will Include<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Be the front line for developers using Reducto\'s API —\r\n  triage, reproduce, and resolve issues across auth, webhooks, rate limits,\r\n  schema/field extraction, and SDKs.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Own the debugging loop end-to-end — capture great repros,\r\n  dig through logs/metrics, file crisp bug reports, and drive fixes across\r\n  Engineering.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Build durable support processes — write playbooks, macros,\r\n  and self-serve docs; instrument queues and SLAs; tighten feedback loops so\r\n  issues don\'t repeat.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Use AI to move faster — summarize long logs, cluster\r\n  similar tickets, propose replies, and draft docs; measure where AI assists\r\n  actually reduce time-to-resolution.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:20.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Champion\r\n  the developer experience — spot rough edges in our API, docs, and tooling;\r\n  partner with Engineering and Product on roadmap fixes and quality-of-life\r\n  improvements.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bonus Points If You<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Have supported API-first or developer-tooling products.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Have used observability stacks (logs/metrics/traces) and\r\n  basic SQL to investigate issues.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Have worked with AWS primitives (S3, IAM, CloudFront) or\r\n  document/OCR/LLM pipelines.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:20.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Have\r\n  experience applying LLMs to customer-support workflows (classification,\r\n  summarization, reply suggestions).<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">This is an in person role at our office in SF. We’re an\r\n  early stage company which means that the role requires working hard and\r\n  moving quickly. Please only apply if that excites you.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Benefits at Reducto<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <i>At Reducto, we’re invested in the well-being and growth of our team.\r\n  Here’s what we currently offer:</i><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if