rif;color:#555555\"><a href=\"https://oli.vi/LaySxtzs\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#555555\"><br>\r\n    Click here to join the interview by Microsoft Teams</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p style=\"line-height:18.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n    &quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#555555\">Meeting ID: 215180970954062<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p style=\"line-height:18.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n    &quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#555555\">Your meeting password: yx3uw3hc<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Accenture Flex offers\r\n  you the flexibility of local fixed-duration project-based work powered by\r\n  Accenture, a leading global professional services company. Accenture is\r\n  consistently recognized on FORTUNE\'s 100 Best Companies to Work For and\r\n  Diversity Inc\'s Top 50 Companies For Diversity lists.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">As an Accenture Flex\r\n  employee, you will apply your skills and experience to help drive business\r\n  transformation for leading organizations and communities. In addition to\r\n  delivering innovative solutions for Accenture\'s clients, you will work with a\r\n  highly skilled, diverse network of people across Accenture businesses who are\r\n  using the latest emerging technologies to address today\'s biggest business\r\n  challenges.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">You will receive\r\n  competitive rewards and access to benefits programs and world-class learning\r\n  resources. Accenture Flex employees work in their local metro area onsite at\r\n  the project, significantly reducing and/or eliminating the demands to travel.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Job Description:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">As a Data Engineer, you\r\n  will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining data solutions\r\n  that support data generation, collection, and processing. Your day-to-day\r\n  activities will include creating data pipelines, ensuring data quality, and\r\n  implementing extract, transform and load (ETL) processes to migrate and\r\n  deploy data across systems. You are expected to be a subject matter expert,\r\n  collaborate and manage the team to perform effectively, take responsibility\r\n  for team decisions, engage with multiple teams, contribute to key decisions,\r\n  and provide solutions to problems within your immediate team and across\r\n  multiple teams.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Lead the design and\r\n  optimization of scalable data pipelines to support complex data workflows.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Provide technical\r\n  guidance and support to team members to enhance overall project delivery.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Collaborate with\r\n  cross-functional teams to align data engineering solutions with business\r\n  objectives.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Analyze and troubleshoot\r\n  data processing issues to ensure high data quality and system reliability.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Contribute to the\r\n  continuous improvement of data architecture and engineering best practices.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">*Please note this is a\r\n  hybrid role which requires being onsite 3 days per week with the client in\r\n  Charlotte, NC.*<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-05-04', '23:30:00', '00:00:00', '2026-05-04 20:00:00', '2026-05-04 20:45:00', 0, '2026-05-04 14:17:56', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-208@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
