=\"540\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:405.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n  <div align=\"center\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;\r\n   mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 14.25pt 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:14.25pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n    &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Hacker Rank Url :&nbsp;</span></b><a href=\"https://hr.gs/7cb33e9\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\">https://hr.gs/7cb33e9</span></a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"543\" style=\"width:407.05pt;border-collapse:collapse;\r\n     mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-table-lspace:2.25pt;mso-table-rspace:2.25pt;\r\n     mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;\r\n     mso-table-left:left;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n 0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"540\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:405.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n  <div align=\"center\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;\r\n   mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview&nbsp;JD</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin:0in;line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#0A0A0A\">About The Position<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:15.0pt;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#0A0A0A\">Building the right\r\ntechnology foundation for Infrastructure &amp; platforms is vital to success at\r\nthe scale of Walmart. Our team builds and maintains the foundational\r\ntechnologies that support the tech organization. Included in this are data\r\nplatforms, enterprise architecture, DevOps, cloud computing, and\r\ninfrastructure. All of these products and services are supported by scalable\r\nand powerful infrastructure, ensuring a secure and seamless employee and\r\ncustomer experience across stores, digital channels, and distribution centers.\r\nWhat you\'ll do... Join Walmart Global Tech\'s Data Platform Services\r\norganization as an Edge Cloud Computing System - Software Engineer II to\r\ndevelop Edge cloud database systems that autonomously monitor, predict, and\r\nresolve issues across the world\'s largest retailer\'s technology ecosystem,\r\nimpacting millions of customers and associates globally. You\'ll lead the\r\ntransformation of traditional Database Managing/Supporting practices into\r\ncutting-edge, self-healing platforms that serve as the intelligent backbone for\r\ndatabase administration across all of Walmart\'s systems, from e-commerce to\r\nstores to supply chain. What you\'ll do: You’ll contribute to building and\r\nsupporting reliable database platforms that help power Walmart’s stores and facilities.\r\nYou’ll work with experienced engineers to implement technical solutions and\r\ntools for Walmart Technology teams across various channels and geographies.\r\nDatabase Engineering &amp; Solution Delivery: Assist in developing and\r\nmaintaining database solutions and platforms for Walmart’s technology\r\necosystem. Help implement architecture patterns for scalability,\r\nmaintainability, and performance. Support the creation of observability and\r\nmonitoring interfaces for anomaly detection and analytics. Participate in\r\nbuilding APIs for edge database solutions and integrating with operational\r\nsystems. Engineering Excellence &amp; Code Quality: Write code that is\r\nreadable, maintainable, and efficient, following team standards. Apply best\r\npractices for testing, performance optimization, and monitoring. Help develop\r\nautomation and agents using AI technologies as guided by senior engineers.\r\nTroubleshoot and resolve basic performance issues in distributed applications.\r\nAssist with CI/CD pipelines for database systems, including deployment and\r\nvalidation. Learn and adopt new technologies and frameworks as part of your\r\ngrowth. Collaboration &amp; Teamwork: Work closely with engineering partners\r\nand cross-functional teams to deliver solutions. Participate in code reviews,\r\ntechnical discussions, and documentation. Collaborate with designers and\r\nproduct managers to improve user experience. Engage in a culture of learning,\r\nasking questions, and sharing knowledge. About Walmart Global Tech Imagine\r\nworking in an environment where one line of code can make life easier for\r\nhundreds of millions of people. That’s what we do at Walmart Global Tech. We’re\r\na team of software engineers, data scientists, cybersecurity expert\'s and\r\nservice professionals within the world’s leading retailer who make an epic\r\nimpact and are at the forefront of the next retail disruption. People are why\r\nwe innovate, and people power our innovations. We are people-led and\r\ntech-empowered. We train our team in the skillsets of the future and bring in\r\nexperts like you to help us grow. We have roles for those chasing their first\r\nopportunity as well as those looking for the opportunity that will define their\r\ncareer. Here, you can kickstart a great career in tech, gain new skills and\r\nexperience for virtually every industry, or leverage your expertise to innovate\r\nat scale, impact millions and reimagine the future of retail. Walmart’s culture\r\nis a competitive advantage, and it’s fostered by being together. Working\r\ntogether in person allows us to collaborate, align quickly and innovate with\r\ngreater speed. We use our campuses to create purposeful connection rooted in\r\ndeepening understanding and investing in the development of our associates.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-04', '23:15:00', '00:00:00', '2026-05-04 17:40:08', '2026-05-04 18:14:18', 0, '2026-05-04 15:55:13', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-212@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
