ot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Join:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/262367306663621?p=kzlqz7snxflE8XRNjg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/262367306663621?p=kzlqz7snxflE8XRNjg</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Meeting ID:&nbsp;262 367 306\r\n  663 621<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Passcode:&nbsp;Zt6G2oy9<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Who Are We?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Taking care of our\r\n  customers, our communities and each other. That’s the Travelers Promise. By\r\n  honoring this commitment, we have maintained our reputation as one of the\r\n  best property casualty insurers in the industry for over 170 years. Join us\r\n  to discover a culture that is rooted in innovation and thrives on\r\n  collaboration. Imagine loving what you do and where you do it.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Compensation Overview<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">The annual base salary\r\n  range provided for this position is a nationwide market range and represents\r\n  a broad range of salaries for this role across the country. The actual salary\r\n  for this position will be determined by a number of factors, including the scope,\r\n  complexity and location of the role; the skills, education, training,\r\n  credentials and experience of the candidate; and other conditions of\r\n  employment. As part of our comprehensive compensation and benefits program,\r\n  employees are also eligible for performance-based cash incentive awards.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Salary Range<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">$109,300.00 -\r\n  $180,200.00<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Target Openings<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">1<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">What Is the Opportunity?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">As a Data Engineer I at\r\n  Travelers, you’ll contribute to how Business Insurance CMP and Specialty\r\n  pricing decisions are powered by data. Working alongside Actuarial and Data\r\n  Science partners, you’ll help turn analytical ideas into trusted,\r\n  production-grade assets that directly influence pricing outcomes across core\r\n  insurance products.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">This is not a\r\n  maintenance role. You’ll join a team that is actively modernizing its data\r\n  platforms migrating legacy processes to cloud-native architectures using AWS\r\n  Glue, Step Functions, and PySpark, and embedding MLOps practices into how\r\n  pricing models are developed and deployed. You’ll build domain expertise CMP\r\n  and Specialty while contributing to high-visibility initiatives that\r\n  strengthen data reliability, model readiness, and long-term scalability\r\n  across pricing platforms.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">The ideal candidate is\r\n  eager to grow as a data engineer, curious about the insurance domain, and\r\n  energized by cross-functional collaboration. You’ll be supported by\r\n  experienced engineers and leaders who are invested in your development. Your\r\n  contributions will directly advance Travelers’ pricing strategies in a\r\n  dynamic and evolving marketplace.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">What Will You Do?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Data Engineering &amp;\r\n  Pipeline Development<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Develop and support data pipelines for CMP and Specialty pricing use cases,\r\n  ensuring reliability and scalability across production environments<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Execute data preparation activities including exploration, cleansing, and\r\n  transformation with growing awareness of enterprise architecture, Platforms,\r\n  and downstream consumption patterns<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Translate actuarial and data science requirements into scalable,\r\n  production-ready data solutions with guidance from senior engineers<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Support data quality controls, profiling, and monitoring across the model\r\n  development lifecycle<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Model Implementation<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Support model implementation for CMP and Specialty pricing models in\r\n  partnership with Data Science and Actuarial teams<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Learn and adopt MLOps practices across the model development and\r\n  implementation lifecycle<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Domain Expertise &amp;\r\n  Collaboration<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Build CMP and Specialty data knowledge over time, growing into a subject\r\n  matter resource for benchmarks, modernization initiatives, and future\r\n  enhancements<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Contribute to project planning and execution across CMP and Specialty data\r\n  engineering initiatives<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Present analysis and contribute technical recommendations to support data\r\n  implementation decisions<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Growth &amp; Team\r\n  Contribution<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Participate in code reviews and design discussions, contributing to team\r\n  standards and best practices<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Contribute to platform modernization efforts, helping migrate legacy\r\n  processes to cloud-native architectures on AWS<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Apply agile methodologies to plan, prioritize, and deliver work across\r\n  concurrent initiatives<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">What Will Our Ideal\r\n  Candidate Have?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Bachelor’s Degree in STEM related field or equivalent.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Six years of related experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Proficient use of tools, techniques, and manipulation including Cloud\r\n  platforms, programming languages, and an understanding of software\r\n  engineering practices.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  The ability to deliver work at a steady, predictable pace to achieve\r\n  commitments, decompose work assignments into small batch releases, and\r\n  contribute to tradeoff and negotiation discussions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Demonstrated track record of domain expertise including the ability to\r\n  understand technical concepts and possess in-depth knowledge of immediate\r\n  systems worked on.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Proven problem solving skills including debugging skills, allowing you to\r\n  determine source of issues in unfamiliar code or systems and the ability to\r\n  recognize and solve repetitive problems.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Strong verbal and written communication skills with the ability to interact\r\n  with team members and business partners.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Leadership - Intermediate leadership skills with a proven track record of\r\n  self-motivation in identifying personal growth opportunities.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">What is a Must Have?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Bachelor’s degree in computer science, related STEM field, or its equivalent\r\n  in education and/or work experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  2 additional years of software/data engineering experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">What Is in It for You?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Health Insurance: Employees and their eligible family members – including\r\n  spouses, domestic partners, and children – are eligible for coverage from the\r\n  first day of employment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Retirement: Travelers matches your 401(k) contributions dollar-for-dollar up\r\n  to your first 5% of eligible pay, subject to an annual maximum. If you have\r\n  student loan debt, you can enroll in the Paying it Forward Savings Program.\r\n  When you make a payment toward your student loan, Travelers will make an\r\n  annual contribution into your 401(k) account. You are also eligible for a\r\n  Pension Plan that is 100% funded by Travelers.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Paid Time Off: Start your career at Travelers with a minimum of 20 days Paid\r\n  Time Off annually, plus nine paid company Holidays.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Wellness Program: The Travelers wellness program is comprised of tools,\r\n  discounts and resources that empower you to achieve your wellness goals and\r\n  caregiving needs. In addition, our mental health program provides access to\r\n  free professional counseling services, health coaching and other resources to\r\n  support your daily life needs.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  Volunteer Encouragement: We have a deep commitment to the communities we\r\n  serve and encourage our employees to get involved. Travelers has a Matching\r\n  Gift and Volunteer Rewards program that enables you to give back to the\r\n  charity of your choice.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Employment Practices<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Travelers is an equal\r\n  opportunity employer. We value the unique abilities and talents each\r\n  individual brings to our organization and recognize that we benefit in\r\n  numerous ways from our differences.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">In accordance with local\r\n  law, candidates seeking employment in Colorado are not required to disclose\r\n  dates of attendance at or graduation from educational institutions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">If you are a candidate\r\n  and have specific questions regarding the physical requirements of this role,\r\n  please send us an email so we may assist you.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Travelers reserves the\r\n  right to fill this position at a level above or below the level included in\r\n  this posting.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">To learn more about our\r\n  comprehensive benefit programs please visit <a href=\"http://careers.travelers.com/life-at-travelers/benefits/\">http://careers.travelers.com/life-at-travelers/benefits/</a>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-04', '01:00:00', '01:30:00', '2026-05-04 18:30:00', '2026-05-04 19:00:00', 30, '2026-05-04 15:56:25', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-213@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
