padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 88.25pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Education\r\n  Details&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"465\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 348.5pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 88.25pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">Cumberland University,\r\n  Alabama</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">MS,&nbsp;Information Science</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">Osmania University, Hyderabad</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">BS,&nbsp;Computer Science</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"275\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 206.4pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Present Company &amp; Address&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"465\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 348.5pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">Regions Bank</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"275\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 206.4pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Vendor Company &amp; Name&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"465\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 348.5pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">xAI</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:29.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"275\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 206.4pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 29.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Client Details and Location for the applied\r\n  position&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"465\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 348.5pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 29.65pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">xAI</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Total\r\nCandidate Experience&nbsp;4+&nbsp;years</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_m_-5279587616180519410m_-1285426568286734177x_x_table_0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"352\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 264.15pt; border: 1pt solid rgb(171, 171, 171); padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Regions Bank</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"389\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 291.7pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Jan 2025&nbsp;– Present</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"352\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 264.15pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color:black\">IBM</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"389\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 291.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Jan 2021&nbsp;– Dec 2023</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\"><br>\r\nJob Description</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">ABOUT xAI</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">xAI’s\r\nmission is to create AI systems that can accurately understand the universe and\r\naid humanity in its pursuit of knowledge.&nbsp;Our team is small, highly\r\nmotivated, and focused on engineering excellence. This organization is for\r\nindividuals who appreciate challenging themselves and thrive on\r\ncuriosity.&nbsp;We operate with a flat organizational structure. All employees\r\nare expected to be hands-on and to contribute directly to the company’s\r\nmission. Leadership is given to those who show initiative and consistently\r\ndeliver excellence. Work ethic and strong prioritization skills are\r\nimportant.&nbsp;All employees are expected to have strong communication skills.\r\nThey should be able to concisely and accurately share knowledge with their\r\nteammates.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">ABOUT THE ROLE:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">You\r\nwill be responsible for leading day-to-day security threat management. You will\r\nhelp identify and manage potential incidents and work with partner teams on\r\nknown or suspected security threats. You will support threat intelligence,\r\nthreat hunting, intrusion detection, and incident response efforts that adhere\r\nto, and push forward, best practices.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">RESPONSIBILITIES:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Certifications\r\nlike CISA, CRISC, CGEIT, Security+, CASP+, or similar preferred.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Drive continual improvement in\r\n     processes, procedures and automations to improve the quality and\r\n     effectiveness of the team.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Participate in a 24/7 on-call\r\n     rotation performing security incident response<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Commandeering security\r\n     incidents and updating stakeholders.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Identify and develop new\r\n     detection use cases and optimize existing detections.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Collaborate on technical\r\n     directions and solutions with other teams.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Research and analyze patterns\r\n     in security events across X’s global infrastructure.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Identify, design, and lead\r\n     threat hunting missions to quantify and reduce threats.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Manage and support the log\r\n     collection, security scanning, intrusion detection, and other\r\n     security-related systems.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Design and assist in the\r\n     development of automation to reduce false positives and handle events\r\n     automatically.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Analyze the security posture of\r\n     systems via testing and vulnerability impact analysis.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">2+ years of\r\nrelevant information security experience</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Self starter, can receive a\r\n     task and execute with minimal supervision<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong Python scripting skills\r\n     for implementing security automation<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Knowledge of networking and\r\n     macOS, Windows or Linux operating systems.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Knowledge of cloud security\r\n     fundamentals and practices (vendor agnostic).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience managing and/or\r\n     deploying security technology.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with building\r\n     queries and dashboards for security monitoring.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Knowledge of current threats\r\n     and techniques and a desire to research and learn more.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with malware\r\n     analysis, forensics or penetration testing.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Problem solving skills or\r\n     experience with troubleshooting.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">ITAR REQUIREMENTS:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">To\r\nconform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S.\r\ncitizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card\r\nholder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. §\r\n1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S.\r\nDepartment of State. Learn more about the ITAR </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#D9D9D9;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://deccs.pmddtc.state.gov/deccs\"><span style=\"color:#D9D9D9\">here</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Elastic /\r\nOpenSearch or similar platforms&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Open Source security automation\r\n     tooling<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">$180,000\r\n- $440,000 USD</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-04', '23:30:00', '00:00:00', '2026-05-04 19:30:00', '2026-05-04 20:15:00', 0, '2