k</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\"><a href=\"https://oli.vi/zMTfNmcS\" target=\"_blank\">https://oli.vi/zMTfNmcS</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:211.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview&nbsp;JD</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Are\r\n  you a passionate iOS Engineer? Do you want to work on a state-of-the-art\r\n  application with modern design, architecture and tools in a truly agile\r\n  environment? Come join our enthusiastic and talented Mobile development team!\r\n  Vanguard is heavily investing and committing to build a world-class mobile\r\n  experience for our clients, and we are hiring top talent to build our new iOS\r\n  and Android native apps. You will be joining a fun, collaborative and\r\n  inclusive cross-functional team where individuals strong on aptitude and\r\n  attitude have an opportunity to grow their professional careers through\r\n  working with some of the most advanced technology, development practices.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  This role is on the mobile team that is part of vanguard’s Discretionary\r\n  Advice platform. Discretionary Advice Platform Engineering is committed to\r\n  Vanguard’s goal to bring high-quality, affordable Advice to our clients. DAP\r\n  enables multiple advice offers including an all-digital offer for the masses\r\n  and a hybrid offer that pairs the digital experience with an Advisor for\r\n  clients who value human support. Both offers are available for Personal\r\n  Investor clients and Institutional plan participants. We are a team living\r\n  the principles of agile and lean and we seek ambitious outcomes that resonate\r\n  with clients while creating a fun and exciting work experience for our crew.\r\n  You will have the opportunity to work with the newest technology at Vanguard\r\n  and be a part of a phenomenal team that’s not afraid to experiment, pivot,\r\n  work hard, and have measurable impact on the success of our clients.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>To be successful in this role, you should have</b>:<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience with\r\n  Native application development<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.