-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Special\r\n  Factors <span style=\"color:black;background:#FFFF66\">Sponsorship</span> </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Vanguard is not offering visa </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\n  none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;background:#FFFF66\">sponsorship</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> for this position.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">About Vanguard </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">At Vanguard,\r\n  we don\'t just have a mission—we\'re on a mission.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  To work for the long-term financial wellbeing of our clients. To lead through\r\n  product and services that transform our clients\' lives. To learn and develop\r\n  our skills as individuals and as a team. From Malvern to Melbourne, our\r\n  mission drives us forward and inspires us to be our best.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">How We Work </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Vanguard has