>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:13.5pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n    font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#39394D\"><a href=\"https://hyperfine.zoom.us/j/82396895912?pwd=r5zqJP9MMS82E8cDaLk7HqqttEDRbk.1&amp;from=addon\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#39394D\">https://hyperfine.zoom.us/j/82396895912?pwd=r5zqJP9MMS82E8cDaLk7HqqttEDRbk.1&amp;from=addon</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n   <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:4;height:13.5pt\">\r\n    <td width=\"118\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:88.45pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;\r\n    height:13.5pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#39394D\">Meeting ID:</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n    &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#39394D\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:13.5pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#39394D\">823 9689 5912</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#39394D\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n   <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:13.5pt\">\r\n    <td width=\"118\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:88.45pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;\r\n    height:13.5pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#39394D\">Passcode:</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#39394D\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:13.5pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#39394D\">186282</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#39394D\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;This role is for\r\n  talented Software Engineers with applied experience in building modern cloud\r\n  services and web applications. The goal of this role is to design and develop\r\n  key software systems for remote setup, management, and monitoring of our\r\n  fleet of devices and ingestion, storage, visualization, and retrieval of data\r\n  at a large scale. This engineer will work closely with other software\r\n  engineers, product managers, UI/UX designers, and subject matter experts\r\n  across the organization to implement solutions for a wide range of\r\n  challenging clinical problems in MRI aimed at improving patient\r\n  outcomes.&nbsp; Across the organization they will make a significant\r\n  contribution to the company’s overall vision of developing cloud services\r\n  with a delightful look and feel. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Key Responsibilities:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Develop software systems\r\n  and cloud applications with focus on maintenance, extensibility, integration,\r\n  and security of data storage and retrieval. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Quickly learn new\r\n  tooling, platforms, and frameworks, when building and developing\r\n  microservices and APIs. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Adoption of new\r\n  policies, technologies, and practices, as well as the evolution of existing\r\n  methodologies. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Implement comprehensive\r\n  medical web application systems for multiple large-scale internal and\r\n  external facing projects and document the design and specifications for\r\n  internal and regulatory documentation. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Participate in the code\r\n  review process. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Collaborate with\r\n  software and cross-functional teams in design and technical reviews. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Define high-level\r\n  architecture, design and implement software solutions, assume accountability\r\n  for the deployment and release of contributed code, and support the\r\n  post-release lifecycle of our products. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Mentor and support other\r\n  engineers on the cloud team in your areas of expertise. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Maintain familiarity\r\n  with compliance standards mandated within a regulated medical device\r\n  environment. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Contribute code to a\r\n  medical device software for cloud connectivity, including OTA (Over-the-air\r\n  updates), Telemetry, User Management, MIoT (Medical Internet of Things), and\r\n  PACS (Picture Archiving and Communication System) relay.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Knowledge, Skill &amp;\r\n  Abilities:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Building modern cloud\r\n  services on AWS, GCP, or Azure. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Backend web development,\r\n  including best software engineering practices, efficient object-oriented\r\n  software design, and building modern back-end systems (Python). <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Building and developing\r\n  APIs and restful web services (Node.js, Flask/Nginx, Docker, PostgreSQL,\r\n  SQLAlchemy). <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Front-end web\r\n  development (Javascript, Typescript) and modern frameworks (React). <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Working with Product and\r\n  UI/UX designers, translating wireframes and requirements into web\r\n  applications. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Education &amp;\r\n  Experience:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Bachelor\'s degree in\r\n  Computer Science or related field and 8+ years’ of work experience; or\r\n  Masters Degree in Computer Science and 5+ years of work&nbsp; experience; or\r\n  equivalent work experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Prior experience working\r\n  in a regulated environment preferred.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-05', '21:30:00', '22:30:00', '2026-05-05 00:30:00', '2026-05-05 01:00:00', 60, '2026-05-05 14:43:43', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-219@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
