: 0in 5.4pt; height: 18.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"line-height:120%\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  11.0pt;line-height:120%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Sept\r\n  2017 – Dec 2018</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job Description</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Responsibilities\r\nand Qualifications</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Work with a cross-functional team on large\r\nscale projects. Identify potential projects risks and contingencies.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Elicit and document detailed business\r\nrequirements to support system and process changes for cross-functional\r\nprojects. Considers root cause analysis and identifies process improvement\r\nopportunities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Apply practical application and industry\r\nknowledge to decision making and strategic initiatives.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Make complete technical and business\r\nprocess recommendations including ROI, estimated time required and other\r\ndocumentation that supports the project life cycle. Serve as liaison between\r\nbusiness process experts and technology experts in order to elicit business\r\nrequirements and translate to technical teams.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Develop the test strategy and planning\r\ndocuments. Coordinate and communicate test strategy to project sponsors, and\r\nmanagement. Ability to serve as a Test Lead on complex projects and provide\r\ntest execution support as needed. Ability to write test plans and enter into\r\ndefined testing tools. Assign testing tasks as needed to project testers.\r\nMonitor activities assigned to testers and ensure testing is completed by the\r\ndue date. Review and coordinate testing with business areas. Communicate test\r\nstatus and milestones to department and project management.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Skills:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong analytical skills with the ability\r\nto analyze problems, identify root cause, determine impact, and develop\r\nbusiness solutions for system changes.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ability to act as a liaison and recommend\r\nsolutions to a variety of departments, as well as other Plans and other\r\nexternal business partners.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ability to effectively communicate in\r\nwriting and verbally with technical and non-technical audiences. Including\r\nwriting documentation such as user stories. Also includes persuasion and\r\nnegotiation skills to resolve differences with skill and understanding.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Proven ability to thrive in fast-paced\r\nenvironments, efficiently managing multiple responsibilities while maintaining\r\na flexible and adaptable approach.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Skilled in quantifying and prioritizing\r\nassigned tasks, adapting to changing priorities, and performing duties with\r\nminimal supervision.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Demonstrated ability to work both\r\nindependently, taking on initiative and collaboratively within a team.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong stakeholder engagement and\r\nrelationship management skills.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Proven ability working with or leveraging\r\nAI-related tools and/or solutions.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Knowledge:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Knowledge of the health care industry and\r\ncorporate structure. Includes knowledge of standards, policies, and business\r\npractices and procedures for multiple departments/systems. Is familiar with\r\nthose business services, systems and/or processes provided by external business\r\npartners.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Knowledge of data processing terminology\r\nand concepts. Includes a high-level technical understanding of technology tools\r\nused to support business requirements gathering and testing.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC).</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">5 plus years experience in Business\r\nAnalyst or Business Systems Analyst role in relevant industry experience or\r\nwork in a similar field.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">5 plus years experience working within\r\nAgile project environments</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience working with Capital core\r\nsystems or an integrated business systems that handles claims processing,\r\nmembership, billing, network, clinical, customer service, and product\r\nprocesses.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Education and Certifications:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Prefer a Bachelor\'s Degree in one of the\r\nfollowing; business administration, health planning and administration,\r\ninformation systems, computer science.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Agile-related certification a plus</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Project management experience or PMP a\r\nplus.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Physical Demands:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">While performing the duties of the job,\r\nthe employee is frequently required to sit, use hands and fingers, talk, hear,\r\nand see. The employee must be able to work over 40 hours per week. The employee\r\nmust occasionally lift and/or move up to 5 pounds</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-05', '00:45:00', '01:15:00', '2026-05-06 19:43:28', '2026-05-06 19:44:24', 30, '2026-05-05 15:02:09', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-225@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
