N\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<b>Total&nbsp;Candidate&nbsp;Experience\r\n4+ years</b></span></u><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5pt; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_table_1\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:249.3pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  color:black\">The Home Depot</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:249.3pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\">Jan 2025 –\r\n  Present</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:249.3pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  color:black\">Accenture &nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:249.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\">Jan 2021 - Dec\r\n  2023 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About\r\nthe job</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About Cymbiotika:</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">At\r\nCymbiotika, we believe that wellness starts with trust. That’s why we’re\r\ncommitted to creating supplements that are not only effective but also\r\ntransparent. From the moment you pick up one of our products, you’ll know\r\nexactly what’s inside—no hidden ingredients, no confusing labels. We take pride\r\nin using only the highest-quality ingredients, carefully sourced and backed by\r\nscience, to ensure you’re getting the best of nature and innovation in every\r\nsupplement.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">We\r\nunderstand that health is personal, which is why our supplements are designed\r\nto work with your body, not against it. By focusing on bioavailability and\r\nusing advanced liposomal delivery systems, we ensure that your body can absorb\r\nand use the nutrients to their fullest potential. Our goal is simple: to help\r\nyou feel your best, with products you can trust, made with ingredients you feel\r\ngood about.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">With\r\nCymbiotika, you’re not just taking a supplement—you’re joining a community of\r\npeople who value wellness, science, and the power of transparency. We’re here\r\nto empower you on your journey to better health, every step of the way.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\npadding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Role Summary</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Cymbiotika\r\nis scaling rapidly across DTC, subscription, and retail channels — and we’re\r\nbuilding a modern analytics foundation to match. We’re hiring a<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>Data Analyst</strong><span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span>who\r\ncan bridge<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>growth marketing</strong>,<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>data engineering</strong>, and<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>automation</strong>. This role is for\r\nsomeone who can<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>write scripts</strong>,<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>pull data via APIs</strong>,<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>build automated pipelines</strong><span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span>and<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>translate\r\ninsights into revenue‑driving decisions</strong>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">You\r\nwill be a core contributor to Cymbiotika’s<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>single source of\r\ntruth</strong>, powering PLTV modeling, promo performance, subscription\r\nanalytics, and real‑time reporting. If you love marketing data but also love\r\nbuilding the systems behind it, this is the role.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\npadding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\npadding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Key Responsibilities</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\npadding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">1. Build Cymbiotika’s Marketing Data\r\nInfrastructure</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Develop\r\nautomated API pipelines for Meta, Google Ads, TikTok, Klaviyo, Shopify, GA4 and\r\nsubscription platforms.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Write\r\nPython or Node scripts to ingest, normalize and join marketing + transactional\r\ndata.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Support\r\nthe buildout of Cymbiotika’s<span class=\"x18a316a5\"> </span><strong>North Star KPI\r\nframework</strong>, ensuring consistent definitions across teams.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Partner\r\nwith Engineering to evolve our data warehouse and schema design.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p