iption propensity, SKU sensitivity,\r\nmonth cohorts).</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Build\r\ndashboards for CAC, ROAS, retention, churn, and promo performance.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\npadding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">3. Automation &amp; Operational Efficiency</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-l