\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\">Video Conferencing\r\n  Link:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://morganstanley.zoom.us/j/91598478568?pwd=5lGqF6OIjPcoHzxR7mEbmXEnRt5gO1.1&amp;from=addon\" target=\"_blank\">https://morganstanley.zoom.us/j/91598478568?pwd=5lGqF6OIjPcoHzxR7mEbmXEnRt5gO1.1&amp;from=addon</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Company Profile</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Morgan Stanley is a leading global financial services firm\r\n  providing a wide range of investment banking, securities, investment\r\n  management and wealth management services. The Firm\'s employees serve clients\r\n  worldwide including corporations, governments, and individuals from more than\r\n  1,200 offices in 41 countries.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">As a market leader, the talent and passion of our people is\r\n  critical to our success. Together, we share a common set of values rooted in\r\n  integrity, excellence, and dedicated team ethic. Morgan Stanley can provide a\r\n  superior foundation for building a professional career - a place for people\r\n  to learn, to achieve and grow. A philosophy that balances personal\r\n  lifestyles, perspectives, and needs is an important part of our culture.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Department Profile</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">The mission of the Cyber Data Risk and Resilience division is\r\n  to ensure the Firm manages its global businesses and serves clients on a\r\n  market-leading technology platform that is resilient, safe, efficient, smart,\r\n  fast, and flexible.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">The Cyber Incident Response Team (CIRT) is part of the Cyber\r\n  Data Risk and Resilience division and manages the incident response\r\n  capability to support day-to-day cross-enterprise event investigations and\r\n  strategic input into security controls and countermeasures to proactively\r\n  create better security for the Firm. The group\'s vision is to deliver\r\n  programs that protect and enable the business, ensure secure delivery of\r\n  services to clients, adjust to address the risks presented by an evolving\r\n  threat landscape, and meet regulatory expectations.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Team Profile</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Morgan Stanley is seeking a Senior Cyber Automation Engineer\r\n  to join the Firm\'s Cyber Incident Response Team (CIRT). Global CIRT is a 24/7\r\n  operation with members in key geographical locations performing incident\r\n  response and remediation, campaign assessments, network and host-based\r\n  forensics.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">What You will do in the role:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Develop, implement, and\r\n       maintain automated playbooks and workflows in the SOAR platform to\r\n       streamline SOC operations.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Integrate the SOAR with\r\n       various security tools (SIEM, EDR, Email, etc.) using APIs and custom\r\n       connectors.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Automate incident triage,\r\n       investigation, and response processes to reduce manual effort and\r\n       improve response times.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Collaborate with analysts and\r\n       leadership to identify automation opportunities and optimize security\r\n       operations.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Maintain up-to-date knowledge\r\n       of the threat landscape, security technologies and best practices.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Build, tune, and maintain SOC\r\n       detections within the SIEM, leveraging scripting and automation to\r\n       ensure accurate and efficient threat detection.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Document automation\r\n       processes, playbooks, and integrations for knowledge sharing and\r\n       compliance.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">What You will bring to the role:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Candidates should have a genuine interest in cyber security\r\n  and a good understanding of the tactics, techniques, and procedures of\r\n  attackers. This role requires a detail-oriented critical thinker who can\r\n  anticipate issues and solve problems.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">3+ years of experience in\r\n       developing, implementing, and maintaining automated workflows, and\r\n       playbooks with SOAR platforms.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Advanced proficiency in\r\n       scripting languages such as Python, PowerShell, and Bash for security\r\n       automation and integration.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience integrating SOAR\r\n       platforms with various security tools (SIEM, EDR, etc.) using APIs and\r\n       custom connectors.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Ability to design, document\r\n       and optimize automated processes and playbooks for SOC workflow.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong understanding of\r\n       security operations concepts, triage and investigation, including event\r\n       management, log collection, and workflow orchestration.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Excellent written and verbal\r\n       communication skills for documenting automation processes and\r\n       collaborating with SOC team members.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience working in a\r\n       collaborative environment to identify automation opportunities and\r\n       implement solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Hands-on experience building,\r\n       tuning, and maintaining SOC detections within SIEM platforms.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Desired skills:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Hands-on experience with SOAR\r\n       platform administration and customization (e.g., developing custom\r\n       integrations, connectors, and modules)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Familiarity with SIEM\r\n       technologies, especially in relation to automation and orchestration.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Possesses knowledge or\r\n       experience as a member of a cyber security team, enabling the\r\n       identification of key focus areas.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience with security\r\n       product assessments and automation of product evaluation workflows.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience working with LLM\r\n       models.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Industry certifications\r\n       related to automation, scripting, or SOAR platforms (e.g., GCIH, GNFA,\r\n       GREM, or similar).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM MORGAN STANLEY:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">At Morgan Stanley, we raise, manage and allocate capital for\r\n  our clients – helping them reach their goals. We do it in a way that’s\r\n  differentiated – and we’ve done that for 90 years. &nbsp;Our values - putting\r\n  clients first, doing the right thing, leading with exceptional ideas,\r\n  committing to diversity and inclusion, and giving back - aren’t just beliefs,\r\n  they guide the decisions we make every day to do what\'s best for our clients,\r\n  communities and more than 80,000 employees in 1,200 offices across 42 countries.\r\n  At Morgan Stanley, you’ll find an opportunity to work alongside the best and\r\n  the brightest, in an environment where you are supported and empowered. Our\r\n  teams are relentless collaborators and creative thinkers, fueled by their\r\n  diverse backgrounds and experiences. We are proud to support our employees\r\n  and their families at every point along their work-life journey, offering\r\n  some of the most attractive and comprehensive employee benefits and perks in\r\n  the industry. There’s also ample opportunity to move about the business for\r\n  those who show passion and grit in their work.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">To learn more about our offices across the globe, please copy\r\n  and paste <a href=\"https://www.morganstanley.com/about-us/global-offices\">https://www.morganstanley.com/about-us/global-offices</a>​\r\n  into your browser.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Salary range for the position $65000 to $125,000 per year. The\r\n  successful candidate may be eligible for an annual discretionary incentive\r\n  compensation award. The successful candidate may be eligible to participate\r\n  in the relevant business unit’s incentive compensation plan, which also may\r\n  include a discretionary bonus component. Morgan Stanley offers a full\r\n  spectrum of benefits, including Medical, Prescription Drug, Dental, Vision,\r\n  Health Savings Account, Dependent Day Care Savings Account, Life Insurance, Disability\r\n  and Other Insurance Plans, Paid Time Off (including Sick Leave consistent\r\n  with state and local law, Parental Leave and X Vacation Days annually), 10\r\n  Paid Holidays, 401(k), and Short/Long Term Disability, in addition to other\r\n  special perks reserved for our employees. Please visit\r\n  mybenefits.morganstanley.com to learn more about our benefit offerings.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Morgan Stanley is an equal opportunity employer committed to\r\n  building and maintaining a workforce that is diverse in experience and\r\n  background.&nbsp; Our recruiting efforts reflect our strong commitment to a\r\n  culture of inclusion, where individuals are hired, developed, and advanced\r\n  based on their skills and talents.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Our workforce reflects a broad cross-section of the global\r\n  communities in which we operate, bringing a variety of backgrounds, talents,\r\n  perspectives, and experiences.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-06', '20:00:00', '20:30:00', '2026-05-06 02:00:00', '2026-05-06 02:45:00', 30, '2026-05-06 14:00:51', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-229@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
