<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_ZTY3NzBiMTQtOWU0ZC00MWI5LTkzNDYtNmYxODFiMTM2Y2U1%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2263ce7d59-2f3e-42cd-a8cc-be764cff5eb6%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%2247f23e01-31dc-4693-b3fc-83728919ecb4%22%7d\" target=\"_blank\">https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_ZTY3NzBiMTQtOWU0ZC00MWI5LTkzNDYtNmYxODFiMTM2Y2U1%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2263ce7d59-2f3e-42cd-a8cc-be764cff5eb6%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%2247f23e01-31dc-4693-b3fc-83728919ecb4%22%7d</a></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;</span></i></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td width=\"16\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:11.8pt;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n    background:#D9E2F3;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:123.2pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td width=\"260\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:195.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n    none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n    background:#D9E2F3;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:123.2pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">Use your\r\n    microphone and speakers (VoIP)– a headset is recommended.&nbsp; Or, call in\r\n    using your telephone.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">Dial in\r\n    number:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">NA<b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">Access\r\n    Code:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">NA</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Job\r\n  description<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Job\r\n  details<br>\r\n  Job Role<br>\r\n  Technology Lead - US<br>\r\n  Work Location<br>\r\n  Hartford, CT<br>\r\n  State / Region / Province<br>\r\n  Connecticut<br>\r\n  Country<br>\r\n  USA<br>\r\n  Skills<br>\r\n  Technology|Artificial Intelligence|Artificial Intelligence - ALL,\r\n  Technology|DevOps|Continuous integration - Java<br>\r\n  Domain<br>\r\n  Delivery<br>\r\n  Interest Group<br>\r\n  Infosys Limited<br>\r\n  Company<br>\r\n  ITL USA<br>\r\n  Requisition ID<br>\r\n  145886BR<br>\r\n  <b>Infosys Limited is seeking an API Developer with AI /ML. </b>In this role,\r\n  you will enable digital transformation for our clients in a global delivery\r\n  model, research on technologies independently, recommend appropriate\r\n  solutions and contribute to technology-specific best practices and standards.\r\n  You will provide inputs for identifying best-fit architectural solutions for\r\n  one or more projects; develop design of applications, provide regular support\r\n  and guidance to project teams on complex coding and issue resolution with the\r\n  objective of ensuring best-fit and high-quality technical solutions within\r\n  the area of technology specialization and in compliance with guidelines,\r\n  policies and norms of Infosys. You will be part of a learning culture, where\r\n  teamwork and collaboration are encouraged, excellence is rewarded, and\r\n  diversity is respected and valued.<br>\r\n  <b>Key Responsibilities</b><br>\r\n  • Design and implement GenAI solution architectures using enterprise approved\r\n  LLMs and cloud platforms.<br>\r\n  • Support use cases such as document processing, summarization, Q&amp;A,\r\n  copilots, and workflow augmentation.<br>\r\n  • Define reference architectures for GenAI components (LLMs, vector stores,\r\n  APIs, orchestration layers).<br>\r\n  • Collaborate with engineers to integrate GenAI services into existing\r\n  applications and data platforms.<br>\r\n  • Assist with prompt engineering, evaluation, and optimization for\r\n  reliability and performance.<br>\r\n  • Provide technical guidance during PoCs and early production deployments.<br>\r\n  • Document architecture decisions, patterns, and implementation guidance.<br>\r\n  <b>Required Qualifications</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Candidate\r\n       must be located within commuting distance of any of mentioned locations\r\n       i.e., <b>Hartford, CT or Raleigh, NC</b> or be willing to relocate to\r\n       the area. This position may require travel in USA.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor\'s\r\n       degree or foreign equivalent required from an accredited institution.\r\n       Will also consider three years of progressive experience in the\r\n       specialty in lieu of every year of education.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">At\r\n       least 4 years of experience in Information Technology.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       in software, data, or cloud architecture roles.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Hands\r\n       on experience with Generative AI based solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Working\r\n       knowledge of REST APIs, cloud services, and modern application\r\n       architectures.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       collaborating with engineering and product teams.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\n       communication skills with the ability to explain AI concepts to non\r\n       technical stakeholders<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Candidates\r\n       authorized to work for any employer in the United States without\r\n       employer-based visa sponsorship are welcome to apply. Infosys is unable\r\n       to provide immigration sponsorship for this role at this time<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Preferred\r\n  Qualifications </span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" s