,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">We’re on a mission to make financial services better for every\r\n  Canadian. That means no hidden fees, no predatory interest rates - just\r\n  financial products designed to help our users spend smart, save more, and\r\n  build real wealth. We’re a performance organization with a strong heart: we\r\n  care deeply about outcomes, and everything ties back to our mission - to\r\n  financially empower a generation of Canadians.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  At KOHO, we’re not your average 9-5. We believe real impact comes from people\r\n  who are trusted, empowered, and supported to do their best work - without\r\n  sacrificing their lives to do it. We prioritize work-life integration, not\r\n  just work-life balance. That means asynchronous collaboration, flexible\r\n  hours, and a remote-first setup built around autonomy and high trust.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  KOHO is entering its next chapter - leaner, smarter, more AI-integrated.\r\n  We’re building for impact, not bureaucracy. If you thrive in environments\r\n  that value clarity, ownership, and bold thinking, you’ll fit right in.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>About The Role<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </b>We are seeking a skilled <b>Data Engineer II</b> to join our Data\r\n  Platform team. In this role, you will be responsible for building,\r\n  maintaining, and optimizing the data infrastructure that powers KOHO’s\r\n  analytics, data science, and product features.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Reporting to the Data Platform Development&nbsp;Manager, you will be part of\r\n  a team that maintains and expands KOHO\'s data engineering platform.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  What You’ll Be Doing</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Practicing\r\n       the KOHO values</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Gathering\r\n       requirements for, and implementing streaming and batch pipelines</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Developing\r\n       and maintaining of batch data pipelines using AWS Glue, Lambda, and\r\n       Python</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Collaborating\r\n       with business users, Data Analyst, and Data Scientists in questions\r\n       related to our data platform</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Implementing\r\n       shared infrastructure used by all services and teams within the KOHO\r\n       platform</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Contributing\r\n       to and improving our internal standards for style, maintainability, and\r\n       best practices</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:12.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Participating\r\n       in rotating on-call duties, including incident management</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"msonormaltable0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Who\r\n  You Are</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Someone\r\n       who has 2-5 years of professional&nbsp;experience&nbsp;working with\r\n       data, or relevant internship/co-op&nbsp;experience, as well as:</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"circle\">\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong\r\n        proficiency in Python and SQL</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Hands-on\r\n        with at least two AWS services (S3, Glue, Lambda, or Redshift)</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience&nbsp;with\r\n        Infrastructure as Code tools, specifically Terraform.</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience&nbsp;with\r\n        workflow orchestration tools like Airflow.</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Solid\r\n        understanding of data modelling, distributed systems (e.g., Spark), and\r\n        ETL/ELT design patterns.</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Comfortable\r\n        troubleshooting complex data issues in a production environment.</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Nice\r\n        to have: AWS Certified Data Engineer - Associate</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Nice\r\n        to have:&nbsp;Experience&nbsp;with financial data or understanding of\r\n        fintech concepts.</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   </ul>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:10.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Someone\r\n       who has familiarity with AI-powered development tools (GitHub Copilot,\r\n       Claude, Cursor, etc.) to improve coding productivity or troubleshooting</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:12.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n       tab-stops:list .5in\"><span role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">A\r\n       strong communicator who can explain technical concepts clearly to both\r\n       technical and non-technical stakeholders.</span></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"msonormaltable0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">The\r\n  budgeted salary range for this role is $100,000 - $130,000 CAD / year.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <i>At KOHO, we provide pay transparency to all&nbsp;candidates. Compensation\r\n  at KOHO is determined through various factors including but not limited to\r\n  comparable salary market data within Canada, technical skill assessment, a\r\n  holistic view of previous work history, and internal pay equity with other\r\n  KOHO team members.</i></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">KOHO is for builders.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">If you’re energized by challenge, motivated by mission, and want\r\n  to be part of a team that punches above its weight - we want to hear from\r\n  you.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  The KOHO culture is one of collaboration, creativity, and diverse\r\n  perspectives. We are committed to building and fostering an inclusive,\r\n  accessible environment for everyone. If you have any questions, concerns, or\r\n  requests regarding accessibility needs, please contact </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#467886\"><a href=\"mailto:peopleaccessibility@koho.ca\"><span style=\"color:#467886\">peopleaccessibility@koho.ca</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;and\r\n  the People and Culture team will be happy to help.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  AI Disclosure: KOHO uses artificial intelligence (AI) in certain aspects of\r\n  its recruitment process to screen, assess, or select applicants. For any\r\n  questions or concerns, please contact us at </span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#467886\"><a href=\"mailto:talent@koho.ca\"><span style=\"color:#467886\">talent@koho.ca</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Note: this posting is for an existing vacancy that we are seeking to fill.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '2026-05-06', '18:00:00', '18:45:00', '2026-05-06 06:00:00', '2026-05-06 06:45:00', 45, '2026-05-06 14:38:26', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-233@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
