ckground-color: rgba(171, 171, 171, 0.14);\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Client Details and Location\r\n  for the applied position&nbsp;</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"389\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 4.05in; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 16.5pt; background-color: rgba(171, 171, 171, 0.14);\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Cymbiotika</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Total No. Of years\' Experience : 5+ years&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:FluentSystemIcons;\r\ncolor:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"386\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:289.85pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">The Home Depot</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"391\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 293.6pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Jan 2023 - Present</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"386\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 289.85pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Data Analyst – Sales &amp;\r\n  Marketing</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"391\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 293.6pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Jun 2019 – Jul 2021</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Role Summary</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">About\r\nCymbiotika:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">At\r\nCymbiotika, we believe that wellness starts with trust. That’s why we’re\r\ncommitted to creating supplements that are not only effective but also\r\ntransparent. From the moment you pick up one of our products, you’ll know\r\nexactly what’s inside—no hidden ingredients, no confusing labels. We take pride\r\nin using only the highest-quality ingredients, carefully sourced and backed by\r\nscience, to ensure you’re getting the best of nature and innovation in every\r\nsupplement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">We\r\nunderstand that health is personal, which is why our supplements are designed\r\nto work with your body, not against it. By focusing on bioavailability and\r\nusing advanced liposomal delivery systems, we ensure that your body can absorb\r\nand use the nutrients to their fullest potential. Our goal is simple: to help\r\nyou feel your best, with products you can trust, made with ingredients you feel\r\ngood about.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">With\r\nCymbiotika, you’re not just taking a supplement—you’re joining a community of\r\npeople who value wellness, science, and the power of transparency. We’re here\r\nto empower you on your journey to better health, every step of the way.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Role\r\nSummary</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Cymbiotika\r\nis scaling rapidly across DTC, subscription, and retail channels — and we’re\r\nbuilding a modern analytics foundation to match. We’re hiring a&nbsp;<b>Data\r\nAnalyst</b>&nbsp;who can bridge&nbsp;<b>growth marketing</b>,&nbsp;<b>data\r\nengineering</b>, and&nbsp;<b>automation</b>. This role is for someone who\r\ncan&nbsp;<b>write scripts</b>,&nbsp;<b>pull data via APIs</b>,&nbsp;<b>build\r\nautomated pipelines</b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b>translate insights into revenue‑driving\r\ndecisions</b>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">You will\r\nbe a core contributor to Cymbiotika’s&nbsp;<b>single source of truth</b>,\r\npowering PLTV modeling, promo performance, subscription analytics, and real‑time\r\nreporting. If you love marketing data but also love building the systems behind\r\nit, this is the role.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Key\r\nResponsibilities</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1.\r\nBuild Cymbiotika’s Marketing Data Infrastructure</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Develop automated API pipelines for Meta, Google Ads, TikTok,\r\n     Klaviyo, Shopify, GA4 and subscription platforms.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Write Python or Node scripts to ingest, normalize and join\r\n     marketing + transactional data.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Support the buildout of Cymbiotika’s&nbsp;<b>North Star KPI\r\n     framework</b>, ensuring consistent definitions across teams.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Partner with Engineering to evolve our data warehouse and schema\r\n     design.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2.\r\nGrowth &amp; Subscription Analytics</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Analyze performance across paid media, email/SMS, onsite funnels,\r\n     and subscription lifecycle.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Support PLTV modeling (discount cohorts, subscription propensity,\r\n     SKU sensitivity, month cohorts).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Build dashboards for CAC, ROAS, retention, churn, and promo\r\n     performance.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">3.\r\nAutomation &amp; Operational Efficiency</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Automate recurring reporting workflows (daily pacing, promo\r\n     tracking, subscription health).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Build internal tools/scripts for QA, anomaly detection, and budget\r\n     pacing.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Support real‑time PLTV signal generation for paid media platforms.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">4.\r\nCross‑Functional Collaboration</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Work closely with Finance, CX, and Engineering.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Translate business questions into analytical frameworks and\r\n     technical solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Required\r\nSkills &amp; Experience</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2–5+ years in Marketing Analytics, Growth, or Technical Analytics.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong proficiency in&nbsp;<b>Python or Node.js</b>&nbsp;for\r\n     scripting and API integrations.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with REST APIs, OAuth, JSON and building automated data\r\n     pipelines.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">SQL expertise (joins, window functions, CTEs).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Hands-on experience with Meta, Google Ads, TikTok, Klaviyo,\r\n     Shopify, GA4.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong understanding of CAC, ROAS, LTV, subscription metrics and\r\n     cohort analysis.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Ability to communicate technical concepts to non‑technical\r\n     stakeholders.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Preferred\r\nQualifications</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with dbt, Airflow, or other orchestration tools.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with subscription analytics (churn modeling, retention\r\n     curves, cohort decay).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Familiarity with MMM, MTA modeling.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience in DTC, wellness, or subscription-based businesses.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">What\r\nSuccess Looks Like in 90 Days</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">You’ve automated at least one major recurring report (e.g., daily\r\n     pacing, promo dashboard).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">You’ve built stable API pipelines for 2–3 core marketing platforms.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">You’ve contributed to Cymbiotika’s&nbsp;<b>PLTV model</b>&nbsp;and\r\n     helped refine cohort logic.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">You’ve delivered insights that directly influence budget\r\n     allocation, creative strategy, or promo planning.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">You’ve established yourself as a technical partner to Growth and a\r\n     data partner to Engineering.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-06', '23:00:00', '23:45:00', '2026-05-06 11:00:00', '2026-05-06 11:30:00', 45, '2026-05-06 14:58:31', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-238@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(239, 22, 92, 23, 1, 4, 'NA', '<div>Company Name: Augustine Property Management</div><div>Role: Operations Coordinator</div><div>Job Description:</div><div>Are you someone who thrives on keeping things organized while also digging into complex problems? Do you enjoy making systems run smoother, catching what others miss, and turning chaos into clarity? If you’re detail-oriented, proactive, and like being at the center of how things get done - keep reading.</div><div><br></div><div>Augustine Property Management is seeking an Operations Coordinator who can both handle the day-to-day details, while also stepping into bigger projects that improve how we operate. This role plays a key part in keeping our property management operations running efficiently and moving forward.</div><div><br></div><div>Responsibilities</div><div><br></div><div>Own the accuracy and organization of key operational data, reports, and systems</div><div>Act as a central point of coordination to keep priorities, tasks, and communication aligned across the team</div><div>Identify gaps, inefficiencies, or breakdowns in processes - and help fix them</div><div>Support and execute on projects that improve operations, reporting, and scalability</div><div>Track critical tasks and deadlines, ensuring consistent follow-through and accountability</div><div>Build and maintain reporting that gives leadership clear visibility into performance and issues</div><div>Jump in where needed to solve problems, remove bottlenecks, and keep operations moving</div><div>Handle day-to-day administrative items with speed, accuracy, and minimal oversight</div><div>Qualifications</div><div><br></div><div>Proven track record of staying highly organized while managing multiple priorities without things slipping</div><div>Strong analytical ability - comfortable working with data, identifying patterns, and making sense of it</div><div>High attention to detail - you catch errors, inconsistencies, and gaps others miss</div><div>Naturally proactive - you don’t wait for direction, you identify issues and take action</div><div>Ability to operate in both structured tasks and ambiguous projects without losing momentum</div><div>Strong ownership mindset - you follow through and take responsibility for outcomes, not just tasks</div><div>Clear and direct communicator - able to keep others aligned and informed without overcomplicating things</div><div>Comfortable with tools like Excel, Microsoft 365, AI, Project Management Software, and willing to learn systems quickly</div><div>Bachelor\'s Degree and above preferred.</div>', '2026-05-06', '22:30:00', '23:00:00', '2026-05-06 12:00:00', '2026-05-06 12:45:00', 30, '2026-05-06 15:06:56', 5000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-239@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
