ople. In exchange, we let our people own their careers. Their ideas,\r\nbig and small, genuinely improve the world. And that’s the kind of work we want\r\nto be part of.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The Financial\r\nBusiness Analyst plays a pivotal role in maintaining the&nbsp; integrity&nbsp;\r\nof&nbsp; financial&nbsp; customer&nbsp; program&nbsp; data&nbsp; within&nbsp;\r\nour&nbsp; integrated&nbsp; program management,&nbsp; supply&nbsp; chain,&nbsp;\r\nand&nbsp; finance&nbsp; systems&nbsp; throughout&nbsp; the&nbsp; Sales&nbsp;\r\nand Operations (S&amp;OP) cycles. They leverage their expertise in IT systems\r\nsuch as SAP, IBP, Business Warehouse (BW), Planview (PV), and Power BI (PBI),\r\nalong with an understanding of S&amp;OP processes and agile stakeholder\r\nmanagement, to identify and resolve data integrity issues. With an operational\r\nexcellence mindset, they actively contribute to the improvement of PM-related\r\nprocesses and systems, rolling out global changes, supporting&nbsp;\r\ntraining&nbsp; and&nbsp; deployment&nbsp; of&nbsp; global&nbsp; tools&nbsp;\r\nand&nbsp; implementing&nbsp; local solutions as required. As&nbsp; an&nbsp;\r\nextended&nbsp; member&nbsp; of&nbsp; the&nbsp; PM&nbsp; management&nbsp;\r\nteam,&nbsp; the&nbsp; Financial Business&nbsp; Analyst identifies&nbsp;\r\nand&nbsp; communicates&nbsp; necessary&nbsp; actions&nbsp; to&nbsp; drive&nbsp;\r\ncompleteness&nbsp; and accuracy&nbsp; of&nbsp; data,&nbsp; both&nbsp;\r\nwithin&nbsp; the&nbsp; PM&nbsp; team&nbsp; and&nbsp; across&nbsp; other&nbsp;\r\ndepartments&nbsp; for escalation.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">What\r\nyou will get:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The full-time base\r\nannual salary for this position is expected to range between&nbsp; $101,000 to\r\n$161,000. In addition, below you will find a comprehensive summary of the\r\nbenefits package we offer:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Performance-related bonus</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-posi