></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Coordinate with Global Billing to optimize WBS master\r\ndata and invoicing precision, focusing on eliminating data inaccuracies through\r\nsystem-led interfaces.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Lead the adoption of globally standardized tools and\r\nprocesses through personal application, training, and coaching of the PM\r\norganization.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Support the PMO by trending errors and identifying\r\nhigh-precision, data-driven solutions to improve the delivery of standard work.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">What\r\nwe are looking for:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s degree in Life Sciences, Finance or\r\nBusiness.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Power BI strongly preferred for translating complex\r\ndata into clear, actionable business insights and relevant KPIs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Expert in SAP and Excel, with additional experience in\r\nPlanview to ensure high-quality data integrity for executive decision-making.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Exceptional attention to detail and an analytical\r\nmindset capable of navigating ambiguity to drive precise process improvements.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong business acumen used to interpret profitability\r\ndrivers and translate strategic data needs into achievable objectives.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Skilled facilitator who effectively resolves conflict\r\nand clears roadblocks while managing the multiple demands of data integrity.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 13.9pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Results-oriented professional with clear communication\r\nskills to translate technical data and monitor progress toward on-time\r\ndelivery.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About\r\nLonza</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">At Lonza, our people\r\nare our greatest strength. With 30+ sites across five continents, our globally\r\nconnected teams work together every day to manufacture the medicines of\r\ntomorrow. Our core values of Collaboration, Accountability, Excellence, Passion\r\nand Integrity reflect who we are and how we work together. Everyone’s ideas,\r\nbig or small, have the potential to improve millions of lives, and that’s the\r\nkind of work we want you to be part of.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Innovation thrives\r\nwhen people from all backgrounds bring their unique perspectives to the table.\r\nAt Lonza, we offer equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants\r\nregardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation,\r\ngender identity, age, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic\r\nprotected by law. If you’re ready to help turn our customers’ breakthrough\r\nideas into viable therapies, we look forward to welcoming you on board.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-06', '22:00:00', '22:45:00', '2026-05-06 16:24:56', NULL, 45, '2026-05-06 15:14:17', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-240@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
