sd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qMUEqJtIxgvDxqaNxtw7D\" target=\"_blank\">https://you.ashbyhq.com/meeting/b7d95d98-34f7-4101-a020-cdb9346a56df/</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">This meeting is part of the interview process for\r\n        the&nbsp;Azure MSP Cloud Engineer - Bilingual&nbsp;position at Megazone\r\n        Cloud U.S., as outlined in the email.<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Participants:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n         <li class=\"xmsonormal\">2:30 PM - 3:00\r\n             PM (EDT) - Recruiter Screen<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n         <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"circle\">\r\n          <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Michelle\r\n              Gallagher (Director of Technical Talent,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fmichelle-gallagher-cir-349a953a&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2upTUXnKIpRZqiFQqlN3xf\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a>)<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n         </ul>\r\n        </ul>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Duration:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">30m<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Format:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Virtual Google Meet<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        If any scheduling issues arise, feel free to contact Michelle (<a href=\"mailto:Michelle.Gallagher@megazone.com\" target=\"_blank\">Michelle.Gallagher@megazone.com</a>)<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><br>\r\n        We look forward to the conversation!<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">To keep your interview experience seamless and\r\n        distraction-free, we use an AI Notetaker to record and transcribe our\r\n        interviews. This helps interviewers focus fully on the conversation and\r\n        ensures your responses are captured accurately. The recording will only\r\n        be used internally for evaluation. If you would prefer not to be\r\n        recorded, you can opt out using the link below. Opting out will not\r\n        impact your candidacy in any way.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fyou.ashbyhq.com%2Fconsent%2F8e783a6f-14c3-4d6b-a65d-bcb09e7aef1c&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw00FdKDZ7FMVo5XJyXIIY1w\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to opt-out</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in .25in 0in\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 3.0pt 0in\">\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>When</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Wednesday May 6, 2026 <span style=\"font-family:\r\n        &quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">⋅</span> 1:30pm – 2pm (Central Time - Chicago)<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in .25in 0in\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 3.0pt 0in\">\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Location</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\">See attached Google Meet link<br>\r\n        <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/See+attached+Google+Meet+link?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><b>View map</b></a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in .25in 0in\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 3.0pt 0in\">\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Guests</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"mailto:preethimedipelli22@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">preethimedipelli22@gmail.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/event?action=VIEW&amp;eid=YTcxdDAwM3Y4Z2djbzFnZnY3cGszOW9sZWsgcHJlZXRoaW1lZGlwZWxsaTIyQG0&amp;tok=OTIjY181NDQxNGY0NTNmNzg2ZjYyY2U0NzQ1Y2YwZWE2MzQ5MmE3NDlhZWY2ZDc1NTJlMjM1Yjc2ZTU0MGE4ZjI4Y2M0QGdyb3VwLmNhbGVuZGFyLmdvb2dsZS5jb202OWU5NmNkYzJmZTI2YzZiODkyMzc2ZTcyOWQ3MGRlY2QxMjliMjA2&amp;ctz=America%2FChicago&amp;hl=en&amp;es=1\" target=\"_blank\"><b>View all guest info</b></a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Reply</b>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:preethimedipelli22@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">preethimedipelli22@gmail.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 12.0pt 0in\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:6.0pt 9.0pt 0in 0in\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"mso-cellspacing:0in;border:solid #DADCE0 1.0pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:\r\n           1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td style=\"border:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n            <div align=\"center\">\r\n            <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n             <tbody><tr>\r\n              <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 12.0pt\">\r\n              <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Yes<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n              </td>\r\n             </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n            </div>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td style=\"border-top:none;border-left:solid #DADCE0 1.0pt;\r\n            border-bottom:none;border-right:solid #DADCE0 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n            <div align=\"center\">\r\n            <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n             <tbody><tr>\r\n              <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt\">\r\n              <p class=\"xmsonormal\">No<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n              </td>\r\n             </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n            </div>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td style=\"border:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n            <div align=\"center\">\r\n            <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n             <tbody><tr>\r\n              <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:4.5pt 12.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt\">\r\n              <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Maybe<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n              </td>\r\n             </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n            </div>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"mso-cellspacing:0in;border:solid #DADCE0 1.0pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:\r\n           1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"border:none;padding:4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 12.0pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"xmsonormal\">More options<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Role Summary</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">We are seeking a highly motivated and skilled&nbsp;<b>Intermediate\r\nAzure Cloud Engineer</b>&nbsp;to join our Managed Services team in Irvine, CA.\r\nIn this role, you will be responsible for the day-to-day management,\r\noptimization, and troubleshooting of complex Azure environments for a diverse\r\nportfolio of clients.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">As a key member of our technical team, you will bridge the\r\ngap between initial cloud architecture and ongoing operational excellence. The\r\nideal candidate has a strong technical foundation in Azure, a\r\n\"security-first\" mindset, and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced,\r\nmulti-client environment.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Key Responsibilities</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Infrastructure\r\n     Management:</b>&nbsp;Provision,\r\n     configure, and manage Azure resources including Virtual Machines, VNet,\r\n     Azure SQL, App Services, and Storage Accounts.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Automation &amp; IaC:</b>&nbsp;Develop and\r\n     maintain Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using&nbsp;<b>Terraform, Bicep, or\r\n     ARM Templates</b>&nbsp;to standardize and automate deployments.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Identity &amp; Security:</b>&nbsp;Manage&nbsp;<b>Microsoft\r\n     Entra ID (formerly Azure AD)</b>, implement Role-Based Access Control\r\n     (RBAC), and ensure compliance using Azure Policy and Microsoft Defender\r\n     for Cloud.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Monitoring &amp;\r\n     Optimization:</b>&nbsp;Utilize\r\n     Azure Monitor, Log Analytics, and Application Insights to proactively\r\n     monitor performance and troubleshoot issues.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Cost Management:</b>&nbsp;Analyze client\r\n     cloud spend using Azure Cost Management and provide actionable\r\n     recommendations for cost optimization (Rightsizing, Reserved Instances,\r\n     etc.).<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Backup &amp; Disaster\r\n     Recovery:</b>&nbsp;Implement\r\n     and test robust backup and recovery solutions using&nbsp;<b>Azure Backup</b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b>Azure\r\n     Site Recovery (ASR)</b>.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>L3 Technical Support:</b>&nbsp;Act as an\r\n     escalation point for complex technical issues, performing Root Cause\r\n     Analysis (RCA) and documenting resolutions.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Client Engagement:</b>&nbsp;Interface with\r\n     clients to understand technical requirements and provide updates on\r\n     infrastructure health and project status.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Qualifications</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Experience:</b>&nbsp;3–5 years of\r\n     hands-on experience in Azure cloud engineering or administration within an\r\n     MSP or enterprise environment.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Technical Proficiency:</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Deep understanding of\r\n     Azure Networking (NSGs, ASGs, VPN Gateways, Firewalls).<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Deep understanding of\r\n     Azure Storage Account.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Strong scripting skills\r\n     in&nbsp;<b>PowerShell</b>, Azure CLI, or Python.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Experience with CI/CD\r\n     pipelines (Azure DevOps or GitHub Actions).<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Solid knowledge of\r\n     Windows and Linux Server administration.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Soft Skills:</b>&nbsp;Excellent\r\n     problem-solving skills, the ability to prioritize tasks in a high-pressure\r\n     environment, and clear professional communication skills.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Requirement:</b>&nbsp;Must be able to\r\n     work&nbsp;<b>100% on-site</b>&nbsp;at our Irvine, CA office.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Preferred Skills &amp; Certifications</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Certifications:</b>&nbsp;Microsoft\r\n     Certified:&nbsp;<b>Azure Administrator Associate (AZ-104)</b>&nbsp;is\r\n     highly preferred. Progress toward AZ-305 (Solutions Architect) or AZ-500\r\n     (Security Engineer) is a plus.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Containerization:</b>&nbsp;Experience with\r\n     Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) or Docker.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Migration:</b>&nbsp;Experience with\r\n     \"Lift &amp; Shift\" or Refactoring migrations from on-premises to\r\n     Azure.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">●&nbsp;<b>Language\r\n     Skills:</b>&nbsp;Korean language proficiency is preferred<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Why You\'ll Love It Here</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Our Product is Our\r\n     People:</b>&nbsp;We\r\n     live by this. We invest in people who invest in themselves. Your growth is\r\n     our growth.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>True Servant Leadership:</b>&nbsp;Our CTO leads with\r\n     a \"force multiplier\" philosophy. Management is here to empower\r\n     you and clear roadblocks, not to micromanage. We won\'t ask you to do\r\n     anything we\'re not willing to do ourselves.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Flat Organization, Real\r\n     Impact:</b>&nbsp;Your\r\n     voice and designs will directly shape our technical roadmap and our\r\n     clients\' success. You\'ll work on the latest tech to solve real problems.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>A\r\n     \"Learn-from-it\" Culture:</b>&nbsp;We\'re moving fast and building new things. We\r\n     believe mistakes are learning opportunities, not failures.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-06', '00:00:00', '00:30:00', '2026-05-06 18:00:00', NULL, 0, '2026-05-06 15:45:31', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-242@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
