r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">They will call him AT <b>-</b>&nbsp;201\r\n  790 6058.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:1376.9pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"256\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 192.05pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 1376.9pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:\r\n  200%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 296.65pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 1376.9pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><u><span style=\"color:black\">Job Description -&nbsp;</span></u></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">The Opportunity:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">The AI Engineer will architect,\r\n  implement production-ready generative AI systems, working closely with AI\r\n  leads, ML engineers, and platform teams. You will develop solutions powered\r\n  by LLMs, GPU frameworks, and scalable microservices, ensuring they are performant,\r\n  secure, and seamlessly integrated with enterprise systems. You will report to\r\n  the AI Team Leader, Technology Innovation.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">The Day-to-Day:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Design, develop,\r\n  fine-tune, and deploy generative AI models into scalable production\r\n  environments<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Build\r\n       and maintain APIs and microservices using FastAPI to expose AI\r\n       capabilities enterprise wide<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Collaborate\r\n       with the AI Infrastructure team to architect robust LLM pipelines,\r\n       including training workflows and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)\r\n       systems<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Integrate\r\n       AI solutions into enterprise applications using secure, cloud-native\r\n       architectures and best practices<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Ensure\r\n       AI models are explainable, reliable, and compliant with regulatory and\r\n       internal governance standards<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Continuously\r\n       monitor and optimize model performance using evaluation frameworks,\r\n       observability tools, and iterative fine-tuning<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Your Qualifications:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">10 years of IT\r\n  industry experience<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">7\r\n       years of experience:<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:0in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Building data‑driven\r\n  software solutions<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n        auto;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;tab-stops:list 1.0in;align-self:start;\r\n        margin:1rem\">Python\r\n        expertise, with practical experience in LLMs, embeddings, and RAG\r\n        architecture<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   </ul>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">3\r\n       years of hands-on AI development experience<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Demonstrated\r\n       experience with generative AI models, including multimodal models<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Hands-on\r\n       experience with cloud-native AI infrastructure: Azure Foundry,\r\n       Kubernetes, Docker, vector databases, GPU clusters, and AI model\r\n       governance frameworks<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Bachelor\'s\r\n       degree in Computer Science, AI, or a related field (or equivalent\r\n       professional experience)<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Preferred Experience:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">GPU-accelerated\r\n  training and inference using NVIDIA technologies, including NIM and NeMo\r\n  frameworks<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Optimize\r\n       and scale AI models with NVIDIA NIM, and fine-tuning models with NeMo\r\n       services<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Familiarity\r\n       with AI agentic frameworks and deploying AI agents in production\r\n       environments<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Deploy\r\n       models with low latency and high throughput, using frameworks like vLLM\r\n       and other GPU model deployment tools<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Hands-on\r\n       experience with CI/CD pipelines for GenAI workflows, along with\r\n       containerization and orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Distributed\r\n       training, GPU optimization, and large-scale model frameworks (CUDA,\r\n       RAPIDS)<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Why Fisher Investments:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">We work for a bigger purpose:\r\n  bettering the investment universe. We take great pride in our inclusive\r\n  culture, our learning and development framework customized for every\r\n  employee, and our Great Place to Work Certification. It\'s the people that\r\n  make the Fisher purpose possible, and we invest in them by offering\r\n  exceptional benefits like:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">100% paid medical,\r\n  dental and vision premiums for you and your qualifying dependents<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">A\r\n       50% 401(k) match, up to the IRS maximum<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">20\r\n       days of PTO, plus 10 paid holidays<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">Family\r\n       Support programs including 8 week Paid Primary Caregiver Leave, $10,000\r\n       fertility, family forming, and hormonal health assistance, and back-up\r\n       child, adult, and elder care<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;align-self:start;\r\n       margin:1rem\">This\r\n       is an in-office role. Based on your role, tenure, and performance\r\n       eligibility you may have the opportunity to participate in our hybrid\r\n       work from home program. This program is subject to change.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-07', '21:30:00', '22:00:00', NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 13:57:35', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-251@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
