ont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">NA</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"264\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 197.65pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; border-color: initial;\">\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Joining Detail</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"303\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 227.6pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt;\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"264\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 197.65pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; border-color: initial;\">\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Job Description:</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"303\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 227.6pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">We’re looking for an experienced Product Manager / Product\r\n  Lead who has truly owned products end-to-end—not just written specs, but made\r\n  real decisions about what gets built, what gets cut, and why.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">In this role, you’ll help shape realistic product environments\r\n  and artifacts for an AI benchmark. This includes defining product contexts,\r\n  team dynamics, and decision-making scenarios that mirror real-world product\r\n  organizations. You’ll bring strong product judgment, data fluency, and a\r\n  sharp eye for authenticity in how product work is communicated and executed.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">What does day-to-day life look like?</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">You will spend your time operating at the intersection of\r\n  product thinking, data, and storytelling:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Define and simulate\r\n       real-world product scenarios, including company stage, team structures,\r\n       and product strategy tensions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Create and review product\r\n       artifacts such as PRDs, experiment briefs, emails, and Slack threads for\r\n       realism and quality<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Evaluate whether product\r\n       decisions and communication reflect how strong PMs actually operate<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Design and assess A/B\r\n       experiments, including defining hypotheses, metrics, and success\r\n       criteria<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Collaborate closely with\r\n       data/analytics perspectives—interpreting experiment results and making\r\n       informed shipping decisions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bring clarity to ambiguous\r\n       product situations, especially where speed vs. rigor trade-offs exist<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Ensure product narratives\r\n       reflect real-world challenges like prioritization conflicts, metric\r\n       debates, and stakeholder alignment<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; 