ial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Comfortable defining and\r\n       debating product metrics (e.g., activation, engagement, retention)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Ability to interpret\r\n       imperfect data and still make sound product decisions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong understanding of what\r\n       good vs. poor product-data collaboration looks like<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Tools &amp; Collaboration</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n  &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Familiarity with tools such\r\n       as Google Drive, Confluence, Jira, and Slack<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong written communication\r\n       skills—able to produce clear, credible product artifacts<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Ability to distinguish\r\n       high-quality product thinking from superficial or templated outputs<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Perks of Freelancing With Turing</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&qu