der-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Job Overview<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">We are seeking an experienced MLOps Engineer to\r\n  join our DevOps and Infrastructure Engineering team. This role is crucial for\r\n  operationalizing, scaling, and maintaining our Artificial Intelligence (AI)\r\n  and Machine Learning (ML) applications. The successful candidate will\r\n  leverage their expertise to ensure seamless, scalable, and reliable\r\n  deployment and management of AI/ML models, working closely with data\r\n  scientists and ML engineers. This position requires strong proficiency in\r\n  Python, hands-on experience with Ray Tune for hyperparameter optimization,\r\n  and MLflow for experiment tracking and model lifecycle management.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Key Responsibilities:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">ML Pipeline Development &amp; Automation:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Design, build, and maintain robust and scalable end-to-end\r\n       ML pipelines for data ingestion, preprocessing, model training,\r\n       validation, and deployment.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">CI/CD for ML:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Implement and manage Continuous Integration/Continuous\r\n       Delivery (CI/CD) pipelines specifically tailored for machine learning\r\n       workflows, ensuring automated testing, versioning, and deployment of ML\r\n       artifacts.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experiment Tracking &amp; Model Management:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Utilize&nbsp;<b>MLflow</b>&nbsp;extensively for experiment\r\n       tracking, reproducible runs, managing model versions, and maintaining a\r\n       centralized model registry.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Hyperparameter Optimization:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Leverage&nbsp;<b>Ray Tune</b>&nbsp;for efficient and\r\n       distributed hyperparameter optimization to enhance model performance and\r\n       accelerate experimentation.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Containerization &amp; Orchestration:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Package ML models and their dependencies using Docker and\r\n       deploy/manage them effectively on Kubernetes clusters.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Data Platform Integration:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Integrate with and optimize existing data platforms,\r\n       including Apache Iceberg, Apache Spark, and FLINK, to ensure efficient\r\n       data processing and feature engineering for ML models.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Data Storage &amp; Streaming:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Work with PostgreSQL, Oracle, and MongoDB for diverse data\r\n       storage needs, and utilize Kafka for real-time data streaming to support\r\n       various ML applications.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Monitoring &amp; Observability:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Implement comprehensive monitoring, logging, and alerting\r\n       solutions (e.g., Prometheus, Grafana) for ML models in production,\r\n       tracking model performance, data drift, and infrastructure health to\r\n       ensure reliability and facilitate automated retraining or rollback.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Scripting &amp; Automation:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Develop automation scripts and tools using&nbsp;<b>Python</b>&nbsp;and\r\n       Bash/Go to streamline MLOps processes and integrate various systems.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Collaboration:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Act as a vital link between data scientists, ML engineers,\r\n       and infrastructure teams, facilitating clear communication and ensuring\r\n       that ML solutions are production-ready.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Required Qualifications:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;3-5 years of hands-on experience in an MLOps, DevOps, or\r\n       Machine Learning Engineering role, with a proven track record of\r\n       deploying and managing ML models in production environments.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Programming:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Expert-level proficiency in&nbsp;<b>Python</b>&nbsp;for ML\r\n       development, scripting, and automation.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">MLOps Tooling:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Demonstrated hands-on experience with&nbsp;<b>Ray Tune</b>&nbsp;for\r\n       hyperparameter optimization and&nbsp;<b>AirFlow or MLflow&nbsp;</b>for\r\n       experiment tracking and model management.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Containerization &amp; Orchestration:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Strong experience with Docker and Kubernetes (including\r\n       Helm).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">CI/CD:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;Experience\r\n       implementing CI/CD practices for software and/or ML pipelines.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Data Technologies:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Familiarity with or experience with Apache Spark, Apache\r\n       Iceberg, FLINK, and Kafka.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Databases:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;Experience\r\n       with PostgreSQL, Oracle, and MongoDB.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Workflow Orchestration:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Experience with Apache Airflow.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Infrastructure as Code:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Experience with HashiCorp (Terraform).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Operating Systems:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:\r\n       EN-IN\">&nbsp;Proficiency in Linux/Unix environments.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Desirable Skills:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure,\r\n       GCP) and managing cloud-native ML infrastructure.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Knowledge of deep learning frameworks such\r\n       as TensorFlow or PyTorch.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with generative AI technologies\r\n       (e.g., LLMs, prompt engineering, RAG pipelines).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Understanding of distributed computing and\r\n       big data processing techniques.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-05-07', '00:30:00', '01:00:00', '2026-05-07 19:57:00', '2026-05-07 21:20:39', 30, '2026-05-07 14:02:50', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-253@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
