512<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.15pt\">Passcode:&nbsp;ez3Rs3qQ<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"798\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:598.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Job Title: SQL Server\r\n  Database Administrator Job Profile: B52<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Department: Data\r\n  Services WC Code: 8810<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Position Summary<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">This position is\r\n  assigned responsibilities involving the administration of SQL Server\r\n  databases.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">This includes the\r\n  design, development, maintenance, security administration, capacity<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">planning, performance\r\n  monitoring and tuning, upgrade, backup and recovery of SQL Server<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">databases to ensure\r\n  maximum availability, integrity, confidentiality and security of data.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Position\r\n  Responsibilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Database Installation,\r\n  Configuration &amp; Upgrades<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Install, configure, and maintain SQL Server instances across\r\n  on-prem and cloud<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">environments.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Apply patches, cumulative updates, and perform version\r\n  upgrades/migrations.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Configure SQL Server components such as SSIS, SSRS, and SSAS\r\n  when required.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Performance Monitoring\r\n  &amp; Optimization<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Monitor database performance using DMVs, Extended Events, Query\r\n  Store, and other<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">tools.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Tune SQL queries, indexes, and execution plans to ensure optimal\r\n  database<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">performance.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Troubleshoot blocking, deadlocks, and system bottlenecks.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Backup, Recovery &amp;\r\n  High Availability<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Develop and manage reliable database backup and recovery\r\n  strategies.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Perform restore scenarios including point-in-time recovery.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Configure and support high-availability solutions such as\r\n  Always On AGs, Failover<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Clustering, log\r\n  shipping, and replication.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Participate in disaster recovery planning and testing.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Security &amp;\r\n  Compliance<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Manage database security including logins, users, roles, and\r\n  permissions.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Implement encryption like TDE or its equivalent, auditing, and\r\n  best-practice security<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">measures.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Ensure regulatory and internal compliance standards are met.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Database Maintenance\r\n  &amp; Operations<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Manage SQL Agent jobs, alerts, and automation processes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-char-type:symbol;\r\n  mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\"> Perform ongoing maintenance: index management, statistics\r\n  up