\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:211.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Interview&nbsp;JD</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline;font-style:inherit;font-weight:\r\n  inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">About Akia</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#373E4D\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">Akia\r\n  builds AI agents for hospitality — a system of actions that handles guest\r\n  communication, drives direct bookings, manages upsells, and operates the full\r\n  guest lifecycle.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">Built on a\r\n  modular skills architecture. The AI reasons, acts, and learns across every\r\n  domain of hotel operations. The stack is real, the problems are hard, and the\r\n  AI isn\'t a feature bolted on — it\'s the product.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">We\'re\r\n  still early, and there\'s a lot left to build.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;line-height:18.9pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#373E4D;font-weight:normal\">Role Overview <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height:18.9pt;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">We\'re building AI that can\r\n  learn complex real-world operations and run them autonomously. That means\r\n  designing agentic systems that compose reliably across domains, scale across\r\n  wildly different environments, and make the right decisions with imperfect information.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">This role\r\n  is about building those systems. You\'ll design the architecture that lets\r\n  autonomous AI act correctly in production at scale.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">We believe\r\n  the best engineering in the age of AI comes down to architectural judgment —\r\n  knowing what to build, why the pieces fit together, and where the system will\r\n  break under pressure. We use AI heavily in how we build, and we need\r\n  engineers who can guide it well.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;line-height:18.9pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#373E4D;font-weight:normal\">What You\'ll Do <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height:18.9pt;vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Design\r\n  and build the skills architecture.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">Define how\r\n  modular AI capabilities are structured, how they share context, and how they\r\n  compose. Tool use, function calling, multi-step agent orchestration —\r\n  production-grade and built to last.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Build\r\n  the action and execution layer.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">The AI\r\n  doesn\'t just converse — it acts. Action execution, rollback, retry, audit\r\n  trails. Structured outputs, chain-of-thought reasoning, human-in-the-loop\r\n  gating, and guardrails that control autonomy.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Architect\r\n  the reasoning and retrieval pipeline.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">RAG\r\n  pipelines, embedding strategies, context window management, semantic search.\r\n  Build the systems that make agentic reasoning reliable and consistent at\r\n  scale.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Design\r\n  the AI harness and feedback systems.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">The\r\n  software systems, environments, and feedback loops that govern how AI agents\r\n  learn, improve, and operate safely. Evaluation frameworks, testing\r\n  infrastructure, confidence calibration, and the engineering scaffolding that\r\n  turns a language model into a reliable autonomous system.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Own\r\n  scale and reliability.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\n  none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">Production systems that handle\r\n  real traffic across wildly different environments. Multi-tenancy, database\r\n  performance, caching, horizontal scaling, observability, and the operational\r\n  rigor that keeps autonomous AI safe in production.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;line-height:18.9pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#373E4D;font-weight:normal\">What We\'re Looking For <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height:18.9pt;vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">CS\r\n  degree or equivalent depth.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">Data\r\n  structures, algorithms, distributed systems, networking, concurrency — as\r\n  tools you reach for daily when designing real systems.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">5–8\r\n  years building production systems.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">You\'ve\r\n  designed, shipped, and operated systems at scale. You\'ve tuned database\r\n  queries, debugged performance bottlenecks, managed migrations, and been\r\n  on-call for systems you built. You know what breaks at scale because you\'ve\r\n  lived it.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Deep\r\n  system design experience.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\n  none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">End-to-end system architecture —\r\n  you\'ve designed entire systems, owned the tradeoffs, and evolved them over\r\n  time. Distributed systems, database internals, caching, message queues,\r\n  service decomposition, horizontal scaling, and reasoning about failure at every\r\n  layer.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Genuine\r\n  passion for AI agents.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\n  none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">You\'re deeply curious about how\r\n  autonomous systems work, how they fail, and what makes them reliable. You\'ve\r\n  built with LLMs — RAG, agent orchestration, tool use, prompt engineering, any\r\n  or all.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Ability\r\n  to guide AI, beyond just using it.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">You spot\r\n  leaky abstractions, naive error handling, and unscalable data models in\r\n  AI-generated code instantly. You know when to accept, redirect, or throw it\r\n  away.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 18.9pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:\r\n  none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Critical\r\n  thinking about AI output.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\n  none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#373E4D\">You hold AI-generated code to the\r\n  same bar as a senior engineer: correctness, performance, security, and\r\n  behavior at the edges.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;line-height:18.9pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#373E4D;font-weight:normal\">Compensation &amp; Benefits <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:18.9pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#373E4D;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#373E4D;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Salary:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#373E4D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\n  none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;font-weight:normal\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#373E4D;font-weight:normal\">$165,000 – $230,000<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:18.9pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#373E4D;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#373E4D;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Equity / stock options<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:18.9pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#373E4D;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#373E4D;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Full health, dental, and vision coverage<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:18.9pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#373E4D;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; li