etails</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"582\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 436.35pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 0in 0.25in; height: 145.25pt; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:center;\r\n  line-height:15.0pt\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">Hi Aashish Prasad,</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">Great news - We\'ve confirmed the following interview(s)\r\n  for the&nbsp;Equity Research Analyst - Healthcare IT\r\n  -&nbsp;R0113963&nbsp;position at Truist.</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">Truist Interview - Equity Research Analyst - Healthcare\r\n  IT | R0113963 (30 minutes)<br>\r\n  When: May 8, 2026, 3:00 PM - 3:30 PM (America/New_York)<br>\r\n  Where: Microsoft Teams - join the meeting (</span><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_OWU2MzcyYmQtOGNmZi00ZWViLWI4ZGEtZTM2Mjc0NzRkYzM5%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2255651e97-f81c-4b3b-9131-af8a1cd02346%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%224d1a1071-f5aa-4f4a-aa0a-9958a5e7e665%22%7d\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\">https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join</span></a></span><span style=\"color:#242424\">)</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">Meeting ID: 234922211701614 Passcode: mW28mw7E</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><br>\r\n  Interviewer(s): Payton Engdahl, Eduardo Ron, Jailendra Singh</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">For virtual interviews using Microsoft Teams only: If\r\n  you receive a message that the account you’re using doesn’t have access to\r\n  the meeting, click ‘Join without an account’ to join the interview.</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">We\'re excited to speak to you and learn more about your\r\n  skills and experience, as well as answer any questions about the role.</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">Note: Should you need to cancel or reschedule, please\r\n  click the following link:</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><a href=\"https://sh.phenom.com/PnUgmXG\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\">https://sh.phenom.com/PnUgmXG</span></a></span></b><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">If you need to cancel within 24 hours of your interview\r\n  time due to unforeseen circumstances, please contact&nbsp;Christa McAnulty at\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><a href=\"mailto:christa.mcanulty@truist.com\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\">christa.mcanulty@truist.com</span></a></span><span style=\"color:#242424\">.</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:70.4pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"167\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 125.25pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt 5.4pt; height: 70.4pt; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Details to connect</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"582\" style=\"width: 436.35pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 0in 0.25in; height: 70.4pt; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><b><span style=\"color:#242424\">Here\r\n  is the Teams&nbsp; for our interview &nbsp;(Fri May 8) at 3:00pm ET:</span></b><span style=\"color:#242424\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#1155CC\">Meeting ID:\r\n  234922211701614&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#1155CC\">Passcode: mW28mw7E</span></b><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-05-08', '00:30:00', '01:00:00', '2026-05-08 19:02:51', '2026-05-08 19:34:23', 30, '2026-05-08 15:20:13', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-273@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
