width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"798\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:598.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">JD:- <a href=\"https://www.accenture.com/us-en/careers/jobdetails?id=R00323002_en&amp;title=Applied+AI+Engineer%2C+Founding+Team\">https://www.accenture.com/us-en/careers/jobdetails?id=R00323002_en&amp;title=Applied+AI+Engineer%2C+Founding+Team</a><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">We Are:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Accenture\'s Oracle\r\n  Business Group AI Center of Excellence is one of the\r\n  most&nbsp;active&nbsp;enterprise AI innovation environments in the Oracle\r\n  ecosystem.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">We build real products\r\n  that close deals and run in production — a knowledge platform spanning 27\r\n  Oracle knowledge servers and 980K+ documents. We move at startup speed inside\r\n  a global platform, and we\'re scaling fast.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">This is a founding\r\n  team, these first hires will shape the culture, the systems, and the\r\n  trajectory of the work we are doing!<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">You Are:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">You\'re an AI builder\r\n  who doesn\'t wait for permission. You\'ve rebuilt how you work around AI agents\r\n  — not just adopted them. You ship agentic systems, you know the Anthropic\r\n  ecosystem, and when a new research paper or open-source repo drops, you\'re\r\n  testing it the next day. You have an instinct for turning cutting-edge AI\r\n  into commercial value.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">You\'re equally\r\n  comfortable in a technical deep-dive and a client conversation.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">You might come from\r\n  engineering, consulting, product, or pre-sales — what matters is that you\r\n  build things that work and can explain why they matter.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">The Work:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:\r\n  bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">&nbsp;Contribute\r\n  to the Knowledge Repository&nbsp;— a multi-tenant enterprise knowledge\r\n  platform built on Oracle 23ai, powering intelligent search and document\r\n  retrieval at scale&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:\r\n  bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Build\r\n  and extend MCP server infrastructure&nbsp;— our federated Model Context\r\n  Protocol network across Oracle product lines, including retrieval 