f\">Ansh\r\nPanchal<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>', '2026-05-11', '22:00:00', '22:30:00', '2026-05-11 23:10:54', '2026-05-11 23:11:01', 30, '2026-05-11 13:21:27', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-277@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
