ad0709@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3C4043\">aborad0709@gmail.com</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4042;letter-spacing:\r\n    .15pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n    font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.15pt\"><a href=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/event?action=VIEW&amp;eid=cmE0MXJqMmwwbWNhNms1bG5sNmZhamdmOTQgYWJvcmFkMDcwOUBt&amp;tok=MjEjaHVpLmh1YW5nQHNreWxpbmUuZGV2Y2I5MTdkYjIxMjIzZTgyYjAzYzBkNTlhN2E0ODdmYjgwNDkwZjllNA&amp;ctz=America%2FChicago&amp;hl=en&amp;es=1\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"color:#1A73E8\">View all guest info</span></b></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Job Description: <o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"693\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:519.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Astoria AI (<a href=\"http://www.astoria.ai\">http://www.astoria.ai</a>)\r\n  is an early-stage startup focused on building human-centered global talent\r\n  intelligence platform powered by Artificial Intelligence. At Astoria AI we\r\n  believe that people have indispensable human need to realize their full\r\n  potential. Our mission is to help people to unlock their potential and help\r\n  organizations to attract those people and build sustained practices of\r\n  retaining motivated and most qualified talent.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Role Overview <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">We’re&nbsp;looking for a&nbsp;full-stack AI\r\n  developer&nbsp;who knows how to turn ideas into real&nbsp;product&nbsp;—\r\n  fast, safely, and thoughtfully.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">In this role,&nbsp;you’ll&nbsp;design and build\r\n  applications powered by LLMs and agentic workflows (automation, reasoning,\r\n  and tool-use).&nbsp;You’ll&nbsp;partner closely with product and design to\r\n  ship features that feel intuitive, trustworthy, and genuinely helpful.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">This is a chance to shape an MVP, influence\r\n  architecture decisions, and help define how AI gets built — the right\r\n  way.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Compensation:&nbsp;equity until MVP&nbsp;launch,\r\n  competitive salary after — with meaningful ownership and long-term\r\n  upside.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">What&nbsp;You’ll&nbsp;Do <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Design\r\n       and build features using modern LLM workflows (RAG, agents, tools,\r\n       structured prompting, evals).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Prototype\r\n       quickly using AI coding tools&nbsp;-&nbsp;while ensuring code is still\r\n       maintainable and reviewed.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Implement\r\n       guardrails, observability, and feedback loops to make AI outputs\r\n       reliable and safe.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Work\r\n       with product to translate user problems into testable experiments and\r\n       shippable features.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Integrate\r\n       AI services (closed-source + open-source models) depending on cost,\r\n       latency, privacy, and risk.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Contribute\r\n       to our developer experience: CI/CD, testing, monitoring, and\r\n       automation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Stay\r\n       current with emerging AI platforms, benchmarks, and best practices — and\r\n       help us adopt them thoughtfully.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">What You Bring <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Design\r\n       and build features using modern LLM workflows (RAG, agents, tools,\r\n       structured prompting, evals).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Prototype\r\n       quickly using AI coding tools - while ensuring code is still\r\n       maintainable and reviewed.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Implement\r\n       guardrails, observability, and feedback loops to make AI outputs\r\n       reliable and safe.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Work\r\n       with product to translate user problems into testable experiments and\r\n       shippable features.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Integrate\r\n       AI services (closed-source + open-source models) depending on cost,\r\n       latency, privacy, and risk.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Contribute\r\n       to our developer experience: CI/CD, testing, monitoring, and\r\n       automation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Stay\r\n       current with emerging AI platforms, benchmarks, and best practices — and\r\n       help us adopt them thoughtfully.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Bonus (nice to have, not&nbsp;required): <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with vector databases, observability tools, or AI evaluation\r\n       frameworks.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Exposure\r\n       to&nbsp;data privacy, ethics, or responsible AI practices.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Built\r\n       something&nbsp;end-to-end (startup, side project, OSS, hackathon, or\r\n       internal tool).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:#33