 within Salesforce.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong project management\r\n     capabilities including exceptional communication skills &amp; a bias to\r\n     urgency combined with a high level of organization.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong reporting &amp;\r\n     analytics capabilities with the ability to utilize the information to\r\n     influence decision making for the team and across the organization.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Meet regularly with team and\r\n     organization leadership regarding technology development &amp; projects,\r\n     growth initiatives, integration efforts, etc.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Coordinate efforts between\r\n     multiple national offices and integration with sales, operations,\r\n     marketing and technology services.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Actively lead or assist with\r\n     Salesforce development testing, manage the Enablement Team’s Seismic\r\n     Platform, and participate in any other relevant technology projects.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Act as a team lead by assisting\r\n     Analysts III and IV in efforts related to project management, process\r\n     excellence, communication, technology tools and more.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Drive technology initiatives\r\n     related to improving overall selling techniques &amp; effectiveness<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Assist in promoting a unified\r\n     sales culture across all markets<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Drive awareness &amp; adoption\r\n     of systems &amp; tools while providing specialized local support<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Influence sales activity KPIs\r\n     and business intelligence<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Be responsible for the\r\n     accountabilities of an Analyst III and IV &amp; other duties as assigned<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Education, Experience, &amp; Skill\r\nRequirements</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in;list-style-position:initial\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strategic, analytical, &amp;\r\n     detail-oriented with knowledge of sales operations, competitive company\r\n     metrics, best practices, and sales processes with a proven track record of\r\n     strong decision-making abilities and a bias to continuous improvement<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Ability to lead presentations\r\n     for a variety of audiences, including executive leadership, with a talent\r\n     for encouraging higher level colleagues to execute on decisions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Project Management experience\r\n     preferred<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Highly proficient with\r\n     technology including extensive experience with MS Office, Salesforce, SAP\r\n     or additional CRMs, JIRA, etc.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Technology certifications a\r\n     plus with expectation that Salesforce certification completed within 1\r\n     year of employment in role<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong communication and\r\n     collaboration skills desired<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Ability to travel nationally up\r\n     to 25% of time<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">High school diploma or\r\n     equivalent<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience gained through\r\n     college degree programs and/or preferred<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">7+ years experience preferred<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Key Metrics</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in;list-style-position:initial\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Leverage skills to produce\r\n     actionable performance insights for the organization through proactive\r\n     project management, active support of core operational initiatives, and\r\n     development &amp; delivery of strategic assessments<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Assist sales &amp; support\r\n     functions of organization through development &amp; deployment of\r\n     Salesforce enhancements both assigned &amp; recommended<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Build energized relationships\r\n     with Business Markets IT Teams<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Consistently collaborate with\r\n     Enablement Team &amp; Leadership and supports Team through\r\n     cross-functional interactions across organizations.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Contribute to growth of\r\n     Business Markets segments while also improving and empowering the culture\r\n     of the organization.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Offer guidance and leverage\r\n     decisions-making skills when Team Leadership is unavailable<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-05-11', '23:30:00', '00:00:00', '2026-05-11 19:25:24', '2026-05-11 19:25:45', 0, '2026-05-11 15:37:37', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-282@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
