style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Mon May, 11. 2026 | 02:00 Pm – 03:00 Pm (EST)</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:35.2pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 211.25pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 35.2pt; border-color: currentcolor;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xskipproofing\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Round Of&nbsp;Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 314.85pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 35.2pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xskipproofing\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xskipproofing\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">1 Round</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 211.25pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt; border-color: currentcolor;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xskipproofing\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview&nbsp;Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 314.85pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Abraham Vargas-</span></b><span style=\"color:black\">Executive VP Of Operations @ Roth Industries&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Linkedin</span></b><span style=\"color:black\">-<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/abraham-vargas-681352162/\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/abraham-vargas-681352162/</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:34.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 211.25pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 34.65pt; border-color: currentcolor;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xskipproofing\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview&nbsp;Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 314.85pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 34.65pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xskipproofing\"><span style=\"color:#242424\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Microsoft Teams</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:34.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 211.25pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 34.65pt; border-color: currentcolor;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview&nbsp;Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 314.85pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 34.65pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#5B5FC7\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/287275321439124?p=5Cr95iE0q6vCeyYV5a\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\"><span style=\"color:#5B5FC7\">https://teams.microsoft.com/</span></a><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/287275321439124?p=5Cr95iE0q6vCeyYV5a\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\"><span style=\"color:#5B5FC7\">meet/287275321439124?p=</span></a><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/287275321439124?p=5Cr95iE0q6vCeyYV5a\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\"><span style=\"color:#5B5FC7\">5Cr95iE0q6vCeyYV5a</span></a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 211.25pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt; border-color: currentcolor;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Job Description</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 314.85pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xskipproofing\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">About the job</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Procurement Specialist</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;Roth Industries | North Colorado Springs</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Salary Range $80K – $90K, depending on experience.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Join a National Leader in Fresh Prepared Foods</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;Roth Industries is a diversified prepared foods company\r\n  specializing in manufacturing, distributing, marketing, and selling freshly\r\n  prepared foods. We proudly distribute our own brands in more than 8,000\r\n  stores nationwide through the country’s largest retailers and supermarket\r\n  chains. We also partner with grocers, restaurants, CPG start-ups, and\r\n  established brands to provide private-label and co-packed solutions.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Position Summary</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;We are seeking a detail-oriented and proactive Procurement\r\n  Specialist to support our fast-paced food manufacturing operations. This role\r\n  is responsible for purchasing ingredients and packaging, managing vendor\r\n  relationships, maintaining accurate inventory across multiple warehouses, and\r\n  supporting production planning through NetSuite. The ideal candidate thrives\r\n  in a hands-on environment and can balance multiple priorities while ensuring\r\n  accuracy and timeliness.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Key Responsibilities</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Procurement &amp; Vendor Management</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Purchase raw materials and packaging from a network of 25+\r\n  vendors</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Generate and manage purchase orders in NetSuite</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Adjust orders based on demand and production changes</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Track orders, follow up with vendors, and ensure on-time\r\n  delivery</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Expedite urgent or delayed shipments</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Communicate forecasts and manage vendor\r\n  documentation/specifications</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Production Planning &amp; NetSuite Management</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Set up and maintain items, vendors, and recipes in NetSuite</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Create and manage work orders to support production</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Participate in production planning meetings</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Inventory &amp; Receiving</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Receive materials in NetSuite and verify against purchase orders</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Resolve discrepancies in shipments and documentation</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Maintain inventory across multiple warehouse locations (internal\r\n  and external)</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Manage warehouse transfers, reporting, and monthly inventory\r\n  counts</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Reconcile inventory discrepancies</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Order Management &amp; Reporting</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Process customer and sales orders daily in NetSuite</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Maintain PO trackers and internal reporting tools</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Generate weekly cost, purchasing, and sales reports</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Support sales and inventory reporting at the store level</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Qualifications</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">2–5 years of experience in procurement, supply chain, or\r\n  inventory management</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Experience in food manufacturing, CPG, or related industry\r\n  strongly preferred</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Proficiency with ERP systems (NetSuite preferred) and Microsoft\r\n  Excel</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Strong organizational skills and attention to detail</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced\r\n  environment</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Why Join Roth Industries?</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Be part of a growing national food company with products in\r\n  8,000+ stores</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Work in a collaborative, operations-focused environment</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Gain hands-on experience across procurement, production, and\r\n  supply chain</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Opportunity to make a direct impact on business performance and\r\n  efficiency</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Apply today to join a team that is shaping the future of fresh\r\n  prepared foods.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Requirements added by the job poster</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• Commute to this job’s location</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• Can start immediately</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• Working in an onsite setting</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• No need for visa sponsorship</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• 2+ years of Food and Beverage Manufacturing experience</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-11', '23:30:00', '00:30:00', '2026-05-11 17:58:57', '2026-05-11 18:24:26', 60, '2026-05-11 15:53:33', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-285@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `client_id`, `candidate_id`, `poc_id`, `task_type_id`, `status_id`, `title`, `description`, `due_date`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `task_start_time`, `task_end_time`, `duration`, `created_at`, `total_amount`, `payment_status_id`, `payment_mode`, `paid_at`, `reference_no`, `payment_notes`, `email_thread_id`, `invoice_id`, `billing_status`) VALUES
(286, 5, 113, 4, 1, 4, 'FW: Technical Interview With Apple for Meghana Dhanekula - AI/ML Engineer Mon May 11, 2026, At 02:00 PM – 03:15 PM (ET)', '<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;letter-spacing:.15pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Hi Meghana Chowdary,</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;letter-spacing:.15pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Our team is looking forward to meeting with you. The\r\nnext step is to confirm your interview plan for the Software QA Engineer,\r\nMachine Learning - Creativity Apps role. Please reply to this email to let me\r\nknow that you’re available.&nbsp;Here are the interview details:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\npadding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\"\r\n coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\"\r\n filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\r\n <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\r\n <v:formulas>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\r\n </v:formulas>\r\n <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\r\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"x__x005f_x0000_i1025\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\r\n alt=\"Image removed by sender.\" style=\'width:36pt;height:33pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/Admin1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.jpg\"\r\n  o:href=\"cid:image004.jpg@01DCE10D.0D5215A0\"/>\r\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img width=\"48\" height=\"44\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"height:.458in;width:.5in\" alt=\"Image removed by sender.\" border=\"0\" v:shapes=\"x__x005f_x0000_i1025\"><!--[endif]--></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;Schedule</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;letter-spacing:.15pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Please note that interview details are subject to\r\nchange. To prepare, you may want to take a look at our </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#0066CC;letter-spacing:.15pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/careers/us/interview_tips.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0066CC\">interview tips</span></a></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;letter-spacing:.15pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">. Wear\r\nwhatever you think presents your best self in a work setting.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Overview</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Monday, May 11, 2026</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">01:00 PM to 01:30 PM Central Daylight Time<br>\r\n01:30 PM to 02:15 PM Central Daylight Time</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Details</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Monday, May 11, 2026</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Your interview will take place on Webex:<br>\r\n</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#0066CC;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://appleinc.webex.com/appleinc/j.php?MTID=mc4f28a05eb9ef4d4f4dd9d3b4021cc61\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0066CC\">Interview Link</span></a></span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">01:00 PM to 01:30 PM Central Daylight Time<br>\r\nRochelle</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">01:30 PM to 02:15 PM Central Daylight Time<br>\r\nBegum<br>\r\nOn-Demand Assessment: </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#0066CC;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://app.coderpad.io/KNZ3ZQ63\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0066CC\">CoderPad</span></a></span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\"><br>\r\nWebex Information</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Join the meeting no more than 10 minutes prior to the start time. To\r\nmake sure your device is ready, you can test it on the </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#0066CC;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.webex.com/test-meeting.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0066CC\">Webex</span></a></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;site. For additional\r\ninformation, visit </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#0066CC;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://help.webex.com/ld-4ew3r4-CiscoWebexSupport/Webex-Support#Get-Started\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0066CC\">Webex&nbsp;Support</span></a></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">If there are any technical issues related to Webex, the interviewer will\r\ncall you at +1(682) 433-0400. Let me know if you’d like us to use a different\r\nphone number. If no one enters the meeting within five minutes of the scheduled\r\nstart time, please contact me.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Other important things to know</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;letter-spacing:.15pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">At Apple, we’re not all the same. And that’s our\r\ngreatest strength. We draw on the differences in who we are, what we’ve\r\nexperienced, and how we think. Because to create products that serve everyone,\r\nwe believe in including everyone. And we want you to feel supported in bringing\r\nyour best self to the interview experience. Should you need any accommodation\r\nto do so, please let me know. Any information received by email will be used\r\nonly to schedule the required accommodations and will not be retained beyond the\r\ncompletion of this interview.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Apple is considering you as a candidate for employment based upon your\r\nrelevant knowledge, experience, and skills. Please do not discuss any\r\nconfidential, proprietary, or trade secret information or intellectual property\r\nof any other persons or entities, including employers, nor disclose such\r\ninformation to anyone at Apple.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">To ensure a fair and accurate evaluation of your individual skills and\r\nexpertise, please do not use any form of AI assistance during the hiring\r\nprocess, unless given clear instructions to use AI by your recruiter or\r\ninterviewer. By proceeding, you confirm that you are not using AI.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Taking screenshots, photos, or videos during the interview is strictly\r\nprohibited.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">If you have any questions, feel free to contact me or your recruiter,\r\nBlake McAuley. And remember, there’s a reason we say, “Join us. Be you.” We\r\nreally want you to feel welcome here, in interviews and throughout your entire\r\nApple experience. I encourage you to check out a few ways Apple team members\r\nfeel they belong here — through the </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#0066CC;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/careers/us/shared-values.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0066CC\">values we share</span></a></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;and the strength of </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#0066CC;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/careers/us/dna.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0066CC\">our communities</span></a></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;l