 width=\"204\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 152.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Present<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">&nbsp;</span>Location<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">&nbsp;</span>with<span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n  -.25pt\">&nbsp;</span>zip<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">&nbsp;</span>code</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1301\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 975.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">133 cottage street, New Jersey, Journal Square. 07306</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"204\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 152.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Company Name&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1301\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 975.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#41444E;background:#F7F6F6\">bonfire\r\n  effect</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"204\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 152.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview&nbsp;Date &amp; Time</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1301\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 975.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  11.5pt;color:#242424\">Mon, May 11, 2026, • 3:00</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:#242424\">PM – 3:30</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:#242424\">PM (EST)</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:35.2pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"204\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 152.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 35.2pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Round Of&nbsp;Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1301\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 975.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 35.2pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:#242424\">1st Round Interview\r\n  (Technical)</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"204\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 152.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview&nbsp;Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1301\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 975.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Isaac Bartholomew - Chief\r\n  Operating Officer</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">LinkedIn - <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/isaac-bartholomew/\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/isaac-bartholomew/</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"204\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 152.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview&nbsp;Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1301\" style=\"width: 975.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#C82613\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1A73E8\">Microsoft Teams meeting</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"204\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 152.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview&nbsp;Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1301\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 975.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/211510402852791?p=8G5tm4ga7fHlJRtd7F\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/211510402852791?p=8G5tm4ga7fHlJRtd7F</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"204\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 152.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview&nbsp;JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1301\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 975.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"line-height: 13.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Job\r\n  Overview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">About the job</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">the role.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Do you see yourself as the river-rafting guide of\r\n  transformation—reading the water, calling the lines, and steering teams\r\n  through the whitewater of business without flipping the boat?</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Bonfire Effect is looking for an Integration Project Manager who\r\n  has mastered both “figuring it out” and working with people (a lot to ask, we\r\n  know).</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">This role lives at the heart of a major technology\r\n  integration—where strategy meets reality, systems collide, and progress\r\n  depends as much on trust and relationships as it does on timelines and\r\n  spreadsheets. You’re the calm in the chaos. The connector. The steady hand\r\n  that keeps smart, well-intentioned humans aligned and moving forward when\r\n  things get messy.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">You won’t be hiding in the background updating plans no one\r\n  reads. You’ll be visible, trusted, and pulled into the conversations that\r\n  actually matter. If you love understanding how things work, asking sharp\r\n  questions, and translating complexity in a way that clicks, you’ll feel right\r\n  at home here.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Most importantly, you get shit done—with confidence, not force.\r\n  You create momentum without drama, clarity without condescension, and\r\n  progress without leaving people behind. You know when to push, when to\r\n  listen, and when a well-timed joke keeps the team paddling in the same\r\n  direction.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">If that sounds like your kind of campfire, pull up an\r\n  Adirondack.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">the bonfire effect.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">While this role is directly supporting a client, you’ll be part\r\n  of Bonfire Effect’s Professional Services team —a trusted group of experts\r\n  and problem solvers embedded inside our clients’ organizations.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">We bring our love of people, fearless creativity, and commitment\r\n  to doing the right thing to every engagement. A thriving change\r\n  transformation and staff augmentation agency, Bonfire Effect boasts a\r\n  passionate team of problem solvers who ignite our clients’ brands—whether\r\n  that’s a local nonprofit or a global technology company navigating a\r\n  once-in-a-generation integration.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">We’re a diverse crew of folks who start fires. Not literally\r\n  (though we <i>do</i> have an annual Bonfire bonfire), but the kind that\r\n  sparks change and illuminates new opportunities. We work smart, play hard,\r\n  and live with passion.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Some of\r\n       us love change management.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Some of\r\n       us love project management.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Some of\r\n       us love PowerPoint (J/K—no one loves PPT).</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Some of\r\n       us love memes about grammar corrections.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">We don’t judge. We embrace our differences and look for ways to\r\n  fuel each other’s interests. And you’re in luck—we’re currently looking to\r\n  add a Project Manager to our team.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Pull up a chair. Let’s start something.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">day in the life.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">As a Bonfire Integration Project Manager, you’ll:</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Live\r\n       the values: Show up grounded in Bonfire’s core values—fearless\r\n       creativity, contagious love, and <i>let go, have fun</i>.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Be the\r\n       connector: Coordinate multiple integration workstreams, acting as a\r\n       central point of alignment between functional leads, stakeholders, and\r\n       the integration core team.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Own the\r\n       plan: Maintain and evolve detailed project plans, milestones,\r\n       dependencies, and dashboards using tools like Smartsheet.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Surface\r\n       the hard stuff: Identify risks, issues, and performance gaps early—and\r\n       work with leaders to drive corrective action before they become\r\n       problems.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Drive\r\n       momentum: Support planning, execution, and readiness activities to keep\r\n       workstreams aligned and delivering.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Translate\r\n       complexity: Turn data, analysis, and business insights into clear\r\n       updates, practical recommendations, and actionable next steps.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Support\r\n       change: Help teams navigate ambiguity with professionalism, empathy, and\r\n       clarity.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Improve\r\n       how we work: Adhere to Bonfire processes, identify opportunities for\r\n       continuous improvement, and propose smarter ways of operating.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">what you’ll need.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Minimum Requirements</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">:</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">6–10\r\n       years of experience project managing complex, cross-functional\r\n       initiatives in technical, operational, or integration-heavy\r\n       environments.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong\r\n       technical aptitude and comfort working with detailed systems,\r\n       dependencies, and data.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">High\r\n       confidence in verbal and written communication—you enjoy facilitating\r\n       discussions and guiding teams toward alignment.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Natural\r\n       relationship builder who gains energy from collaboration.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Ability\r\n       to move at a fast pace while helping others stay aligned and grounded.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong\r\n       business sense—you understand acquisition environments and how\r\n       integration work connects to broader business goals.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Developed\r\n       leadership skills, including facilitation and conflict resolution.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">High\r\n       emotional intelligence, sound judgment, and a calm presence under\r\n       pressure.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Comfort\r\n       working in visible roles where interaction is constant and your voice\r\n       matters.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Proficiency\r\n       with Smartsheet.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong\r\n       working knowledge of Microsoft tools (PowerPoint, Excel, Outlook).</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">We’re most interested in finding the best candidate for the\r\n  position—and that person may come from a wide variety of backgrounds. If this\r\n  role excites you, we encourage you to apply and let us learn how your\r\n  experience could translate.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">the benefits.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">22\r\n       vacation / personal days to rest &amp; recharge</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">12 paid\r\n       holidays, including the entire week between Christmas and New Year’s</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Salary\r\n       range between $85k–$110k (final compensation based on experience)</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">100%\r\n       medical, vision, and dental coverage</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">401(k)\r\n       retirement savings plan with employer match</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Annual\r\n       investment in learning &amp; professional development</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">how to apply.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">the steps:</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ol style=\"margin-top:0in\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Send a\r\n       cover letter and your resume to <a href=\"mailto:careers@bonfireeffect.com\">careers@bonfireeffect.com</a>.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bonus\r\n       points for including a GIF or meme that captures who you are or what\r\n       you’re into (mostly SFW).</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n       &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Please\r\n       also complete the Culture Index questionnaire: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgo%2Ecultureindex%2Ecom%2Fp%2FPWPUyXZpSUQjpAGcUv&amp;urlhash=02wa&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">https://go.cultureindex.com/p/PWPUyXZpSUQjpAGcUv</a></span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ol>\r\n  <p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">let’s ignite something!</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">\r\n  <hr size=\"1\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n  </span></div>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Benefits found in job post</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">401(k), Medical insurance, Vision insurance, Dental insurance</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">\r\n  <hr size=\"1\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n  </span></div>\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Requirements added by the job poster</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• Working in a remote setting</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• 3+ years of work experience with Smartsheet</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• Accept a background check</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• Authorized to work in the United States</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• 6+ years of work experience with Microsoft PowerPoint.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Topics to Prepare For:</b></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">• Your Career Snapshot:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;Give me the highlight\r\n  reel of your journey so far—what are the big wins, favorite projects, or the\r\n  path you’ve blazed?</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">•&nbsp;<b>Dream Role:</b>&nbsp;What’s the gig that would really\r\n  spark your passion? Let’s talk about the roles that fan your flames.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">•&nbsp;<b>Why&nbsp;Bonfire Effect?:</b>&nbsp;I’m all ears to\r\n  hear why you think&nbsp;Bonfire Effect&nbsp;might be your next great\r\n  adventure.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-11', '00:30:00', '01:00:00', '2026-05-11 19:39:43', '2026-05-11 19:40:18', 30, '2026-05-11 15:59:07', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-287@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
