(288, 5, 33, 4, 1, 5, 'FW: Interview Support - Sudheer Kirar -Fraud Analyst -05/11/2026 - 3:30 AM – 4:00 PM (EDT) -Bank of America', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Please assign the support person to the one of\r\nour candidate Sudheer Kirar– Fraud Analyst for his upcoming Interview with</span><b>&nbsp;Bank\r\nof America</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">- 05/11/2026 -\r\n3:30 AM – 4:00 PM (EDT)<br>\r\n<span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">This 30 min of interview\r\nmight get extend because there is total 3 interviewers so, please schedule our\r\nslot accordingly <br>\r\n</span></span><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Interviewers:\r\n<br>\r\nAndrew Glessner, Fraud Analytics and Innovation Senior Leader<br>\r\nPreet Singh, Fraud Analytics and Innovation Leader<br>\r\nVincenzo Digilio, Fraud Analytics and Innovation Lead Analyst</span> <b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Candidate Name<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1153\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:865.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sudheer kirar<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Technology<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1153\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:865.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  pad