ivaled by traditional retail. Sam\'s Club provides a carefully curated\r\nassortment of items, as well as developing and leading technologies and\r\nservices such as Scan &amp; Go, Club Pickup, and home delivery service in\r\nselect markets. Sam\'s Club also provides travel, auto purchasing, pharmacy,\r\noptical, hearing aid centers, tire and battery centers, and a portfolio of\r\nbusiness operations support services.<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#2196F3\">What you\'ll do...</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#0A0A0A\">As a Software Engineer III on the Sam’s Club\r\nweb engineering team, you will help shape and deliver engaging member-facing\r\nexperiences for the community area of the Sam’s Club e-commerce platform. You\r\nwill contribute to web application architecture, build scalable and\r\nhigh-quality features, and help drive strong performance, maintainability, and\r\nengineering excellence. In this role, you will collaborate closely with\r\nengineering, product, design, and business partners to deliver solutions that\r\nalign with product strategy and member needs. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nWhat you\'ll do: <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:15.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#0A0A0A;\r\nfont-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#0A0A0A\">Design, build, test, and maintain core\r\nfeatures for the Sam’s Club web community experience.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:15.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#0A0A0A;\r\nfont-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#0A0A0A\">Contribute to the technical direction and\r\nimplementation of web solutions across e-commerce engineering initiatives.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:15.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#0A0A0A;\r\nfont-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#0A0A0A\">Partner with engineering leaders, product\r\nmanagers, designers, and business stakeholders to create a cohesive approach to\r\nweb application development.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:15.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#0A0A0A;\r\nfont-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#0A0A0A\">Work within complex system architectures and\r\nenhance existing solutions with scalable, maintainable improvements.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:15.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#0A0A0A;\r\nfont-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-o