(302, 20, 86, 17, 1, 4, 'NA', 'https://eofe.fa.us2.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/BNY-Careers/job/73123/?keyword=JAVA&amp;location=United+States&amp;locationId=300000000378743&amp;locationLevel=country&amp;mode=location', '2026-05-12', '22:15:00', '23:28:00', '2026-05-12 16:21:45', '2026-05-12 18:54:24', 73, '2026-05-12 16:03:54', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-302@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(303, 9, 120, 6, 1, 4, 'FW:  Technical Interview With VUMC for LOKESH KOLLEPARA - Tomorrow • 4:00 PM – 4:40 PM', '<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Job\r\nSummary: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">This role will design,\r\nbuild, and operate production-grade agentic AI solutions and supporting\r\ninfrastructure using Python. You will develop AI agents and workflows that\r\nsecurely leverage institutional data, systems, and tooling to automate routine\r\ntechnical and operational work, accelerate delivery of AI-enabled capabilities,\r\nand enable broader adoption through reusable components and patterns.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">This is a hands-on engineering role\r\nfocused on taking concepts from prototype to production—iterating quickly while\r\nmeeting enterprise expectations for security, reliability, maintainability, and\r\ndocumentation.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b><span style=\"color: black; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Key Responsibilities </span></b></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Design and implement agentic AI workflows and services\r\nin Python, including tool-using agents, orchestrated multi-step processes, and\r\nintegration patterns. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Build and maintain reusable frameworks/components for\r\nagent development (e.g., agent runners, tool registries, prompt/config\r\nmanagement, evaluation harnesses). </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Integrate agents with enterprise data sources and\r\nsystems in a secure, auditable manner (APIs, services, databases, and internal\r\nplatforms as applicable). </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Develop and harden AI-enabled applications and\r\nsupporting APIs for internal use, including deployments to OpenShift. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Implement best practices for production readiness:\r\ntesting, logging/metrics, error handling, performance considerations, and\r\noperational runbooks. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Contribute to platform standards and reference\r\nimplementations for agentic development (including patterns aligned with Model\r\nContext Protocol where applicable). </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</