serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience deploying and operating services in\r\ncontainerized environments; comfortable with CI/CD concepts and operational\r\nrequirements. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Familiarity deploying web services or internal apps to\r\nplatforms such as OpenShift (or equivalent Kubernetes-based environments). </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Required\r\nQualifications </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; ve