=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">NA<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\"><a href=\"https://interview.upwage.com/s/seniordataengineer-unitedstates/bd3c8043-941f-4633-bc49-5d6b795fcb06\" target=\"_blank\">https://interview.upwage.com/s/seniordataengineer-unitedstates/bd3c8043-941f-4633-bc49-5d6b795fcb06</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">NA<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span>Hello Chaitanya priya,&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">To help you quickly progress\r\nwith your application for the Senior Data Engineer position, we ask that you\r\ncomplete this 20<b>-minute assessment</b>&nbsp;to explore the projects you’ve\r\nmanaged in your career.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">We kindly ask that your\r\nresponses reflect your own experiences, skills, and understanding. While you\r\nmay use tools to improve clarity, keep the content your own. For the best\r\nexperience, complete this on a laptop and finish it in one session. If you exit\r\nbefore finishing, you\'ll need to start over. When writing your responses, note\r\nthat pressing Enter/Return on your keyboard will submit your answer. To prevent\r\naccidental submissions, we recommend keeping your responses within one\r\nparagraph.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Please review your answers\r\ncarefully before submitting, as responses cannot be edited afterward.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">To start the assessment,\r\nclick the link below:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><a href=\"https://interview.upwage.com/s/seniordataengineer-unitedstates/bd3c8043-941f-4633-bc49-5d6b795fcb06\" target=\"_blank\">https://interview.upwage.com/s/seniordataengineer-unitedstates/bd3c8043-941f-4633-bc49-5d6b795fcb06</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">We kindly request that you\r\ncomplete this assessment within&nbsp;<b>three days</b>&nbsp;of receiving this\r\nmessage.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Your application will still\r\nreceive a thorough review by one of our recruiters, but will be enhanced by\r\nyour responses. If your experience aligns with the role, we will be in touch\r\nregarding next steps.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">We\'re excited about the\r\npossibility of you joining our team and look forward to your continued\r\nengagement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Regards,<br>\r\nMetropolis Recruiting Team<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-05-12', '23:45:00', '00:30:00', '2026-05-18 19:33:28', '2026-05-18 19:33:48', 45, '2026-05-12 17:19:09', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-305@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(306, 5, 121, 4, 4, 4, 'FW: RUC - Reddy Kamal Teja Thota - Data Scientist', '<p>I hope you\'re doing well.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of my candidates, Reddy Kamal Teja Thota<b>,</b>&nbsp;who is a Data\r\nScientist, is in need of a&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Resume Understanding Session</span></strong>. I\r\nwould appreciate it if you could kindly assist him with this.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos\">Candidate Contact Information:</span></strong><br>\r\n<b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;color:black;background:yellow\">📞</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Contact:</span></b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n+1&nbsp;(716) 303-9059<b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;background:yellow\"><br>\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;color:black;background:yellow\">📧</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;Email\r\n:&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:kamal.t@mycvscout.com\" target=\"_blank\">kamal.t@mycvscout.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b>Availability:-&nbsp; Anytime&nbsp;after\r\n05:30 PM EST<br>\r\n</b><br>\r\nThanks &amp; Regard,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br clear=\"all\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-12', '12:00:00', '12:45:00', '2026-05-12 19:56:48', '2026-05-12 19:57:22', 45, '2026-05-12 17:21:49', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-306@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(307, 5, 122, 4, 4, 4, 'FW: RUC - Setu Chaudhari - Marketing Analyst', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello Team,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I hope you\'re doing well.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of my candidates, Setu Chaudhari, a Marketing analyst, needs a&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Resume\r\nUnderstanding Session</span></strong>. I would appreciate it if you could\r\nkindly assist her with this.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos\">Candidate Contact Information:</span></strong><br>\r\n<b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;color:black;background:yellow\">📞</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span>\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Contact:</span></b>&nbsp;+1\r\n(647) 267-1926<b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\nbackground:yellow\"><br>\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;color:black;background:yellow\">📧</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span>\r\n<span style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Email :&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:setuuchaudhari@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">setuuchaudhari@gmail.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Availability:-&nbsp; 11:00AM - 03:00PM EST (Canada)</b><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-12', '12:00:00', '12:45:00', '2026-05-13 16:38:17', '2026-05-13 16:42:35', 45, '2026-05-12 17:23:42', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-307@bsquare