USA</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:4;height:27.1pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"359\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 269.15pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.1pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Education&nbsp;Details</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"869\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 9.05in; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.1pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Masters in Finance&nbsp; - The\r\n  University of Texas at Dallas, Texas</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">BBA (Major in Finance and Minor\r\n  in Economics)&nbsp;&nbsp;- Amity University, Noida, India</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5;height:28.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"359\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 269.15pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 28.25pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Present&nbsp;Company&nbsp;s&nbsp;Address</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"869\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 9.05in; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt; height: 28.25pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Bank of America&nbsp;, Texas,\r\n  USA&nbsp; ,&nbsp; &nbsp;Aug 2024 - Present</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6;height:27.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"359\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 269.15pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Vendor&nbsp;Company &amp;\r\n  Name</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"869\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 9.05in; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td width=\"834\" nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:625.35pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;\r\n    max-height:20px\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"834\" style=\"width: 625.35pt;\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding: 0in; border-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n      <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n       <tbody><tr>\r\n        <td width=\"1056\" nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 792.1pt; padding: 0in; border-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"1056\" style=\"width: 792.1pt; border-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n         <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:\r\n          yes;height:33.75pt\">\r\n          <td width=\"1056\" nowrap=\"\" style=\"width:792.1pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;\r\n          height:33.75pt\">\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:\r\n            yes;height:15.0pt\">\r\n            <td width=\"736\" nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:551.7pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;\r\n            height:15.0pt;max-height:20px\"></td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><b><u><span style=\"color:black\">Laborin, Bernadette</span></u></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td width=\"766\" nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:574.5pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;\r\n            max-height:20px\">\r\n            <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"766\" style=\"width: 574.5pt;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_table_0\">\r\n             <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:\r\n              yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n              <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:16.5pt\">\r\n              <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><b><u><span style=\"color:black\">,&nbsp;</span></u></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n              </td>\r\n             </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">USAA</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:40.15pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"359\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 269.15pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 40.15pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:13.2pt\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Client&nbsp;Details&nbsp;and&nbsp;Location&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;applied&nbsp;position</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"869\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 9.05in; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt; height: 40.15pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;USAA&nbsp;, TX</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in\"><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp;<b>Total&nbsp;Candidate&nbsp;Experience 4 years</b></span></u><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5pt; border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_table_1\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 249.3pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 23.6pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Bank\r\n  of America&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 249.3pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 23.6pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Aug&nbsp;\r\n  2024 - Present</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:22.8pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 249.3pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 22.8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Deloitte</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 249.3pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt; height: 22.8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Mar&nbsp;2021\r\n  - Jul 2023</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 249.3pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 23.55pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 249.3pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt; height: 23.55pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Job Description</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Why USAA?</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">At\r\nUSAA, our mission is to empower our members to achieve financial security\r\nthrough highly competitive products, exceptional service and trusted advice. We\r\nseek to be the #1 choice for the military community and their families.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Embrace\r\na fulfilling career at USAA, where our core values – honesty, integrity,\r\nloyalty and service – define how we treat each other and our members. Be part\r\nof what truly makes us special and impactful.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">The Opportunity</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">As\r\na dedicated Financial Analyst, you are responsible for solving business\r\nproblems while performing forecasting, planning, and financial modeling related\r\nto income, profitability, liquidity, capital, leverage, asset and liability\r\nmanagement or operating expense. Ensures all activities are completed within\r\nregulatory and compliance guidelines. This role works directly with the\r\nRegional Vice President &amp; Regional Lead Analyst to ensure emerging\r\nfinancial trends are monitored and provide proactive insights that directly\r\nenable achievement of financial targets.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">We\r\noffer a flexible work environment that requires an individual to be <b>in the\r\noffice 4 days per week.</b>&nbsp;This position can be based in one of the\r\nfollowing locations: San Antonio, TX or Charlotte, NC. Relocation assistance is\r\n<b>not</b>&nbsp;available for this position.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">What you\'ll do:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Develops financial forecasts/plans for a large\r\n     and moderately complex to complex business area or expense category;\r\n     Develops and implements forecasting/planning process, and model\r\n     improvement initiatives.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Independently prepares recurring or ad hoc\r\n     financial reports and analysis or cost benefit analysis to support and\r\n     provide insights for internal and external management decision-making.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;Delivers moderately complex to complex\r\n     financial research and value-added business decision support and\r\n     recommends or implements solutions to key financial and operational\r\n     opportunities.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Responsible for product assignments, product\r\n     pricing, product profitability and ad hoc analysis.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Acts as a valued business partner by providing\r\n     informed, proactive analysis and business insights to enable effective\r\n     decision-making and efficient resource utilization.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Acquires and applies intermediate knowledge of\r\n     the business, its products and processes to resolve issues and navigate\r\n     obstacles to deliver work product.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l18 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Ensures risks associated with business activities\r\n     are effectively identified, measured, monitored, and controlled in\r\n     accordance with risk and compliance policies and procedures.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">What you have:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l16 level1 lfo8;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Bachelor’s degree in Business, Accounting,\r\n     Finance, Economics, or related field is required; OR 4 years of related\r\n     experience (in addition to the minimum years of experience required) may\r\n     be substituted in lieu of degree.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">4 years’ experience conducting\r\n     financial/accounting analysis, preparing financial reports, or financial\r\n     plans and providing recommendations; OR Advanced degree in Business,\r\n     Accounting, Finance, Economics, or a related field, progress towards a\r\n     CPA, or CFA designation and 2 years of financial / accounting analysis or\r\n     related work experience.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l13 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Ability to communicate financial/accounting\r\n     concepts.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo11;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience in a financial services environment.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo12;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience using Microsoft Office Excel for\r\n     financial data analysis.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l10 level1 lfo13;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience working with financial/accounting\r\n     technologies.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo14;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Understanding, application, and adherence to\r\n     financial regulations and compliance.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo15;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience producing financial reports.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo16;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">General knowledge of GAAP.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">What sets you apart:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l15 level1 lfo17;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">FP&amp;A experience with relevant industry tools\r\n     to execute financial forecasting and analysis.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">P&amp;C business acumen and experience with\r\n     product management (State, Countrywide/National, Finance, Underwriting,\r\n     Pricing).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l19 level1 lfo19;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Effective communication skills and ability to\r\n     drive outcomes.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l14 level1 lfo20;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">US military experience through military service\r\n     or a military spouse/domestic partner.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Compensation range: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The salary range for this position is: $77,120 -\r\n$147,390<b>.</b></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">USAA does not provide visa sponsorship for this role. Please do not\r\napply for this role if at any time (now or in the future) you will need\r\nimmigration support (i.e., H-1B, TN, STEM OPT Training Plans, etc.).</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Compensation:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;USAA has an effective process for assessing market data and\r\nestablishing ranges to ensure we remain competitive. You are paid within the\r\nsalary range based on your experience and market data of the position. The\r\nactual salary for this role may vary by lo', '2026-05-12', '02:30:00', '03:15:00', '2026-05-12 20:50:56', '2026-05-13 12:49:08', 45, '2026-05-12 19:10:45', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-308@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
