5pt; height: 69.8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Western Alliance Bank,</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;Phoenix, AZ&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Columbus, OH&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">•\r\nTotal Candidate Experience 4.5+&nbsp;years</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_table_1\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:35.4pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"227\" style=\"width: 170pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 35.4pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>ON Semiconductor</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"168\" style=\"width: 126.2pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 35.4pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Aug 2024 – Present<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:40.8pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"227\" style=\"width: 170pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 40.8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Wipro</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"168\" style=\"width: 126.2pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt; height: 40.8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Jul 2020 – Jul 2023<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job description</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Azure Cloud Engineer<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAzure security experience is a plus<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLocation: Phoenix, AZ or Columbus, OH (On-site, Monday–Friday)<br>\r\nType: Contract-to-Hire (6–12 months)<br>\r\nIndustry: Financial Services / Banking<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe are seeking an experienced Azure Cloud Engineer to support the design,\r\nimplementation, and optimization of cloud infrastructure within a highly\r\nregulated enterprise environment. This role will work closely with\r\ninfrastructure, security, and application teams to build scalable, secure, and\r\nhigh-performing cloud solutions.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey Responsibilities<br>\r\nDesign, deploy, and manage Azure-based infrastructure, including compute,\r\nnetworking, storage, and identity services<br>\r\nBuild and maintain Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using tools such as Terraform,\r\nARM templates, or Bicep<br>\r\nSupport cloud migration initiatives from on-premises environments to Azure<br>\r\nConfigure and manage networking components (virtual networks, security groups,\r\nVPNs, private connectivity)<br>\r\nMonitor system performance and ensure high availability, reliability, and\r\nscalability<br>\r\nImplement cloud security best practices, including identity and access\r\nmanagement, threat protection, and compliance controls<br>\r\nCollaborate with DevOps teams to enable CI/CD pipelines and automation\r\nstrategies<br>\r\nTroubleshoot and resolve infrastructure, deployment, and performance issues<br>\r\nMaintain clear and organized technical documentation for systems,\r\nconfigurations, and processes<br>\r\nRequired Qualifications<br>\r\n2+ years of hands-on experience in cloud engineering with a strong focus on\r\nAzure environments<br>\r\nPractical experience with core cloud services (compute, storage, networking,\r\nidentity)<br>\r\nExperience implementing Infrastructure as Code (Terraform, ARM, or Bicep)<br>\r\nSolid understanding of networking fundamentals (DNS, firewalls, load balancing)<br>\r\nScripting experience with PowerShell, Bash, or Python<br>\r\nFamiliarity with identity and access management concepts<br>\r\nExperience using cloud monitoring and logging tools<br>\r\nPreferred Qualifications<br>\r\nIndustry certifications related to Azure cloud platforms<br>\r\nExperience working in financial services or other regulated environments<br>\r\nExperience with CI/CD tools and automation frameworks<br>\r\nExposure to containerization and orchestration technologies (e.g., Docker,\r\nKubernetes)<br>\r\nUnderstanding of cloud security standards and compliance frameworks<br>\r\nExperience supporting enterprise-level cloud migration projects</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-13', '21:30:00', '22:00:00', '2026-05-13 15:54:11', '2026-05-13 16:33:32', 30, '2026-05-13 14:51:05', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-318@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
