h: 2.5in; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.45pt\">Aug<span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n  -.3pt\"> </span>2021 -<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\"> </span>Jul <span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\">2023</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"264\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:2.75in;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:.75pt 5.4pt .75pt 5.4pt;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Druva<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\"> Software, India</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:2.5in;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:.75pt 5.4pt .75pt 5.4pt;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.45pt\">Jul<span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n  -.25pt\"> </span>2020<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\"> </span>-<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\"> </span>Jul<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\">2021</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job Description:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">About\r\nthe job</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">About\r\nApplied Business Software, Inc., </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Applied Business Software, Inc., (ABS), the maker of The Mortgage\r\nOffice®, is the industry leader in private lending and loan management\r\ntechnology. Since 1978, our software has powered thousands of lenders,\r\nincluding private money firms, municipalities, CDFIs, Tribal Nations,\r\nuniversities, franchisors, third-party servicers and other non-bank lenders,\r\nhelping them streamline, automate, and scale their lending operations with\r\nconfidence.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>About The Role </b>We are seeking a <b>mid-level AI Engineer</b> with <b>5+\r\nyears of professional software engineering experience (after graduation from\r\nlast school/college)</b>, including <b>1–3 years of hands-on AI/ML experience</b>,\r\nto help build and operate the AI products that power our Loan Origination\r\nSystem (LOS).<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis role is ideal for a strong engineer who has transitioned into AI and is\r\nnow applying machine learning and LLM technologies in real production\r\nenvironments. You will help deliver production-ready, auditable, and\r\nhigh-performance AI pipelines, supporting our continued growth as a SaaS\r\nbusiness and strengthening internal processes, performance, and cross-team\r\nalignment.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>What You\'ll Do </b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Build and maintain production-grade AI pipelines for document\r\n     ingestion, OCR, and entity extraction.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Use LLMs and retrieval-augmented techniques for accurate data\r\n     classification, and apply rules and graph-based models to represent\r\n     relationships between borrowers, entities, and assets<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Work with team to implement agentic in-app experience that enable\r\n     users to interrogate, explore, and act on data insights<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Implement observability and feedback loops to monitor model\r\n     performance, implement human-in-the-loop validation, and continuously\r\n     improve accuracy over time. <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Qualifications\r\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">5+ years of experience (after graduation from last school/college)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1–3 years of professional experience building production-grade AI\r\n     systems using large language models, agentic frameworks (e.g., LangChain,\r\n     PydanticAI), and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) pipelines<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong proficiency in Python and applied ML frameworks such as\r\n     PyTorch and Hugging Face<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience building APIs and data pipelines with a strong\r\n     foundation in system design, testing, CI/CD, and cloud deployment<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with prompt engineering, fine-tuning, and evaluation\r\n     methods for improving real-world model performance <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Nice To\r\nHave </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with knowledge graphs, recommendation engines, or rules\r\n     engines<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Familiarity with AI observability and monitoring tools<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Good understanding of data pipelines, and model evaluation in\r\n     real-world decisioning systems<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Collaborate with backend engineers to deploy AI models as\r\n     low-latency, highly available microservices in the system.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-05-13', '21:30:00', '22:15:00', '2026-05-13 15:31:33', '2026-05-13 16:23:53', 0, '2026-05-13 14:55:54', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-319@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(320, 9, 126, 6, 1, 4, 'FW: Technical Interview with GAF Material Corp  for Aniket Rajpara - Project Manager, Wednesday, May 13 • 03:30 PM – 04:00 PM ET', '<p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100.82%; border-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:26.95pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"269\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 2.8in; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in; height: 26.95pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:12.75pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">First&nbsp;Name</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1042\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 781.35pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0in; height: 26.95pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">ANIKET </span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"269\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:2.8in;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:12.75pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Last&nbsp;Name</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1042\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 781.35pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in; height: 23.55pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-b