(321, 8, 127, 7, 1, 4, 'FW: Interview Support- ( Aritra Shom - Software Engineer- 05/13/2026 03:00 PM - 04:00 PM EST)', '<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Hello Team,</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Hope this email finds you well</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">I\'ve forwarded the details for the upcoming&nbsp;interview&nbsp;of\r\n\"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Aritra&nbsp;Shom</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>&nbsp;</b>\".\r\nKindly proceed to book the technical&nbsp;support&nbsp;person accordingly to\r\nensure a smooth and efficient&nbsp;interview&nbsp;process.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:11.75pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Candidate\r\nDetails:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:11.75pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Candidate\r\nName:&nbsp;</span>Aritra&nbsp;Shom</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:11.75pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Candidate\r\nContact Number:&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;+91 97310 77654</b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:11.75pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:11.75pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Note:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"701\" style=\"width: 526.1pt; border-color: currentcolor;\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-iro