e:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_m_-5279587616180519410m_-1285426568286734177x_x_table_0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:30.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 211.6pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: initial; background: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 30pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">HubSpot</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.7pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black currentcolor; border-image: initial; background: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 30pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">Jul 2023–\r\n  Present</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:22.1pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 211.6pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 22.1pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">Johnson\r\n  &amp; Johnson</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 22.1pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">Aug 2022 – Jun\r\n  2023</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:30.05pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 211.6pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; border-image: initial; background: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 30.05pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">360nautica</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; background: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 30.05pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">Sept 2020 –\r\n  Dec 2021</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job Description</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Solera is seeking\r\na Senior Product Manager for its Claims Services Group in Westlake, TX. This\r\nrole involves analyzing customer insights, regulatory trends, and market\r\nopportunities to guide the roadmaps for Solera’s core product portfolios.\r\nTelecommuting is available. The Senior Product Manager will track market trends\r\nin mobile telematics, driver behavior analytics, and fleet safety regulations\r\nto inform strategic product decisions. They will also evolve product\r\ndevelopment processes and tools to enhance efficiency, transparency, and\r\nalignment across the organization. Collaboration with Data Science,\r\nEngineering, Design, and QA teams is crucial for delivering high-impact,\r\nscalable telematics and risk management solutions that measurably improve fleet\r\nsafety outcomes. The role requires analyzing product performance metrics,\r\nindustry benchmarks, and customer feedback for continuous optimization of\r\nfeatures, engagement, and user experience. Improvements to SDLC workflows and\r\nteam collaboration will be driven through effective use of JIRA, Confluence, MS\r\nTeams, and other integrated tools. Rigorous documentation of product\r\nrequirements, release notes, business cases, and customer-facing materials is\r\nexpected. Building and maintaining strong relationships with key customers to\r\ncapture feedback and translate it into actionable product enhancements is also\r\na key responsibility. The Senior Product Manager will provide recommendations\r\nand plans to execute Solera’s digital driver safety and risk management\r\nportfolio, ensuring alignment with customer needs and growth strategy. They\r\nwill drive agile product development through cross-functional collaboration\r\nwith scrum teams, participating in sprint planning, backlog grooming, daily\r\nstand-ups, and release planning. Monitoring application release management for\r\ntimely delivery to the Apple App Store and Google Play Store, including all\r\nrequired assets, documentation, and approvals, is essential. Partnering with\r\nSales, Marketing, and Customer Success to develop go-to-market strategies for\r\nnew features, value propositions, and product launches is required.\r\nFacilitating internal and external stakeholder communication, providing clear\r\nupdates on roadmap progress, releases, and issue resolution based on customer,\r\nproduct, and market data, is also part of the role. Identifying and addressing\r\nproduct risks, troubleshooting escalated issues, and ensuring alignment between\r\ncross-functional teams and business objectives are critical. Finally, aligning\r\nproduct-related responsibilities to support business objectives and customer\r\nsuccess is a core function of this position. Multiple positions are available.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">See More</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Requirements</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Master’s degree (or foreign equivalent) in Computer Science, Product\r\nManagement, Business Analytics, Business Administration, or a related field</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Two (2)\r\n     years of experience in the job offered or related occupation</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;align-self:start\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0p