 style=\"width:2.25pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Total Candidate Experience 4+ years</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:28.95pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"270\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 202.15pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 28.95pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">FISERV<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"354\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 265.35pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 28.95pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Aug 2020 – Jul 2023<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:25.1pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"270\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 202.15pt; border-width: medium 1pt; border-style: none solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 25.1pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">IBM , India<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"354\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 265.35pt; border-width: medium 1pt medium medium; border-style: none solid none none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext currentcolor currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 25.1pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Jul 2021 – Dec 2023</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:25.1pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"270\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:202.15pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:25.1pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">TCS , India<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"354\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:265.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:25.1pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">May 2019 – Aug 2020</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp; </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">About\r\nThe Company<br>\r\nBuilt on a foundation of integrity, respect, and commitment, JPI stands out as\r\none of the most active real estate developers and builders in the nation.&nbsp;\r\nFor more than 35 years, JPI has designed and developed communities with\r\nbest-in-class homes and amenities. JPI is committed to data-driven management\r\nand continuous improvement. Its team of experts utilizes data – including\r\nunparalleled market research, proven business processes, and proprietary models\r\n– to ensure that every decision is strategic, focused, and produces exceptional\r\nmultifamily communities with the best risk-adjusted returns. More than just\r\ngreat communities, JPI is focused on leaving a lasting impact on the\r\ncommunities where we build and is continually committed to “Building What\r\nMatters.” &nbsp;JPI operates as a subsidiary of Sumitomo Forestry, which is\r\nrecognized as one of the largest home builders in the United States.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">About\r\nthe Job. </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">JPI has\r\nan exciting opportunity for an Agentic and AI specialist to join the\r\nApplications and Integrations team within the Digital &amp; IT organization in\r\nDallas, TX.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">As JPI\r\ncontinues to expand and modernize its AI and software development ecosystem,\r\nthis role will play a key part in advancing our digital strategy and\r\ntransforming building. You’ll have a unique opportunity to design, deliver and\r\nlead sophisticated agentic systems, AI-driven applications, RPA solutions,\r\nintegrations, and automations that directly enhance business processes and\r\ncreate meaningful impact across the company.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">The\r\nAgentic Integrations and Applications Developer will deliver proprietary JPI\r\nagents, applications, and system integrations—leveraging platforms such as\r\nWorkato and complementary technologies. This role collaborates closely with\r\nboth technical and non technical teams to architect and implement high value\r\nprocess improvements throughout the organization.<br>\r\nEssential Functions &amp; Responsibilities</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Agentic\r\nAI Development</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Lead, design, build and maintain Agents, RPAs and other AI\r\n     solutions to expand what business units across JPI can achieve.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Establish and maintain automatic and procedural guardrails\r\n     regarding security, reliability, fairness, accuracy, observability, and\r\n     traceability.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Continually review and update agents, AI solutions and RPA systems\r\n     to maintain the highest standards of security, reliability, fairness,\r\n     accuracy, observability, and traceability.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Back-End\r\n&amp; Integrations Development</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Lead, design, and deliver scalable integrations using Workato,\r\n     Python, Oracle Cloud and REST APIs to manage flows between many different\r\n     systems.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Establish and maintain secure application connections to various 3P\r\n     systems.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Document integration flows and connections.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Optimize application performance, reliability, and observability.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Solution\r\nArchitecture &amp; Development</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Contribute to the design and development of scalable, maintainable,\r\n     and secure integrations and AI aligned with business needs.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Translate functional requirements into technical user stories.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Contribute to application development, implementing key features or\r\n     solving challenging problems as needed.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Agile\r\nSprint Methodology</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Participate or lead code reviews, sprint planning and technical\r\n     decision making.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Participate in Agile development processes, including sprint\r\n     planning, stand-ups, and retrospectives.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define and deliver user\r\n     stories and application features within sprint cycles.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Mentor and assist scrum team to ensure consistently delivered\r\n     sprint commitments.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Collaboration\r\n&amp; Strategy</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Collaborate with co-workers in the Digital &amp; IT team and other\r\n     business units to understand business needs.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Optimize use of Agents and RPA by training business units,\r\n     monitoring and improving feature usage.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Work closely with UI developers to ensure integrations and Agents\r\n     are aligned with UI needs.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Train co-workers on agentic development, RPA and integration best\r\n     practices.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Non-essential\r\nFunctions &amp; Responsibilities</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Participate in special projects and other duties as assigned.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Education,\r\nWork Experience, &amp; Physical Requirements</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Required\r\nQualifications</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">5+ years of professional software development experience.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1+ year of Agentic AI development experience.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1+ year experience with LangChain, RPA, RAG and Vector\r\n     Stores/Databases.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2+ years of experience with Python, Node.js and/or React.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2+ years of experience working with cloud platforms or iPaaS tools.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2+ years of experience integrating with REST APIs.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong understanding of integration patterns and architecture.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Excellent problem-solving skills and a proactive, collaborative\r\n     mindset.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Comfortable working in Agile environments.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Preferred\r\nQualifications</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with any of LangGraph, MCP and Agent Harness</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with Workato.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Familiarity with any of Workday, BuildingConnected, Procore,\r\n     Airtable, Oracle Primavera Cloud, Oracle Cloud Infrastructure, Fabric,\r\n     Power Platform, and Azure.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with SQL databases</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with GitLab</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Why\r\nwork for us?</span></i></b><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><br>\r\n&nbsp;<br>\r\nWe have a 35-year track record of developing multifamily communities with\r\nresponsibility, accountability, and integrity.&nbsp; Our stated purpose is to:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Transform Building</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Enhance Communities</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Improve Lives</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<br>\r\nJPI has an ambitious and exciting vision for how we will achieve this, which\r\nmakes for a positive and dynamic work environment, with many opportunities for\r\npersonal development and growth.&nbsp; As well as our highly competitive\r\noffering of compensation and benefits, we are committed to:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Transformative careers in a transformative company</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Comprehensive training and development</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Promotion from within at all levels of the organization</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Borderless Careers, based on performance, potential, and personal\r\n     ambition</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-14', '00:30:00', '01:20:00', '2026-05-14 19:01:30', '2026-05-14 20:04:31', 50, '2026-05-14 14:41:07', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-333@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
