(334, 9, 134, 6, 1, 4, 'FW: Technical Interview with Origami Risk for Manasa Jayanthi - Product Manger Thursday, May 14,  1:00  PM – 1:45 PM ET', '<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Candidate Name:&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;Manasa Jayanthi</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Position: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Product Manager</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Talent Acquisition Specialist: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Rachel Block</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Type of Interview:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"> Video</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Date/Start Time: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Thu, May 14, 2026 1:00 PM - 1:45 PM EDT</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Interviewer(s) Name/Title: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Trevor Fadler: Team Lead/Scrum\r\nMaster, Kaitlyn Barrett: Senior Product Designer, Jeff Spung: Product Manager,\r\nCaitlin Fox-Carter: Product Manager</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p cl