 style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Manasa\r\n    Jayanthi &lt;<a href=\"mailto:jmanasa2015@gmail.com\">jmanasa2015@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Mon, Apr 20, 3:26 PM</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n  <td nowrap=\"\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"1024\" style=\"width: 768pt;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">to me</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n    <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape\r\n     id=\"x_Picture_x0020_11\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1026\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" alt=\"\"\r\n     style=\'width:.5pt;height:.5pt\'>\r\n     <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/Admin1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image003.gif\"\r\n      o:href=\"cid:image003.gif@01DCE2BB.14B37820\"/>\r\n    </v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img border=\"0\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAgAAAAAECAwICRAEAOw==\" style=\"height:.006in;width:.006in\" v:shapes=\"x_Picture_x0020_11\"><!--[endif]--></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Overview</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">The Product Manager on our Platform team is responsible for identifying\r\ncustomer and market needs, developing a 12-month strategic plan/roadmap that\r\naligns to business goals, and planning and executing to that vision. The\r\nProduct Manager closely partners with Engineering to solve complex business and\r\nclient problems that drive solutions that delight our users and clients. The\r\nProduct Manager manages product development deliverables, such as requirements\r\ndocumentation, analytics, design reviews, implementation, and delivery.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Starting base pay for this role is between $117,000 and $145,000. The\r\nactual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as transferable skills,\r\nwork experience, business needs, training, location, and market demands. The\r\nbase pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This\r\nrole will be eligible for a bonus as well as competitive medical, dental, and\r\nvision benefits, wellness reimbursement, life insurance, and a 401(k) with\r\ncompany match. We offer vacation and sick leave benefits (under a flexible time\r\noff policy in most states).</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Responsibilities</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Roadmaps and Product Strategy:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Owns the 12-month product roadmap and align the\r\n     scrum team around delivery of high value business outcomes.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Researches and identifies emerging market and\r\n     technology needs to influence the market roadmap and promote innovation\r\n     and differentiation.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Uses data to validate roadmap prioritization and\r\n     proposed solution builds. Ensures that we are solving the right problems\r\n     and that these problems are worth solving.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Builds deep business domain and user and client\r\n     expertise to identify product and market opportunities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Acts as the subject matter expert for their\r\n     assigned product and market related to file management and work management\r\n     features.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Requirement Creation:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Translates business requirements into technical\r\n     requirements.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Documents requirements in the form of user\r\n     stories to create a shared understanding with Engineering teams.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Develops, refines, and documents other product\r\n     artifacts (Ex: Visual collaboration documents, Lucid Chart workflows,\r\n     etc.)</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">In partnership with Engineering, Design and\r\n     Architecture teams, builds system designs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Validates all product &amp; engineering artifacts\r\n     (User Stories/Acceptance Criteria, Visual Collaboration documents, design\r\n     documents, etc.) to ensure risks to value, viability, feasibility, and\r\n     usability are addressed upfront.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Backlog Maintenance, Prioritization, and Scrum Team Support:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Participates in quarterly release planning\r\n     activities, driving direction and prioritization for each quarter.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Serves as the product owner of the scrum team to\r\n     plan the work of the team and resolve in-sprint issues.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Acts as a ruthless “prioritizer” while balancing\r\n     the needs of clients and stakeholders.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Performs necessary backlog maintenance, such as\r\n     identifying escalated feature or bug requests and preparing them for\r\n     upcoming sprints.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">In partnership with Engineering, Design and\r\n     Architecture teams, builds system designs; Validates all system designs\r\n     that impact your product.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">In conjunction with the Product Analyst, oversees\r\n     that the totality of delivered user stories meet the epic’s definition of\r\n     done.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Serves as the day-to-day contact for the team on\r\n     clarification of requirements and drives the teams’ refinement ceremony.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Acts as the product point of contact for all\r\n     sprint ceremonies: sprint planning, refinement, sprint demo,\r\n     retrospective, etc.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ensures backlog health meets the demands of the\r\n     team as set/determined by Product Leadership.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Performs functional testing and confirm sprint\r\n     demos to ensure delivery of quality software.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Business Partnership:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Partners with business stakeholders to align to\r\n     strategic long-term roadmaps and ensure delivery of the aligned product\r\n     outcomes.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Aligns stakeholders across the organization to\r\n     ensure transparency of prioritization and roadmap status.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Acts as a liaison between stakeholder and\r\n     development teams.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Drives the agenda and facilitate meetings with\r\n     Analysts to obtain roadmap feedback.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Partners with marketing and operations to provide\r\n     market and product responses to RFIs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Champions and models Origami Risk’s values\r\n     (Prioritize Clients’ Trust and Success, Innovate with an Entrepreneurial\r\n     Spirit, Collaborate and Win as a Team)</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Other duties as assigned.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Qualifications</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s Degree in technology, business,\r\n     liberal arts, science, or engineering.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">5-7 years’ experience in Product Management,\r\n     including owning a product roadmap and driving Agile processes.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Excellent analytical and conceptual thinking\r\n     skills and a high attention to detail</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Business acumen to identify opportunities,\r\n     facilitate strategic planning, and use data and storytelling to influence.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ability to balance short term needs with\r\n     long-term strategy.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong relationship building skills, including an\r\n     ability to influence stakeholders and scrum team members.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Exceptional communication skills (verbal and\r\n     written) across all levels of the organization.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience overseeing all or some phases of the\r\n     product development lifecycle.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience working in agile methodologies and\r\n     working on an agile team.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Benefits</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Medical and Dental coverage available for\r\n     employees, dependents, domestic partners, and spouses</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Paid Time Off – Flexible options plus 10 paid\r\n     company holidays where available**</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">All full-time positions are hybrid, with many\r\n     eligible to be completely remote</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Fully Paid by Origami Risk – Vision insurance,\r\n     Short &amp; Long-Term Disability Insurance, and Basic Life Insurance</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Generous family leave options—including adoption\r\n     and foster care placements</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Pre-Tax Savings Accounts – Flexible Spending\r\n     Account, Health Savings Account, Commuter Benefits, Dependent Care Savings\r\n     Account</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Retirement Savings – 401(k) with company match up\r\n     to 4%</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Employee Assistance Program (EAP) – Confidential\r\n     &amp; Free support offered to colleagues facing personal or work-related\r\n     complications</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Education Assistance Program – to help colleagues\r\n     pursue industry/role-specific certifications</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Wellness Benefits – reimbursement program to\r\n     invest in healthy habits as well as support better colleague productivity\r\n     and stress management</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Additional coverages available – Pet Insurance,\r\n     Critical Illness Insurance, and Voluntary Life &amp; AD&amp;D coverage</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-14', '22:15:00', '23:00:00', '2026-05-14 16:57:12', '2026-05-14 19:03:26', 45, '2026-05-14 14:43:28', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-334@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
