ata src=\"file:///C:/Users/Admin1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\r\n    o:href=\"cid:image001.png@01DCE392.12DF32A0\"/>\r\n  </v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img border=\"0\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"height:.75in;width:.75in\" alt=\"🚀\" v:shapes=\"Picture_x0020_2\"><!--[endif]--><br>\r\n  The TestGorilla team<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Job Description: </b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:13.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Role\r\n  Responsibilities The responsibilities of the role will include:<br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Portfolio\r\n       Performance Analysis Analyzing customer behavior (spend, transactions,\r\n       delinquency, write-offs) to identify trends, risks, and opportunities.\r\n       Translate findings into actionable insights that inform portfolio\r\n       strategies and optimize risk-reward tradeoffs.<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Reporting\r\n       &amp; Dashboard Development Managing and maintaining large-scale\r\n       datasets in SQL and support portfolio reporting through dashboards and\r\n       presentations. Deliver regular, insight-driven reporting on key metrics\r\n       such as spend, utilization, delinquency, and losses.<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Strategy\r\n       Impact Analysis Monitoring and evaluating the effectiveness of account\r\n       management strategies using A/B testing, sensitivity analysis, and\r\n       impact sizing. Track post-implementation performance (e.g., spend,\r\n       retention, losses) and communicate key outcomes and recommendations.<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Account\r\n       Management Strategy Support Supporting the design and execution of\r\n       account management strategies (e.g., credit line increases, risk\r\n       tightening) aimed at improving portfolio performance, mitigating risk,\r\n       and driving revenue growth. <o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Qualifications &amp; Skills <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Bachelor’s\r\n       degree in a quantitative field<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">1–3\r\n       years of experience with SQL (academic or professional)<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">1–3\r\n       years of experience with Python or R (including ability to generate,\r\n       read, and validate code)<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Proficiency\r\n       in Excel and PowerPoint<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Experience\r\n       with data visualization tools (e.g., Tableau or similar)<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Strong\r\n       communication skills with the ability to present insights clearly and\r\n       effectively <o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Preferred <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Experience\r\n       working with large datasets<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Exposure\r\n       to financial services, credit risk, or lending analytics<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Experience\r\n       with tools such as Alteryx<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Master’s\r\n       degree in a quantitative field<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-14', '01:00:00', '02:00:00', '2026-05-14 19:35:58', '2026-05-14 21:31:01', 60, '2026-05-14 15:35:33', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-339@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(340, 24, 138, 26, 1, 7, 'NA', '<div>Job Description</div><div><br></div><div>Key Responsibilities</div><div><br></div><div>* Participates in iteration planning meetings ensuring that the team has a common understanding of each story and chores in a team’s backlog</div><div><br></div><div>* Participate in executing the strategy, keeping the customer needs and wants in mind</div><div><br></div><div>* Collaborates within the team in designing systems and apps</div><div><br></div><div>* Participates in daily site, cross-site, and product team standups</div><div><br></div><div>* Participates in retrospectives to gather feedback and derive actionable items to improve the team and the product</div><div><br></div><div>* Support software products in user environments</div><div><br></div><div>* Participates in knowledge sharing, and contributes to the overall growth of the collective knowledge of the team</div><div><br></div><div>* Practices daily paired programming and test-driven development in writing software and building products</div><div><br></div><div>* Establishes continuous integration, continuous delivery, and continuous deployment pipelines and practices</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>TECHNICAL SKILLS</div><div><br></div><div>Experience and knowledge in developing REST APIs using Java Spring boot, including tooling for documentation (swagger, REST-docs, OpenAPI spec), versioning, service discovery/registration, testing and management; experience using API gateways a plus.</div><div>Hands on experience and accountability architecting, designing, implementing and delivering large scale distributed systems and/or applications for the cloud, including MicroServices architectures.</div><div>Experience and knowledge in web and API security including authentication, authorization, OAuth, OWASP, OpenID, and SAML.</div><div>Experience in backend development design and implementation, database (MongoDB, caching) and Kafka messaging.&nbsp;</div><div>Knowledge and experience using distributed version control systems (git), artifact management systems, build and packaging systems (maven, gradle, npm, artifactory, etc ) and Jenkins or similar Continuous Integration tools .</div><div>Experience of working in an Agile environment or paired programming/engineering model.</div><div>Experience using Python.is a plus.&nbsp;</div><div>Experience with the test driven approach and writing unit tests for front to back coverage.</div><div>Experience with problem-solving and analyzing performance bott</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Experience</div><div><br></div><div>* 2 to 10 years of experience</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Supervisory Responsibilities</div><div><br></div><div>* This job does not have supervisory duties.</div>', '2026-05-15', '01:00:00', '02:00:00', '2026-05-15 14:49:23', '2026-05-15 14:50:15', 60, '2026-05-14 17:02:54', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-340@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
