(343, 5, 46, 4, 1, 4, 'terview Support - concoracredit- Data Engineer - Mayur Patel- Sr. Data & ML Ops Engineer -05/15/2026 • 2:30 PM – 3:30 PM EST', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Dear Team, <br>\r\nO<span style=\"color:black\">ne of our candidate </span>MAYUR KUMAR PATEL </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">- </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">He managed to secure the Interview with <b>concoracredit\r\n</b>the <b>Sr. Data &amp; ML Ops Engineer</b>-</span> <b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">05/15/2026 • 2:30 PM – 3:30 PM EST</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\"><br>\r\ncandidate and screening detail along with the resume used in the\r\napplications are attached. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"975\" style=\"width: 731.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"975\" nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:731.5pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"975\" style=\"width: 731.1pt;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:.3in\">\r\n  <td width=\"1178\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 883.4pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 0.3in;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"