/td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Date<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black\">05/15/2026 •\r\n  2:30 PM – 3:30 PM EST</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Round of Interview<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">2<sup>nd</sup> round<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Client Details<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:Roboto;color:#5F6368;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">concoracredit<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Joining Details<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Microsoft\r\n  Teams meeting<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Join: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/289062422584187?p=AO1MoSL25gCg06kZFi\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/289062422584187?p=AO1MoSL25gCg06kZFi</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Meeting\r\n  ID: 289 062 422 584 187<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Passcode: XV9Ys3AP<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Responsibilities<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">As our Sr. Data &amp; ML Operations\r\n  Engineer, you will:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Manage\r\n       and monitor ETL/ELT pipelines, analytics reporting jobs, ML workflows\r\n       across Azure services, ensuring SLA compliance and the timely resolution\r\n       of Incidents, failures, and performance bottlenecks.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Proactively\r\n       monitor platform health, performance, and SLAs using Databricks\r\n       monitoring, logging, and alerting, to minimize downtime and data issues.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Perform\r\n       root cause analysis and implement long-term fixes that prevent recurring\r\n       issues and improve overall operational reliability.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Contribute\r\n       to platform automation, CI/CD for data/ML pipelines, infrastructure as\r\n       code, and disaster recovery planning.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Partner\r\n       with data engineers, ML engineers, and BI engineers to troubleshoot\r\n       issues, implement improvements, automate operations, and drive\r\n       continuous enhancement of data/ML platform reliability.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Provide\r\n       operational support for MOVEit Automation, GoAnywhere, and secure file\r\n       transfer processes.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Operate\r\n       and support Fivetran for data ingestion, ensuring connector health, sync\r\n       reliability.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Manage\r\n       Tokenization processes to ensure secure handling of sensitive data,\r\n       including tokenization, detokenization, and compliance with PCI.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Audit\r\n       PCI controls regularly to maintain compliance.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Develop\r\n       and maintain code enhancements, automation scripts that support both\r\n       data engineering and operational needs.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Provide\r\n       after-hours support for critical systems and applications.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Develop\r\n       and maintain documentation, runbooks, and operational standards.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">These duties must be performed with\r\n  or without reasonable accommodation.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">We know experience comes in many\r\n  forms and that many skills are transferable. If your experience is close to\r\n  what we\'re looking for, consider applying. Diversity has made us the\r\n  entrepreneurial and innovative company that we are today.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Qualifications<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Requirements:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">5-7\r\n       years of experience in Data Operations, ML Operations, or Data\r\n       Engineering roles.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Extensive\r\n       hands-on experience with Azure Databricks with Unity Catalog, ADF, ADLS<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\n       experience in SQL, Python, and PySpark<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       working in regulated environments (Finance etc.)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Familiarity\r\n       with secure file transfer tools.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with monitoring tools (Azure Monitor, Log Analytics, etc.)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Solid\r\n       understanding of data warehousing, ETL/ELT, and data modeling best\r\n       practices.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with version control and CI/CD pipelines (Azure DevOps, GitHub, etc.)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Knowledge\r\n       of RBAC, data security, and governance in cloud environments.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Knowledge\r\n       of Spark performance tuning, partitioning, and job orchestration.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s\r\n       or Master’s degree (or equivalent) in Computer Science or related field.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Soft Skills:</span></b><span styl