rmal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Meeting\r\n  ID: 290 057 741 379 068<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Passcode: cQ9AR96Y<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Job Summary<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">We are expanding <b>Clinical\r\n  Intelligence and Workflow Automation</b> capabilities to support clinicians,\r\n  reduce administrative burden, and improve patient outcomes. We are seeking a <b>Senior\r\n  Machine Learning / LLM Engineer</b> to design and implement advanced AI\r\n  systems that enable intelligent decision support, workflow automation, and\r\n  real-time clinical insights.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">This role focuses on building <b>agentic\r\n  AI systems</b>, <b>Retrieval‑Augmented Generation (RAG)</b> pipelines, and <b>scalable\r\n  machine learning infrastructure</b> that integrates with electronic health\r\n  records, clinical workflows, and operational platforms.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The position collaborates closely\r\n  with clinicians, product leaders, and engineering teams to deliver <b>safe,\r\n  reliable, and high‑impact AI solutions</b> in regulated environments.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Essential Duties &amp;\r\n  Responsibilities<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Other duties and tasks may be\r\n  assigned as required.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Design\r\n       and implement <b>AI agent systems</b> using frameworks such as\r\n       LangGraph, Semantic Kernel, or custom orchestration layers<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Build\r\n       and maintain <b>RAG pipelines</b> grounded in clinical guidelines,\r\n       evidence-based medicine, and real-time patient data<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Develop\r\n       systems that synthesize fragmented clinical data (EHRs, labs, imaging,\r\n       clinical notes) into prioritized, actionable insights<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Architect\r\n       scalable inference services capable of <b>low-latency performance</b> in\r\n       clinical environments<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Create\r\n       evaluation frameworks to ensure AI outputs are accurate, unbiased, and\r\n       aligned with source-of-truth data<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Implement\r\n       and manage <b>vector search infrastructure</b> using platforms such as\r\n       Pinecone, Milvus, Weaviate, or equivalent technologies<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Perform\r\n       <b>model fine-tuning</b>, PEFT/LoRA training, and optimization for\r\n       production workloads<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Build\r\n       high-performance backend services using <b>C# / .NET</b> to integrate AI\r\n       systems with existing clinical and operational platforms<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Ensure\r\n       AI systems comply with <b>data privacy, security, and regulatory\r\n       requirements</b><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Research\r\n       emerging AI and ML technologies and apply them to improve clinician\r\n       productivity and patient care<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Mentor\r\n       and support engineers on <b>ML, LLM, and AI engineering best practices</b><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Participate\r\n       in code reviews and contribute to consistent engineering standards<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Collaborate\r\n       with cross-functional teams to translate clinical workflows into\r\n       automated, intelligent systems<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Maintain\r\n       regular and reliable attendance<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Qualifications &amp; Requirements<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">To perform this job successfully, an\r\n  individual must be able to perform each essential duty satisfactorily.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Education &amp; Experience<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s\r\n       degree preferred<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">5+\r\n       years</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n       of professional experience in machine learning and LLM engineering,\r\n       including production-grade systems<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Technical Skills<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Deep\r\n       experience with <b>LLM orchestration</b>, tool calling, and long-context\r\n       document processing<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\n       proficiency with <b>vector databases</b> (e.g., Pinecone, Milvus,\r\n       Weaviate)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with <b>MLOps and deployment pipelines</b>, including Docker,\r\n       Kubernetes, and CI/CD<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Proficiency\r\n       with <b>C# / .NET</b> for backend and service-oriented development<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       designing <b>scalable, low-latency inference systems</b><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\n       understanding of data modeling and workflow mapping<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Familiarity\r\n       with healthcare interoperability standards such as <b>FHIR and HL7</b><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with automated testing, unit tests, and AI evaluation frameworks<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Proficiency\r\n       with version control systems such as <b>Git, TFS, or Azure DevOps</b><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       using <b>JIRA</b> or similar task-tracking tools<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with AI development tools (e.g., Cursor, Copilot)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans