(349, 9, 120, 6, 1, 4, 'FW: Technical Interview With Ascensus for LOKESH KOLLEPARA-tomorrow, Friday, 5/15 at 12:15PM EST to 1:00 PM EST', '<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Hello Team,</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Below are the details of the technical interview we received from <b>A</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">scensus</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">for </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">LOKESH KOLLEPARA</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">. Please assist him with\r\ninterview preparation and support</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Great! I\r\nhave you all set for your interview with Lide on <b>Friday, 5/15 at\r\n12:15pm EST </b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Microsoft\r\nTeams meeting</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Join: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/247324113100392?p=KOccpwLY7UUb53Yrgh\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/247324113100392?p=KOccpwLY7UUb53Yrgh</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Meeting\r\nID: 247 324 113 100 392<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Passcode: ko68A7EK<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US\" target=\"_blank\">Need help?</a> | <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_NTdjZmQ1MjItM2M5My00OGViLWFkYTAtZDQ4Y2NkYjg1Yjdm%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%221d3bed01-6d09-498e-ab05-f1e2fdb1b138%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22cd2c388e-e02d-4a13-b2b0-fd06cbb31505%22%7d\" target=\"_blank\">System reference</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Dial in\r\nby phone</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"tel:+12672817060,,558701764\" target=\"_blank\">+1 267-281-7060,,558701764#</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About\r\nthe job</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"x946213aa\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span class=\"xabf4077d\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ascensus\r\nis the leading independent technology and service platform powering savings\r\nplans across America, providing products and expertise that help nearly 16\r\nmillion people save for a better today and tomorrow.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Ascensus\r\ndoes not provide visa sponsorship now or in the future and does not hire\r\ncandidates working under OPT</span></strong><span class=\"xabf4077d\">.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span class=\"xabf4077d\">Ascensus is the leading independent technology and\r\nservice platform powering savings plans across America, providing products and\r\nexpertise that help nearly 16 million people save for a better today and\r\ntomorrow.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span class=\"xabf4077d\">We are currently hiring multiple associate level\r\nengineers for our Software Engineering teams. These engineers will be hired\r\ninto one of these areas of engineering:</span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Full\r\nStack Software Development </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Front-End/UI\r\nDevelopment </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><spa