(351, 9, 120, 6, 1, 4, 'Interview Support - Google Doc - LOKESH KOLLEPARA - 18 May 2026 - 10:30 PM (01:00 PM EST)', '<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Hello Team,</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Below are the details of the technical interview we received from <b>A</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">scensus</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">for </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">LOKESH KOLLEPARA</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">. Please assist him with\r\ninterview preparation and support</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Great!\r\nYou’re all set for your interview with Michael on Monday, 5/18 at <b>1:00pm\r\n(EST).</b>&nbsp; Here is the link to access the video call:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Microsoft\r\nTeams meeting</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Join: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/298528408702434?p=6pkUvfNrLBUD4WbgDj\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/298528408702434?p=6pkUvfNrLBUD4WbgDj</a><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Meeting\r\nID: 298 528 408 702 434<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Passcode: cN2Lh7yv<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US\" target=\"_blank\">Need help?</a> | <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_NzJjMTBmZGUtYzJmNC00ODQwLWIwNWYtNzMyM2QxMzlhNTE0%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%221d3bed01-6d09-498e-ab05-f1e2fdb1b138%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22cd2c388e-e02d-4a13-b2b0-fd06cbb31505%22%7d\" target=\"_blank\">System reference</a><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Dial in\r\nby phone</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"tel:+12672817060,,720156378\" target=\"_blank\">+1 267-281-7060,,720156378#</a> United<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">I’ve\r\nattached the benefits guide for your review<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About\r\nthe job</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2><p class=\"x946213aa\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span class=\"xabf4077d\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ascensus\r\nis the leading independent technology and service platform powering savings\r\nplans across America, providing products and expertise that help nearly 16\r\nmillion people save for a better today and tomorrow.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Ascensus\r\ndoes not provide visa sponsorship now or in the future and does not hire\r\ncandidates working under OPT</span></strong><span class=\"xabf4077d\">.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span class=\"xabf4077d\">Ascensus is the leading independent technology and\r\nservice platform powering savings plans across America, providing products and\r\nexpertise that help nearly 16 million people save for a better today and\r\ntomorrow.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span class=\"xabf4077d\">We are currently hiring multiple associate level\r\nengineers for our Software Engineering teams. These engineers will be hired\r\ninto one of these areas of engineering:</span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Full\r\nStack Software Development </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Front-End/UI\r\nDevelopment </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Back-End\r\nDevelopment </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Software\r\nQuality/ Test Automation </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Data\r\nEngineering </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Data\r\nScience </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">DevOps\r\nEngineering </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Video\r\nInterview Process: </span></strong><span class=\"xabf4077d\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">As part\r\nof our Software Engineer hiring efforts, we\'re using a video screening process\r\nand coding assessment. To learn more and to help prepare for this</span></span><span class=\"x027fdfa6\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"> </span></span><span class=\"xabf4077d\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fcareers%2Eascensus%2Ecom%2Fassociate-software-engineer-hiring-process&amp;urlhash=7GbA&amp;mt=i_el3lYE1QrKzQBalsS3eyiToV9bNlypFvNTjyvE2dZT2USgoC9Z42Q3eFHyPYpdEKM8ofvSMcaAGz_jH7X-OExJoLc&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">click here! </a></span></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Section 1: Position Summary </span></strong><span class=\"xabf4077d\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">As an Associate Engineer at Ascensus, you will be\r\nworking in a high-energy team, delivering high quality software using the best\r\nengineering practices in industry today. Curiosity and passion for software\r\ndevelopment is critical. We are building teams that are empowered with AI\r\ncapabilities and innovative tools to solve business needs using a rapid\r\ndevelopment and deployment pipeline focused on AI, automation, and rapid\r\niteration.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\ninherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\npadding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span class=\"xabf4077d\">As a Scrum team member, you will be responsible for\r\ndelivering solutions that adhere to the software architecture strategy, coding\r\nstandards, and established organizational policies and procedures.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri\">Section\r\n2: Job Functions, Essential Duties and Responsibilities </span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Responsible\r\nfor protecting, securing, and proper handling of all confidential data held by\r\nAscensus to ensure against unauthorized access, improper transmission, and/or\r\nunapproved disclosure of information that could result in harm to Ascensus or\r\nour clients. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Our\r\nI-Client service philosophy and our Core Values of People Matter, Quality First\r\nand Integrity Always® should be visible in your actions on a day to day basis\r\nshowing your support of our organizational culture. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Analyze,\r\nimplement, test, document and maintain new and current software applications\r\nwith minimal oversight in support of achieving the business goals. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assist\r\nin estimating and planning throughout the software development life cycle. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Support\r\npeople and process improvement strategies for the organization. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assist\r\nwith other tasks and projects as assigned </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Section\r\n3: Experience, Skills, Knowledge Requirements </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Up to\r\ntwo years of full time professional experience developing software &amp; systems\r\nfor small to medium business environments through internships, Co-ops or\r\nprofessional experience. </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Working\r\nexperience in one or more programming or scripting languages </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\nin using Generative AI tools for software development </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Understanding\r\nof object-oriented design, data structures and algorithms </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\nproblem-solving skills </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;