le=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;color:#222222;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222;font-weight:normal\">Business Analysis</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222;\r\nfont-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:1.0in;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:\r\nbaseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;color:#222222;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222;font-weight:normal\">Process Improvement</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222;\r\nfont-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Position Overview:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">The Mobile Biz Ops Sr. Analyst is a key\r\nmember of the team responity simulations based on various factors, such as\r\nCOF/PO, sell-out forecast validation through promotion activity and seasonal\r\ntrends.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Analyze weekly Purchase Sales Inventory\r\n(PSI) to identify demand fluctuations and inform demand shaping or cleaning.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Propose supply allocation between\r\naccounts to maximize overall SEA sales.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Consolidate and publish weekly AP2\r\nreports, including sell-in/sell-out week-over-week changes, risks, and\r\nfinancial implications.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Manage system-based tools to extract data\r\nfor channel inventory analysis and reconciliation.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Monitor product arrival schedules and\r\nexecute purchase order confirmations to maintain optimal inventory levels.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Monitor KPIs for operational excellence,\r\nsuch as proposing aging depletion plans, Project Support and Ad-Hoc Analysis:</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Assist with supply chain projects and\r\nperform ad-hoc analyses as needed, such as reporting, dashboard creation,\r\nautomation, etc.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Collaborate with team members and provide\r\nbackup support/training when necessary.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Skills and Qualifications:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• 2~3 years of experience in a relevant\r\nfield</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Preferred degree in SCM, Business\r\nAdministration, Finance or Engineering</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Strong analytical, data management, and\r\ncomputer skills</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">o Proficiency in Microsoft Excel, Outlook,\r\nand Office Suite</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">o SAP experience is beneficial</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Excellent communication and interpersonal\r\nskills, both written and verbal</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Ability to present to and collaborate\r\nwith senior management</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Experience working in a multicultural\r\nbusiness environment</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Background/Experience Required:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Bachelor’s degree in Supply Chain,\r\nOperations management, or related field; strong preference for Supply Chain\r\nManagement or Finance degree</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• 5 plus years’ experience in, SCM,\r\nBusiness Planning, Finance or related field Preferred</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Experience in Demand Planning, Inventory\r\nAllocation or Finance Analysis</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Ability to work independently, problem\r\nsolving, delivering solid recommendations/solutions, and executing upon\r\nrecommendations</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Delivery against supply chain objectives</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Collaboration toward resolution of supply\r\nchain reliability issues</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;\r\n  height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"372\" style=\"width:279.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:15.0pt;\r\n  background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;\r\n  background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">sible for ensuring product availability\r\naligns with mid/long-term forecasted demand. This role involves collaborating\r\nwith Sales, Product, and Operations to generate accurate forecasts and managing\r\ndemand for all product categories. The Sr. Analyst will play a pivotal role in\r\ndata analysis, reporting, maximize sales and ensuring efficient supply chain\r\nmanagement.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Responsibilities and Duties:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Develop, analyze, and communicate demand\r\nforecasts between Mobile Biz Ops and relevant stakeholders.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Manage mid to long-term sell-in/sell-out\r\nforecasts(AP2), including buffer management and logic, based on leadership\r\ndirectives and consensus.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">• Conduct sell-in risk and opportun</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-15', '03:30:00', '04:00:00', '2026-05-18 13:35:31', '2026-05-18 13:36:11', 30, '2026-05-15 20:18:41', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-353@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
