n\">\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Guests</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"mailto:lindsay.morton@sourcefuse.com\" target=\"_blank\">Lindsay Morton</a> - organizer<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"mailto:mohammedhamed872985@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">mohammedhamed872985@gmail.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"mailto:saurabh.kumar@sourcefuse.com\" target=\"_blank\">Saurabh kumar</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"mailto:akanksha.puri@sourcefuse.com\" target=\"_blank\">Akanksha Puri</a> - optional<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"mailto:rahul.sharma@sourcefuse.com\" target=\"_blank\">Rahul Sharma</a> - optional<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"mailto:ravdeep.singh@sourcefuse.com\" target=\"_blank\">Ravdeep Singh</a> - optional<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/event?action=VIEW&amp;eid=NXMwbTYybzg4dWtpZDUxazR1Mjc1amg2ZWQgbW9oYW1tZWRoYW1lZDg3Mjk4NUBt&amp;tok=MjkjbGluZHNheS5tb3J0b25Ac291cmNlZnVzZS5jb21iMDViZTQ0NzgzNjA1NGFmYWI5ZTE3MWE2MTIwNzE3MmZmOTY2Mzlk&amp;ctz=America%2FNew_York&amp;hl=en&amp;es=1\" target=\"_blank\"><b>View all guest info</b></a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Reply</b> for <a href=\"mailto:mohammedhamed872985@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">mohammedhamed872985@gmail.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 12.0pt 0in\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:6.0pt 9.0pt 0in 0in\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"mso-cellspacing:0in;border:solid #DADCE0 1.0pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:\r\n           1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td style=\"border:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n            <div align=\"center\">\r\n            <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n             <tbody><tr>\r\n              <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 12.0pt\">\r\n              <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Yes<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n              </td>\r\n             </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n            </div>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td style=\"border-top:none;border-left:solid #DADCE0 1.0pt;\r\n            border-bottom:none;border-right:solid #DADCE0 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n            <div align=\"center\">\r\n            <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n             <tbody><tr>\r\n              <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt\">\r\n              <p class=\"xmsonormal\">No<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n              </td>\r\n             </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n            </div>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td style=\"border:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n            <div align=\"center\">\r\n            <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n             <tbody><tr>\r\n              <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:4.5pt 12.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt\">\r\n              <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Maybe<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n              </td>\r\n             </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n            </div>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          <p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"mso-cellspacing:0in;border:solid #DADCE0 1.0pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:\r\n           1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td nowrap=\"\" style=\"border:none;padding:4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 12.0pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"xmsonormal\">More options<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>About the Role</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">We’re hiring a DevOps Engineer with strong Azure expertise\r\nto build and scale secure, production-grade cloud infrastructure. You’ll play a\r\nkey role in designing CI/CD pipelines, automating deployments, and improving\r\nsystem reliability across our cloud environments.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Location: San Francisco Bay Area (Hybrid preferred)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">What You’ll Do<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Build and manage CI/CD pipelines (Azure DevOps / GitHub\r\nActions)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Develop Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using Terraform, ARM,\r\nor Bicep<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Deploy and maintain scalable Azure environments (VMs, AKS,\r\nApp Services, Functions)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Implement monitoring, logging, and alerting (Azure Monitor,\r\nApp Insights)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Ensure cloud security best practices (IAM, Key Vault,\r\nnetworking)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Collaborate with engineering teams to streamline releases<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Drive automation and cost optimization initiatives<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>What We’re Looking For</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Strong hands-on experience with Microsoft Azure<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Expertise in CI/CD pipelines<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Experience with Terraform (preferred) or ARM/Bicep<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Knowledge of Docker &amp; Kubernetes (AKS preferred)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Strong scripting skills (PowerShell, Bash, or Python)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Solid understanding of Azure networking, security, and\r\nidentity (AAD)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Nice to Have</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Multi-region / high-availability architecture experience<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">DevSecOps exposure<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Azure certifications (Azure DevOps Engineer Expert)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">FinOps / cost optimization experience<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Why Join SourceFuse?</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Work on modern cloud-native technologies<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Collaborate with global teams across the US, UK, and India<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Be part of a fast-growing digital transformation company<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Strong culture focused on ownership, agility, and customer\r\nsuccess<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Featured benefits</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Medical insurance, Dental insurance, 401(k), Vision\r\ninsurance<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Requirements added by the job poster<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">* Commute to this job’s location<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">* Authorized to work in the United States<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">* No need for visa sponsorship<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">* 3+ years of work experience with Continuous Integration\r\nand Continuous Delivery (CI/CD)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">* 3+ years of work experience with Azure Kubernetes Service\r\n(AKS)<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-18', '21:00:00', '21:30:00', '2026-05-18 16:13:08', '2026-05-18 16:15:00', 30, '2026-05-18 15:19:28', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-354@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
