 style=\"color:black\">1<sup>st</sup> round </span><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\">(Technical\r\n  )</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:38.95pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"209\" style=\"width:156.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:\r\n  none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:38.95pt;border-color:currentcolor\">\r\n  <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Interview Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"494\" style=\"width:370.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:38.95pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xxelementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Grant Brewer</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"> - (Senior Data Engineer)</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xxelementtoproof\"><span style=\"color:black\">LinkedIn - <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/grant-brewer-b63382120/\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/grant-brewer-b63382120/</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:40.1pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"209\" style=\"width:156.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:\r\n  none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:40.1pt;border-color:currentcolor\">\r\n  <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Interview Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"494\" style=\"width:370.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:40.1pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Zoom meeting</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:135.2pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"209\" style=\"width: 156.5pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 135.2pt; border-color: currentcolor;\">\r\n  <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Interview Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"494\" style=\"width: 370.3pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 135.2pt;\">\r\n  <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><a href=\"https://kwiktrip.zoom.us/j/89408514347?pwd=KsPdFrxZJyQAVszP002yIW8aGfbHlw.1&amp;from=addon\">https://kwiktrip.zoom.us/j/89408514347?pwd=KsPdFrxZJyQAVszP002yIW8aGfbHlw.1&amp;from=addon</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:38.95pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"209\" style=\"width:156.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:\r\n  none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:38.95pt;border-color:currentcolor\">\r\n  <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Job\r\n  Description</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"494\" style=\"width:370.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:38.95pt\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt;min-height:1.5em\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">About the job</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Department</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"> : Information Technology</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Location</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"> : La Crosse Support Center | Onsite</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Job\r\n  Type : Full-time</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">About\r\n  the Role</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Kwik\r\n  Trip’s Data Engineering team is growing! We’re looking for a Data Engineer II\r\n  who thrives on solving complex data challenges and building scalable\r\n  infrastructure. If you’re passionate about transforming raw data into\r\n  actionable insights and enjoy working in a collaborative, fast-paced\r\n  environment, we want to hear from you.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">What\r\n  You’ll Do</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Build,\r\n  test, and maintain robust data pipelines and architectures</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Develop\r\n  real-time integrations and troubleshoot data infrastructure issues</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Evaluate\r\n  and implement emerging data technologies</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Create\r\n  and maintain technical documentation and data flow diagrams</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Collaborate\r\n  with cross-functional teams to support business initiatives</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Analyse\r\n  data for trends, anomalies, and optimization opportunities</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Support\r\n  data transformation, metadata management, and workload orchestration</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">What\r\n  You’ll Bring</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">2–5\r\n  years of experience as a Data Engineer</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Bachelor’s\r\n  degree in information systems, Computer Science, or related field</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Advanced\r\n  SQL skills and experience with relational and big data databases</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Proficiency\r\n  in Python, Scala, or R</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Experience\r\n  with ETL tools (Informatica, SSIS, Talend)</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Familiarity\r\n  with Databricks, Snowflake, and stream processing technologies</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Strong\r\n  analytical and problem-solving skills</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Ability\r\n  to work independently and in team settings</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Excellent\r\n  communication skills</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Bonus\r\n  Points</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Experience\r\n  with natural language processing or statistical modelling</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Familiarity\r\n  with Agile methodologies and source control best practices</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Work Schedule</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"> : Monday–Friday, standard business hours</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-18', '21:35:00', '22:55:00', '2026-05-18 17:15:18', '2026-05-18 17:15:30', 80, '2026-05-18 15:42:04', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-359@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
