text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Akhilesh\r\n  Gaonkar</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About\r\nthe job</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Full\r\nStack Developer Position</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Guzman\r\n&amp; Company is recruiting for a full-time Full Stack Developer Position for\r\nour Coral Gables, FL headquarters.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job\r\nDuties:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Generate\r\nfinancial reports, including MSCI, S&amp;P 500, AmCen, and Russell rebalance\r\ndeliverables</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Create\r\nBAT files in a virtual machine to back up files to AWS and archive files to the\r\nshared trading drive</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Build\r\na new Airflow DAG for file merging</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Build\r\na new Airflow DAG for daily and weekly reporting</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Build\r\na new Airflow DAG for SFTP backups</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Maintain\r\nand modify an Airflow DAG for file delivery</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Maintain\r\nthe Airflow scripts</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Deploy\r\nAirflow in the production environment to support stable scheduled operations</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Add\r\nemail notifications to Airflow delivery processes and manage authentication and\r\nconnection settings</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any\r\nother duties as assigned</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Required\r\nSkills and Qualifications:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in;list-style-position:outside\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s degree in computer science or related\r\n     field preferred</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Apache Airflow for building,\r\n     scheduling, monitoring, and troubleshooting production DAGs</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong knowledge of Python for workflow\r\n     automation, file processing, and data transformation</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with AWS S3 for file storage,\r\n     movement, and pipeline integration</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Familiarity with SFTP/FTP processes for automated\r\n     file delivery and retrieval</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ability to work in Linux/Unix environments,\r\n     including SSH access, file management, and service restarts</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience supporting production data pipelines\r\n     with retries, scheduling, dependency handling, and error resolution</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Knowledge of CSV/file-based data processing,\r\n     validation, and transformation workflows</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Familiarity with GitHub for source control, code\r\n     updates, and deployment workflows</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ability to deploy and maintain Airflow DAGs in\r\n     production environments</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with automated reporting pipelines and\r\n     client file delivery processes</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Languages\r\n/ technical knowledge:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in;list-style-position:outside\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Python</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Shell scripting / Bash</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Airflow CLI / basic DevOps commands</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in;background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Understanding of financial operations or\r\n     trade-support workflows is a plus</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><i><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Guzman\r\n&amp; Company is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will\r\nreceive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion,\r\nsex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or\r\nprotected veteran status.</span></i><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#F9F9F9\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"1\" width=\"100%\" align=\"left\">\r\n\r\n</span></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xd8d5bbbc\" style=\"margin: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Requirements added by the job poster</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xd8d5bbbc\" style=\"margin: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">• Commute to this job’s location</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xd8d5bbbc\" style=\"margin: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">• Working in an onsite setting</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-18', '22:00:00', '22:30:00', '2026-05-18 16:21:35', '2026-05-18 17:03:15', 30, '2026-05-18 15:49:08', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-361@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
