 style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">MS Team</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:211.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview Link:</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <div align=\"center\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"536\" style=\"width: 402pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:42.75pt 0in 7.5pt 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#242424\">Microsoft Teams meeting</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n    &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#242424\">Join: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#242424\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/273243907734254?p=Gm8khCPPC2fWRgEbO3\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\n    color:#5B5FC7\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/273243907734254?p=Gm8khCPPC2fWRgEbO3</span></a></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#616161\">Meeting ID: </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n    font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\">273 243 907 734 254</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#616161\">Passcode: </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n    font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424\">rS7iG6Xy</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n   <tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"282\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:211.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">We are\r\n  seeking a highly motivated and adaptable FP&amp;A Analyst to join our\r\n  Brokerage Finance team based in Menlo Park. This role has opened due to\r\n  increased workload from multiple new product launches and offers an exciting\r\n  opportunity to work in a fast-paced, collaborative environment.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  You’ll play a key role in budgeting, forecasting, financial modeling, and\r\n  performance analysis, helping drive strategic decisions as part of a growing\r\n  FP&amp;A function. The ideal candidate is detail-oriented, proactive, and\r\n  thrives on quickly getting up to speed in a dynamic team setting.<br>\r\n  A background or strong interest in the financial services industry,\r\n  particularly brokerage, fintech, or trading platforms—is highly preferred.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Key Responsibilities<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  • Support budgeting and forecasting processes for new and existing brokerage\r\n  products<br>\r\n  • Develop and maintain detailed financial models to support revenue and cost\r\n  projections<br>\r\n  • Analyze operating costs, revenue trends, and performance metrics<br>\r\n  • Partner with cross-functional teams to support business planning and\r\n  product financials<br>\r\n  • Prepare regular and ad hoc financial reports and presentations for senior\r\n  leadership<br>\r\n  • Assist with improving processes and tools across reporting and work streams<br>\r\n  • Communicate effectively to both finance and non-finance stakeholders<br>\r\n  • Use collaboration tools such as Slack and Google Workspace (Sheets, Docs,\r\n  Slides)<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Qualifications<br>\r\n  • Bachelor’s degree in finance, Accounting, Economics, or a related field<br>\r\n  • 2–5 years of relevant experience in FP&amp;A or a finance-related role<br>\r\n  • Strong Excel skills (e.g., financial modeling, advanced formulas, pivot\r\n  tables)<br>\r\n  • Proven ability to learn quickly and contribute in a fast-paced environment<br>\r\n  • Excellent communication and interpersonal skills<br>\r\n  • Strong analytical and problem-solving capabilities<br>\r\n  • Background or strong interest in the financial services industry<br>\r\n  • Experience with cloud-based collaboration and communication tools (e.g.,\r\n  Slack, Google Workspace)<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  What We Offer:<br>\r\n  • Opportunity for conversion to a full-time role based on performance<br>\r\n  • Involvement in high-impact projects that support product growth and\r\n  innovation<br>\r\n  • Join a national network of 4,000+ professionals through Robert Half’s\r\n  consulting practice — offering clients top-tier talent on a contract basis\r\n  while you remain a full-time Robert Half employee<br>\r\n  • Ensure continuity and expertise on critical finance engagements with\r\n  long-term client impact</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;background:yellow\">Please\r\nensure the support person is available 20 minutes before the interview.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n 0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNo