 style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <h3 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:3.75pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in;box-sizing:inherit;text-transform:capitalize\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#0B1F28;font-weight:normal\">Job Title: IT Project Manager – Genesys,\r\n  Contact Center, CRM.<br>\r\n  Location: Austin, TX (Onsite – 5 days a week).<br>\r\n  Duration: 7+ Months Contract (With possible chances of extension).<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Position Description - The services You will provide the Deloitte project\r\n  team:<br>\r\n  As an IT Project Manager Contractor, you will oversee the planning,\r\n  execution, and delivery of IT projects. Develop project plans, including\r\n  scope, schedule, budget, and resource allocation. Coordinate meetings and\r\n  ensure stakeholder alignment. Identify and mitigate project risks, issues,\r\n  and dependencies. Monitor progress and provide regular status updates. Ensure\r\n  timely, within-scope, and budget-compliant project delivery.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Primary Skill Required for the Role:<br>\r\n  Genesis - Contact Centre Advanced (6-9 years’ experience).<br>\r\n  SAP C4C - Cloud for Customer Intermediate (3-5 years’ experience).<br>\r\n  Salesforce - Service Cloud Intermediate (3-5 years’ experience.<br>\r\n  Additional Project Details:<br>\r\n  The client is looking for a project manager that can manage a team for\r\n  implementing a Phone bot and Chat bot using Genesys software for client\'s\r\n  contact centre team globally.<br>\r\n  The client needs someone with Omni-channel and integration to SAP C4C or\r\n  Service Cloud V2.<o:p></o:p></span></h3>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-18', '02:30:00', '03:00:00', '2026-05-18 21:22:53', '2026-05-18 21:23:05', 30, '2026-05-18 16:59:10', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-368@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
