ize:15.0pt;\r\n    font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Join: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/265711706856722?p=aIwsjmA6ujbjtmajXK\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/265711706856722?p=aIwsjmA6ujbjtmajXK</a></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\n    font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Meeting ID: 265 711 706\r\n    856 722</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\n    font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Passcode: oy3xm6RD</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"426\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:319.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">SUMMARY</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">: Provide functional and technical expertise and\r\n  production support, including application troubleshooting, development, and\r\n  maintenance of workflow, security, and integrations. Coordinate projects and\r\n  facilitation of improvements, enhancements, quarterly regression testing, and\r\n  instance management for the enterprise Oracle ERP system.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>DUTIES AND RESPONSIBILITIES</b>: <i>The following tasks describe the basic\r\n  functions of the job and represent the type of work performed. They do not\r\n  constitute an exhaustive list of the duties and responsibilities performed on\r\n  the job. The following frequencies and percentage of time spent are\r\n  approximations only. </i><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Mentor junior level analyst. [Daily, 15%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Participate in production support, from\r\n       troubleshooting and identification through resolution. [Daily, 15%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Facilitate and monitor production\r\n       operational processes performed by the IS team. Including running\r\n       reports, scheduled processes, uploads, and issue resolution, monitor\r\n       scheduled integrations and processes.[Daily, 10%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Develop and maintain scheduled, and ad hoc\r\n       reports and queries in support of ongoing organizational needs. [Daily,\r\n       10%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Develop, maintain, and oversee security\r\n       rules and roles. Including auto provisioning, deprovisioning, and AOR\r\n       assignment. [Daily, 10%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Develop and maintain Oracle BPM and HCM\r\n       workflows. [Daily, 10%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Monitor scheduled integrations and\r\n       processes. [Daily, 5%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Responsible for instance management.\r\n       Including scheduling and coordinating P2T and T2T clones and performing\r\n       post cloning tasks. [Daily, 5%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Coordinate regression testing related to\r\n       quarterly Oracle patching. Including communicating schedules,\r\n       coordinating tasks and reviewing new available enhancements. [Daily, 5%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Work with Senior Analysts to develop\r\n       internally or work with third party vendors to deploy business\r\n       solutions. Integrate complex systems in multi-platform and multi-vendor\r\n       environments to include transactional data collection systems, data\r\n       warehouse/decision support systems, and other critical district systems.\r\n       [Daily, 5%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Develop and maintain documentation of\r\n       processes and procedures. [Daily, 5%]<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Perform other related duties as assigned or\r\n       requested. [Daily, 5%] <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Minimum Qualifications </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s degree in Information Technology\r\n       or related field or equivalent training.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Three (3) years of experience in Information\r\n       Systems/Technology or related field.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Intermediate knowledge of ERPs (Enterprise\r\n       Resource Systems) and SaaS (Software as a Service) environments.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Intermediate knowledge and experience with\r\n       PL/SQL, reporting packages, databases, programming, scripting, and query\r\n       writing.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Intermediate verbal and written\r\n       communication skills in English, interpersonal relations, and\r\n       organizational skills.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Ability to work independently and\r\n       collaboratively with others.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Ability to successfully communicate and\r\n       maintain positive and effective relationships with all levels within an\r\n       organization and facilitate understanding of processes and issues from a\r\n       business perspective.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Criminal background check and fingerprinting\r\n       required for hire. <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Required Certificates, Licenses, And\r\n  Registrations </span></b><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">All certifications, licenses, and registrations\r\n  must be valid and unexpired. </span></i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">N/A <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Preferred Qualifications </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Oracle Cloud Fusion ERP,\r\n       HCM, and EPM.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Oracle Transactional\r\n       Business Intelligence (OTBI).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Oracle HCM Extracts and Data\r\n       Loader.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Oracle Integration Cloud\r\n       (OIC) and using SOAP and REST API’s.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Oracle Visual Builder.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Oracle EPM Automate and\r\n       EDMCS.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Microsoft SQL Server\r\n       Reporting Services (SSRS).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience working directly with people from\r\n       diverse racial, ethnic, and socioeconomic backgrounds.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Racially conscious and culturally competent\r\n       with the skill, will, capacity, and knowledge to commit to a culture of\r\n       continuous improvement. <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Thanks &amp; Regards,<br>\r\nRiddesh Makwana</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-05-19', '00:30:00', '01:00:00', '2026-05-19 18:55:53', '2026-05-19 19:34:18', 30, '2026-05-19 13:15:38', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-372@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(373, 8, 150, 7, 3, 4, 'FW: Request for One-on-One TQC Session - Gopinath Paila', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">Hello Team,&nbsp;<br>\r\nI hope you are doing well.&nbsp;<br>\r\n&nbsp;<br>\r\nCandidate Details<br>\r\nCandidate Name:&nbsp;<b>&nbsp;Gopinath Paila</b><br>\r\nCandidate Contact Number:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>+1&nbsp;</b> <b>8049387992&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><br>\r\n&nbsp;<br>\r\nI am reaching out to request a one-on-one <b>TQC</b> session for\r\nthe <b>Gopinath Paila</b>. To facilitate this process, I have\r\nprovided the contact number and attached their resume for your reference.&nbsp;<br>\r\n&nbsp;<br>\r\nYour prompt scheduling of the TQC session is greatly\r\nappreciated. If there are any specific requirements or if you need further\r\ninformation, please let me know.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Why Wells Fargo<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis is where your true career begins. We ranked #3 on the 2022 LinkedIn Top\r\nCompanies list - and #1 among financial services companies - as the best\r\nworkplace \"to grow your career\" in the U.S. At Wells Fargo, we\r\nsupport employees\' career aspirations and growth. We\'re proud of our\r\nemployee-welfare-centered business approach. We offer competitive salaries and\r\none of the richest benefits packages in the industry. Our Total Rewards program\r\nfocuses on wellness, work-life balance and the financial health of our employees.\r\nOur customers invest with us, we invest in you. Apply today.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAt Wells Fargo, we are looking for talented people who will put our customers\r\nat the center of everything we do. Help us build a better Wells Fargo. It all\r\nbegins with outstanding talent. It all begins with you.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLearn more about the career areas and lines of business at <a href=\"http://wellsfargojobs.com\" target=\"_blank\">wellsfargojobs.com</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\nAbout This Role<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe are seeking a Capital Markets Middle Office Associate/ Governance and\r\nOversight Analyst to join the Governance &amp; Oversight team supporting Global\r\nCorporate &amp; Investment Banking (CIB) Operations. This cross-functional role\r\nhelps assess operational risk, strengthen control environments, and support\r\nglobal governance routines. It offers broad exposure to operational processes,\r\nregulatory considerations, and enterprise risk frameworks while collaborating\r\nwith teams across regions and business lines.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey Responsibilities<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGovernance &amp; Oversight<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSupport governance routines by preparing materials, tracking deliverables, and\r\nmaintaining key documentation.<br>\r\nMaintain dashboards, SharePoint sites, and reporting inventories to ensure\r\naccuracy and alignment with enterprise standards.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nControl Evaluation &amp; Risk Support<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAssist in control assessments by collecting data, reviewing evidence, and\r\ndocumenting results.<br>\r\nIdentify control gaps or emerging risks through analysis of operational\r\nprocesses.<br>\r\nSupport partners with requests related to audits, regulatory reviews, and\r\nsupervisory activities.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nCross-Functional Collaboration<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWork with partners across CIB Operations, Compliance, Business Control, and\r\nOperational Risk to drive consistency in controls and standards.<br>\r\nSupport coordination with regulators and audit partners.<br>\r\nAssist with global governance submissions and documentation across regions.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nReporting &amp; Communication<br>\r\n<br>\r\nContribute to reports summarizing control performance, risk themes, and trends<br>\r\n<br>\r\nRequired Qualifications<br>\r\n<br>\r\n6+ months of Capital Markets industry experience, or equivalent through work\r\nexperience, training, military service, or education.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDesired Qualifications<br>\r\n<br>\r\nStrong analytical, organizational, and multitasking skills.<br>\r\nAbility to identify risks and evaluate control effectiveness.<br>\r\nProficiency in Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, and Word; SharePoint or Power BI\r\nexperience is a plus.<br>\r\nHigh attention to detail and accuracy.<br>\r\nStrong verbal, written, and interpersonal communication skills.<br>\r\nExperience drafting clear communications to support governance updates and\r\ninquiries.<br>\r\nAbility to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced, global\r\nenvironment.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nJob Expectations:<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPosition offers a hybrid work schedule in which you are required to work in\r\noffice 3 days per week at a minimum in one of the locations listed below<br>\r\nRelocation assistance is not available for this position<br>\r\nVisa sponsorship is not available for this position<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLocations: <br>\r\n<br>\r\n144039 NC 550 S Tryon Street Charlotte, NC<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPosting End Date:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n1 May 2026<br>\r\n<br>\r\nJob posting may come down early due to volume of applicants.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe Value Equal Opportunity<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWells Fargo is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will\r\nreceive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion,\r\nsex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, status\r\nas a protected veteran, or any other legally protected characteristic.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nEmployees support our focus on building strong customer relationships balanced\r\nwith a strong risk mitigating and compliance-driven culture which firmly\r\nestablishes those disciplines as critical to the success of our customers and\r\ncompany. They are accountable for execution of all applicable risk programs\r\n(Credit, Market, Financial Crimes, Operational, Regulatory Compliance), which\r\nincludes effectively following and adhering to applicable Wells Fargo policies\r\nand procedures, appropriately fulfilling risk and compliance obligations,\r\ntimely and effective escalation and remediation of issues, and making sound risk\r\ndecisions. There is emphasis on proactive monitoring, governance, risk\r\nidentification and escalation, as well as making sound risk decisions\r\ncommensurate with the business unit\'s risk appetite and all risk and compliance\r\nprogram requirements.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nCandidates applying to job openings posted in Canada: Applications for\r\nemployment are encouraged from all qualified candidates, including women,\r\npersons with disabilities, aboriginal peoples and visible minorities.\r\nAccommodation for applicants with disabilities is available upon request in\r\nconnection with the recruitment process.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nApplicants With Disabilities<br>\r\n<br>\r\nTo request a medical accommodation during the application or interview process,\r\nvisit Disability Inclusion at Wells Fargo .<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDrug and Alcohol Policy<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWells Fargo maintains a drug free workplace. Please see our Drug and Alcohol\r\nPolicy to learn more.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWells Fargo Recruitment And Hiring Requirements<br>\r\n<br>\r\n&nbsp;Third-Party recordings are prohibited unless authorized by Wells Fargo.<br>\r\n&nbsp;Wells Fargo requires you to directly represent your own experiences\r\nduring the recruiting and hiring process.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n@RWF<br>\r\n<br>\r\nReference Number<br>\r\n<br>\r\nR-518826</b><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-19', '20:30:00', '21:00:00', '2026-05-19 15:11:23', '2026-05-19 15:17:26', 30, '2026-05-19 15:06:33', 2000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-373@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(374, 8, 151, 7, 4, 4, 'FW: Request for Doubt Session -Sujith kondabrolu - Supply Chain Analyst-06/05/2026', '<p>Hello Team,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I hope you’re doing well.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">My candidate, <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Google Sans&quot;;color:#1F1F1F\">Sujith kondabrolu </span><b>&nbsp;</b>has\r\nsome doubts regarding the Resume Understanding Session (RUC) and\r\nneeds clarification. Could you please arrange a doubt session for\r\nHim.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black\">NOTE: [ Candidate Full Name:</span></strong>&nbsp;<b> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;;color:#1F1F1F\">Sujith kondabrolu</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">]</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [ Candidate Number:</span></strong><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> <span style=\"color:black\">+1</span></span></b>\r\n<b>&nbsp;(945) – 267 – 0011&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">]</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-19', '21:00:00', '21:30:00', '2026-05-19 15:12:54', '2026-05-19 15:45:49', 30, '2026-05-19 15:09:45', 2000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-374@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
