-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Proactively identify and mitigate security risks;\r\n  establish incident response and governance protocols.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#595959\">Qualifications</span></b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#595959\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Deep expertise in cloud computing (public, private,\r\n  hybrid) and major cloud providers (AWS, Azure, GCP).<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertic