ont-size:\r\n  12.0pt;color:black\">Client Details and Location for the applied position</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1027\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 769.9pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in; height: 40.15pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16.5pt; font-family: Roboto; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">ASIC\r\n  Design Verification Engineer</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in\"><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<b>Total Candidate Experience 3+ years</b></span></u><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5pt; border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_table_1\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"341\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 3.55in; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: initial; padding: 0in; height: 23.6pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\">Qualcomm<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"324\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:243.0pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\">Aug 2024 – Present<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"341\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:3.55in;border:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\">Infosys<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"324\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:243.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt\">Jul 2021 – Jul 2023<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#494949;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job Details:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Your Impact</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">As an\r\nASIC Design Verification Engineer, you will play a critical role in developing\r\nCisco’s revolutionary data center solutions. You’ll architect and develop DV\r\ninfrastructure, create and execute comprehensive test plans, and ensure robust\r\nverification and coverage for complex chips. Your collaboration with designers,\r\narchitects, and software teams will help guarantee seamless integration and\r\noptimal performance of Cisco’s hardware platforms. You will:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Participate in the ASIC design\r\n     verification for Cisco high-end switching products.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Perform end-to-end verification\r\n     of design blocks and top-level</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Develop simulation models, test\r\n     plans, direct and random tests, code or functional coverage,\r\n     multi-chip/system simulation, and performance analysis.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Construct testbenches\r\n     components like scoreboard, agents, sequencers, and monitors.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Collaborate with the hardware,\r\n     software designers, and vendors.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Minimum Qualifications:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor\'s degree in\r\n     electrical/computer science/computer engineering/related degree and 5+\r\n     years of related experience or master\'s in electrical/computer\r\n     science/computer engineering/related degree and 3+ years of related\r\n     experience, or PhD in electrical/computer science/computer\r\n     engineering/related degree + 1 year of related experience.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience in System Verilog\r\n     and UVM.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with ASIC design and\r\n     verification processes, debugging, methodology, and tools.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience verifying\r\n     blocks/clusters/full chip level for ASIC.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Hands on debugging experience.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Preferred Qualifications:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">PCIe and AXI protocol knowledge</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Linux, C/C++,\r\n     and/or Python/Perl.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience in Networking.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with Formal\r\n     verification.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cisco Sans TT&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with post-silicon\r\n     lab bring-up</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-05-20', '22:30:00', '02:00:00', '2026-05-20 18:53:35', '2026-05-21 14:03:24', 1230, '2026-05-20 13:48:41', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-386@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
