order-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Link: - <a href=\"https://www.indeed.com/job/data-scientist-person-austin-tx-4a64dcad334ed79c?from=msg&amp;vjs=3\">https://www.indeed.com/job/data-scientist-person-austin-tx-4a64dcad334ed79c?from=msg&amp;vjs=3</a><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Job Overview<br>\r\n  We’re a fast-growing startup company, based in Austin, Texas, that is\r\n  dedicated to helping businesses leverage AI with automated customer service\r\n  responses.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Our system utilizes\r\n  SQL queries through CRM/ERP API integrations to deliver highly accurate\r\n  responses. As a network of advanced open-source large language models (LLMs),\r\n  we perform multiple functions across the customer service process at\r\n  production scale. In unison, we help companies to integrate our technology\r\n  into their infrastructure. Our flagship technology improves the customer\r\n  service team’s productivity by 10X.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">We are seeking a\r\n  passionate and resourceful Data Scientist with a \"hacker\" mindset\r\n  to join our team and contribute to the development and deployment of\r\n  cutting-edge, AI-powered decision support systems. In this dynamic role,\r\n  you\'ll be involved in everything from data harvesting and schema design to\r\n  building machine learning products and decision support tools.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">You are determined to\r\n  overcome technical challenges, and are excited to work in a constantly\r\n  evolving technological landscape. You\'ll play a key role in analyzing large\r\n  datasets, identifying patterns, and devising solutions that enhance our\r\n  clients\' capabilities. You\'ll work collaboratively with cross-functional\r\n  teams to tackle complex, large-scale problems and help achieve shared goals.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Responsibilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:\r\n  bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Identify\r\n  valuable data sources and automate mining/collection processes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"fon