p:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Present Location with zip code</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Texas,\r\n  76201</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Company Name</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Google</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview Date &amp; Time</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">1st\r\n  Interview:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n  Wednesday, May 20, 2026 at <span style=\"color:black\">1:00pm - 1:45pm</span><span style=\"color:#313131\"> (PST)<br>\r\n  </span><b>2nd Interview:</b> Wednesday, May 20, 2026 at <span style=\"color:black\">3:00pm - 3:45pm</span><span style=\"color:#313131\">&nbsp;\r\n  (PST)</span></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Round Of Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Loop\r\n  round 1: Coding<br>\r\n  Loop round 2: Coding</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#161513\">N/A</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Google\r\n  meet, Virtual</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview Meeting link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Loop\r\n  round 1: </span><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/dcw-xxsj-psf\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">https://meet.google.com/dcw-xxsj-psf</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131;\r\n  text-decoration:none;text-underline:none\"><br>\r\n  </span></a><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Loop round 2: <a href=\"https://meet.google.com/dcw-xxsj-psf\">https://meet.google.com/dcw-xxsj-psf</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:29.25pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  height:29.25pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;height:29.25pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Job\r\n  description</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Software\r\n  Engineer III, Google Home</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">corporate_fare\r\n  Google place Los Angeles, CA, USA; Mountain View, CA, USA</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Mid</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Experience\r\n  driving progress, solving problems, and mentoring more junior team members;\r\n  deeper expertise and applied knowledge within relevant area.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">info_outline</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">This\r\n  role may also be located in our Playa Vista, CA campus.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Applicants\r\n  in the County of Los Angeles: Qualified applications with arrest or\r\n  conviction records will be considered for employment in accordance with the\r\n  Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers and the California\r\n  Fair Chance Act.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Note:\r\n  By applying to this position you will have an opportunity to share your\r\n  preferred working location from the following: Los Angeles, CA, USA; Mountain\r\n  View, CA, USA .</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Minimum\r\n  qualifications:</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Bachelor\'s\r\n  degree or equivalent practical experience.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">2\r\n  years of experience programming in C++, Java or Python.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Preferred\r\n  qualifications:</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Master\'s\r\n  degree or PhD in Computer Science or related technical fields.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">2\r\n  years of experience with performance, large scale systems data analysis,\r\n  visualization tools, or debugging.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">2\r\n  years of experience with data structures or algorithms in either an academic\r\n  or industry setting.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Experience\r\n  developing accessible technologies.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Proficiency\r\n  in code and system health, diagnosis and resolution, and software test\r\n  engineering.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">About\r\n  the job</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Google\'s\r\n  software engineers develop the next-generation technologies that change how\r\n  billions of users connect, explore, and interact with information and one\r\n  another. Our products need to handle information at massive scale, and extend\r\n  well beyond web search. We\'re looking for engineers who bring fresh ideas\r\n  from all areas, including information retrieval, distributed computing,\r\n  large-scale system design, networking and data storage, security, artificial\r\n  intelligence, natural language processing, UI design and mobile; the list\r\n  goes on and is growing every day. As a software engineer, you will work on a\r\n  specific project critical to Google\'s needs with opportunities to switch\r\n  teams and projects as you and our fast-paced business grow and evolve. We\r\n  need our engineers to be versatile, display leadership qualities and be\r\n  enthusiastic to take on new problems across the full-stack as we continue to\r\n  push technology forward.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">With\r\n  your technical expertise you will manage project priorities, deadlines, and\r\n  deliverables. You will design, develop, test, deploy, maintain, and enhance\r\n  software solutions.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Google\'s\r\n  mission is to organize the world\'s information and make it universally\r\n  accessible and useful. Our Devices &amp; Services team combines the best of\r\n  Google AI, Software, and Hardware to create radically helpful experiences for\r\n  users. We research, design, and develop new technologies and hardware to make\r\n  our user\'s interaction with computing faster, seamless, and more powerful.\r\n  Whether finding new ways to capture and sense the world around us, advancing\r\n  form factors, or improving interaction methods, the Devices &amp; Services\r\n  team is making people\'s lives better through technology.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">The\r\n  US base salary range for this full-time position is $147,000-$211,000 + bonus\r\n  + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role, level, and\r\n  location. Within the range, individual pay is determined by work location and\r\n  additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant\r\n  education or training. Your recruiter can share more about the specific\r\n  salary range for your preferred location during the hiring process.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Please\r\n  note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the\r\n  base salary only, and do not include bonus, equity, or benefits. Learn more\r\n  aboutbenefits at Google (<a href=\"https://careers.google.com/benefits/\">https://careers.google.com/benefits/</a>)\r\n  .</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Responsibilities</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Write\r\n  product or system development code.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Participate\r\n  in, or lead design reviews with peers and stakeholders to decide amongst\r\n  available technologies.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Review\r\n  code developed by other developers and provide feedback to ensure best\r\n  practices (e.g., style guidelines, checking code in, accuracy, testability,\r\n  and efficiency).</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Contribute\r\n  to existing documentation or educational content and adapt content based on\r\n  product/program updates and user feedback.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Triage\r\n  product or system issues and debug/track/resolve by analyzing the sources of\r\n  issues and the impact on hardware, network, or service operations and\r\n  quality.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Information\r\n  collected and processed as part of your Google Careers profile, and any job\r\n  applications you choose to submit is subject to Google\'sApplicant and\r\n  Candidate Privacy Policy (./privacy-policy) .</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '2026-05-20', '03:30:00', '04:14:00', '2026-05-21 13:36:47', '2026-05-21 13:36:59', 44, '2026-05-20 15:15:31', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-395@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
