(408, 17, 166, 12, 1, 4, 'FW: Interview Support Email Formate', '<p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Hello Sir</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black\">Hope this email finds you well.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nI\'ve forwarded the details for the upcoming interview of Manushree Thakkar\r\nKindly proceed to book<br>\r\nthe technical support person accordingly to ensure a smooth and efficient\r\ninterview process.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nCandidate Details:<br>\r\nCandidate Name: Manushree Thakkar<br>\r\nCandidate Contact Number: +1 (945) 527-4170</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor;\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:35.25pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5pt; height: 35.25pt; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Candidate Name</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-left:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  height:35.25pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Manushree\r\n  Thakkar</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:39.75pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  height:39.75pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Candidate T