r\n  .15pt\">https://calendly.com/events/cbd85880-4274-44b6-9c8c-664420b7c052/google_meet</span></a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:32.9pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"182\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:32.9pt;border-color:currentcolor rgb(0,0,0) rgb(0,0,0)\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"418\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:313.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:32.9pt;border-color:currentcolor rgb(0,0,0) rgb(0,0,0) currentcolor\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:32.9pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"600\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:6.25in;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:32.9pt;border-color:currentcolor rgb(0,0,0) rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;Job\r\n  Description :&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:1.25rem;margin:1.5rem 0px 0px\" id=\"x_m_-5422202218322001093m_7575162737866527163m_1710127228057446684gmail-jobDescriptionTitleHeading\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#2D2D2D\">Full job description<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#595959\">About Financial Modeling\r\n  Prep:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#595959\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#595959\">Join Financial Modeling Prep (FMP) as a\r\n  Cloud Solutions Architect to lead the design, build, and management of\r\n  enterprise infrastructure for mission-critical financial data services.\r\n  Architect scalable, high-performance systems across hybrid cloud and on-premises\r\n  environments while collaborating with expert engineers and data scientists.\r\n  Drive best practices for integration, automation, and deployment, ensuring\r\n  secure and resilient infrastructure. We seek candidates with deep expertise\r\n  in cloud computing platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP), advanced system design\r\n  skills, strong business acumen, and excellent leadership abilities.\r\n  Experience with risk management, privacy, and cloud governance is essential.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#595959\">Join us as a Cloud Solutions Architect\r\n  and lead the design, build, and management of enterprise infrastructure for\r\n  our mission-critical financial data services. Architect scalable,\r\n  high-performance systems across hybrid (cloud and on-premises) environments.\r\n  Collaborate with expert engineers, developers, and data scientists. Drive\r\n  best practices for integration, automation, and deployment. Take ownership\r\n  for secure and resilient infrastructure, enabling growth and innovation and\r\n  enjoy opportunities for advancement and skill development.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#595959\">Responsibilities</span></b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#595959\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Develop and lead the overall cloud vision, including\r\n  adoption, migration, and platform evolution strategies.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Design high-level and detailed cloud architecture for new\r\n  and existing systems.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Align technical initiatives with business objectives,\r\n  translating stakeholder needs into actionable plans.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#595959;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Ensure cloud infrastructure meets standards for security,\r\n  scalability, performance, and cost-effectiveness.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-