ivers well-tested API capabilities, <span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">maintaining reliable\r\n  operations, and improving</span> developer experience through clear patterns\r\n  and documentation.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\">How you’ll make us better:</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Build and maintain Azure\r\n  Functions using the .NET 8 isolated worker model and HTTP triggers<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Design and deliver REST\r\n  APIs using OpenAPI-first principles with clear annotations and documentation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Actively leverage AI‑assisted\r\n  development tools to optimize day‑to‑day work<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Implement stored\r\n  procedure-based data access against Azure SQL Managed Instance, including\r\n  read-replica patterns where appropriate<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Apply caching strategies to\r\n  improve performance and reliability<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Build and maintain shared\r\n  libraries for common capabilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Assist with architecture\r\n  decisions and capture key choices in lightweight Architecture Decision\r\n  Records (ADRs)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Improve performance and\r\n  reliability by applying established patterns<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Integrate with Azure\r\n  services including Application Insights, Key Vault, Blob Storage, and Azure\r\n  Identity<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Analyze and document\r\n  existing MSSQL schemas to understand entity relationships, constraints, and\r\n  data flows<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Develop and refine SQL\r\n  queries and stored procedures so API responses are accurate, performant, and\r\n  aligned to business logic<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Partner with data owners\r\n  and DBAs to validate assumptions, coordinate model changes, and troubleshoot\r\n  performance issues when needed<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Create reusable query\r\n  templates and schema references to speed onboarding and improve consistency\r\n  across services.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Assess the impact of schema\r\n  changes on existing APIs and coordinate versioning or data-access updates as\r\n  needed<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Configure and maintain\r\n  Azure API Management (APIM), including backend routing, policies, and\r\n  subscription management<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Maintain APIM configuration\r\n  for backend setup and policy updates, following established patterns and\r\n  change controls<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Support API versioning for\r\n  non-breaking changes and coordinate breaking changes that require new\r\n  versions<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Implement throttling and\r\n  rate limiting per subscription and operation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;