ont-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">High School diploma\r\n  required<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Three (3) years of\r\n  experience in a modern .NET software engineering position with one (1) year\r\n  of experience building and supporting workloads on Azure Functions required<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Intermediate knowledge of\r\n  C# / .NET 8, PowerShell 7+, and JSON/YAML for configuration Intermediate\r\n  knowledge of Azure services used in production such as Functions, API\r\n  Management (APIM), Azure SQL, Key Vault, and Application Insights<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Intermediate knowledge of\r\n  Visual Studio 2026 or VS Code, Git &amp; GitHub (Actions, OIDC), Azure CLI,\r\n  Postman or similar API testing tools<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\">Intermediate knowledge of\r\n  SQL, including writing queries and working with stored procedures to support\r\n  API data access<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:black\">We saved the best for last.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;font-weight:normal\"><br>\r\n  In exchange for the dynamic contribution you’ll bring to our team, we offer:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">·<