e;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:63.75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">RealPage<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Anna Allen<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:69.8pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"365\" style=\"width:273.4pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:\r\n  none;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:69.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Client Details and Location for the</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>applied position&nbsp;</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"359\" style=\"width:268.9pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:69.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">RealPage,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">US-TX-Remote<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">• Total Candidate Experience 6+ years<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:35.4pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"227\" style=\"width: 170pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 35.4pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>HubSpot</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"168\" style=\"width:126.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:\r\n  none;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:35.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mar 2023 – Present<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:40.8pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"227\" style=\"width:170.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:\r\n  none;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:40.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Deloitte</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"168\" style=\"width:126.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:40.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sept 2020 – Oct 2022<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:40.8pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"227\" style=\"width:170.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:\r\n  none;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:40.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>HCLTech</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"168\" style=\"width:126.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:40.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">May 2019 – Aug 2021<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Job description</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Realpage<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Senior Product Manager- REMOTE<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">LocationUS-TX-Remote<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Overview<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">As a RealPage Senior Product Manager, Product Management,\r\nyou will be a hands-on owner of an Affordable product area and interact with a\r\nteam of other product managers who will help create, maintain, and grow our\r\nmultifamily SaaS product offerings. You will work collaboratively with\r\nengineering (Developers and QA) across a global organization and will report\r\ninto a Director/Sr Director of Product Management. &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">SCOPE OF RESPONSIBILITY: &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">*Hands-on owner of an Affordable Product area, ensuring\r\nOneSite Affordable remains compliant with regulatory changes<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">*Delivers market and product vision and new product\r\ninnovations<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">*Supports relationships with Affordable Housing clients<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">*Drives PME (Problem Management Escalations) to completion<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">*Interacting internal cross-functional stakeholder\r\nrelationships (engineering, support, CS)&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Responsibilities<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Creation of product vision, strategy, roadmap (for product\r\nmodules/Add on products or similar)<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Leads process modeling and translates customer needs into\r\nrequirements<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Plans, designs, and analyzes user requirements for\r\ndevelopment<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Breakdown of requirements into Epics/features/stories and\r\nacceptance criteria<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Identifies cross product dependencies and impact<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Demos (internal or external, as needed)<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Analyze &amp; triage product maintenance issues<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Applies broad knowledge to identify and resolve core\r\nproblems, suggest process improvements, and review technical solutions<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Works &amp; coordinates with multiple scrum teams (PO for\r\nmultiple scrum teams)<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Oversee Scrum team backlog creation/refinement<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Plans, prioritizes, and organizes multiple work streams<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Customer interaction (discovery, user groups)<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Qualifications<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">QUALIFICATIONS&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">* 5-8 years product management experience in a regulated,\r\ncalculation-driven market segment or industry. &nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">* Affordable Housing Industry specific domain experience\r\nvalued, but not required&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">* 3+ years management experience&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">* Bachelor’s Degree &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">KNOWLEDGE/SKILLS/ABILITIES<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">SaaS based product company experience<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Experience in market research and analysis<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Product Mindset<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Business minded/Strategy focused<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Visionary, leading with influence<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Customer-focused, market sensing<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Commercially and financially responsible<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Collaborative; facilitator; relationship enabler<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Strategic problem-solving focus/analytical skills<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Strong communicator; transparent &amp; trusted<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Tenacious, proactive &amp; courageous<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Strong knowledge of Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint,\r\nVisio and/or user interface design tools.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Physical Demands and Working Conditions<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">While performing the duties of this job, the employee is\r\noccasionally required to stand; walk; sit; use hands to finger, handle or feel\r\nobjects, tools or controls; reach with hands and arms; climb stairs; talk or\r\nhear. The employee must have the ability to operate a personal computer and\r\nexpress or exchange ideas by means of the spoken word. May be required to sit\r\nand/or stand for long periods of time. Specific vision abilities required by\r\nthis job include close vision, distance vision, color vision, peripheral\r\nvision, depth perception, and ability to adjust focus. May be required to lift\r\nor move 10+ pounds.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Salary and Benefits<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">RealPage provides a competitive salary package along with a\r\ncomprehensive benefit plan that includes:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Health, dental, and vision insurance.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Retirement savings plan with company match.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Paid time off and holidays.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Professional development opportunities.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Performance-based bonus based on position.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Compensation may vary depending on your location,\r\nqualifications including job-related education, training, experience,\r\nlicensure, and certification, that could result at a level outside of these\r\nranges. Certain roles are eligible for additional rewards, including annual\r\nbonus, and sales incentives depending on the terms of the applicable plan and\r\nrole as well as individual performance.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Equal Opportunity Employer: RealPage Company is an equal\r\nopportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all\r\nemployees.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '2026-05-21', '00:30:00', '01:14:00', '2026-05-21 18:56:26', '2026-05-21 19:52:14', 55, '2026-05-21 18:02:14', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-413@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
