=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;Job\r\n  Description :&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Connect\r\n  with us <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%252Fcompany%252F74182%252F%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318716222%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DCmI%252FFo%252F6HUV1RSSrS5JAu0GvjSFuUpg6uwJ9Gh45Vd8%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=13IO&amp;mt=wS5McVC3-u7fg6FD_GSthesXVNzKcp-xXvAUsEo1kst3QLD6Af9WRE9BifQk0v6hJwHD1jtPsLrTpCE1CSVflUOB9Zo&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww%2Einstagram%2Ecom%252Fellisdoncorp%252F%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318744038%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DZ4gj8oanaKLmxandPKOce98DaTCeQKzivY6Q2ZD769I%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=QpNy&amp;mt=jLPRYdlANjQia7-wKv57RQet6nLelVBy3P5Oob8EAgG9KAZiIP9_h5vm6aRElbNqtidFOamgz08qdE6w8CDtrbVxyzA&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww%2Efacebook%2Ecom%252Fellisdoncorporation%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318760705%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3D9w%252BBJvkf2xq5gM0v6NS9kstmVYowJkCoV9Mins3ShvI%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=xdLQ&amp;mt=-dbEAb1jAuwM0kvaaM_SCAq4t2rlg7A7h4wrWiuvGl0xzI3TZRW5UC51N31qd2Rq1jxOaGE6UMAtQO3wPoveRRWoO9w&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Ftwitter%2Ecom%252FEllisDon%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318777416%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DVefoMlmxNYPTr7kOAm6KY1QKRIoiS4sHeN%252F%252FclXl2pc%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=B2x0&amp;mt=iJsl8s8X3UMySsQsv6iNR2g4a1CWyNG1z01KdcDEkMiYluFjXn2W6NnsG8Qj7W6FXdeetVEP-AF6Nmbk6dQRYokfIqo&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter </a>Thinking about a change? Join EllisDon!<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We recognize that the construction industry is changing at a rapid pace, and\r\n  we continually strive to be at the forefront. Our core <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww%2Eellisdon%2Ecom%252Four-values%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318792640%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3Dug8%252FaTsB5M4H6BUa9g2pxJRXUvq2IiQ8dHWuwf34M0o%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=lAIO&amp;mt=uiFRlLUIVvtaPDGfxaF3tbDVZ4toB1Br4XzURdAN3OlLcrWiH4cb6CUU1G8ejJS9wcb8lC5cPYpYzCpXLHld_yoSyYQ&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">values</a> empower people to deliver great careers to one\r\n  another and develop creative solutions for complex problems on some of the\r\n  most exciting projects. It doesn’t matter what your expertise and craft is –\r\n  there are no boundaries. We are a group of professionals with a variety of\r\n  expertise within pre-construction, construction, and post-construction. To\r\n  learn more, check out our <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fellisdondevelopments%2Ecom%252Fcradle-to-grave%252F%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318806566%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DEVlF0rEISqqbeCuaWwEQkXgfgDbKiSXEA%252FySJ3tomII%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=ZdeZ&amp;mt=KeEJGeaGyX19JPfV-_vwFLeAfP_ssCWm9q9RsyEfvgFxfyqj-xNNBf0HM18ifuPD-GnYuxGrSi25Rb88T0cstRwkzvQ&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">Cradle to Grave</a> services and hear from our <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww%2Eyoutube%2Ecom%252Fwatch%253Fv%253DHVqbCQUiOaY%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318821330%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3D3QZIsEdQ07hGBMvtUNF4hUTQUZlFMTHkaIPH7xXsyo4%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=7hbK&amp;mt=01dNIRjNPkOIO7EybLqCEBV-xrdd-WsJxhUv2NZMZ3aMvzjPvQSkanXVNCGW8_0X681zpxQqkGrck6p5XOyKXCIb78I&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">team</a> directly about what a career at EllisDon could look\r\n  like for you. As you can see, we are a diverse bunch.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Above all, we are a group of individuals with unique experiences and at\r\n  EllisDon, we choose to celebrate the strength in our differences, every day.\r\n  EllisDon’s commitment to Inclusive Diversity is to work together to create an\r\n  environment where every employee feels safe to be their true and authentic\r\n  self. Ultimately, EllisDon’s purpose is to provide people with similar values\r\n  the opportunity to achieve their full potential; to deliver that opportunity\r\n  for great careers to one another; and to contribute meaningfully to the\r\n  community we share with others.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  In case you’re curious, here’s what the industry thinks of us and some of the\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww%2Eellisdon%2Ecom%252Fcommunity%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318836181%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3Dl7sfXjpsAvxowz4fXh3TZMy8NiG8NAt2zva%252BvHF1Phk%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=gKfN&amp;mt=G2l3UNLFWG7KdZloYSph5CBkNW487aFu8T94ZUMAM9g3GUs6bG0VAn9S6hwUMoBhWtyrkTRp4IoAAiC1T1R750sC774&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">impacts we\'ve made to the communities</a> we work in, and our\r\n  latest <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcan01%2Esafelinks%2Eprotection%2Eoutlook%2Ecom%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fexperience%2Eellisdon%2Ecom%252Fimpactreport2024%252Fen%252F%26data%3D05%257C02%257Cmmacdougall%2540ellisdon%2Ecom%257C635c4342364b455b053b08de21eb7183%257C4f5a827713d444fcb65a8836c5784d0c%257C0%257C0%257C638985492318850949%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DX8SciCDYOgeSRYN2Y6SI3MOFxdxlYg9OYwsDbU4sLg4%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;urlhash=XziL&amp;mt=HobrVkDr8xUAfFBzyYLhN5IFA2WRHdcmq0uKtMhg6mGx4Pzf2Qvd1kIWQ8KMg6Hqn9LzYNQUarftEnnICP88H503CPM&amp;isSdui=true\" target=\"_blank\">Impact report</a>.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>You As a DevOps Engineer Will </b></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Collaborate with\r\n  application developers and team members to architect solutions on cloud\r\n  platform for application hosting.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Design and implement CI/CD\r\n  pipelines and workflows to streamline application delivery and deployment.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Analyze, debug, and triage\r\n  Incident tickets, resolve production issues, including infrastructure\r\n  failures, application performance bottlenecks, system latency, and IaaS\r\n  service disruptions.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Scale and optimize cloud\r\n  infrastructure to support growth while ensuring high reliability, security,\r\n  and compliance standards. <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Is this the right role for\r\n  you? </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  verti