border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#222222\">barclayscorp</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Name of Client</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 239.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#222222\">barclayscorp<i><o:p></o:p></i></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Round of Interview</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 239.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><sup><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Final</span></sup></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\"> Round</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview Date and Time</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 239.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#222222\">Thursday, May 21 • 11:00 AM – 12:30 PM (EDT)</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interviewer Details:</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 239.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt;margin:inherit;max-width:\r\n  calc(100% - 8px)\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#0563C1\"><a href=\"mailto:yourinterviewsupport@barclayscorp.com\">yourinterviewsupport@barclayscorp.com</a></span></u></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Joining Detail</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 239.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">To join the interview,\r\n  please click <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/372681470200871?p=5gkKcEy8mksmedUtHl\" target=\"_blank\">this link</a>.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Meeting ID: 372 681 470\r\n  200 871<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Passcode: 477hv6sn<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"elementtoproof\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Job Description:</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 239.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"color:black\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><i><span style=\"color:\r\n  black\">Join Barclays as a Finance MI Data Analyst at Barclays, where you\'ll\r\n  have the chance to deliver accurate, timely, and insightful management\r\n  information that supports US Consumer Banking Finance decision-making. You’ll\r\n  partner closely with CFO Business Partner teams, Financial Control, Risk,\r\n  Technology, and Regulatory stakeholders to produce and validate critical\r\n  daily, monthly, quarterly, and annual reporting. In this role, you’ll\r\n  leverage strong data analytics and IT skills to analyze, reconcile, and validate\r\n  financial information across multiple systems and platforms. You’ll play a\r\n  key role in maintaining robust MI processes, ensuring data quality, and\r\n  meeting financial and regulatory reporting standards. Additionally, you’ll\r\n  help drive continuous improvement by identifying opportunities for\r\n  automation, process optimization, and enhanced reporting transparency.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  To be successful as a Finance MI Data Analyst at Barclays:<o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Experience\r\n       in Finance MI, data analysis, or reporting within banking or financial\r\n       services, preferably supporting Consumer Lending, Deposits and Credit\r\n       Card portfolios<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Experience\r\n       with programming and analytical tools such as SAS, SQL, Python, Alteryx,\r\n       and Excel, along with reporting platforms including Tableau, Power BI,\r\n       Essbase, JIRA, and VBA/Macros; familiarity with Oracle and AWS platforms\r\n       is advantageous<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Understanding\r\n       Finance MI tools, data architecture, and production reporting processes,\r\n       with the ability to work independently, maintain data quality and\r\n       controls, reconcile output across systems, and collaborate effectively\r\n       with Finance, Risk, and Technology stakeholders <o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"color:black\">Other Highly Valued Skills\r\n  And Experience Include <o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Degree\r\n       in Information Systems, Computer Science, or a related field, with at\r\n       least two years of experience developing code and supporting MIS-driven\r\n       data analysis and reporting<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Proficiency\r\n       with MI and reporting tools such as Tableau, Power BI, and automated\r\n       reporting platforms, along with strong technical skills in Python, SAS,\r\n       SQL, Alteryx, Excel, VBA, and Essbase.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Understanding\r\n       of banking and financial services data architecture, combined with\r\n       excellent communication skills to effectively translate data insights\r\n       and collaborate across technical and business stakeholders <o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"color:black\">You may be assessed on the\r\n  key critical skills relevant for success in this role, such as risk and\r\n  controls, change and transformation, business acumen strategic thinking and\r\n  digital and technology, as well as job-specific technical skills.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  This role is based in Wilmington, DE.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Purpose of the role To provide financial expertise and support to specific\r\n  business units or departments within the organisation, and act as a liaison\r\n  between the finance function and various business units, helping to bridge\r\n  the gap between financial data and business decisions.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Accountabilities <o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Development\r\n       and implementation of business unit financial strategies, plans and\r\n       budgets, using insights to evaluate the financial implications of\r\n       strategic initiatives and recommend appropriate actions.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Development\r\n       of financial models to forecast future performance, assess investment\r\n       opportunities, and evaluate financial risks for business units, and to\r\n       analyse the impact of business decisions on financial performance and\r\n       provision of recommendations. .<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Cross\r\n       functional collaboration to provide financial insights and guidance to\r\n       business unit stakeholders.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Identification\r\n       of opportunities and implementation of financial process improvements\r\n       that streamline financial operations.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Support\r\n       to business units in identification, assessment, and mitigation of\r\n       financial risks, including provision of training and guidance to\r\n       business units on financial risk management and compliance practices.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Analysis\r\n       and presentation of financial data to provide insights into business\r\n       performance, identify trends, and support decision-making. <o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"color:black\">Analyst Expectations <o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>To\r\n       perform prescribed activities in a timely manner and to a high standard\r\n       consistently driving continuous improvement.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Requires\r\n       in-depth technical knowledge and experience in their assigned area of\r\n       expertise<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Thorough\r\n       understanding of the underlying principles and concepts within the area\r\n       of expertise<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>They\r\n       lead and supervise a team, guiding and supporting professional\r\n       development, allocating work requirements and coordinating team\r\n       resources.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>If\r\n       the position has leadership responsibilities, People Leaders are\r\n       expected to demonstrate a clear set of leadership behaviours to create\r\n       an environment for colleagues to thrive and deliver to a consistently\r\n       excellent standard. The four LEAD behaviours are: L – Listen and be\r\n       authentic, E – Energise and inspire, A – Align across the enterprise, D\r\n       – Develop others.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>OR\r\n       for an individual contributor, they develop technical expertise in work\r\n       area, acting as an advisor where appropriate.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Will\r\n       have an impact on the work of related teams within the area.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Partner\r\n       with other functions and business areas.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Takes\r\n       responsibility for end results of a team’s operational processing and\r\n       activities.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Escalate\r\n       breaches of policies / procedure appropriately.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Take\r\n       responsibility for embedding new policies/ procedures adopted due to\r\n       risk mitigation.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Advise\r\n       and influence decision making within own area of expertise.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Take\r\n       ownership for managing risk and strengthening controls in relation to\r\n       the work you own or contribute to. Deliver your work and areas of\r\n       responsibility in line with relevant rules, regulation and codes of\r\n       conduct.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Maintain\r\n       and continually build an understanding of how own sub-function\r\n       integrates with function, alongside knowledge of the organisations\r\n       products, services and processes within the function.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Demonstrate\r\n       understanding of how areas coordinate and contribute to the achievement\r\n       of the objectives of the organisation sub-function.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Make\r\n       evaluative judgements based on the analysis of factual information,\r\n       paying attention to detail.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Resolve\r\n       problems by identifying and selecting solutions through the application\r\n       of acquired technical experience and will be guided by precedents.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Guide\r\n       and persuade team members and communicate complex / sensitive\r\n       information.<o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><i>Act\r\n       as contact point for stakeholders outside of the immediate function,\r\n       while building a network of contacts outside team and external to the\r\n       organisation. <o:p></o:p></i></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"color:black\">All colleagues will be\r\n  expected to demonstrate the Barclays Values of Respect, Integrity, Service,\r\n  Excellence and Stewardship – our moral compass, helping us do what we believe\r\n  is right. They will also be expected to demonstrate the Barclays Mindset – to\r\n  Empower, Challenge and Drive – the operating manual for how we behave.<o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></i></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-21', '23:30:00', '00:00:00', '2026-05-22 15:46:09', '2026-05-22 15:46:25', 0, '2026-05-21 18:37:46', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-415@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
