ckground-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);text-transform:capitalize\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#1D1C1B\">Job Description<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#1D1C1B;font-weight:normal\">We\r\n  are looking for an experienced Oracle Fusion Middleware / Oracle SOA Suite\r\n  Developer with strong hands-on expertise in Oracle SOA Suite 12c and\r\n  enterprise integration solutions. The candidate will be responsible for\r\n  designing, developing, deploying, and supporting integration solutions across\r\n  enterprise applications.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Required Skills<br>\r\n  7+ years of IT experience in middleware and integration technologies<br>\r\n  Strong experience with Oracle SOA Suite 12c<br>\r\n  Hands-on experience with:<br>\r\n  BPEL<br>\r\n  Mediator<br>\r\n  OSB (Oracle Service Bus)<br>\r\n  BPM<br>\r\n  Oracle Enterprise Manager<br>\r\n  Experience with Oracle Fusion Middleware Administration<br>\r\n  Strong knowledge of:<br>\r\n  SOAP/REST Web Services<br>\r\n  XML/XSD/XSLT/XPath<br>\r\n  JMS queues/topics<br>\r\n  WSDL<br>\r\n  Experience integrating Oracle applications and third-party systems<br>\r\n  Experience with deployment, troubleshooting, and performance tuning<br>\r\n  Knowledge of CI/CD and DevOps practices<br>\r\n  Experience working in Agile/Scrum environments<br>\r\n  Preferred Skills<br>\r\n  Oracle Integration Cloud (OIC) experience<br>\r\n  Oracle WebLogic Administration<br>\r\n  Java/J2EE background<br>\r\n  Cloud migration experience<br>\r\n  Experience with Oracle ERP/HCM integrations</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#1D1C1B\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:12;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.65pt;mso-row-margin-right:\r\n  211.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"420\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;\r\n  border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt\"></td>\r\n  <td style=\"mso-cell-special:placeholder;border:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\" width=\"282\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-22', '01:30:00', '02:30:00', '2026-05-22 19:50:33', '2026-05-22 20:50:16', 59, '2026-05-22 14:02:08', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-422@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
