d windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p>22 May 2026, 4:00<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM –\r\n  4:45<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM EST<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Round Of Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">1st Round Technical</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">MS Teams</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">About Misfits Market:<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Misfits Market is a mission-driven, high-growth startup dedicated to reducing\r\n  food waste and making shopping for sustainable, high-quality groceries easier\r\n  and more affordable. We deliver organic produce, high-quality meats and\r\n  seafood, plant-based proteins, dairy, bakery, wine, and other grocery items\r\n  to nearly every zip code in 48 states at up to 30 percent off traditional\r\n  grocery store prices. In 2022, Misfits Market acquired sustainable e-grocer\r\n  Imperfect Foods and now leverages its in-house transportation network to\r\n  deliver directly to consumers with one of the most carbon-efficient grocery\r\n  delivery models on the market. By tackling inefficiencies in the food system,\r\n  our passionate and motivated team of problem solvers helps save an average of\r\n  500,000 pounds of food per week from waste or lesser outcomes, with an\r\n  all-time savings of 190+ million pounds of food.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  As Misfits we support our customers and mission by embracing our core values\r\n  of<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Prioritizing our Customers &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Doing more with less<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Thinking Differently &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Respecting one another &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Moving deliberately and quickly &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Taking initiative and delivering <br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Overview<br>\r\n  We are seeking a Senior Packaging Analyst to own packaging procurement,\r\n  buying, and performance across multiple fulfillment centers. This role will\r\n  be responsible for full category ownership, including supplier management,\r\n  cost optimization, inventory management, and packaging testing to ensure\r\n  quality and efficiency.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Key Responsibilities<br>\r\n  Serve as the category owner for packaging, accountable for cost, service\r\n  levels, quality, and continuous improvement<br>\r\n  Own end-to-end packaging procurement and purchasing, including PO creation,\r\n  adjustments, and supplier communication aligned to SKU-specific lead times\r\n  and forecasts<br>\r\n  Lead supplier management and negotiations, driving cost savings while\r\n  maintaining performance and reliability<br>\r\n  Own packaging master data, reporting, and KPIs (cost per box, usage variance,\r\n  supplier performance, WOH)<br>\r\n  Manage and optimize the packaging allocation system to ensure accurate\r\n  material usage across all box types<br>\r\n  Partner closely with Inventory and Production teams across the network to\r\n  improve inventory accuracy, investigate and resolve variances, and mitigate\r\n  risks. <br>\r\n  Support new product development and packaging innovation, including thermal,\r\n  drop, and production testing<br>\r\n  Drive continuous improvement by enhancing processes, systems, and tools to\r\n  scale packaging operations efficiently<br>\r\n  Qualifications<br>\r\n  Bachelor’s Degree required (Supply Chain, Business, Engineering, or related\r\n  field preferred)<br>\r\n  5-7+ years of experience in supply chain, procurement, or operations<br>\r\n  Experience with packaging, cold chain, or perishable supply chains preferred<br>\r\n  Strong analytical skills <br>\r\n  Proven ability to manage suppliers, negotiate costs, and own a category or\r\n  program end-to-end<br>\r\n  Experience building or improving SOPs, systems, or operational processes<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <h3 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:3.75pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222;font-weight:normal\">Experience Project\r\n  managing</span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#0B1F28;font-weight:normal\">.<o:p></o:p></span></h3>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-22', '01:30:00', '02:15:00', '2026-05-22 19:52:42', '2026-05-22 20:41:22', 48, '2026-05-22 14:04:48', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-423@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
