" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Google&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Name of Client<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><a href=\"mailto:noreply@google.com\">noreply@google.com</a><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Round of Interview <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Assessment<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interview Date and Time<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#222222\">N/A</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Hi\r\n  Bheema Sai Shankar,<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Thanks again for applying for a role at Google. The next step of the hiring\r\n  process will be to complete the <a href=\"https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/dashboard\" target=\"_blank\">Google Hiring Assessment</a>, which should take about 30\r\n  minutes.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  You may find your assessment link in your <a href=\"https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/dashboard\" target=\"_blank\">Candidate Portal</a> or you may also copy and paste this\r\n  link into your browser: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/dashboard\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/dashboard</a><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Please complete the Google Hiring Assessment by 12:07 PM ET/9:07 AM PT on May\r\n  25. We can only consider your application for a role at Google if your\r\n  assessment is completed by the deadline. The results of this assessment will\r\n  determine if you\'re eligible to move forward with the hiring process.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  The Google Hiring Assessment questions, along with your responses, are for\r\n  your eyes only. Do not forward or share them.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Instructions<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ol style=\"margin-top:0in\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Please complete this ~30-minute Google Hiring\r\n       Assessment which will evaluate your work styles that are important to\r\n       success at Google.<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">If you need troubleshooting support with your\r\n       assessment, please send an email to <a href=\"mailto:assessment-help@google.com\" target=\"_blank\">assessment-help@google.com</a> and\r\n       include your:<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <ol style=\"margin-top:0in\" start=\"1\" type=\"a\">\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n        mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">First and Last Name<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n        mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Question or description of\r\n        the issue and any relevant screenshots<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   </ol>\r\n  </ol>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><br>\r\n  Accommodations<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We understand there are many ways to process information. If you require an\r\n  accommodation due to a medical condition, disability, or neurodivergence,\r\n  please send an email to <a href=\"mailto:assessment-help@google.com\" target=\"_blank\">assessment-help@google.com</a> to request a specific\r\n  accommodation or determine what options may be available. Let us know your\r\n  accommodation needs before engaging in or completing the assessment.\r\n  Accommodations include, but are not limited to:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Extra time to complete the assessment<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Guidance on screen reader resources:<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n   <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"circle\">\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n        mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><a href=\"https://support.google.com/accessibility/answer/7031755?hl=en#:~:text=To%20open%20your%20ChromeVox%20options,and%20hear%20text%20spoken%20aloud\" target=\"_blank\">Google Accessibility </a>- built in screen reader<o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n    <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"square\">\r\n     <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo2;\r\n         tab-stops:list 1.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n         mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Browser URL:<br>\r\n         <a href=\"https://support.google.com/accessibility/answer/7031755?hl=en#zippy=%2Cchoose-text-with-your-cursor\" target=\"_blank\">https://support.google.com/accessibility/answer/7031755?hl=en#zippy=%2Cchoose-text-with-your-cursor</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo2;\r\n        tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n        mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/complete-guide-to-narrator-e4397a0d-ef4f-b386-d8ae-c172f109bdb1\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft - Narrator</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n    <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"square\">\r\n     <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo2;\r\n         tab-stops:list 1.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n         mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Browser URL:<br>\r\n         <a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/complete-guide-to-narrator-e4397a0d-ef4f-b386-d8ae-c172f109bdb1\" target=\"_blank\">https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/complete-guide-to-narrator-e4397a0d-ef4f-b386-d8ae-c172f109bdb1</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n   </ul>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><br>\r\n  There is no need to provide us with the nature of or reason for your request\r\n  for accommodations at this time. Any information you do provide us regarding\r\n  your health is provided with your explicit consent to our using such\r\n  information to assess your accommodation request. You can withdraw that\r\n  consent at any time by sending a subsequent email to <a href=\"mailto:assessment-help@google.com\" target=\"_blank\">assessment-help@google.com</a>.\r\n  However, if you withdraw consent before we have made an assessment we may not\r\n  be able to provide you with an accommodation.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Confidentiality: The information you provide in an accommodation request\r\n  will only be reviewed by our global disability partner, Korn Ferry, in order\r\n  to assess and provide you with reasonable accommodations. Google does not\r\n  require a diagnosis, treatment plan, or Government disability certificate.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Thanks!<br>\r\n  Google Recruiting<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\">\r\n  <hr size=\"1\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n  </span></b></div>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">FAQs:<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Can I have an extension to complete the assessment?<br>\r\n  To keep our process consistent, we ask that everyone complete the Google\r\n  Hiring Assessment by the deadline. If you have a scheduling conflict that\r\n  absolutely can\'t be moved, let us know as soon as possible by emailing <a href=\"mailto:assessment-help@google.com\" target=\"_blank\">assessment-help@google.com</a> and\r\n  we\'re happy to talk through options.<i>Note: while we expect the GHA to take\r\n  about 30 minutes to complete, you can spend as much time on it as you’d like\r\n  up until your deadline noted above.</i><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Please note, if you hear from a recruiter before you\'ve completed the Google\r\n  Hiring Assessment, you\'ll still need to finish it by the deadline.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Are there system/browser requirements to complete the Google Hiring\r\n  Assessment?<br>\r\n  A consistent internet connection is essential for an optimal experience. We\r\n  recommend testing your internet connection using our <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=internet%20speed%20test\" target=\"_blank\">Measurement\r\n  Lab tool</a> to ensure it\'s stable.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  [Measurement Lab tool URL: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=internet%20speed%20test\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.com/search?q=internet%20speed%20test</a>]<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Please use the latest version of one of these browsers: Chrome, Firefox,\r\n  Microsoft Edge, Microsoft Internet Explorer, Safari.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Additional questions? Check the <a href=\"https://services.google.com/fh/files/helpcenter/ghafaqs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Google Hiring Assessment FAQs</a>.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Google Hiring Assessment FAQ URL:<br>\r\n  <a href=\"https://services.google.com/fh/files/helpcenter/ghafaqs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://services.google.com/fh/files/helpcenter/ghafaqs.pdf</a><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <i>Google LLC 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA. 94043 You\r\n  received this email because of your recent application to Google.</i><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\r\n   id=\"_x0000_t75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\"\r\n   path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\r\n   <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\r\n   <v:formulas>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n    <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\r\n   </v:formulas>\r\n   <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\r\n   <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\r\n  </v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"Picture_x0020_2\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1026\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\r\n   alt=\"\" style=\'width:.5pt;height:.5pt\'>\r\n   <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/Admin1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif\"\r\n    o:href=\"cid:image001.gif@01DCEA03.D2B019B0\"/>\r\n  </v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img border=\"0\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHcA