(428, 5, 171, 4, 6, 4, 'Assessment Support - BHEEMA SAI SHANKAR REDDY SABILLA - DATA ENGINEER   - wellsfargo', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Please\r\nassign the support person to the one of our candidate </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,serif\">Gangga Kalyaan Patapanchala</span> <span lang=\"EN-IN\">- </span><b>DATA ENGINEER </b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">for his/her upcoming Assessment with\r\n</span><b>wellsfargo</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">. </span><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">please find\r\nthe candidate details and interview details below: <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#EE0000\">Please note: </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#EE0000;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The candidate has\r\nrequested that this Assessment be completed by the end of the day.</span><span style=\"color:#EE0000\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#EE0000\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Candidate Name<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,serif\">BHEEMA SAI\r\n  SHANKAR REDDY SABILLA<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Technology<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>DATA ENGINEER<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Personal Email id <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,serif\"><a href=\"mailto:bheema.work@gmail.com\">bheema.work@gmail.com</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Personal Number (WhatsApp) <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,serif\">6055928848<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"754\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:565.15pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Interview\r\n  Details:<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Name of the vendor <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>wellsfargo<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Name of Client<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><a href=\"mailto:wellsfargoworkday@wellsfargo.com\">wellsfargoworkday@wellsfargo.com</a><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Round of Interview <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Assessment<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interview Date and Time<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#222222\">N/A</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Hello,<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Thank you for your application for the Wells Fargo Engineering Associate –\r\n  Data Engineering &amp; Analytics. We have initiated the technical assessment\r\n  portion of the application process, via HackerRank, and we ask that you check\r\n  your email inbox for the link to complete the assessment. If you did not\r\n  receive it at the email address in your application profile, please be sure\r\n  to check your spam folders. If you still have not received your HackerRank\r\n  assessment invitation by the end of the day, please email <a href=\"mailto:wellsfargotechnologycampusrecruiting@wellsfargo.com\" target=\"_blank\">wellsfargotechnologycampusrecruiting@wellsfargo.com</a> so\r\n  we can ensure you receive the assessment.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  The technical assessment link will expire 7 days from when the email was sent\r\n  from HackerRank. Please refer to your assessment invitation from HackerRank\r\n  for your exact expiration date and time. In an effort to maintain a fair and\r\n  equitable evaluation process for all candidates, <u>we are unable to\r\n  grant any deadline extension requests for this assessment.</u><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Please note that your technical assessment must be completed prior to\r\n  advancing to the next stage of the process. If you are selected for next\r\n  steps, our recruitment team will contact you accordingly.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Your assessment score will be valid for 180 days on the Wells Fargo platform.\r\n  During this time frame, any subsequent job applications requiring this\r\n  assessment will automatically utilize your initial results, and you will not\r\n  receive an additional invitation to complete the assessment.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <u>IMPORTANT:</u> <u>We will not be providing any updates on your\r\n  application status from this inbox. You may continue to check your status in\r\n  your Workday application profile. Applications will be reviewed on a rolling\r\n  basis.</u><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Resources:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\"><a href=\"https://candidatesupport.hackerrank.com/hc/en-us/articles/19147883340051-FAQs-for-Campus-Hiring\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs for Campus Hiring – HackerRank Candidates</a></span></u></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\"><a href=\"https://www.wellsfargojobs.com/en/early-careers/\" target=\"_blank\">Early Careers | Wells Fargo</a></span></u></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We appreciate your interest in Wells Fargo and look forward to learning more\r\n  about your qualifications and experience.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Best Regards,<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Wells Fargo Technology Early Careers Recruiting Team<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <u>REMINDER REGARDING THIS POSITION:</u> Wells Fargo will only consider\r\n  candidates who are presently authorized to work for any employer in the\r\n  United States and who do not require work visa sponsorship from Wells Fargo\r\n  now or in the future in order to retain their authorization to work in the\r\n  United States.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">This\r\n  email is being sent from a mailbox that is not monitored. Please do not reply\r\n  directly to this message.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Note: This email is not an offer of employment.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without\r\n  regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity,\r\n  national origin, disability, status as a protected veteran, or any other\r\n  legally protected characteristic.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Relevant military experience is considered for veterans and transitioning\r\n  service men and women for positions in the United States.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER: Please be aware that your email service provider may\r\n  add hyperlinks to the content of the email. Please note that throughout the\r\n  Wells Fargo selection process you may receive emails that include hyperlinks\r\n  and are sent by Wells Fargo or our trusted vendor partners. All messages from\r\n  our vendor partners will have the following note included: “This message is\r\n  associated with Wells Fargo and is an official Wells Fargo communication.” If\r\n  this message is not included, the message is not sponsored by Wells Fargo,\r\n  and Wells Fargo makes no representation regarding the validity or security of\r\n  the message or the hyperlinks in the message. Also, please note that Wells\r\n  Fargo does not require candidates to pay fees in connection with its\r\n  employment application process.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"442\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:331.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">N/A<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-22', '03:15:00', '04:15:00', '2026-05-26 14:10:24', '2026-05-26 14:10:36', 0, '2026-05-22 21:27:16', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-428@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
