lass=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:15.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:\r\n    .15pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n    color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.15pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n    mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job\r\n  Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"570\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:427.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\"><br>\r\n  JD :</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\"><a href=\"https://onemagnify.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/OneMagnify_Careers/job/Remote/AI-Engineer_R1919?source=LinkedIn\">https://onemagnify.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/OneMagnify_Careers/job/Remote/AI-Engineer_R1919?source=LinkedIn</a><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Role Summary<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">As an AI Engineer at OneMagnify, you’ll\r\n  focus on making machine learning and generative AI systems reliable,\r\n  scalable, and production‑ready for real client use. You’ll sit within our AI\r\n  team and work closely with data scientists, engineers, and delivery partners\r\n  to operationalize models across digital, analytics, and marketing platforms.\r\n  This role is designed for someone with professional experience who enjoys\r\n  hands‑on engineering work and wants to deepen their impact at the\r\n  intersection of AI, infrastructure, and real‑world business outcomes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">The Impact You’ll Have<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">You’ll play a critical role in helping\r\n  clients move AI from proof‑of‑concept to production. Your work will ensure\r\n  machine learning and generative AI models are deployable, observable, and\r\n  continuously improving—so clients can depend on them to inform decisions,\r\n  power applications, and enhance customer experiences.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">At OneMagnify, AI is delivered as part of\r\n  integrated solutions. You’ll collaborate across data science, engineering,\r\n  strategy, and analytics teams to embed MLOps practices into broader CRM\r\n  programs, digital platforms, and marketing ecosystems. Your work ensures AI\r\n  systems don’t just exist—but operate reliably within complex, real‑world\r\n  environments.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">What You’ll Do<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">Build and Maintain Production ML/AI\r\n  Pipelines<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;font-weight:\r\n  normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">Design and maintain production ML and AI\r\n  pipelines, including training, evaluation, deployment, and monitoring.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;font-weight:\r\n  normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">Develop scalable model serving\r\n  architectures for real‑time and batch inference.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;font-weight:\r\n  normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">Ensure AI and LLM systems are production‑ready,\r\n  stable, and performant.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">Apply MLOps Best Practices<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;font-weight:\r\n  normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">Implement experiment tracking, model\r\n  versioning, and reproducible training workflows.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;font-weight:\r\n  normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\">Establish processes for continuous\r\n  evaluation and improvement of machine learning and generative AI systems.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-si