  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:Roboto;color:#1F1F1F\">E-Solutions Inc</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Details<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"426\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:319.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;\r\n    height:38.85pt\">\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in .25in 0in;height:38.85pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">This is to confirm that we\r\n    have scheduled your <b>Technical Interview - Round 1</b> over <b>Video\r\n    Interview</b> for the <b>Data Engineer</b> role on <b>Fri\r\n    22 May 2026 12:30 PM - 01:30 PM (EDT)</b>.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">To get a better understanding\r\n    of the role before the interview, please find the job description\r\n    here: <a href=\"https://k78hpk3d.r.us-east-1.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhire.glider.ai%2Fjobs%2Fpreview%2FdN5ByP7C7q2ke9jXm/1/0100019e4b6b2321-bd3e652a-e37e-4c83-af8e-4ad38f950e98-000000/V2uWVKBv2KqXVp1qAoocPl4cKdI=473\" target=\"_blank\">Job Description</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Interview Readiness\r\n    Checklist</span><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n    <ol style=\"margin-top:0in\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n     <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Attire:</span></b><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n     <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Please\r\n          dress in professional attire. (avoid t-shirts, hoodies, or overly\r\n          casual wear)</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n     </ul>\r\n     <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Video\r\n         Background &amp; Setup:</span></b><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n     <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Ensure\r\n          your background is clean, quiet, and distraction-free (plain wall,\r\n          bookshelf, or subtle virtual background if needed- must be neutral\r\n          and professional).</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Avoid\r\n          public or noisy areas like cafes or shared spaces.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Make\r\n          sure your camera is at eye level and your face is clearly visible and\r\n          well-lit.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">You are\r\n          expected to keep your video on for the entire duration of the\r\n          interview.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n     </ul>\r\n     <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Equipment\r\n         &amp; Connectivity:</span></b><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n     <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Use\r\n          headphones/earphones with a microphone to minimize background noise.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Ensure\r\n          you\'re joining from a quiet location with a strong internet\r\n          connection.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">To get\r\n          the best possible experience on Glider, we recommend you use Chrome\r\n          or Firefox and avoid using an incognito window.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n     </ul>\r\n     <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Timeliness:</span></b><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n     <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n      <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\">Please\r\n          join the interview 15 minutes in advance to allow time to verify your\r\n          audio/video setup and ensure all requirements above are met.</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n     </ul>\r\n    </ol>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">You can preview the interview\r\n    session <a href=\"https://k78hpk3d.r.us-east-1.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhire.glider.ai%2Fdemo%2Fcandidate%2FvideoInterview%2Fnew/1/0100019e4b6b2321-bd3e652a-e37e-4c83-af8e-4ad38f950e98-000000/bgBEbIIeSpK8idngU9c2_YfJ9lU=473\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\n    <span style=\"color:black;mso-color-alt:windo