lease\r\n  find the below feedback to prepare<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The\r\n  candidate has knowledge on hadoop, azure and snowflake however is lacking in\r\n  clarity of communication and ambiguity resolution. Given that they are\r\n  processing around 90 gb data per day, he was not very clear on how some jobs\r\n  take 3 hrs or more and yet finish successfully at times and how did he\r\n  optimize them.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Candidate\r\n  has limited understanding of medallion architecture however he was not quite\r\n  clear on the design approaches for data validation.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">SQL\r\n  query writing experience is average, the query optimization was missing.\r\n  Similarly while explaining the logs analysis on spark UI he was not clear.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:normal\">Job Title: Data Engineer (Azure |\r\n  Databricks | Snowflake)(In-person Interview for final round )<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Location: Overland Park, KS &amp; Frisco, TX<br>\r\n  Duration: Long term<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Mandatory Skills:</span></u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:normal\"> Azure |\r\n  Databricks | Snowflake, Software Engineering, Data Modeling, Databricks,\r\n  Snowflake, Spark, Data Pipelines, Azure data factory<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Role Overview</span></u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">We are seeking a Data Engineer for an Azure-native\r\n  third-party data enrichment platform built on Databricks/Spark and Snowflake.\r\n  The role focuses on building reliable, governed data pipelines with strong\r\n  Spark troubleshooting capabilities, privacy/compliance enforcement, and\r\n  cost-aware engineering practices<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Must-Have Skills</span></u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:normal\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Candidates should have recent, hands-on\r\n  experience with:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Strong coding skills in PySpark and SQL (hands-on development,\r\n  not just orchestration)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Databricks:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Notebooks and Jobs<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Performance tuning fundamentals<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Medallion architecture patterns<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Spark fundamentals:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Partitioning<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Shuffle and skew optimization<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Failure diagnosis using logs<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Snowflake:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quo