ze: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Access control patterns<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">PII handling<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Strong ownership mindset with the ability to execute independently<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">Team / Business Context<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">You will join a data engineering team responsible for\r\n  third-party data enrichment, augmenting first-party datasets with external\r\n  identity and attribute data to support analytics, activation, and research\r\n  initiatives.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">The enriched datasets are consumed by multiple downstream\r\n  systems and teams, including the Customer Data Platform (CDP) and various\r\n  analytics/research stakeholders. The platform is Azure-native and primarily\r\n  built on:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Databricks for data processing and some ML workloads<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Snowflake for analytics and warehousing<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  font-weight:normal\">A key focus of the platform is building reliable,\r\n  governed, vendor-agnostic datasets while ensuring:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:\r\n  normal\">Privacy and compliance<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family: