"top\" style=\"width: 3.55in; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: initial; padding: 0in; height: 23.6pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt;mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:\r\n  9.0pt;mso-element-wrap:around;mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;\r\n  mso-element-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-height-rule:exactly\">Qualcomm<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"324\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:243.0pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt;mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:\r\n  9.0pt;mso-element-wrap:around;mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;\r\n  mso-element-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-height-rule:exactly\">Aug 2024 –\r\n  Present<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"341\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:3.55in;border:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt;mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:\r\n  9.0pt;mso-element-wrap:around;mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;\r\n  mso-element-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-height-rule:exactly\">Infosys<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"324\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:243.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.75pt;mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:\r\n  9.0pt;mso-element-wrap:around;mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;\r\n  mso-element-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-height-rule:exactly\">Jul 2021 – Jul\r\n  2023<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><br clear=\"all\">\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#494949;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0in;padding:0in;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job Details:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><br>\r\nDESIGN VERIFICATION ENGINEER, ANALOG DEVICES INC <br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span><b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Description\r\nof team and role</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">The Digital Mixed Signal\r\n(DMS) Verification Team seeking a motivated, Design Verification <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Engineer to provide support\r\nto our Industrial Power Group located at ADI’s Chandler, AZ <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Design Center. The\r\ncandidate will verify integrated circuits and support assigned products <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">through the full product\r\nlife cycle. Emphasis will be mainly on verification, though design <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">assignments will also be\r\navailable on an as-needed basis. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Responsibilities\r\nmay include, but are not limited to: </span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Verification of state\r\nmachines, and controlling logic required to implement <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">new products in a wide\r\nrange of application spaces <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Development of directed\r\nand constrained random test cases in <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">SystemVerilog <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Implementation of\r\nmetric-driven SystemVerilog and UVM verification <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">environments as determined\r\nby project complexity <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Mixed Signal Simulation <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Modeling of analog blocks\r\n(electrical and real number) <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Minimum\r\nQualifications: </span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Bacherlor’s Degree in\r\nElectrical or Computer Engineering <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Analog Microelectronics\r\nand Digital Systems Design <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o SystemVerilog <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Strong written and verbal\r\ncommunication skills <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">o Strong general coding,\r\nobject-oriented programming, and documentation <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">skills\r\n</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><br>\r\no Experience with a scripting language (Perl, Python, C, etc.) <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Preferred\r\nQualifications:</span></u></b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"><br>\r\n</span></u><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><br>\r\no System Verilog Assertion for Dynamic and Formal Verification. <br>\r\no Fundamental understanding of Universal Verification Methodology <br>\r\no Working experience with custom digital interfaces (I2C, SPI, UART, etc.) <br>\r\no Knowledge of linear regulators and switching regulators&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-26', '02:30:00', '03:00:00', '2026-05-26 20:41:22', '2026-05-26 21:20:42', 39, '2026-05-26 15:11:43', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-438@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
