font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview JD</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"420\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:314.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.65pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  0in;margin-left:83.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  0in;margin-left:130.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">Why choose us?<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Are you ready to take the next step in your career? Join us for an exciting\r\n  opportunity at Albertsons Companies, where innovation and customer service go\r\n  hand-in-hand!<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">At\r\n  Albertsons Companies, we are looking for someone who’s not just seeking a\r\n  job, but someone who wants to make an impact. In this role, you’ll have the\r\n  opportunity to lead, innovate, and contribute to the growth of a company that\r\n  values great service and lasting customer relationships. This position offers\r\n  the chance to work in a fast-paced, dynamic environment that’s constantly\r\n  evolving.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b><span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">Bring your flavo</span></b>r<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Building the future of food and well-being starts with you. Join our team and\r\n  bring your best self to the table.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b><span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">What You Will Be Doing<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span></b>As a Sr. Analyst on the Marketing Science Engagement team, you\r\n  will be part of a fast-growing team and key subject matter expert to the\r\n  national Client Success and Media teams at Albertsons Media Collective.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  The MarSci Engagement team is the analytics center of excellence that\r\n  provides pre-campaign audience targeting recommendations, data driven\r\n  storytelling for holistic campaign performance, best in class client\r\n  consultations, and serves as the business stakeholder to support innovative\r\n  enhancements for the Albertsons Media Collective.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  The position is in office 4 days per week and will be based in Boise, ID,\r\n  Pleasanton, CA, Itasca, IL, or NY, NY<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b><span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">Main Responsibilities<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  0in;margin-left:166.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level4 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 2.0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Own the full end to end analytics process during a campaign\r\n  lifecycle from pre-campaign audience targeting recommendations, to data<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  0in;margin-left:166.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level4 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 2.0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">QA while the campaign is live to provide actionable insights\r\n  and recommendations upon the completion of the campaign.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  0in;margin-left:166.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level4 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 2.0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Act as the analytics and audience subject matter expert and\r\n  main point of contact for the Client Success and Media Teams across a book of\r\n  business.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  0in;margin-left:166.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level4 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 2.0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-fon