ops:list 2.0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#222222\">Complete ad hoc analyses for internal and external\r\n  stakeholders by using SQL to query data environments and using that data to\r\n  build impactful reports.<br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  0in;margin-left:130.5pt;vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\n  none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">We Are Looking For Candidates Who Possess\r\n  The Following<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--></span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  0in;margin-left:166.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level4 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 2.0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: n