o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>David Pence<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Round of Interview <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Screening Round<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interview Date and Time<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">05/26/2026 - 2:00-2:30 PM EST</span><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><b><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=https%3A%2F%2Fus02web.zoom.us%2Fj%2F86391878904%3Fpwd%3DD5OnFL21xQvQMyWoawteomxtwbDiWs.1%26amp%3Bfrom%3Daddon\" target=\"_blank\">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86391878904?pwd=D5OnFL21xQvQMyWoawteomxtwbDiWs.1&amp;from=addon</a><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">NA<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  Sage Mountain Advisors<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Sage\r\n  Mountain Advisors, based in Atlanta Georgia, is an independent, fee-only\r\n  investment advisory firm serving ultra high-net-worth individuals, families\r\n  and institutions. We deliver highly customized investment management and\r\n  strategic advice, grounded in fiduciary responsibility and disciplined\r\n  thinking. Our approach is deliberately boutique and relationship-driven. We\r\n  work closely with clients to understand their full financial picture —\r\n  integrating public and private investments, tax and estate considerations,\r\n  and long-term planning — with the goal of delivering thoughtful, disciplined\r\n  outcomes over time.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">At\r\n  Sage Mountain, we value intellectual curiosity, sound judgment, and\r\n  collaboration. We believe great results come from rigorous thinking, aligned\r\n  approach, and a commitment to doing what is right for clients.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  the Role<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The\r\n  Senior Operations Analyst is responsible for executing a broad range of\r\n  operational processes, owning complex workflows, implementing and maintaining\r\n  software solutions and contributing to the continuous improvement of\r\n  operational infrastructure. This role plays a key part in enhancing team\r\n  efficiency, ensuring data integrity, and maintaining adherence to firm\r\n  policies and procedures.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Responsibilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Optimize a wide range of operational activities, including\r\n  complex transactions, bulk asset movements, and firmwide account maintenance\r\n  requests<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Perform reconciliations across multiple systems,\r\n  proactively identifying, investigating, and resolving discrepancies<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Develop, document, and maintain standard operating\r\n  procedures and workflow documentation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Identify opportunities for process improvement and drive\r\n  initiatives that enhance operational efficiency and scalability<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Partner with custodians and internal teams to resolve\r\n  operational issues in a timely and effective manner<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Support the integration, implementation, and optimization\r\n  of financial technology platforms<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Assist in building process flows, enhancing procedures,\r\n  and developing reporting capabilities to support business needs<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Required\r\n  Qualifications<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">2–5 years of experience in operations and/or process\r\n  improvement, preferably within an RIA environment or other financial services\r\n  organizations<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with high\r\n  attention to detail<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Highly organized with the ability to manage complex\r\n  workstreams, maintain meticulous documentation, and ensure consistent\r\n  follow-through across all responsibilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel, including data\r\n  analysis, pivot tables, and reporting/modeling capabilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Demonstrated project management skills, with the ability\r\n  to plan, prioritize, and execute across multiple concurrent initiatives<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Proven ability to work independently while managing\r\n  competing priorities in a fast-paced environment<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the\r\n  ability to work cross-functionally<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Preferred\r\n  Skills<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bachelor’s degree in preferred fields such as Business\r\n  Administration, Finance, Economics, Information Systems, Engineering,\r\n  Computer Science or related discipline<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Proficiency with Tableau, Python and HTML<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience working with AI tools and technologies,\r\n  including leveraging AI-assisted workflows to improve operational efficiency\r\n  and support data-driven decision-making<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Pay\r\n  range and Benefits<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">$60,000 - $100,000 annual salary plus performance bonus\r\n  and profit sharing<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Comprehensive benefits package, including 401K, health,\r\n  dental, and vision insurance<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Generous PTO (paid time off)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp