rflow:ellipsis;\r\n  overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:normal\">Michelle\r\n  Anderson</span><o:p></o:p></h3>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:32.9pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"182\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:32.9pt;border-color:currentcolor rgb(0,0,0) rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview Link<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"418\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:313.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:32.9pt;border-color:currentcolor rgb(0,0,0) rgb(0,0,0) currentcolor\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/hzc-zbny-cxr\" target=\"_blank\">https://meet.google.com/hzc-zbny-cxr</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:32.9pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"182\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:32.9pt;border-color:currentcolor rgb(0,0,0) rgb(0,0,0)\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"418\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:313.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:32.9pt;border-color:currentcolor rgb(0,0,0) rgb(0,0,0) currentcolor\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:32.9pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"600\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:6.25in;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:32.9pt;border-color:currentcolor rgb(0,0,0) rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:11.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;Job\r\n  Description :&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">Why NeuraFlash, Part of Accenture:<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  At NeuraFlash, Part of Accenture, we are redefining the future of business\r\n  through the power of AI and groundbreaking technologies like Agentforce. As a\r\n  trusted leader in AI, Amazon, and Salesforce innovation, we craft intelligent\r\n  solutions—integrating Salesforce Einstein, Service Cloud Voice, Amazon\r\n  Connect, Agentforce and more—to revolutionize workflows, elevate customer\r\n  experiences, and deliver tangible results. From conversational AI to\r\n  predictive analytics, we empower organizations to stay ahead in an ever-evolving\r\n  digital landscape with cutting-edge, tailored strategies.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We are proud to be creating the future of generative AI and AI agents.\r\n  Salesforce has launched Agentforce, and NeuraFlash, Part of Accenture, was\r\n  selected as the only partner for the private beta prior to launch.\r\n  Post-launch, we\'ve earned the distinction of being Salesforce\'s #1 partner\r\n  for Agentforce, reinforcing our role as pioneers in this transformative space.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Be part of the NeuraFlash, Part of Accenture journey and help shape the next\r\n  wave of AI-powered transformation. Here, you\'ll collaborate with trailblazing\r\n  experts who are passionate about pushing boundaries and leveraging\r\n  technologies like Agentforce to create impactful customer outcomes. Whether\r\n  you\'re developing advanced AI-powered bots, streamlining business operations,\r\n  or building solutions using the latest generative AI technologies, your work\r\n  will drive innovation at scale. If you\'re ready to make your mark in the AI\r\n  space, NeuraFlash, Part of Accenture is the place for you.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  AS A SR. AWS CONSULTANT, YOU WILL HAVE THE OPPORTUNITY TO:<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Support customers in the adoption of Amazon Connect solutions,\r\n  ensuring successful implementation and helping to achieve positive outcomes\r\n  for NeuraFlash clients.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Conduct technology assessment and audits to identify the need\r\n  (from an ROI and Outcomes perspective) to move to CCaaS AWS Connect Platform,\r\n  improving agent experience and productivity<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Educate customers on the value proposition of AWS, and\r\n  participate in deep architectural discussions to ensure solutions are\r\n  designed for successful deployment in the cloud <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Facilitate business process reviews with customers to understand\r\n  their requirements and challenges. Assist in documenting these needs to guide\r\n  solution design.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: nor