; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Advanced knowledge of AWS services and cloud architecture <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Salesforce knowledge and familiarity with Salesforce Service\r\n  Cloud<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Contact center product knowledge of other platforms (Genesys,\r\n  Cisco, Avaya, Twilio, etc.)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Experience with WorkForce Management solutions<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Experience working with outbound dialers and campaign management<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Knowledge of software development methodologies such as Agile and\r\n  Scrum<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">AWS Cloud Practitioner Certification<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">AWS Developer Associate Certification or Professional<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">AWS Solution Architect Certification or Professional<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Salesforce Certified Administrator <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">What\'s\r\n  it like to be a part of NeuraFlash, Part of Accenture?<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Remote &amp; In-Person: Whether you work out of our HQ in\r\n  Massachusetts, one of our regional hubs, or you\'re one of over half of our\r\n  NeuraFlash, Part of Accenture Family who work remotely, we\'re focused on\r\n  keeping everyone connected and unified as one team.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Travel: Get ready to pack your bags and hit the road! For certain\r\n  roles, travel is an exciting part of the job, with an anticipated travel\r\n  commitment of up to 25%. So, if you have a passion for adventure and don\'t\r\n  mind a little jet-setting, this opportunity could be your ticket to exploring\r\n  new places while making a positive impact on clients.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Flexibility: Do you have to take the dog to the vet, pick up the\r\n  kids from school, or the in-laws from the airport? We know that a perfect 9-5\r\n  isn\'t possible. So you have to jump out to do any of those, no problem! We\r\n  build a culture of trust and understanding. We value good work not the hours\r\n  in which you get it done<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Collaboration: You have a voice here! If you work with a team of\r\n  smart people like we do, it\'s a no-brainer to take suggestions and feedback\r\n  on how to keep NeuraFlash, Part of Accenture thriving. Our executive team\r\n  holds town halls &amp; company meetings where they address any suggestions or\r\n  questions asked, no matter how big or small.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Celebrate Often: We take our work seriously, but we don\'t take\r\n  ourselves too seriously. Whether it is an arm wrestling contest, costume\r\n  party, or ugly holiday sweaters our teams love to have fun. And while we work\r\n  hard, we don\'t forget to slow down and celebrate the big things and the small\r\n  things together.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '2026-05-26', '01:30:00', '02:00:00', '2026-05-26 20:13:31', '2026-05-26 20:15:31', 2, '2026-05-26 19:15:07', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-451@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
