mily:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:239.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#222222\"><a href=\"mailto:Anna.Li@ensemblehp.com\">Anna.Li@ensemblehp.com</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:239.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Join: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/210918236191956?p=kL6Mi0hr61TWPpfXFY\" target=\"_blank\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/210918236191956?p=kL6Mi0hr61TWPpfXFY</a><br>\r\n  Meeting ID: 210 918 236 191 956<br>\r\n  Passcode: ge263UJ7<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:239.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Responsibilities:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Productize and optimize models\r\n       from Research into reliable, performant, and cost-efficient services\r\n       with clear SLOs (latency, availability, cost).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Scale training across nodes/GPUs\r\n       (DDP/FSDP/ZeRO, pipeline/tensor parallelism) and own\r\n       throughput/time-to-train using profiling and optimization.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Implement model-efficiency\r\n       techniques (quantization, distillation, pruning, KV-cache, Flash\r\n       Attention) for training and inference without materially degrading\r\n       quality.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Build and maintain model-serving\r\n       systems (vLLM/Triton/TGI/ONNX/TensorRT/AITemplate) with batching,\r\n       streaming, caching, and memory management.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Integrate with vector/feature\r\n       stores and data pipelines (FAISS/Milvus/Pinecone/pgvector;\r\n       Parquet/Delta) as needed for production.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Define and track performance and\r\n       cost KPIs; run continuous improvement loops and capacity planning.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Partner with ML Ops on CI/CD,\r\n       telemetry/observability, model registries; partner with Scientists on\r\n       reproducible handoffs and evaluations.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Educational\r\n  Qualifications:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Bachelors in computer science,\r\n       Electrical/Computer Engineering, or a related field required; Master’s\r\n       preferred (or equivalent industry experience).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Strong systems/ML engineering with\r\n       exposure to distributed training and inference optimization.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Industry\r\n  Experience:&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">3–5 years in ML/AI engineering\r\n       roles owning training and/or serving in production at scale.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Demonstrated success delivering\r\n       high-throughput, low-latency ML services with reliability and cost\r\n       improvements.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Experience collaborating across\r\n       Research, Platform/Infra, Data, and Product functions.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Technical\r\n  Skills:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Familiarity with deep learning\r\n       frameworks: PyTorch (primary), TensorFlow.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Exposure to large model training\r\n       techniques (DDP, FSDP, ZeRO, pipeline/tensor parallelism); distributed\r\n       training experience a plus&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Optimization: experience profiling\r\n       and optimizing code execution and model inference: (PTQ/QAT/AWQ/GPTQ),\r\n       pruning, distillation, KV-cache optimization, Flash Attention&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Scalable serving: autoscaling,\r\n       load balancing, streaming, batching, caching; collaboration with\r\n       platform engineers.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Data &amp; storage: SQL/NoSQL,\r\n       vector stores (FAISS/Milvus/Pinecone/pgvector), Parquet/Delta, object\r\n       stores.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Write performant, maintainable\r\n       code&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Understanding of the full ML\r\n       lifecycle: data collection, model training, deployment, inference,\r\n       optimization, and evaluation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-27', '00:30:00', '01:30:00', '2026-05-27 19:53:55', '2026-05-27 20:09:58', 16, '2026-05-27 14:51:28', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-457@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
