:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4D5062;letter-spacing:\r\n        -.05pt\">Additionally, while not required to solve the problem, there\r\n        are a few other relevant technologies in the provided repository, and\r\n        knowledge of these may help:</span><span style=\"font-size:1.0pt;\r\n        font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7C7474\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4D5062;letter-spacing:\r\n        -.05pt\">• NestJS<br>\r\n        • Prisma and SQL</span><span style=\"font-size:1.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n        color:#7C7474\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:12;height:14.0pt\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:14.0pt\"></td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4D5062;letter-spacing:\r\n        -.05pt\">Please have a read of the <a href=\"https://lkzkbn18.r.eu-west-1.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.codescreen.com%2Fcandidates%2F%23%2Fintro/1/0102019e65ac3e80-8b44fed4-c932-446b-a2b7-e54541f1ab2e-000000/ek7xcO-eKOkcwJPipKc70iDemgw=473\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\">user guide</span></a> for\r\n        CodeScreen, our assessment platform, before starting the assessment.</span><span style=\"font-size:1.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7C7474\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:14;height:15.0pt\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:15.0pt\"></td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n        10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4D5062;letter-spacing:\r\n        -.05pt\">Good luck — We’re looking forward to seeing what you submit!</span><span style=\"font-size:1.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7C7474\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:16;height:12.5pt\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:12.5pt\"></td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.5pt\"><span class=\"il\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4D5062\">Clipboard</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4D5062\"> Health\r\n        Technical Recruiting Team</span><span style=\"font-size:1.0pt;\r\n        font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7C7474\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:18;height:12.5pt\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:12.5pt\"></td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.5pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4D5062\">†One\r\n        day, we’d like to support more languages and tech stacks, but for now\r\n        we’re limited from a practical perspective with the number of good\r\n        prompts we can create and grade for candidates. If you’re used to using\r\n        another language, you can still likely do well if you spend a bit of\r\n        time honing your typescript skills. This assessment doesn\'t require any\r\n        TypeScript-specific skills, knowledge, or concepts, although it may be\r\n        helpful to make sure you understand the async keyword before starting.\r\n        Since this is an async assessment, you\'re welcome to use any resources,\r\n        including online searches or AI assistance, in completing the\r\n        assessment.</span></i><span style=\"font-size:1.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n        color:#7C7474\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:20;height:12.5pt\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:12.5pt\"></td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n       <tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.5pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4D5062\">Be\r\n        aware that solving this assessment with AI still requires clever\r\n        prompting and understanding of the business domain, and that if you\r\n        pass the assessment, we will be pushing on your understanding of any\r\n        AI-generated code in a live interview.</span></i><span style=\"font-size:1.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#7C7474\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n      <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n      <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"display:none;mso-hide:all\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"1152\" style=\"width:12.0in;mso-cellspacing:1.5pt;background:#F8F8F9;border:none;\r\n   border-top:solid #F3EEEE 1.0pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"border:none;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Job Description: <o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"693\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:519.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">About Clipboard<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Our mission is to uplift as many communities as possible.\r\n  We do this through our app-based marketplace that connects healthcare\r\n  professionals with the workplaces that need amazing workers. This enables\r\n  hundreds of thousands of people to achieve financial stability for themselves\r\n  and their families while providing essential care to millions of people\r\n  across the U.S.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\n  Founded in 2016, we are a remote-first team of over 1,000 people building a\r\n  top <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/topcompanies/\" target=\"_blank\">Y-Combinator\r\n  company</a> and have been profitable since 2022. We’re the leader in\r\n  Long-Term Care staffing and are rapidly expanding into Home Health,\r\n  Hospitals, and more, meaning we have more work to do than people to do it,\r\n  and are growing our team to support millions more people and their\r\n  communities.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">The team<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Applied Science builds the quantitative systems that power\r\n  Clipboard’s marketplace. The team owns pricing algorithms, auction\r\n  mechanisms, ML infrastructure, and the core metrics — take rate, margins, and\r\n  the drivers behind them — that the rest of the org depends on. They also\r\n  partner with product teams to build out quantitative approaches to new\r\n  problems as they come up. You can find more information on the team and areas\r\n  of work from this <a href=\"https://www.notion.so/Engineering-35e8643321f4810a9f9fec9d8ec77c4d\" target=\"_blank\">page</a>.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">What you\'d be working on<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Pricing algorithms and\r\n       auction mechanisms<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Shared marketplace\r\n       metrics, automated variance detection, and notification systems<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Causal modeling,\r\n       experimentation frameworks, and analytical investigations<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">What we\'re looking for<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Engineers who do well on Applied Science are interested in\r\n  marketplace economics and data science as much as they are in software\r\n  engineering. They\'re equal parts builder and analyst — they dig into the data\r\n  to understand what\'s actually driving a metric, reason through the cause and\r\n  effect, and then go build and ship the solution. They partner with platform\r\n  and data teams to build out our ML pipelines and rules engines, and they\'re\r\n  comfortable working through tough architectural problems when the work demands\r\n  it.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">The team owns its systems end-to-end, so you should be\r\n  comfortable working across the stack.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>We use a straightforward TypeScript stack: React on the\r\n  frontend with Ionic on mobile; our backend is Node/NestJS powered by MongoDB\r\n  and Postgres.</i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">The interview process<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">When looking at candidates, their actual competencies\r\n  matter more to us than what’s on your resumes. Because of that we make sure\r\n  our assessments and interviews mirror real work that’s being done at\r\n  Clipboard.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Here\'s what the process looks like:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ol style=\"margin-top:0in\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Take-home PR\r\n       assessment (~60–90 min) + live follow-up<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Second take-home\r\n       (technical design or second PR) + live follow-up<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Hiring manager\r\n       interview<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Final culture screen\r\n       with our Head of People<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ol>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">The process is written and async by design in order to for\r\n  you to get a feel for how we work in our remote culture.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Let me know if you required any further information on it.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '2026-05-27', '21:30:00', '22:15:00', '2026-05-27 16:13:15', '2026-05-27 16:48:56', 35, '2026-05-27 14:57:26', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-458@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `client_id`, `candidate_id`, `poc_id`, `task_type_id`, `status_id`, `title`, `description`, `due_date`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `task_start_time`, `task_end_time`, `duration`, `created_at`, `total_amount`, `payment_status_id`, `payment_mode`, `paid_at`, `reference_no`, `payment_notes`, `email_thread_id`, `invoice_id`, `billing_status`) VALUES
(459, 17, 70, 12, 1, 4, 'FW: Interview Support', '<p><span style=\"color:black\">Hello Sir</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Hope this email finds\r\nyou well.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nI\'ve forwarded the details for the upcoming interview of Shuvam\r\nChatterjee Kindly proceed to book<br>\r\nthe technical support person accordingly to ensure a smooth and\r\nefficient interview process.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n&nbsp;<br>\r\nCandidate Details:&nbsp;<br>\r\nCandidate Name: Shuvam Chatterjee<br>\r\nCandidate Contact Number: </span>7163038873<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:FluentSystemIcons;color:black;\r\nbackground:#D6D6D6\"></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"1023\" style=\"width: 767.6pt; border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_m_-3999772303157939951m_3033710429921497777m_200799353812255342table_0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"334\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 250.4pt; border-width: 1pt; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt; border-color: initial;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"color:black\">Candidate Name</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1101\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 825.85pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.65pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:black\">Shuvam Chatterjee</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:33.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"334\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 250.4pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext wind