\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Zoom Meeting<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Link<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><a href=\"https://connect4.zoom.us/j/96601973425?pwd=AEQw8BG4J9ae8XXTmRIVc47YznDarX.1\" target=\"_blank\">https://connect4.zoom.us/j/96601973425?pwd=AEQw8BG4J9ae8XXTmRIVc47YznDarX.1</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">JD<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#444444\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h1 style=\"margin:0in;font-size:2rem;line-height:2.5rem\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#16304E;font-weight:normal\">Data Engineer (Python/Spark)<o:p></o:p></span></h1>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\">Toronto, Ontario,\r\n  Canada<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">Who We Are</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">Headquartered in New York City, Take-Two Interactive Software,\r\n  Inc. is a leading developer, publisher, and marketer of interactive\r\n  entertainment for consumers around the globe. We develop and publish products\r\n  principally through Rockstar Games, 2K, and Zynga. Our strategy is to create\r\n  hit entertainment experiences, delivered on every platform relevant to our\r\n  audience through a variety of sound business models. Our pillars -\r\n  creativity, innovation, and efficiency - guide us as we strive to create the\r\n  highest quality, most captivating experiences for our consumers. The\r\n  Company’s common stock is publicly traded on NASDAQ under the symbol TTWO.\r\n  For more corporate and product information please visit our website at <a href=\"http://www.take2games.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3D74CC\">http://www.take2games.com</span></a>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">While our offices (physical and virtual) are casual and\r\n  inviting, we are deeply committed to our core tenets of creativity,\r\n  innovation and efficiency, and individual and team development opportunities.\r\n  Our industry and business are continually evolving and fast-paced, providing\r\n  numerous opportunities to learn and hone your skills. We work hard, but we\r\n  also like to have fun, and believe that we provide a great place to come to\r\n  work each day to pursue your passions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">The Challenge</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">We are looking for a dynamic Data Engineer to join a team\r\n  involved in designing, building, and maintaining reliable and scalable data\r\n  solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">The ideal candidate is a strong Python developer who has some\r\n  experience in front-end technologies like JavaScript, CSS3 and/or HTML5. They\r\n  are a self-starter, comfortable with ambiguity, able to think big (while\r\n  paying careful attention to detail) and enjoy working in a fast-paced\r\n  environment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">What You’ll Take On</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:\r\n  &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Develop and maintain scalable data pipelines and\r\n       build out new API integrations to support continuing increases in data\r\n       volume and complexity.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Work with business teams and analysts to understand\r\n       complex business rules and implement these for deriving insights.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Implement processes and systems to monitor data\r\n       quality, ensuring production data is always accurate and available for\r\n       key stakeholders and business processes that depend on it.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Perform data analysis required to troubleshoot data\r\n       related issues and assist in the resolution of data issues.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Provide thought leadership and collaborate with other\r\n       team members to continue to scale our architecture to evolve for the\r\n       needs of tomorrow.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Develop and support continuous integrations build and\r\n       deployment processes using Jenkins, Docker, Git, etc.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Define and implement monitoring and alerting policies\r\n       for data solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">What You Bring</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">3+ years of hands-on experience in Python.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">3+ years of hands-on experience in using advanced SQL\r\n       queries and writing/optimizing highly efficient SQL queries.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">2+ years of working in AWS environment.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience with Git.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience with Docker.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Comfortable working with business customers to\r\n       collect requirements and gain a deep understanding of varied business\r\n       domains.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Knowledge of software coding practices across the\r\n       development lifecycle, including agile methodologies, coding standards,\r\n       code reviews, source management, build processes, testing, and\r\n       operations.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bachelor’s degree or equivalent in an engineering or\r\n       technical field such as Computer Science, Information Systems,\r\n       Statistics, Engineering, or similar.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">Great to Have</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience integrating with 3rd party APIs is highly\r\n       desirable.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"line-height:2.5rem\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">What We Offer You</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:\r\n  &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Great Company Culture.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> Ranked as one of the most creative and\r\n       innovative places to work, creativity, innovation, efficiency, diversity\r\n       and philanthropy are among the core tenets of our organization and are\r\n       integral drivers of our continued success.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Growth.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> As a global entertainment company, we pride\r\n       ourselves on creating environments where employees are encouraged to be\r\n       themselves, inquisitive, collaborative and to grow within and around the\r\n       company.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Work Hard, Play Hard.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> Our employees bond, blow-off steam, and flex\r\n       some creative muscles – through corporate boot camp classes, company\r\n       parties, game release events, monthly socials, and team challenges.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Benefits.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> Medical, dental, vision, pension plan, employee\r\n       stock purchase plan, commuter benefits, in-house wellness program, broad\r\n       learning &amp; development opportunities, a charitable giving platform\r\n       with company match and more!<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#4A4A4A;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Perks.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> Fitness allowance, employee discount programs,\r\n       free games &amp; events, stocked pantries and the ability to earn up to\r\n       $500+ per year for taking care of yourself and more.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p><em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;color:#4A4A4A\">The pay range for this position in\r\n  Ontario at the start of employment is expected to be between $85,000 and\r\n  $115,000 per year. However, base pay offered is based on market location, and\r\n  may vary further depending on individualized factors for job candidates, such\r\n  as job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and other objective business\r\n  considerations.</span></em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p><em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;color:#4A4A4A\">Subject to those same\r\n  considerations, the total compensation package for this position may also\r\n  include other elements, including a bonus and/or equity awards and\r\n  eligibility to participate in our 401(K) plan and Employee Stock Purchase\r\n  Program.</span></em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p><em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;color:#4A4A4A\">Regular, full-time employees are\r\n  also eligible for a range of benefits at the Company, including: medical,\r\n  dental, vision, and basic life insurance coverage; 14 paid holidays per\r\n  calendar year; paid vacation time per calendar year (ranging from 15 to 25 days)\r\n  or eligibility to participate in the Company’s discretionary time off\r\n  program; up to 10 paid sick days per calendar year; paid parental and\r\n  compassionate leave; wellbeing programs for mental health and other wellness\r\n  support; family planning support through Maven; commuter benefits; and\r\n  reimbursements for fitness-related expenses. The use of Artificial\r\n  Intelligence is not being used to screen candidates. The position is for an\r\n  existing vacancy.</span></em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p><em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;color:#4A4A4A\">As an equal opportunity employer,\r\n  Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. (“Take-Two”) is committed to fostering\r\n  and celebrating the diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds of its\r\n  talent, partners, and communities throughout its organization. Consistent with\r\n  this commitment, Take-Two does not discriminate or retaliate against any\r\n  employee or job applicant because of their race, color, religion, sex\r\n  (including pregnancy, sexual orientation, and gender identity), national\r\n  origin, age, disability, and genetic information (including family medical\r\n  history), or on the basis of any other trait protected by applicable law. If\r\n  you need to report a concern or have questions regarding Take-Two’s equal\r\n  opportunity commitment, please contact <a href=\"mailto:Careers@take2games.com.*\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3D74CC\">Careers@take2games.com</span></a></span></em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p><em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;color:#4A4A4A\">Please be aware that Take-Two does\r\n  not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps\r\n  such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others. Take-Two also does not engage in any\r\n  financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and the\r\n  Company will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial\r\n  information over an app or other unofficial chat channel. Any attempt to do\r\n  so may be the result of a scam or phishing exercise. Take-Two’s in-house\r\n  recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company\r\n  email addresses (i.e., via a <a href=\"http://take2games.com\" target=\"_blank\">take2games.com</a>\r\n  email domain). If you need to report an issue or otherwise have questions,\r\n  please contact <a href=\"mailto:Careers@take2games.com.*\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3D74CC\">Careers@take2games.com</span></a></span></em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p><em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;color:#4A4A4A\">We will ensure that individuals\r\n  with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the\r\n  job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and\r\n  to receive other benefits and privileges of employment. Please contact us to\r\n  request accommodation.</span></em><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#4A4A4A\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:12;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Interview </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 1.5pt 0in\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:\r\n     1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n