(475, 8, 192, 9, 4, 4, 'FW: Request to Coordinate RUC Session - Hrushikesh Tadepally', '<p>Hello Team,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I hope you are doing well.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I am reaching out regarding my candidate, <b>Hrushikesh Tadepally</b>,\r\nwho is being considered for the <b>Full stack developer</b> role. He would\r\nlike to schedule a <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">RUC</span></strong> with your team.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos;color:black;background:yellow\">Candidate Availability:</span></strong><br>\r\n<b><span style=\"color:black;background:yellow\">Wednesday and Thursday:\r\nAnytime<br>\r\nFriday before 5PM EST</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span style=\"color:black;background:yellow\">Candidate Details:<br>\r\nPhone:&nbsp;&nbsp;+1 (216) 264-6647<br>\r\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:hrushikesh.t@mycvhire.com\" target=\"_blank\">hrushikesh.t@mycvhire.com</a></span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please feel free to reach out if you need any additional information or\r\nassistance from me.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you for your support.<o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-27', '23:00:00', '23:30:00', '2026-05-27 17:43:56', '2026-05-27 17:44:09', 0, '2026-05-27 16:39:53', 2000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-475@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(476, 8, 193, 9, 4, 4, 'Fw: RUC - Abhishek Bajirao Kumbhar - Software Engineer', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Team,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I\'d like to schedule a resume understanding session for\r\nAbhishek Kumbhar, who is a candidate for the Software Engineer position. I\r\nhave attached his resume for your convenience. His contact number is&nbsp; +1\r\n(312) 358 2968, and his email address is&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:abhishek.kumbhar2205@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">abhishek.kumbhar2205@gmail.com</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:blue;\r\nletter-spacing:-.1pt\">.</span></u></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you<o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-27', '23:00:00', '23:30:00', '2026-05-27 17:54:56', '2026-05-27 17:55:35', 0, '2026-05-27 16:41:52', 2000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-476@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
