=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:329.75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Joining Details</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:329.75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Hi Sahithya,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">You\'ve just been invited by someone\r\n  from Ramp to take Ramp Frontend Challenge Assessment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">To begin, please click the link below.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">You can get started at your convenience before at\r\n  12:13pm PDT on Friday, May 29th using the link below.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://app.codesignal.com/pre-screens\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://app.codesignal.com/pre-screens\">GET STARTED</a></span><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">To make the most of your prep time, download\r\n  our <a href=\"https://codesignal.com/learn/get-cosmo?utm_source=learn&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=assessment_invite\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://codesignal.com/learn/get-cosmo?utm_source=learn&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=assessment_invite\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Cosmo mobile app</span></a> for quick practice\r\n  on the go.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">We also recommend getting familiar with the\r\n  CodeSignal platform beforehand. After you create a CodeSignal account, you\r\n  will have access to a <a href=\"https://app.codesignal.com/practice-questions/n5qRg3yeiqW57gG7j?sourceId=c8eNQW7gxR2kkBT2M&amp;source=emailInvite\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://app.codesignal.com/practice-questions/n5qRg3yeiqW57gG7j?sourceId=c8eNQW7gxR2kkBT2M&amp;source=emailInvite\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">practice experience</span></a> where you can:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Sample different types of\r\n       questions you might encounter.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Change the environment\r\n       settings to accommodate your preferences.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">CodeSignal is best experienced using the latest\r\n  version of Chrome, Firefox, or Edge on a laptop or desktop device.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Good luck!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">- Ramp<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Sent from Ramp through CodeSignal.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Questions? Check out our <a href=\"https://support.codesignal.com/hc/en-us/categories/360003537053\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://support.codesignal.com/hc/en-us/categories/360003537053\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Help Center</span></a>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Job Description: </b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">About the Role<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Our ideal candidate has a deep\r\n  understanding of JavaScript, a passion for web performance, and can\r\n  creatively come up with solutions to solve customer\'s needs. Our tech stack\r\n  currently involves TypeScript, React, Vite, and Ryu, our in-house design\r\n  system.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Check out our<a href=\"https://engineering.ramp.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Engineering Blog</a> for\r\n  more on our tech stack, mission and values!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">What You’ll Do<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Build!&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Design performant, beautiful,\r\n       and usable interfaces&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Collaborate on our technical\r\n       vision. Lead discussions and implementation of multiple complex projects<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Foster a culture of upholding\r\n       industry-leading UX<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Continuously improve our\r\n       engineering processes, tools, and systems that allow us to scale the\r\n       code base, productivity, and the team<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Recruit, interview and develop\r\n       your own interview questions, while fostering the culture of excellence,\r\n       velocity and humility<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Inspire and mentor\r\n       less experienced engineers and interns<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">What You\'ll Need<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Minimum of 2 years of frontend\r\n       engineering experience preferred<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Proficiency\r\n       in JavaScript and React<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Knack for getting the visuals\r\n       right<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Track record of shipping\r\n       high-quality products and developing projects at scale<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Ability to turn business and\r\n       product ideas into engineering solutions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Desire to work in a fast-paced\r\n       environment, continuously grow, and master your craft<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Alignment with Ramp’s core\r\n       values of enabling businesses to grow more by spending less<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Benefits available to all full-time Ramp\r\n  employees (Global)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Flexible PTO<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Unlimited AI token usage<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Centralized home-office equipment\r\n  ordering<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Health and wellness stipend<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Budget for intra-office travel<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Weekly coffee stipend<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">United States<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• 100% medical, dental &amp; vision\r\n  insurance coverage for you, with partial coverage for dependents<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• One Medical annual membership<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• 401(k), including employer match on\r\n  contributions made while employed by Ramp<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Fertility HRA (up to $10,000 per year)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Parental leave: up to 16 weeks (80\r\n  days) at 100% pay<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Pet insurance<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• In-office perks: lunch, snacks, drinks,\r\n  and more<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Relocation support to NYC or SF (as\r\n  needed)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Canada<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Group medical, dental, and vision\r\n  coverage through Sun Life<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Life, AD&amp;D, and disability coverage<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Fertility drug coverage (up to $4,000\r\n  lifetime)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Group Retirement Plan with employer\r\n  match (RRSP + DPSP)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Parental leave: up to 16 weeks (80\r\n  days) at 100% pay, with additional time available at reduced pay<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Employee Assistance Program and virtual\r\n  care through Lumino Health<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">United Kingdom<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Private medical insurance through\r\n  Freedom Elite<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Virtual GP and at-home care via eMed x\r\n  Livi<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Workplace pension through Penfold, with\r\n  salary sacrifice option<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">• Parental leave: up to 16 weeks (80\r\n  days) at 100% pay, with additional time available at reduced pay<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Referral Instructions</span></b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">If you are being referred for the role,\r\n  please contact that person to apply on your behalf.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Other notices</span></b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance\r\n  Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest\r\n  and conviction records.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Beware of recruiting scams: Ramp will\r\n  only contact you through official @</span></i><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\r\n  font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\"><a href=\"http://ramp.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Ramp.com</i></a><i> email\r\n  addresses and will never ask for payment or sensitive personal information\r\n  during the hiring process.</i><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-28', '14:00:00', '15:00:00', '2026-05-28 22:26:58', '2026-05-28 22:27:13', 0, '2026-05-27 16:59:03', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-478@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
