(485, 5, 55, 4, 1, 4, 'FW: Screening Support - Jyothi Swaroop Illipilli -AI Engineer - 05/28/2026 - 1:30 AM – 2:00 PM EST - Polestar Analytics.', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Please assign the support person to one of our\r\ncandidates, Jyothi Swaroop Illipilli– </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">AI Engineer, </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\">for his Screening with Polestar</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Analytics – 05/28/2026.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span><b><span style=\"color:black;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">I\r\nwant to let you know that Jyothi already had a screening call with the\r\nrecruiter, and the recruiter warned him not to cheat during the screening.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.75pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Candidate Name<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"798\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:598.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Jyothi Swaroop Illipilli<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5