uot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">AM\r\n  – 2:00</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> PM</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\"> EST&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"798\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:598.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"798\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:598.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:#467886\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MWFmNTVmYmItYjIyYS00NGQxLTkxNDYtZWU1MTlhZjNhNDE5%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%225c979e27-0063-4697-891c-ba85b3eddf83%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%220df8e726-d0d5-426d-bc73-2629efb52931%22%7d\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join link\"><b><span style=\"color:#467886\">Join\r\n  the meeting now</span></b></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Meeting ID: 467 126 631 314 8<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Passcode: 7WM3jR7T<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"798\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:598.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; --c68b067b: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9); --_8e6f174e: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9); --_2bb14ae5: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9);\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Polestar Analytics is hiring\r\n  two AI Engineers to join our on-site delivery team in the tri-state area. You\r\n  will be building and deploying production-grade AI agents and agentic systems\r\n  on Microsoft Azure infrastructure, using Azure AI Foundry as the primary\r\n  platform. This is a hands-on engineering role focused on designing,\r\n  developing, and operationalizing AI agents that solve real business problems\r\n  at enterprise scale.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Key\r\n  Responsibilities</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top: 0in; padding-inline-start: 16px;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Design, build, and deploy AI agents and multi-agent systems\r\n       using Azure AI Foundry and the Azure AI Agent Service.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Implement agentic architectures including tool use,\r\n       function calling, retrieval-augmented generation, memory, planning, and\r\n       orchestration patterns on Microsoft Azure infrastructure.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Integrate agents with enterprise data sources, APIs, and\r\n       downstream systems using Azure-native services such as Azure Functions,\r\n       Logic Apps, API Management, AI Search, and Cosmos DB.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Develop, evaluate, and iterate on prompts, model\r\n       configurations, and agent workflows using Foundry\'s prompt flow,\r\n       evaluation, and observability tooling.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Apply responsible AI practices including content safety,\r\n       grounding, evaluation metrics, and guardrails.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Collaborate closely with the Solution Architect, data\r\n       engineers, and client stakeholders to translate requirements into\r\n       working agent-based solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Operationalize agents with proper CI/CD, monitoring,\r\n       logging, versioning, and cost management.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Continuously evaluate new capabilities in Azure AI Foundry\r\n       and recommend their adoption where appropriate.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Required\r\n  Qualifications</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top: 0in; padding-inline-start: 16px;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">5 years of overall experience in software engineering, data\r\n       science, machine learning, or AI engineering roles.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">1 to 2 years of hands-on experience with AI agents, meaning\r\n       building and deploying agentic systems rather than just calling LLM\r\n       APIs.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Strong working knowledge of Azure AI Foundry, including the\r\n       model catalog, agent service, prompt flow, and evaluation tooling.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Demonstrated experience deploying AI workloads on Microsoft\r\n       Azure infrastructure including Azure OpenAI, Azure AI Search, Azure\r\n       Functions, Azure Container Apps or AKS, and related services.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Solid programming skills in Python, and ideally C# or\r\n       TypeScript, for building agent backends and integrations.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Experience with frameworks and patterns relevant to agentic\r\n       systems such as function calling, tool orchestration, RAG, vector\r\n       databases, prompt engineering, and evaluation.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Strong grasp of LLM fundamentals including tokenization,\r\n       context management, embeddings, and the trade-offs between fine-tuning\r\n       and RAG.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Familiarity with MLOps and LLMOps practices including CI/CD\r\n       for AI, monitoring, evaluation pipelines, and prompt versioning.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to work\r\n       directly with client stakeholders on-site.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Must be based in or willing to work on-site in the NY/NJ\r\n       tri-state area.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Preferred\r\n  Qualifications</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;\r\n  border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top: 0in; padding-inline-start: 16px;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Microsoft certifications such as Azure AI Engineer\r\n       Associate (AI-102) or Azure Data Scientist Associate.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Experience with Semantic Kernel, AutoGen, LangChain or\r\n       LangGraph, or similar agent orchestration frameworks, especially in\r\n       conjunction with Azure.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Experience integrating agents with Microsoft 365, Copilot\r\n       Studio, or Teams.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n       padding:0in\">Exposure to enterprise concerns including identity through\r\n       Entra ID, networking, content safety, data governance, and compliance.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n       10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-bord