aintain Python software modules for\r\n     product testing and qualification throughout product development and\r\n     manufacturing.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Collaborate\r\n     with electrical, mechanical, and signal integrity engineers to create\r\n     software solutions for testing high-speed and low-speed electrical\r\n     performance.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Build\r\n     and enhance desktop software (Python) to optimize and expand\r\n     capabilities in global manufacturing centers.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Partner\r\n     with engineering teams to develop tools that improve the design process\r\n     and engineering efficiency, focusing on feature implementation,\r\n     configuration, and application development.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Continuously\r\n     learn and adopt new technologies to keep software skills\r\n     current.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Conduct\r\n     code reviews, design reviews, and unit testing to improve software\r\n     reliability and performance.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Analyze\r\n     test results, prepare reports, and implement necessary software\r\n     modifications.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Document\r\n     software solutions and share knowledge internally with other engineers.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Demonstrate proficiency in\r\n     Python development and standard software verification and validation\r\n     techniques.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Explore\r\n     and contribute to new concepts and innovative solutions.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Who You Are (Basic\r\nQualifications)</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s\r\n     or master’s degree in Electrical or Electronics/ Computer\r\n     Science/Systems Engineering.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">3–5\r\n     years of experience designing Python\r\n     based desktop applications.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Minimum\r\n     2 years of practical software development experience in Python\r\n     with demonstrated ability to design and build <b>tools and\r\n     applications that support testing and validation workflows</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Knowledge\r\n     of software architecture and design principles, emphasizing usability,\r\n     extensibility, and performance for tools.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Extensive\r\n     experience with source control tools such as Git or SVN.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Understanding\r\n     of bug tracking software (i.e. <b>JIRA).</b></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n     list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ability\r\n     to develop/maintain software in <b>Python.</b></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"