tyle=\"border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 12.05pt;\">\r\n  <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Sales POC Name</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 12.05pt;\">\r\n  <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Annu Mishra</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\"\r\n coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\"\r\n filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\r\n <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\r\n <v:formulas>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\r\n </v:formulas>\r\n <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\r\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"x_Picture_x0020_2\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\r\n alt=\"Client\" style=\'width:75pt;height:15pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/Admin1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\r\n  o:href=\"cid:image001.png@01DCEE73.ABE34400\"/>\r\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img border=\"0\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"height:.208in;width:1.041in\" alt=\"Client\" v:shapes=\"x_Picture_x0020_2\"><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Hi Mohammed,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis is a friendly reminder to complete the DevOps Engineer - US AI interview\r\nwhere you can showcase your expertise and contribute to cutting-edge AI\r\ntraining projects.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt takes about 45 minutes, requires no preparation, and only needs to be done\r\nonce to unlock multiple opportunities.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">We typically fill roles within 48 hours, so we recommend\r\ncompleting it as soon as possible.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.interview.micro1.ai/intro/micro1/?candidate=c39bc47a-33fc-41bf-8545-db8d842fbc3f&amp;ping=ok\" target=\"_blank\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Start the\r\ninterview</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Note: Desktop only, mobile won\'t work<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>About the job</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Job Title:</b> DevOps Engineer<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Job Type: </b>Full-time<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Location: </b>Remote - US only<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Job Summary:</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Join our team as a pivotal DevOps Engineer, where you’ll\r\narchitect, implement, and optimize scalable infrastructure solutions across\r\ndynamic cloud environments. You’ll play a key role in driving world-class\r\nproduction reliability, automation, and security for high-traffic systems. If\r\nyou thrive in a remote, fast-paced setting and have a passion for building\r\nrobust, secure, and efficient infrastructure, we want to hear from you.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Key Responsibilities:</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Design, build, and\r\n     maintain resilient, secure, and scalable infrastructure leveraging AWS,\r\n     Kubernetes, and Docker.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Manage end-to-end cloud\r\n     infrastructure, addressing real production issues and ensuring high system\r\n     availability.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Implement and optimize\r\n     CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins, GitHub Actions, and Infrastructure as Code\r\n     (Terraform/CDK).<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Drive cost optimization\r\n     initiatives and monitor resource utilization across multiple cloud\r\n     providers (AWS, GCP, Azure).<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Champion DevSecOps best\r\n     practices, including container security, API protection, and secret\r\n     management.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Develop and maintain\r\n     comprehensive observability through logging, metrics, alerting, and rapid\r\n     debugging strategies.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Mentor and set standards\r\n     for the next wave of DevOps hires, fostering a culture of technical\r\n     excellence.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Required Skills and Qualifications:</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">5+ years of experience\r\n     in DevOps roles with strong AWS, Kubernetes, and Docker expertise.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Deep technical knowledge\r\n     of DevSecOps toolkits, including Jenkins, Terraform, Git/Version control,\r\n     and containerization technologies.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Hands-on experience with\r\n     large-scale, high-availability production environments and real-time issue\r\n     resolution.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Solid understanding of\r\n     DevOps automation tools (Terraform, GitHub Actions) and best practices for\r\n     zero-downtime deployments.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Proficiency in\r\n     infrastructure security: IAM, secrets management, network security, and\r\n     API protection.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Proven experience with\r\n     AWS services (RDS, S3, Lambda, EC2, ECS, API Gateway, WAF), with exposure\r\n     to GCP/Azure in multi-cloud setups.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Exceptional written and\r\n     verbal communication skills for effective cross-functional collaboration\r\n     and documentation.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Preferred Qualifications:</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Experience with security\r\n     platforms such as Prisma Cloud, SIEM, CrowdStrike, or similar tools.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Familiarity with API and\r\n     container security in cloud-native environments.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\">Demonstrated leadership\r\n     in mentoring, standard-setting, or guiding DevOps teams through\r\n     infrastructure evolution.<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-28', '00:30:00', '01:12:00', '2026-05-28 19:53:57', '2026-05-28 19:54:06', 0, '2026-05-28 17:49:16', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-494@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
