(500, 8, 104, 7, 6, 4, 'FW: TAC [ Niteesh Paila - Software Engineer- 05/27/2026]', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello Team,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nI hope you are doing well.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nI have a candidate,<b> Niteesh</b>, who needs to complete a technical\r\nassessment.<br>\r\nYou may contact him directly at&nbsp; +1<b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,serif;mso-ansi-language:EN\">737 315 1386&nbsp;</span></b>&nbsp;for\r\ncoordination.<br>\r\nI have attached the assessment for your reference. Your assistance in\r\nfacilitating this process is highly appreciated.<br>\r\nIf you have any questions or need further information, please feel free to\r\nreach out.<br>\r\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter.<br>\r\nHi Niteesh Paila,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThanks again for applying for a role at Google. The next step of the hiring\r\nprocess will be to complete the <a href=\"https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/dashboard\" target=\"_blank\">Google Hiring Assessment</a>, which should take about 30\r\nminutes.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nYou may find your assessment link in your <a href=\"https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/dashboard\" target=\"_blank\">Candidate Portal</a> or you may also copy and paste this\r\nlink into your browser: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/dashboard\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/dashboard</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease complete the Google Hiring Assessment by 2:29<span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM ET/11:29<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>AM\r\nPT on May 30. We can only consider your application for a role at Google if\r\nyour assessment is completed by the deadline. The results of this assessment\r\nwill determine if you\'re eligible to move forward with the hiring process.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe Google Hiring Assessment questions, along with your responses, are for your\r\neyes only. Do not forward or share them.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Instructions</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Please\r\ncomplete this ~30-minute Google Hiring Assessment which will evaluate your work\r\nstyles that are important to success at Google.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->If\r\nyou need troubleshooting support with your assessment, please send an email\r\nto <a href=\"mailto:assessment-help@google.com\" target=\"_blank\">assessment-help@google.com</a> and\r\ninclude your: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:94.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->a.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->First\r\nand Last Name<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:94.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->b.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Question\r\nor description of the issue and any relevant screenshots<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\n<b>Accommodations</b><br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe understand there are many ways to process information. If you require an\r\naccommodation due to a medical condition, disability, or neurodivergence,\r\nplease send an email to <a href=\"mailto:assessment-help@google.com\" target=\"_blank\">assessment-help@google.com</a> to request a specific\r\naccommodation or determine what options may be available. Let us know your\r\naccommodation needs before engaging in or completing the assessment.\r\nAccommodations include, but are not limited to: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]-->Extra\r\ntime to complete the assessment<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]-->Guidance\r\non screen reader resources: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:94.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo2;tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><a href=\"https://support.google.com/accessibility/answer/7031755?hl=en#:~:text=To%20open%20your%20ChromeVox%20options,and%20hear%20text%20spoken%20aloud\" target=\"_blank\">Google Accessibility </a>- built in screen reader <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:141.75pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo2;tab-stops:list 1.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Browser\r\nURL:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://support.google.com/accessibility/answer/7031755?hl=en#zippy=%2Cchoose-text-with-your-cursor\" target=\"_blank\">https://support.google.com/accessibility/answer/7031755?hl=en#zippy=%2Cchoose-text-with-your-cursor</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:94.5pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo2;tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/complete-guide-to-narrator-e4397a0d-ef4f-b386-d8ae-c172f109bdb1\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft - Narrator</a> <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:141.75pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level3 lfo2;tab-stops:list 1.5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Browser\r\nURL:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/complete-guide-to-narrator-e4397a0d-ef4f-b386-d8ae-c172f109bdb1\" target=\"_blank\">https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/complete-guide-to-narrator-e4397a0d-ef4f-b386-d8ae-c172f109bdb1</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\nThere is no need to provide us with the nature of or reason for your request\r\nfor accommodations at this time. Any information you do provide us regarding\r\nyour health is provided with your explicit consent to our using such\r\ninformation to assess your accommodation request. You can withdraw that consent\r\nat any time by sending a subsequent email to <a href=\"mailto:assessment-help@google.com\" target=\"_blank\">assessment-help@google.com</a>.\r\nHowever, if you withdraw consent before we have made an assessment we may not\r\nbe able to provide you with an accommodation.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Confidentiality:</b> The information you provide in an accommodation\r\nrequest will only be reviewed by our global disability partner, Korn Ferry, in\r\norder to assess and provide you with reasonable accommodations. Google does not\r\nrequire a diagnosis, treatment plan, or Government disability certificate.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThanks!<br>\r\nGoogle Recruiting<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"1\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">FAQs:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Can I have an extension to complete the assessment?</b><br>\r\nTo keep our process consistent, we ask that everyone complete the Google Hiring\r\nAssessment by the deadline. If you have a scheduling conflict that absolutely\r\ncan\'t be moved, let us know as soon as possible by emailing <a href=\"mailto:assessment-help@google.com\" target=\"_blank\">assessment-help@google.com</a> and\r\nwe\'re happy to talk through options.<b><i>Note: while we expect the GHA to take\r\nabout 30 minutes to complete, you can spend as much time on it as you’d like up\r\nuntil your deadline noted above.</i></b><br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease note, if you hear from a recruiter before you\'ve completed the Google\r\nHiring Assessment, you\'ll still need to finish it by the deadline.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Are there system/browser requirements to complete the Google Hiring\r\nAssessment?</b><br>\r\nA consistent internet connection is essential for an optimal experience. We\r\nrecommend testing your internet connection using our <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=internet%20speed%20test\" target=\"_blank\">Measurement\r\nLab tool</a> to ensure it\'s stable.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n[Measurement Lab tool URL: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=internet%20speed%20test\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.com/search?q=internet%20speed%20test</a>]<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease use the latest version of one of these browsers: Chrome, Firefox,\r\nMicrosoft Edge, Microsoft Internet Explorer, Safari.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAdditional questions? Check the <a href=\"https://services.google.com/fh/files/helpcenter/ghafaqs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Google Hiring Assessment FAQs</a>.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGoogle Hiring Assessment FAQ URL:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://services.google.com/fh/files/helpcenter/ghafaqs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://services.google.com/fh/files/helpcenter/ghafaqs.pdf</a><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-28', '02:30:00', '03:30:00', '2026-05-28 21:28:40', '2026-05-28 22:28:00', 59, '2026-05-28 20:29:09', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-500@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
