 target=\"_blank\">https://hr.gs/fc2ae9e</a><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  5<sup>th</sup> Interview Details<br>\r\n  1:30pm-2:15pm EST<br>\r\n  Technical Business Acumen Interviewers: Parul Kothari<br>\r\n  <b>Your HackerRank code pair link is</b>: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://hr.gs/348bcc9&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;ust=1779821746589531&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nAXDAAjagRlCXLyxgL6JC\" target=\"_blank\">https://hr.gs/348bcc9</a><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  General meeting Link:<br>\r\n  <b>Zoom</b>: <a href=\"https://lat-ai.zoom.us/j/82768210583?pwd=a54l1dpenf8aYmglY7beqwcUytH5A8.1&amp;jst=3\" target=\"_blank\">https://lat-ai.zoom.us/j/82768210583?pwd=a54l1dpenf8aYmglY7beqwcUytH5A8.1&amp;jst=3</a>&nbsp;\r\n  <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Latitude AI (lat.ai)\r\n  develops automated driving technologies, including L3, for Ford vehicles at\r\n  scale. We’re driven by the opportunity to reimagine what it’s like to drive\r\n  and make travel safer, less stressful, and more enjoyable for everyone.&nbsp;\r\n  <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">When you join the\r\n  Latitude team, you’ll work alongside leading experts across machine learning\r\n  and robotics, cloud platforms, mapping, sensors and compute systems, test\r\n  operations, systems and safety engineering – all dedicated to making a real,\r\n  positive impact on the driving experience for millions of people. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">As a Ford Motor Company\r\n  subsidiary, we operate independently to develop automated driving technology\r\n  at the speed of a technology startup. Latitude is headquartered in Pittsburgh\r\n  with engineering centers in Dearborn, Mich., and Palo Alto, Calif.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Meet the team:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">The Autonomy Analytics\r\n  team is responsible for evaluating the performance of our autonomous software\r\n  using data, statistics, and machine learning. Combining data from real-world\r\n  testing with our extensive simulations, our team builds the metrics and analytics\r\n  that ensure our product is safe, reliable, and delights our customers. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Our team is spread\r\n  geographically with some members on-site in Pittsburgh, Palo Alto, and\r\n  Dearborn. Others work fully remotely.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">What you’ll do: <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Translate loosely\r\n  defined questions into clear requirements, metric definitions, and analytical\r\n  deliverables<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Partner closely with\r\n  software development teams, test engineering, product, and analytics partners\r\n  to understand needs and deliver trusted data products<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Build and maintain\r\n  scalable data models in Google BigQuery and similar cloud data platforms to\r\n  support reporting, analysis, and operational decision-making<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Develop dashboards and\r\n  lightweight data applications in Apache Superset, Plotly Dash, or similar\r\n  tools for technical and business stakeholders<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Investigate source data,\r\n  identify quality issues, and implement durable fixes that improve accuracy,\r\n  consistency, and reliability<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Create reusable\r\n  datasets, testing practices, and documentation that strengthen trust in data\r\n  and improve self-service access<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Balance near-term\r\n  dashboard development with long-term data modeling work to support both speed\r\n  and scale<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Communicate findings,\r\n  assumptions, and tradeoffs clearly to internal stakeholders and external\r\n  platform or data partners as needed<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">What you\'ll need to\r\n  succeed:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Bachelor\'s degree in\r\n  Computer Engineering, Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, Robotics or a\r\n  related field and 4+ years of relevant experience (or Master\'s degree and 2+\r\n  years of relevant experience, or PhD)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience building and\r\n  maintaining analytics-ready data models in Google BigQuery or a similar cloud\r\n  data warehouse<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience using dbt or\r\n  a similar data transformation framework to develop tested, documented, and\r\n  maintainable data pipelines<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience designing\r\n  dashboards and analytical applications in Apache Superset, Tableau, or\r\n  similar reporting and visualization tools<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Strong SQL skills,\r\n  including complex transformations, data validation, and query optimization<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience with Python\r\n  for data analysis and application development, including the ability to\r\n  contribute to and maintain Plotly Dash dashboards<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Demonstrated ability to\r\n  succeed in ambiguous environments by defining requirements, shaping metrics,\r\n  and creating structure from incomplete problem statements<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience partnering\r\n  with software development, test engineering, product, or similar\r\n  cross-functional teams to deliver measurable outcomes<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Strong foundation in\r\n  data modeling, dashboard design, documentation, and quality assurance\r\n  practices<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Strong written and\r\n  verbal communication skills with the ability to explain analytical concepts\r\n  and findings to varied audiences<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Nice to have: <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience supporting\r\n  autonomous vehicle development or other complex hardware and software\r\n  products<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience working with\r\n  telemetry, operational, or product usage data at scale<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience building\r\n  shared metrics and self-service reporting solutions for engineering and\r\n  product organizations<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#384148\">Experience with\r\n  front-end technologies such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, or React to support\r\n  customization and enhancement of data applications and dashboards<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-29', '21:30:00', '23:45:00', '2026-05-29 16:00:38', '2026-05-29 18:05:52', 125, '2026-05-29 14:30:04', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-505@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
