>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Screening round<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Client Details<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  color:#5F6368;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Amazon</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#5F6368;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Joining Details<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">Meeting\r\n  URL: <a href=\"https://amazon.zoom.us/j/99508256271?pwd=x9WQAmQRq7b2oZvsabJd3pLF8ZmacF.1\" target=\"_blank\">https://amazon.zoom.us/j/99508256271?pwd=x9WQAmQRq7b2oZvsabJd3pLF8ZmacF.1</a><br>\r\n  Meeting details:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Meeting ID: 99508256271<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Passcode: 02275981<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">U.S.\r\n  one-tap toll-free dial-in: 833 928 4609,,99508256271#,,,,*02275981#<br>\r\n  U.S. toll-free dial-in: 833 928 4609<br>\r\n  International dial-in details: <a href=\"https://amazon.zoom.us/u/advL0jZv19\" target=\"_blank\">https://amazon.zoom.us/u/advL0jZv19</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">As a Data Engineer on the Network Design team, you\'ll\r\n  architect the data infrastructure behind how Amazon moves millions of\r\n  packages across the US every day. You\'ll design and implement scalable data\r\n  pipelines and models that fuel network optimization — powering decisions on\r\n  speed, cost, quality, and sustainability. From building real-time data\r\n  solutions to establishing governance frameworks, your work will directly\r\n  shape the supply chain that delivers for hundreds of millions of customers.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  You\'ll operate at the intersection of data engineering and network planning,\r\n  translating complex logistics problems into elegant, automated solutions.\r\n  This is a high-visibility role where your technical contributions drive\r\n  measurable business outcomes — faster deliveries, lower costs, and a more\r\n  sustainable transportation network.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Key job responsibilities<br>\r\n  - Design and implement data pipelines for the different Network design\r\n  programs.<br>\r\n  - Develop foundational data infrastructure for the network design models to\r\n  enable faster and automated runs of underlying models, with automated end to\r\n  end data flows.<br>\r\n  - Identify the business needs for design scenario analysis, formulate data\r\n  architecture strategies, and develop a user-friendly platform for NDPE\r\n  program managers to perform what-if analysis.<br>\r\n  - Define the data engineering processes that leverage various AWS services to\r\n  improve accessibility, redundancy, data integrity, AWS services costs, and\r\n  storage requirements.<br>\r\n  - Develop the high quality solutions for the faster development of the\r\n  products/models that solve the business needs in a scalable format, while\r\n  also anticipating future requirements<br>\r\n  - Collaborate with Research/Applied Scientists, Data Engineers, BIEs, Data\r\n  Scientists and Product/Program Managers to understand the business and\r\n  technical requirements, and make decisions that help make the\r\n  products/programs smoother.<br>\r\n  - Lead the technical design of the data infrastructure with strong coding\r\n  skills (preferable in python), code deployment and code maintenance.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  A day in the life<br>\r\n  We\'re the Network Design team within Amazon\'s Transportation organization —\r\n  the people behind how millions of packages move across the US supply chain.\r\n  We partner cross-functionally to build innovative connectivity solutions and\r\n  deliver data-driven strategies that optimize network performance for speed,\r\n  cost, quality, and sustainability. Our work spans three focus areas: Cost\r\n  Governance, High Velocity Event Planning (think Prime Day), and Strategic\r\n  Organizational Initiatives. If you\'re energized by solving complex logistics\r\n  challenges at massive scale with real-world impact, this is the team for you.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  About the team<br>\r\n  Your days will be dynamic and high-impact. You might start the morning\r\n  modeling network topology to improve how packages flow coast-to-coast, then\r\n  shift to collaborating with cross-functional partners on a connectivity\r\n  solution that shaves hours off delivery times. Some days you\'ll build\r\n  recommendations to reduce carbon footprint; others, you\'ll plan for peak\r\n  events at unprecedented scale. You\'ll tackle long-term planning, drive\r\n  \"Think Big\" innovations in automation and containerization, and see\r\n  your work directly shape the customer experience for hundreds of millions of\r\n  customers worldwide.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Basic Qualifications<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">- 3+ years of data engineering experience<br>\r\n  - 1+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for\r\n  business intelligence analytics using ETL/ELT processes experience<br>\r\n  - 1+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for\r\n  business intelligence analytics using OLAP technologies experience<br>\r\n  - 1+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for\r\n  business intelligence analytics using data modeling experience<br>\r\n  - 1+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for\r\n  business intelligence analytics using SQL experience<br>\r\n  - 1+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for\r\n  business intelligence analytics using Oracle experience<br>\r\n  - Experience with data modeling, warehousing and building ETL pipelines<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"skipproofing\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Preferred Qualifications<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">- Master\'s degree in a quantitative field<br>\r\n  - Experience with network, graph, or geospatial data modeling and\r\n  optimization<br>\r\n  - Experience in logistics, supply chain, or transportation domains<br>\r\n  - Experience with data visualization tools (e.g., QuickSight, Tableau)<br>\r\n  - Familiarity with real-time or streaming data architectures (e.g., Kinesis,\r\n  Kafka)<br>\r\n  - Understanding of data governance frameworks and regulations (e.g., GDPR,\r\n  DMA)<br>\r\n  - Experience with infrastructure-as-code and CI/CD pipelines for data systems<br>\r\n  - Experience mentoring engineers or leading technical design reviews<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Amazon is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the\r\n  basis of protected veteran status, disability, or other legally protected\r\n  status</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-29', '01:00:00', '01:30:00', '2026-05-29 19:11:03', '2026-05-29 19:11:13', 0, '2026-05-29 14:31:37', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-506@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(507, 5, 204, 4, 5, 4, 'FW: Welcome to bEdge Tech Services for Job-Hunting Journey | GOWTHAM PIRATLA | Data Scientist', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Dear Gowtham<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Thank you for choosing us\r\nas your career growth partner in your job-hunting journey. We appreciate your\r\ntrust and are excited to assist you in finding &nbsp;<b>“Data Scientist”</b>\r\nposition in the US Job Market. As discussed during our recent call, please\r\nshare the required details below.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;Requirements for\r\nthe Job-Hunting Process</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Work\r\n     Authorization Document (EAD Copy, H1B Copy, or Receipt of Application if\r\n     documents are pending)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Identity\r\n     Card (State ID or Driver\'s License)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Email\r\n     Address for Marketing Purposes – ( Please create a Gmail ID and share the\r\n     credential details) <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Google\r\n     Voice Number – Please share the Google Voice number, login ID, and\r\n     Password. <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">LinkedIn\r\n     Profile – Please share your LinkedIn credentials ( change the primary\r\n     email ID to Marketing email ID) <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Certificates\r\n     Link – Shared Certification Link<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">GitHub\r\n     and Other Portfolio Links<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">In addition to the above\r\ndetails, please complete the attached form with as much information as you\r\ncurrently have. Please don\'t hesitate to provide any additional information\r\nlater if it isn\'t available right now.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;Do\'s and Don\'ts</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> stay updated on current market skill requirements for your\r\n     role.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> seek to learn new skills and technologies through platforms\r\n     like Google Learning and LinkedIn Learning.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> answer all calls if possible; if you miss a call, please\r\n     return it promptly, as it could be a job opportunity.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Don\'t</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> reschedule interviews unless necessary.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> prepare thoroughly before each interview.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> practice for interviews; a technical expert will be available\r\n     to assist you if needed.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> evaluate past experiences to learn and improve for future\r\n     opportunities.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> maintain daily communication with your recruiter regarding\r\n     your progress and any updates.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">If\r\n     you are unavailable</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">, please inform your recruiter\r\n     as soon as possible.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">In\r\n     case of any disputes</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">, follow the established\r\n     hierarchy for resolution.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do\r\n     </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">refer to the service agreement and enrolment\r\n     form.<b> </b><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Don’t\r\n     </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">use multiple profile marketing techniques.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do\r\n     follow </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">the instructions of the recruiter if you\r\n     have any concerns related to the recruiter, connect with your Account\r\n     Manager, or raise a complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;For any queries\r\nand complaints – </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"mailto:wecare@bedgetechinc.com\">wecare@bedgetechinc.com</a><b> </b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a id=\"OWAAM7420A8B270254E54A94420BF21D03929\" href=\"mailto:Parth.soni@bedgetechinc.com\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Aptos;text-decoration:none;text-underline:none\">@Parth\r\nSoni</span></a>– Please help her with the Resume understanding session and\r\ndocument along with technical support demo and Mock call.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;If you have any\r\nconcerns, feel free to reach out to me at <b>3077769517</b> on call and text\r\nand <b>3072106245</b> for WhatsApp. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">We are excited to embark on\r\nthis journey with you and are committed to supporting you every step of the\r\nway. If you have any questions or need further clarification, please do not\r\nhesitate to reach out.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-06-01', '22:00:00', '22:30:00', '2026-06-01 20:00:13', '2026-06-01 20:17:13', 17, '2026-05-29 14:34:35', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-507@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
