lack;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Base\r\nPay/Salary</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Chicago,IL\r\n$109,250.00-$177,500.00</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job\r\nDescription</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">You\r\nenjoy shaping the future of product innovation as a core leader, driving value\r\nfor customers, guiding successful launches, and exceeding expectations. Join\r\nour dynamic team and make a meaningful impact by delivering high-quality\r\nproducts that resonate with clients.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">As\r\na Product Manager, Vice President within the Global Customer Platform team, you\r\nwill leverage your expertise in product development and optimization to make a\r\nsignificant impact. You’ll use user research and customer feedback to fuel the\r\ncreation of innovative products and enhance existing offerings. With a strong\r\nfocus on scalability, resiliency, and stability, you’ll collaborate with\r\ncross-functional teams and play a pivotal role in shaping the future of our\r\nproducts and the ongoing success of our organization.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;Job\r\nresponsibilities</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Partners\r\nwith the Product Owner to identify new product opportunities that reflect the\r\nneeds of our customers and the market through user research and discovery.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Considers\r\nand plans for upstream and downstream implications of new product features on\r\nthe overall product experience.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Supports\r\nthe collection of user research, journey mapping, and market analysis to inform\r\nthe strategic product roadmap and provide insight on potential product features\r\nthat provide value to customers.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Analyzes,\r\ntracks, and evaluates product metrics including work to time, cost, and quality\r\ntargets across the product development life cycle.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Writes\r\nthe requirements, epics, and user stories to support product development.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Supports\r\nthe completion of change management activities across functional partners and\r\nmonitors adherence to the firm’s risk, controls, compliance, and regulatory\r\nrequirements.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Raise\r\nblockers and other impediments to the Product Manager and assist in driving\r\nsolutions to removed blockers.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assist\r\nProduct Owner in managing timelines and reporting risks and issues.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Remain\r\nflexible in a changing environment due to high demands from products across the\r\nfirm all working to solution their highest priority change.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Excel\r\nin communication, collaboration, and coordination across product and technology\r\nto ensure the needs of our customers are clearly understood and we\r\nexpeditiously deliver solutions that meet or exceed their needs and\r\nexpectations.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Required\r\nqualifications, capabilities, and skills</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">5+\r\nyears of experience or equivalent expertise in product management or a relevant\r\ndomain area</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Proficient\r\nknowledge of the product development life cycle</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\nin product life cycle activities including discovery and requirements\r\ndefinition.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Developing\r\nknowledge of data analytics</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Demonstrated\r\nperformance in either product management or relevant domain area.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\nexecuting operational management and change readiness activities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\nin product deployment processes&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Understand\r\nthe process and practice of Agile software delivery.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Support\r\nProduct Manager with breaking down a complex problem into manageable and\r\nachievable parts, then the experience to see it thru to implementation.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Preferred\r\nqualifications, capabilities, and skills</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Demonstrated\r\nprior experience working in a highly matrixed, complex organization</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Firm\r\nknowledge of the product development life cycle</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\nverbal and written communication skills to effectively collaborate with\r\nstakeholders, present findings, and document requirements.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Teamwork\r\nand Collaboration: Ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional teams,\r\nincluding product managers, designers, and engineers.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\ndiligence to ensure accuracy and precision in data analysis, documentation, and\r\nrequirement gathering.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-29', '00:00:00', '00:45:00', '2026-05-29 17:54:37', '2026-05-29 19:07:05', 72, '2026-05-29 17:01:29', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-528@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `client_id`, `candidate_id`, `poc_id`, `task_type_id`, `status_id`, `title`, `description`, `due_date`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `task_start_time`, `task_end_time`, `duration`, `created_at`, `total_amount`, `payment_status_id`, `payment_mode`, `paid_at`, `reference_no`, `payment_notes`, `email_thread_id`, `invoice_id`, `billing_status`) VALUES
(529, 10, 114, 8, 1, 4, 'NA', '<div>About the job</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>About the Role</div><div>We are seeking a motivated and detail-oriented Entry-Level Project Manager to join our growing team. This is an excellent opportunity for a recent graduate or early-career professional looking to develop in a structured, supportive project management environment.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>You will work alongside experienced project managers and cross-functional teams to support the planning, coordination and delivery of a range of internal and client-facing projects. Full training, mentorship and professional development opportunities (including funded certifications) will be provided.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Key Responsibilities</div><div>Assist in the planning, scheduling and coordination of project activities</div><div>Prepare project documentation, reports, meeting minutes and status updates</div><div>Support project managers in monitoring progress, risks and issues</div><div>Communicate with internal teams, clients and stakeholders</div><div>Help track budgets, timelines and deliverables</div><div>Contribute to process improvements and project governance activities</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>About You</div><div>Degree in Business, Management or related industry is preferable but not essential</div><div>Strong organisational and communication skills</div><div>Ability to manage multiple tasks and prioritise effectively</div><div>Keen attention to detail and willingness to learn</div><div>A proactive, positive approach to problem-solving</div><div>Proficiency with MS Office; familiarity with project tools (e.g., Jira, Trello, MS Project) is a bonus but not required</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>What We Offer</div><div>Comprehensive training and structured career development</div><div>Inclusive and supportive working culture</div><div>Opportunity to gain hands-on experience in real projects from day one</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>How to Apply</div><div>Please submit your CV outlining your interest in the role via LinkedIn Easy Apply.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Addison is an equal opportunity employer, this role is a W-2 full time ongoing role.</div>', '2026-05-29', '19:45:00', '20:15:00', '2026-05-29 22:08:46', '2026-05-29 22:08:57', 0, '2026-05-29 17:16:02', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-529@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(530, 8, 213, 7, 4, 4, 'Fw: RUC [ Hamsini Reddy Gunda – Business Intelligence Analyst 05/29/2026 ]', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi ,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hope\r\nyou are well.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I am reaching out to request your assistance in coordinating a Resume\r\nUnderstanding Session (RUC) for my candidate, <b>Hamsini Reddy Gunda</b>.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>To streamline the process, I have attached the resume for your reference.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have any questions or need additional information, please feel free\r\nto reach out.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you in advance for your prompt attention to this matter.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>WhatsApp Contact: (636) 686-3699</b><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-05-29', '01:00:00', '01:30:00', '2026-05-29 20:39:29', '2026-05-29 20:40:35', 1, '2026-05-29 17:25:25', 2000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-530@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
