t-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Strong written and\r\n  verbal communication skills, including presenting findings to non-technical\r\n  and senior audiences<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\n  font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">This is a hybrid\r\n  role (in-office on Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\">Travel: typical travel is 5-10%</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\">What We’ll Provide:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n  &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\">More than just pay, our DaVita Rewards package connects\r\n  teammates to what matters most. Teammates are eligible to begin receiving\r\n  benefits on the first day of the month following or coinciding with one month\r\n  of continuous employment. Below are some of our benefit\r\n  offerings.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\n  font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Comprehensive\r\n  benefits:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"> Medical,\r\n  dental, vision, 401(k) match, paid time off, PTO cash out&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\n  font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Support\r\n  for you and your family:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"> Family\r\n  resources, EAP counseling sessions, access Headspace®, backup child and elder\r\n  care, maternity/paternity leave and more&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\n  font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Professional\r\n  development programs: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">DaVita offers a\r\n  variety of programs to help strong performers grow within their career and\r\n  also offers on-demand virtual leadership and development courses through\r\n  DaVita’s online training platform StarLearning.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\">&nbsp;#LI-CM2</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\">At DaVita, we strive to be a community first and a company\r\n  second. &nbsp;We want all teammates to experience DaVita as \"a place\r\n  where I belong.\" &nbsp;Our goal is to embed belonging into everything we\r\n  do in our Village, so that it becomes part of who we are. We are proud to be\r\n  an equal opportunity workplace and comply with state and federal affirmative\r\n  action requirements. Individuals are recruited, hired, assigned and promoted\r\n  without regard to race, national origin, religion, age, color, sex, sexual\r\n  orientation, gender identity, disability, protected veteran status, or any\r\n  other protected characteristic.</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-29', '02:00:00', '02:30:00', '2026-05-29 21:28:33', '2026-05-29 21:50:12', 21, '2026-05-29 17:30:26', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-531@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `client_id`, `candidate_id`, `poc_id`, `task_type_id`, `status_id`, `title`, `description`, `due_date`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `task_start_time`, `task_end_time`, `duration`, `created_at`, `total_amount`, `payment_status_id`, `payment_mode`, `paid_at`, `reference_no`, `payment_notes`, `email_thread_id`, `invoice_id`, `billing_status`) VALUES
(532, 5, 217, 4, 1, 4, 'Re: Welcome to bEdge Tech Services for Job-Hunting Journey | Akshitha Patlolla | Salesforce Developer', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Alpesh,&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Please find the attachments for EAD card, ID and\r\ncredential form.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Please let me know if any additional details are required\r\nfrom my side.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks and Regards,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Akshitha<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Thu, May 28, 2026 at 10:04<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>AM\r\nAlpesh Modi &lt;<a href=\"mailto:alpesh.modi@bedgetechinc.com\">alpesh.modi@bedgetechinc.com</a>&gt;\r\nwrote:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Dear Akshitha<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Thank you for choosing us\r\nas your career growth partner in your job-hunting journey. We appreciate your\r\ntrust and are excited to assist you in finding &nbsp;<b>“Salesforce Developer”</b>\r\nposition in the US Job Market. As discussed during our recent call, please\r\nshare the required details below.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;Requirements for\r\nthe Job-Hunting Process</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Work Authorization Document (EAD Copy, H1B\r\n     Copy, or Receipt of Application if documents are pending)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Identity Card (State ID or Driver\'s\r\n     License)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Email Address for Marketing Purposes – (\r\n     Please create a Gmail ID and share the credential details) <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Google Voice Number – Please share the\r\n     Google Voice number, login ID, and Password. <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">LinkedIn Profile – Please share your\r\n     LinkedIn credentials ( change the primary email ID to Marketing email ID) <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Certificates Link – Shared Certification\r\n     Link<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">GitHub and Other Portfolio Links<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">In addition to the above\r\ndetails, please complete the attached form with as much information as you\r\ncurrently have. Please don\'t hesitate to provide any additional information\r\nlater if it isn\'t available right now.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;Do\'s and Don\'ts</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> stay updated on current market skill\r\n     requirements for your role.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> seek to learn new skills and\r\n     technologies through platforms like Google Learning and LinkedIn Learning.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> answer all calls if possible; if you\r\n     miss a call, please return it promptly, as it could be a job opportunity.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Don\'t</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> reschedule interviews unless\r\n     necessary.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> prepare thoroughly before each\r\n     interview.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> practice for interviews; a technical\r\n     expert will be available to assist you if needed.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> evaluate past experiences to learn\r\n     and improve for future opportunities.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> maintain daily communication with\r\n     your recruiter regarding your progress and any updates.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">If you are unavailable</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">, please inform your recruiter\r\n     as soon as possible.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">In case of any disputes</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">, follow the established\r\n     hierarchy for resolution.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">refer to the service agreement and\r\n     enrolment form.<b> </b><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Don’t </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">use multiple profile marketing techniques.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Do follow </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">the instructions of the recruiter if\r\n     you have any concerns related to the recruiter, connect with your\r\n     Account Manager, or raise a complaint.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;For any queries\r\nand complaints - </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:Parth.soni@bedgetechinc.com\" target=\"_blank\">@Parth Soni</a>\r\n– Please help her with the Resume understanding session and document along with\r\ntechnical support demo and Mock call.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;If you have any\r\nconcerns, feel free to reach out to me at 3077769517 on call and text and\r\n3072106245 for WhatsApp. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\">We are excited to embark on\r\nthis journey with you and are committed to supporting you every step of the\r\nway. If you have any questions or need further clarification, please do not\r\nhesitate to reach out.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-05-29', '01:30:00', '02:00:00', '2026-06-01 17:21:46', '2026-06-01 17:22:17', 0, '2026-05-29 17:38:43', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-532@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
