"font-size:16.0pt\">Microsoft\r\n  Teams meeting<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Join: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/250968369220634?p=nqSjlx2eFvMLFZtX3q\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/250968369220634?p=nqSjlx2eFvMLFZtX3q</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Meeting\r\n  ID: 250 968 369 220 634<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Passcode: RJ3N4aP2<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">What You\'ll Do</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Data Platform &amp; Architecture</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Design\r\n       and operate a dual-database architecture: a columnar analytics warehouse\r\n       with schema-per-tenant isolation and a relational OLTP database for\r\n       profiles, config, audit logs, and AI conversations<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Implement\r\n       and enforce tenant data isolation: schema-level grants, session-level\r\n       context injection, defense-in-depth filtering, and row-level security\r\n       policies<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Build\r\n       the data foundation that serves both human-facing dashboards and agentic\r\n       tool-use queries — optimizing for the distinct access patterns of each<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Multi-Source Ingestion</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Build\r\n       and operate ingestion pipelines for diverse healthcare data sources:<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Claims:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> ANSI X12\r\n       837I/837P/835/834 and CSV formats via workflow orchestration, serverless\r\n       parsers, and bulk loading<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">EMR/EHR:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> HL7 FHIR extracts,\r\n       flat-file exports from major EHR systems (Epic, Cerner, Athena,\r\n       eClinicalWorks, etc.)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">RCM:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Revenue cycle data from\r\n       billing platforms — charge capture, A/R aging, denial management,\r\n       collections<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Financial:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> General ledger exports,\r\n       budget files, contract rate tables, fee schedules, capitation rate cards<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Operational:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> HRIS staffing data,\r\n       scheduling system exports, patient volume feeds<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Payer:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Remittance files,\r\n       eligibility responses, authorization data, quality measure submissions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Own\r\n       the CMS public dataset ingestion pipeline: NCCI edits, NPPES, Provider\r\n       Utilization, MS-DRG, HCRIS, Hospital Compare, Physician Fee Schedule,\r\n       and more — with workflow orchestration, schema validation, external\r\n       tables, and operational copies<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Transformation &amp; Modeling</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Manage\r\n       the dbt transformation pipeline: input layer ingestion, core data model\r\n       normalization (claims, members, providers, encounters), and data mart\r\n       outputs (PMPM, CMS-HCC, readmissions, quality measures, CCSR, chronic\r\n       conditions, ED classification)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Build\r\n       domain-specific analytical models beyond claims: visit economics (slot\r\n       utilization, no-show rates, revenue per visit), VBC performance (quality\r\n       measures, shared savings, risk adjustment), financial forecasting\r\n       (revenue projections, budget variance, TCOP), and provider benchmarking\r\n       (peer cohort construction, percentile distributions)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Build\r\n       custom domain tables: contracts, fee schedules, capitation rates,\r\n       delegation agreements, DOFR surveillance, capitation reconciliation,\r\n       facility claims audit, TCOP, budget/forecast, JV attribution<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Operate\r\n       cross-tenant benchmarking pipelines: zero-copy data sharing, monthly\r\n       aggregate computation, de-identified metric distributions, CMS national\r\n       benchmark integration<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">AI &amp; ML Data Foundation</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Provide\r\n       the data foundation for ML models: feature store tables, statistical\r\n       process control metrics, population surveillance outputs, claim scoring\r\n       results, vector embedding storage, and feedback loop tables<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Design\r\n       and optimize data access patterns for agentic AI workflows — the AI\r\n       agent queries your data layer autonomously via tool use, so schema\r\n       design, indexing, and query performance directly impact agent quality<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Support\r\n       the analytics query layer: data model definitions mapping to\r\n       transformation outputs and custom domain tables, tenant security context\r\n       injection, pre-aggregation optimization, cache invalidation on data\r\n       refresh<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">What We\'re Looking For</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Required:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">5+\r\n       years of data engineering experience with production data platforms at\r\n       scale<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with healthcare data — claims formats (837/835/834), clinical data\r\n       (HL7/FHIR), or revenue cycle data. Deep expertise in at least one;\r\n       working familiarity with others<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Deep\r\n       experience with a cloud columnar warehouse (Redshift, BigQuery,\r\n       Snowflake, or Databricks) — schema design, bulk loading, external\r\n       tables, data sharing, query optimization<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\n       PostgreSQL skills — RLS policies, indexing strategies, transactional\r\n       DDL, connection pooling<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Production\r\n       experience with dbt — model design, incremental materializations,\r\n       macros, testing, CI/CD integration<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with cloud data services: object storage, workflow orchestration,\r\n       serverless compute, event-driven scheduling, data catalogs, encryption<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Proficiency\r\n       in SQL and Python for ETL scripting and data validation<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with schema-per-tenant or row-level-security multi-tenant data\r\n       architectures<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Comfort\r\n       with AI-assisted development — you use AI coding tools daily and\r\n       understand how to build data systems that AI agents consume<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Familiarity\r\n       with HIPAA technical safeguards: encryption at rest/in transit, audit\r\n       logging, PHI handling<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">You\'ve\r\n       built data infrastructure in an early-stage environment — comfortable\r\n       making architectural decisions without a platform team behind you.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Preferred:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       building data infrastructure consumed by AI/ML systems or autonomous\r\n       agents (feature stores, tool-use query patterns, RAG data layers)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with multiple healthcare data source types: claims + EMR + RCM +\r\n       financial<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Familiarity\r\n       with healthcare data normalization frameworks (Tuva Project or similar)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with ANSI X12 EDI parsing (837I, 837P, 835, 834 transaction sets)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Exposure\r\n       to CMS public datasets (NPPES, NCCI, HCRIS, MS-DRG tables, Physician Fee\r\n       Schedule)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       with vector databases or extensions (pgvector, Pinecone, or similar) for\r\n       similarity search<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Infrastructure-as-code\r\n       experience (CDK, Terraform, Pulumi, or CloudFormation)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\n       operating data pipelines under BAA/HIPAA compliance requirements<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Founding\r\n       / early data-engineer experience at a VC-backed healthcare or AI startup\r\n       (Tempus AI, Lightbeam, Lyra, Virta, Sprinter, Holmusk, Flatiron, Veeva,\r\n       etc.).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">You\'ve\r\n       built data layers that AI agents query via tool use in production — not\r\n       theoretical.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Tech Stack</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Warehouse:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Cloud columnar warehouse\r\n       (Redshift, BigQuery, Snowflake, or similar) with external table and data\r\n       sharing support<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Operational\r\n       DB:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n       PostgreSQL (with RLS, vector extension support)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Transformation:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> dbt, SQL, Python<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Orchestration:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Workflow orchestration\r\n       (Step Functions, Airflow, Prefect, or similar), event-driven scheduling,\r\n       serverless compute<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Storage:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Object storage (Parquet,\r\n       JSON Lines), encryption at rest<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">AI/Agent\r\n       Layer:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n       LLM platform — the AI agent consumes your data layer via tool use<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Infrastructure:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Infrastructure-as-code,\r\n       monitoring, IAM<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Formats:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> ANSI X12\r\n       (837I/837P/835/834), HL7 FHIR, CSV, Parquet, JSON Lines<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Development:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> AI-assisted coding tools<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-05-29', '00:30:00', '01:00:00', '2026-05-29 19:10:00', '2026-05-29 19:26:18', 16, '2026-05-29 19:09:16', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-533@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
