(534, 5, 218, 4, 8, 4, 'Interview Support - 2nd Round - Sairahul Karanam - Clinical Data analyst - 06/01/2026 - 2:00  PM - 3:00 PM EST - Integra connect', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear Team, <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">One of our candidate <b>Sairahul\r\nkaranam – Clinical Data Analyst </b>he managed to secure the <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">2<sup>nd</sup> Round</span> with\r\nthe <span lang=\"EN-IN\">Integra connect</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">. </span></b>And\r\nhe needs an Interview preparation documents and Mock Interview Session for\r\npreparation for the 2<sup>nd</sup> Round. Please provide him a material and\r\nmock session and his availability is for <span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">Today full day.</span> <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:.3in\">\r\n  <td width=\"623\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 467.5pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 0.3in;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Candidate Detail<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Name of Candidate<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"426\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:319.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  p