-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">About\r\nthe Role</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">As\r\nan AI Product Engineer on the KAIML team, you will build and scale AI-powered<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">applications\r\nthat support Keystone’s litigation, regulatory, investigative, and strategic<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">advisory\r\nwork.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">This\r\nis a full-stack engineering role focused on productization. You will take\r\nproof-of-<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">concepts\r\ndeveloped by Forward Deployed AI Engineers and transform them into<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">secure,\r\nscalable, production-grade products. You’ll own architecture decisions, build<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">robust\r\nbackend and frontend systems, manage releases, and ensure the reliability and<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">maintainability\r\nof AI tools deployed across the firm and to select clients.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">AI\r\nProduct Engineers at Keystone operate like startup engineers inside a\r\nconsulting<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">firm:\r\nmoving quickly from prototype to launch while maintaining production standards<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">appropriate\r\nfor high-stakes use cases.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">What\r\nYou’ll Do</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Lead the end-to-end\r\nproductization of AI tools, translating POCs into secure,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">scalable,\r\nproduction-ready systems<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Design and implement full-stack\r\narchitectures, including frontend interfaces,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">backend\r\nservices, data pipelines, and model integrations in collaboration with<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Keystone’s\r\ndata engineering team<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Own application reliability,\r\nperformance, and maintainability across beta releases<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">and\r\nproduction environments<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Collaborate closely with Forward\r\nDeployed AI Engineers to refine requirements<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">and\r\nprioritize features based on real-world usage<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Manage product releases, including\r\nbeta programs, user testing, feature<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">iteration,\r\nand launch readiness<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Build new features in alignment with\r\nevolving product roadmaps and practice<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">priorities<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Intake, diagnose, and resolve\r\nuser-reported issues and bugs; implement<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">monitoring\r\nand logging to proactively surface problems<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Maintain technical documentation and\r\ncontribute to roadmap planning, effort<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">estimation,\r\nand resource forecasting<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Calibri\"></span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Continuously evaluate improvements to\r\narchitecture, model integration patterns,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">and\r\nsystem design to enhance performance and scalability<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span