n  <p style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:10.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  83.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level2 lfo1;tab-stops:list 1.0in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><i><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;permitted during the interview process to ensure\r\n  the integrity of the interview process for all candidates. If the team\r\n  perceives the use of any such tools your interview will be ended and you will\r\n  no longer be in consideration.</span></i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:83.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level2 lfo1;tab-stops:list 1.0in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:24.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:24.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#171A20\">What\r\n  to Expect</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:24.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:48.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#393C41\">The\r\n  Manufacturing Quality Data Engineering team specializes in predicting safety\r\n  critical issues before they occur, protecting our customers. As part of\r\n  Tesla\'s Vehicle Engineering organization, you\'ll have access to the data gold\r\n  mine of design, manufacturing, and vehicle data sources, enabling you to\r\n  design, develop, and deploy innovative generative AI and machine learning\r\n  platforms globally. In this role, you\'ll focus on developing the backend of\r\n  our generative AI systems, including agentic data pipelines and integrations.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:24.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:24.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#171A20\">What\r\n  You’ll Do</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;margin-top:24.0pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;margin-top:24.0pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Design and deploy scalable architecture for AI\r\n       applications, including generative systems, using LangGraph and ensuring\r\n       seamless<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;margin-top:24.0pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">integration of components to improve overall system\r\n       performance<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Develop and refine AI and machine learning models,\r\n       including graph-based models, using technologies like Large Language\r\n       Model, Retrieval<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Augmented Generation, TensorFlow, PyTorch, and scikit\r\n       learn to create intelligent systems that drive business valueCreate and\r\n       iterate on a comprehensive evaluation framework for generative models,\r\n       focusing on performance improvements and optimization<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Architect and implement data pipelines and automation\r\n       systems to streamline data retrieval, processing, analysis, and\r\n       visualization,<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">ensuring efficient handling of batch and real time\r\n       data<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#393C41;mso-marg