0 PM EST<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Round Of Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">1st Round Technical</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">Job Title<br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <h3 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:3.75pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#0B1F28;font-weight:normal\">RigUp\r\n  is hiring a Senior Product Manager, who will translate our product vision and\r\n  strategy into high-quality, well-defined features that deliver real value to\r\n  customers. Working closely with cross-functional teams including operations,\r\n  research, design, and engineering, the senior product manager will own the\r\n  craft of turning strategic direction into shippable product — from discovery\r\n  through delivery.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We\'re looking for a highly-motivated, detail-oriented product manager with a\r\n  track record of delivering and iterating upon well-informed features in a\r\n  fast-paced environment. You bring strong collaboration and communication\r\n  skills and an eagerness to dive into new domain areas. You also display a\r\n  curious, experimental mindset in leveraging nascent AI tools to help\r\n  streamline traditional processes, explore ideas and build new skills.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Why Join Us? <br>\r\n  At RigUp, we’re transforming the way the energy industry connects skilled\r\n  professionals with the companies that need them most. As part of the Product\r\n  organization, you’ll play a key role in shaping the tools and experiences\r\n  that power our marketplace and support the growth of our platform. You’ll\r\n  have the opportunity to work on meaningful product challenges, collaborate\r\n  with talented cross-functional teams, and help build solutions that deliver\r\n  real value to our customers and partners.<br>\r\n  We’re looking for someone who thrives in a fast-paced environment, enjoys\r\n  turning complex problems into thoughtful product solutions, and is excited to\r\n  help build scalable products that support the next phase of the company’s\r\n  growth.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  What you’ll be doing:<br>\r\n  Develop a deep understanding of our business, customers, and product domain\r\n  to inform features<br>\r\n  Surface insights from discovery, delivery, and customer feedback that\r\n  influence broader product vision and strategy<br>\r\n  Facilitate discovery efforts that clarify problem areas and evaluate\r\n  potential solution paths, staying curious about emerging technologies and\r\n  tools that can sharpen how we build and what we deliver<br>\r\n  Collaborate with stakeholders, operational teams, research, designers, and\r\n  engineers to define and build product features, building trust through open\r\n  and consistent communication<br>\r\n  Help develop, prioritize, and manage a product backlog in a lean, agile\r\n  environment<br>\r\n  Produce clearly-written product requirements and acceptance criteria that\r\n  balance business and user needs<br>\r\n  Partner with design and engineering through delivery, ensuring quality\r\n  through thoughtful testing and release plans<br>\r\n  Collaborate with program leaders on go-to-market plans, training materials,\r\n  and customer communications<br>\r\n  Experience and Education Requirements:<br>\r\n  Bachelor\'s degree in a related field (e.g. computer science, business,\r\n  engineering)<br>\r\n  5+ years of experience in product management, with a focus on strategic\r\n  thinking and execution<br>\r\n  Proven track record of delivering successful products in a fast-paced\r\n  environment<br>\r\n  Clear written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to articulate\r\n  product vision and strategy to cross-functional teams and senior leadership<br>\r\n  Experience with agile development methodologies and tools (e.g. JIRA,\r\n  Confluence)<br>\r\n  analytical skills and the ability to use different types of data to inform\r\n  decision making<br>\r\n  Experience working with cross-functional teams, including engineering,\r\n  design, marketing and legal<o:p></o:p></span></h3>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-01', '01:30:00', '02:00:00', '2026-06-01 19:54:32', '2026-06-01 20:35:02', 40, '2026-06-01 14:50:18', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-544@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
