(548, 8, 224, 9, 4, 4, 'FW: RUC - Shajahan Mohammad - Software Developer', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello Team,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I hope you\'re doing well.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of my candidates,<b> Shajahan Mohammad, </b>who is a Software Developer,\r\nis in need of a <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Resume Understanding Session</span></strong>. I\r\nwould appreciate it if you could kindly assist him with this.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos\">Candidate Contact Information:</span></strong><br>\r\n<b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;color:black;background:yellow\">📞</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Contact:</span></b>&nbsp;&nbsp; +1 (216)\r\n484-4660<b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:\r\nyellow\"><br>\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;color:black;background:yellow\">📧</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;Email\r\n: </b><a href=\"mailto:vinay.p@mycvscout.com\" target=\"_blank\">shajahan.m@cvmailhub.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Availability:-&nbsp; Anytime after 10:00 AM EST</b><o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-06-01', '23:00:00', '23:30:00', '2026-06-01 16:10:29', '2026-06-01 16:10:40', 0, '2026-06-01 15:02:04', 2000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-548@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
