n></u></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">Join: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/22782557754521?p=sml5bioUu0zJbdw7pl\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/22782557754521?p=sml5bioUu0zJbdw7pl</a><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">Meeting ID: 227 825\r\n  577 545 21<o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">Passcode: nR3Zm6gt<o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">NA<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Title\r\n  : Business Systems Analyst<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Duration\r\n  : 6 months (hybrid)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Location\r\n  : Chicago IL<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Roles\r\n  and responsibilities :<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Business\r\n  Analyst – AI Solutions, Investments Technology<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">As\r\n  a Business Analyst supporting AI initiatives for Investments Technology, you\r\n  will partner with business and technology teams to define requirements,\r\n  analyze data, and help shape AI-enabled solutions, including information\r\n  agents and related automation capabilities. You will translate business needs\r\n  into clear functional requirements, process flows, data needs, and success\r\n  measures to support delivery of practical, secure, and high-value AI use\r\n  cases for the Investments team.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Primary\r\n  Responsibilities:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Partner\r\n  with Investments business and technology stakeholders to identify, clarify,\r\n  and prioritize AI use cases that improve decision support, information\r\n  access, and process efficiency<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Elicit,\r\n  document, and validate business, functional, data, and reporting requirements\r\n  for AI solutions, including information agents and analytics-driven workflows<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Analyze\r\n  structured and unstructured data to assess data quality, define required\r\n  inputs, identify gaps, and support AI solution design and business readiness<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Work\r\n  with product, engineering, data, and architecture teams to translate business\r\n  requirements into actionable user stories, process flows, data\r\n  specifications, and acceptance criteria<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Define\r\n  and document business rules, data definitions, usage guidelines, controls,\r\n  and traceability needed to support trustworthy AI outcomes<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Perform\r\n  data analysis, trend analysis, and business process analysis to support\r\n  requirements definition, solution evaluation, and benefit realization<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Support\r\n  evaluation of external data sources, AI tools, and vendor capabilities\r\n  relevant to Investments use cases<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Partner\r\n  in testing and validation activities by defining test scenarios, expected\r\n  outcomes, and business acceptance criteria for AI-enabled capabilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Facilitate\r\n  interviews, workshops, and working sessions to align stakeholders on problem\r\n  statements, requirements, data needs, risks, and success metrics<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The\r\n  successful candidate should exhibit the following skills and abilities:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Requirements\r\n  Definition and Analysis - Demonstrated ability to gather, structure, and\r\n  validate business and functional requirements, define scope, and translate\r\n  needs into actionable deliverables for technology teams<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Investments\r\n  Business Knowledge - Understanding of capital markets, investment workflows,\r\n  and key data domains across Fixed Income, Equities, Alternatives,\r\n  Derivatives, and Real Estate<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Business\r\n  and Data Analysis - Strong ability to analyze business processes and data,\r\n  identify patterns and gaps, and develop insights that improve requirements\r\n  quality and solution outcomes<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;AI\r\n  Fluency, Communication and Facilitation - Ability to explain AI concepts,\r\n  assumptions, risks, and outputs in business terms, facilitate\r\n  cross-functional discussions, and communicate clearly with both business and\r\n  technical stakeholders<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Technical\r\n  and Analytical Skills<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;SQL\r\n  and data query experience for profiling, validating, and analyzing business\r\n  data<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Working\r\n  knowledge of relational databases, data structures, and data lineage concepts<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Experience\r\n  with reporting, dashboard, and analysis tools such as Power BI, Excel, or\r\n  similar business intelligence platforms<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Familiarity\r\n  with AI, generative AI, or information agent concepts and the ability to\r\n  support requirement definition for these solutions<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;3-5\r\n  years of experience in business analysis, data analysis, or technology\r\n  delivery within a financial institution; Investments experience strongly\r\n  preferred<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Hands-on\r\n  participation in technology projects using structured delivery methods,\r\n  including requirements gathering, testing support, and stakeholder alignment<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Experience\r\n  facilitating workshops and working sessions with associates across business\r\n  and technology organizations<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Experience\r\n  using data analysis and query tools to investigate issues, evaluate trends,\r\n  and support business decisions<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;College\r\n  degree required with focus in Business, Finance, MIS, Analytics, Information\r\n  Systems, or related field<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">§&nbsp;&nbsp;Advanced\r\n  degree or relevant certifications in business analysis, data analytics, AI,\r\n  or investments are a plus<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-02', '19:30:00', '19:45:00', '2026-06-02 13:56:51', '2026-06-02 14:50:06', 53, '2026-06-02 13:43:01', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-549@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
