 class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><a href=\"mailto:trife@cwsapartments.com\" target=\"_blank\">trife@cwsapartments.com</a><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"1072\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:804.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"544\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:407.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-ligatures:none\">Microsoft Teams meeting<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-ligatures:none\">Join: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/230042977020517?p=irfhnq7cAwqhJ8Tkmr\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/230042977020517?p=irfhnq7cAwqhJ8Tkmr</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-ligatures:none\">Meeting ID: 230 042 977 020 517<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-ligatures:none\">Passcode: 73Fa2XP6<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"1072\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:804.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"544\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:407.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Job Description<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>CWS Purpose: <i>Enhancing Lives the CWS Way</i><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>CWS Values:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Honoring Our Word : Do what you say you will\r\n  do.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>&nbsp;Ethical Dealings are Paramount : Do the\r\n  right thing all the time, every time.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>A Respect for People : Treat others the way you\r\n  want to be treated<i>.</i>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Requirement for Profitability and Sustainability :\r\n  Bring value to our employees, residents and investors in a company designed\r\n  for the long term.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>A Demand for Excellence with a Sense of Urgency :\r\n  Be intentional. Be accurate. Be timely. CARE.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>What’s Your Purpose?<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Connect&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp; Engage&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n  Serve<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>What You Will Do<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>The Director of Business Intelligence will lead the\r\n  design, development, and delivery of BI dashboards and reports while\r\n  providing leadership to a reporting and analytics team. &nbsp;This role\r\n  combines hands‑on development with mentorship, standards enforcement, and\r\n  collaboration across the business to drive consistent, high‑quality reporting\r\n  solutions.<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>What Your Day Consists Of<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Power BI Development<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Design, develop, and\r\n       maintain BI reports, dashboards, and datasets<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Translate business\r\n       requirements into clear, actionable data visualizations<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Build and optimize\r\n       data models<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Integrate data\r\n       from multiple sources<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Ensure report\r\n       performance, scalability, and data accuracy<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Implement row‑level\r\n       security (RLS) and data governance standards<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Troubleshoot and\r\n       resolve data quality and performance issues<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Team Leadership &amp; Ownership<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Lead, mentor, and\r\n       support a team of analysts<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Establish and enforce\r\n       reporting standards, best practices, and design guidelines<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Review team\r\n       deliverables for accuracy, performance, and usability<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Prioritize work,\r\n       manage workloads, and coordinate delivery timelines<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Act as a technical\r\n       escalation point for complex BI and data modeling issues<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Collaborate with\r\n       stakeholders to align team output with business priorities<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Support onboarding,\r\n       training, and skill development within the team<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Drive continuous\r\n       improvement in reporting processes and tools<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>What You Bring To Us<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Qualifications<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Experience developing\r\n       reports and dashboards in Microsoft Power BI<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>knowledge of DAX,\r\n       Power Query (M), and data modeling<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Experience with\r\n       SQL and relational databases<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Ability to lead or\r\n       mentor team members<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Understanding of data\r\n       visualization and UX best practices<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Ability to translate\r\n       business needs into scalable technical solutions<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Excellent\r\n       communication and stakeholder management skills<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Technical Skills<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Power BI Desktop<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>DAX &amp; Power Query<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>SQL<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Data modeling<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Excel, CSV, and cloud\r\n       based data sources<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Documentation and\r\n       version control practices<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Soft Skills<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Leadership and\r\n       mentorship capability<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Strong attention to\r\n       detail and quality<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Collaborative,\r\n       customer‑focused mindset<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Ability to manage\r\n       multiple priorities and deadlines<o:p></o:p></b></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i>This job description is not designed to cover or\r\n  contain a comprehensive listing of activities, duties or responsibilities\r\n  that are required of the employee. The above statements are intended to\r\n  describe the general nature and level of work being performed.</i><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-02', '00:30:00', '01:30:00', '2026-06-02 18:57:01', '2026-06-02 20:00:36', 63, '2026-06-02 13:44:57', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-550@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
