-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Using one or more\r\n  programming languages (e.g. Python, R) for data analysis<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Cleaning,\r\n  transforming, and validating data from multiple sources<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Preferred experience\r\n  building predictive models (e.g. machine learning, regression, multivariate\r\n  analysis) and conducting statistical analyses<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Strong experience\r\n  with Tableau, including developing dashboards and visual analyses that\r\n  support decision-making<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Ability to translate\r\n  ambiguous problems into structured analyses and actionable recommendations<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Strong written and\r\n  verbal communication skills, including presenting findings to non-technical\r\n  and senior audiences<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">This is a hybrid\r\n  role (in-office on Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Travel: typical\r\n  travel is 5-10%</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">What We’ll\r\n  Provide:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">More than just pay,\r\n  our DaVita Rewards package connects teammates to what matters most. Teammates\r\n  are eligible to begin receiving benefits on the first day of the month\r\n  following or coinciding with one month of continuous employment. Below are\r\n  some of our benefit offerings.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n  &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Comprehensive\r\n  benefits:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"> Medical,\r\n  dental, vision, 401(k) match, paid time off, PTO cash out&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Support\r\n  for you and your family:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"> Family\r\n  resources, EAP counseling sessions, access Headspace®, backup child and elder\r\n  care, maternity/paternity leave and more&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Professional\r\n  development programs: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">DaVita offers a\r\n  variety of programs to help strong performers grow within their career and\r\n  also offers on-demand virtual leadership and development courses through\r\n  DaVita’s online training platform StarLearning.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">&nbsp;#LI-CM2</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">At DaVita, we strive\r\n  to be a community first and a company second. &nbsp;We want all teammates to\r\n  experience DaVita as \"a place where I belong.\" &nbsp;Our goal is to\r\n  embed belonging into everything we do in our Village, so that it becomes part\r\n  of who we are. We are proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and comply\r\n  with state and federal affirmative action requirements. Individuals are\r\n  recruited, hired, assigned and promoted without regard to race, national\r\n  origin, religion, age, color, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity,\r\n  disability, protected veteran status, or any other protected characteristic.</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-02', '03:00:00', '03:30:00', '2026-06-02 21:04:54', '2026-06-02 22:02:34', 57, '2026-06-02 14:03:53', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-551@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `client_id`, `candidate_id`, `poc_id`, `task_type_id`, `status_id`, `title`, `description`, `due_date`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `task_start_time`, `task_end_time`, `duration`, `created_at`, `total_amount`, `payment_status_id`, `payment_mode`, `paid_at`, `reference_no`, `payment_notes`, `email_thread_id`, `invoice_id`, `billing_status`) VALUES
(552, 9, 120, 6, 1, 4, 'FW: Technical Interview With Keystone for LOKESH KOLLEPARA-Tuesday, June 02 - Tomorrow • 11:00 AM – 12:00 PM', '<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Hello Team,</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Below are the details of the technical interview we received from <b><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Keystone</span></b></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">for </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">LOKESH KOLLEPARA</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">. Please assist him with\r\ninterview preparation and support</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Tomorrow\r\n• 11:00 AM – 12:00 PM</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Lokesh\r\nKollepara &lt;&gt; Keystone<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\r\n id=\"_x0000_t75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\"\r\n path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\r\n <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\r\n <v:formulas>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\r\n </v:formulas>\r\n <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\r\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"x_Picture_x0020_3\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\r\n alt=\"https://www.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/images/calendar/daynumberillustrations/day_number_illustration_02.png\"\r\n style=\'width:66pt;height:66pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/Admin1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.jpg\"\r\n  o:href=\"cid:image001.jpg@01DCF1D9.D061A650\"/>\r\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img width=\"88\" height=\"88\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"height:.916in;width:.916in\" alt=\"https://www.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/images/calendar/daynumberillustrations/day_number_illustration_02.png\" border=\"0\" v:shapes=\"x_Picture_x0020_3\"><!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span class=\"xmsohyperlink\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=https%3A%2F%2Fkeystonestrategy.zoom.us%2Fj%2F82101414600%3Fpwd%3DOaxpkpOFSPuR65NT5taHtWX4bU0Af3.1\" target=\"_blank\">https://keystonestrategy.zoom.us/j/82101414600?pwd=OaxpkpOFSPuR65NT5taHtWX4bU0Af3.1</a></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Anna\r\nLischke - Organizer<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"mailto:phill@perkinsandassociates.com\">phill@perkinsandassociates.com</a>\r\n&amp; Eva Ward<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">On your\r\nGoogle Calendar</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Previous\r\nevent: Daily Touchpoint at 10:30 AM – 11:00 AM<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">About\r\nthe Role</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">As an AI\r\nProduct Engineer on the KAIML team, you will build and scale AI-powered<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">applications\r\nthat support Keystone’s litigation, regulatory, investigative, and strategic<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">advisory\r\nwork.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">This is a\r\nfull-stack engineering role focused on productization. You will take proof-of-<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">concepts\r\ndeveloped by Forward Deployed AI Engineers and transform them into<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">secure,\r\nscalable, production-grade products. You’ll own architecture decisions, build<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">robust\r\nbackend and frontend systems, manage releases, and ensure the reliability and<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">maintainability\r\nof AI tools deployed across the firm and to select clients.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">AI Product\r\nEngineers at Keystone operate like startup engineers inside a consulting<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">firm:\r\nmoving quickly from prototype to launch while maintaining production standards<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">appropriate\r\nfor high-stakes use cases.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">What\r\nYou’ll Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Lead the\r\nend-to-end productization of AI tools, translating POCs into secure,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">scalable,\r\nproduction-ready systems<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Design and\r\nimplement full-stack architectures, including frontend interfaces,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">backend\r\nservices, data pipelines, and model integrations in collaboration with<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Keystone’s\r\ndata engineering team<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Own\r\napplication reliability, performance, and maintainability across beta releases<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">and\r\nproduction environments<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Collaborate\r\nclosely with Forward Deployed AI Engineers to refine requirements<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">and\r\nprioritize features based on real-world usage<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Manage product\r\nreleases, including beta programs, user testing, feature<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">iteration,\r\nand launch readiness<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Build new\r\nfeatures in alignment with evolving product roadmaps and practice<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">priorities<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Intake,\r\ndiagnose, and resolve user-reported issues and bugs; implement<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">monitoring\r\nand logging to proactively surface problems<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Maintain\r\ntechnical documentation and contribute to roadmap planning, effort<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">estimation,\r\nand resource forecasting<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> Continuously\r\nevaluate improvements to architecture, model integration patterns,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">and system\r\ndesign to enhance performance and scalability<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Details:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"925\" style=\"width: 693.5pt;\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:27.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"311\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.25pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 27pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">First\r\n  Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"601\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:450.9pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:27.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Lokesh<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"317\" style=\"width:237.75pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-left:\r\n  none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:27.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:13.8pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"311\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.25pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  bord