\n    <td width=\"543\" style=\"width: 407.55pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.1pt;\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"0\">\r\n     <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;\r\n      height:16.5pt\">\r\n      <td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in; height: 16.5pt;\"></td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"0\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td width=\"730\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:547.8pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n      <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"730\" style=\"width: 547.8pt;\">\r\n       <tbody><tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n        <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>MUFG&nbsp;</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><u>Total Candidate Experience 4+ years</u></b>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:29.4pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"321\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:240.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\r\n  height:29.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">JPMorgan Chase (Chase Bank) Massachusetts, USA<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"428\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:320.95pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:29.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Aug 2024 – Present<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:28.95pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"321\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:240.9pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:28.95pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Deloitte India (USI) Hyderabad, India<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"428\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:320.95pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:28.95pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Jul 2020 - Jul 2023<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>&nbsp;</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Job Description</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Responsibilities</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Independently responsible for the development and\r\nexecution of technical specifications, including SQL Server Database design and\r\ndevelopment, and security architecture; scripting of database objects; and\r\ndeveloping/deploying of ASP.NET Core MVC framework to create modern versions of\r\nexisting legacy tactical solutions; and App server development (interface\r\narchitecture and automated version update deployment)</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Leading the performance of business analysis and scope,\r\nand objectives for enhancement of and development and modification to Leverage\r\nLending Calculator and Compliance Checklist applications; maintaining and\r\nenhancing underlying database code; and facilitating sign-off of specifications\r\nwith business stakeholders</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Responsible for development of detailed analysis of\r\nrequirements for stakeholders (business specifications, hardware requirements,\r\nsoftware requirements) for development; acting as lead representative for team\r\nin interactions with business and technology stakeholders to represent\r\ncustomers’ needs in larger strategic projects</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Key team member responsible for System Development\r\nLifecycle and how it integrates into development, testing and production\r\nenvironments for current and upcoming Credit Risk Solutions created by the\r\nSmall Apps Team; and utilizing knowledge of the enterprise data architecture\r\nrealizing the role Credit Risk Solutions perform in upstream and downstream\r\nsystems</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Acting as Principal technical support to resolve\r\napplication issues for Small Apps system users</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Qualification</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><i>Represents the skills you have</i><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Find out how your skills align with this job\'s\r\nrequirements. If anything seems off, you can easily click on the\r\ntags to select or unselect skills to reflect your actual expertise.</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>SQL Server Database Design</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>ASP.NET Core MVC</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>C#</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>T-SQL</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Stored Procedures</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>HTML5</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Java</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>JQuery</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>CSS</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC)</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Messaging Middleware (MQ)</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Windows Batch Scripting</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Linux Batch Scripting</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Business Analysis</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Problem Solving</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Required</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Bachelor\'s degree in Computer Science, Computer\r\nEngineering, Information Technology, or a related field (or foreign equivalent\r\ndegree)</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>3 years of Business Analysis and Object Oriented\r\nProgramming experience building web and desktop applications in C#, .Net 6, MVC\r\nand CORE Frameworks</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Performing database design and implementation (T-SQL,\r\nStored Procedures, Index Functions, Views and Cursors)</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Building customer facing solutions using HTML5, Java,\r\nC#, jQuery and CSS</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Applying enterprise design patterns, collections and\r\nmultithreading with messaging middleware (MQ)</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Developing Windows or Linux batch scripts</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Experience with Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC)\r\nprocess</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Writing ad hoc SQL queries</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Experience in the financial/banking industry creating\r\nend-user computing modules for Risk Management</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Position requires employment in-office 4 days per week\r\nand remotely 1 day per week</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-06-02', '03:30:00', '04:00:00', '2026-06-02 21:54:21', '2026-06-02 22:30:49', 36, '2026-06-02 15:39:13', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-555@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
