; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 40.8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>HCLTech</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"168\" style=\"width: 126.2pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt; height: 40.8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">May 2019 – Aug 2021<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job description</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">RadixArk&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Product\r\nManager</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Palo\r\nAlto, CA</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Key\r\nResponsibilities</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Product\r\nStrategy &amp; Roadmap</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Define,\r\nprioritize, and drive the product roadmap for inference and training\r\ninfrastructure.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Stay\r\nahead of AI trends, including new model architectures, hardware optimizations,\r\nand open-source developments.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Balance\r\nqualitative insights (partner feedback, community discussions) with\r\nquantitative metrics (benchmarks, system performance) to inform roadmap\r\ndecisions.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Collaborate\r\nclosely with research and engineering teams, participating in design reviews\r\nand technical discussions to evaluate trade-offs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Translate\r\ncomplex technical capabilities into clear user stories, product requirements,\r\nand actionable deliverables.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Act\r\nas a trusted partner to engineering teams, removing blockers by clarifying\r\nrequirements and managing scope.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">User\r\nEngagement &amp; Growth</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Serve\r\nas the main point of contact for early adopters and partners, gathering\r\nfeedback to guide product iterations.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Support\r\nGo-to-Market initiatives, including creating technical content (blogs,\r\ndocumentation, social assets) and engaging with developer communities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Use\r\ndata and user research to validate hypotheses and measure the impact of product\r\nlaunches.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Qualifications</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Minimum\r\nRequirements</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor\'s\r\nor Master\'s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical\r\nfield.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">3+\r\nyears of experience in Product Management or a related technical role\r\n(Engineering, Solutions Architecture) in a software company.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong\r\ntechnical fluency in AI/ML infrastructure; comfortable discussing system\r\narchitecture and reading technical documentation.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Excellent\r\ncommunication skills, able to clearly explain complex technical concepts to\r\ntechnical and non-technical stakeholders.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Preferred\r\n(Bonus) Qualifications</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Hands-on\r\ncoding skills (Python, C++ etc); experience contributing to open-source\r\ncommunities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\ncreating content for developer audiences (blogs, social media) or organizing\r\ntech events/hackathons.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Data-driven\r\nmindset with experience using analytics to drive product decisions.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience\r\nconducting user research and interviews to uncover user pain points.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">B2B\r\nor developer-facing product experience.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Benefits</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Competitive\r\nsalary and equity package.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Work\r\nwith a world-class team from xAI, Google, and leading research labs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Directly\r\nimpact the future of open AI infrastructure.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About\r\nRadixArk</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">RadixArk\r\nis an infrastructure-first company built by engineers who\'ve shipped production\r\nAI systems, created SGLang (20K+ GitHub stars, the fastest open LLM serving\r\nengine), and developed Miles (our large-scale RL framework).</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">We\'re\r\non a mission to democratize frontier-level AI infrastructure by building\r\nworld-class open systems for inference and training.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Our\r\nteam has optimized kernels serving billions of tokens daily, designed\r\ndistributed training systems coordinating 10,000+ GPUs, and contributed to\r\ninfrastructure that powers leading AI companies and research labs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">We\'re\r\nbacked by well-known infrastructure investors and partner with Nvidia, Google,\r\nAWS, and frontier AI labs.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Join\r\nus in building infrastructure that gives real leverage back to the AI\r\ncommunity.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Compensation</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">We\r\noffer competitive compensation with equity,comprehensive health benefits,and\r\nflexible work arrangements. Compensation is determined by location,level,and\r\nexperience.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Equal\r\nOpportunity</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">RadixArk\r\nis an Equal Opportunity Employer and is proud to offer equal employment\r\nopportunity to everyone regardless of\r\nrace,color,ancestry,religion,sex,nationalorigin,sexual\r\norientation,age,citizenship,marital status, disability,gender identity,veteran\r\nstatus,and more.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-06-02', '23:00:00', '23:30:00', '2026-06-02 17:26:36', '2026-06-02 18:07:05', 40, '2026-06-02 15:44:40', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-556@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
