led workflows using python<br>\r\n  - Knowledge of LLM, Prompt Engineering, RAG Architecture, Agentic AI.<br>\r\n  - Basic knowledge of Hybrid prompting technique<br>\r\n  - Knowledge in Generative AI tools like LangChain, Hugging Face, Llama Index\r\n  etc.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Good to have:<br>\r\n  - Working experience with Gemini LLM<br>\r\n  - Hands-on knowledge in machine learning frameworks like PyTorch, TensorFlow,\r\n  Keras<br>\r\n  - Hands-On knowledge on NLP<br>\r\n  - Understanding of model deployment and containerization (Docker).<br>\r\n  - Understanding of version control systems (Git).<br>\r\n  - Awareness of AI compliance, data privacy, and responsible AI principles<br>\r\n  Roles &amp; Responsibilities<br>\r\n  - AI workflow development<br>\r\n  - Prompt engineering<br>\r\n  - Deployment and maintenance of AI models across all environments including\r\n  Production.<br>\r\n  - Code review, testing and documentation<br>\r\n  - Continuous learning in Generative AI related fields<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-06-02', '01:00:00', '01:30:00', '2026-06-02 19:33:41', '2026-06-02 19:43:52', 10, '2026-06-02 16:53:18', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-559@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
