:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1199\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:898.95pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:\r\n  9.0pt;mso-element-wrap:around;mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;\r\n  mso-element-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">NA<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-02', '00:00:00', '01:00:00', '2026-06-02 19:14:22', '2026-06-02 19:14:39', 0, '2026-06-02 18:56:15', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-560@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(561, 8, 227, 7, 6, 4, 'FW: TAC [ Shivam Dhanpalwar - Data Analyst]', '<p>Hello Team,&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nI hope you are doing well.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I have a candidate, Shivam Dhanpalwar, who needs to complete a technical\r\nassessment. He has been assigned this assessment.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Candidate Contact No: +1 6787490860<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I have attached the assessment for your reference. Your assistance in\r\nfacilitating this process is highly appreciated.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Candidate is available today from 3 PM onwards at any time. Please feel free\r\nto coordinate accordingly.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">If you have any questions or need further\r\ninformation, please feel free to reach out.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-weight:normal\">Hello Shivam,<o:p></o:p></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Thank you for\r\nyour interest in Amazon! The next step of the application process is the online\r\nassessment. The assessment that you are about to complete is an important part\r\nof the hiring process to help us learn more about you. Please complete this\r\nonline assessment in the next two weeks. If you do not complete, you will not\r\nmove forward in the hiring process.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Before\r\nbeginning your online assessment, please review the following instructions and\r\nhelpful hints:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Do not click the <b>Start\r\nMy Assessment</b> link below until you\'re ready to start and complete the\r\nassessment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Complete the assessment\r\nas soon as possible.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Take the assessment in\r\na quiet, distraction-free environment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Set aside at least 50\r\nminutes in a place where you can focus.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Ensure you have a\r\nreliable internet connection during the assessment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">While you are able to\r\nuse a mobile device to take the assessment, we recommend completing it on a\r\nlarger screen such as a tablet, laptop, or desktop computer.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">You can find more\r\ninformation on assessments at Amazon here:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://g3s6mz1j.r.us-west-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.amazon.jobs%2Fen%2Flanding_pages%2Fassessments/1/0101019e8925a443-2f67c7b6-8ec8-4cd6-b524-f30aac24a286-000000/FwBvdysLvFSofufW5BbXUVz7Chc=474\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.amazon.jobs/en/landing_pages/assessments</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">If you have a\r\ndisability and need a workplace accommodation or adjustment during the\r\napplication and hiring process, including support for the interview or\r\nonboarding process, please visit <a href=\"https://g3s6mz1j.r.us-west-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Famazon.jobs%2Fcontent%2Fen%2Fhow-we-hire%2Faccommodations/1/0101019e8925a443-2f67c7b6-8ec8-4cd6-b524-f30aac24a286-000000/wlQ3DbMkANyepkkZtnoGEbnk-Ug=474\" target=\"_blank\">https://amazon.jobs/content/en/how-we-hire/accommodations</a> for\r\nmore information. If the country/region you’re applying in isn’t listed, please\r\ncontact your Recruiting Partner.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">After completing the\r\nassessment, you can take an optional feedback survey.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">You will know you have\r\ncompleted the entire assessment when you see the confirmation page at the end.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">To begin\r\nyour assessment, use the link below:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://g3s6mz1j.r.us-west-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fsso.assessments.amazon.jobs%2F%3Fauth=Z9_OofyzDQSbv6P_rgC1ph7BfdEu4Jyg7-dQJNS_8lE%26aaHashRoute=%2Fassessment%2FHire_4c27d698-45d7-44b8-a624-aa1027ea7286/1/0101019e8925a443-2f67c7b6-8ec8-4cd6-b524-f30aac24a286-000000/riSd2FMMmWu--6lzs9x0Wg10GkQ=474\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:#232F3E;background:#FF8900\">Start\r\nMy Assessment</span></b></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Note: This\r\nlink is unique to you.</span></i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom:0in;font-size:unset\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Troubleshooting<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n     tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">For any technical issues, refer\r\n     to the troubleshooting guides in the assessment. If those do not work,\r\n     examine closely where you left off, log out, and log back in using the\r\n     link above. Please do not repeatedly refresh the screen. If technical\r\n     issues cannot be resolved, please contact your recruiter immediately.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">We recognize\r\nthis is an investment of your time. We value the people we hire and we\r\nappreciate your interest in Amazon. You will be contacted in the event we\r\ndecide to move forward with your application.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom:0in;font-size:unset\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">FAQs<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Want\r\nto catch a glimpse of how it\'s like working at Amazon?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">You\r\ncan refer to <a href=\"https://g3s6mz1j.r.us-west-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.amazon.jobs%2Fen%2Flanding_pages%2Fworking-at-amazon/1/0101019e8925a443-2f67c7b6-8ec8-4cd6-b524-f30aac24a286-000000/_EmrK9XrGzb37jfcgclMzj8HAoE=474\" target=\"_blank\">amazon.jobs</a>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">How\r\ncan I best prepare for the assessment?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Review\r\nthe <a href=\"https://g3s6mz1j.r.us-west-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.amazon.jobs%2Fen%2Flanding_pages%2Fassessments/2/0101019e8925a443-2f67c7b6-8ec8-4cd6-b524-f30aac24a286-000000/x6jA7VkIbXtVJ5JVQD-_mlIg5oU=474\" target=\"_blank\">Assessments page on Amazon.jobs</a>. Set aside an appropriate\r\namount of time and finding a quiet location will be important. Don’t forget a\r\nstrong Internet connection is also key.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I\r\ncannot complete the Online Assessment within the number of days allocated. May\r\nI request an extension?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Yes;\r\nhowever, Amazon hires on a rolling basis and a delay in completing the online\r\nassessment may impact your candidacy. If you require an extension, please email\r\nyour recruiter and our team will follow up within three business days of your\r\nemail.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Can\r\nI take a break during the assessment?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Sure!\r\nWe suggest taking a quick break in between evaluation modules or sections.\r\nStretch, move around, or grab a cup of water before finishing the rest of the\r\nassessment. You don’t need to log out to take a quick break. If for some reason\r\nyou do need to interrupt your session and log out, you can click on the “Start\r\nthe assessment” link to log back in and resume.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">What\r\nshould I do if I experience technical issues?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">For\r\nany technical issues, refer to the technical support guides in the assessment.\r\nIf those do not work, examine closely where you left off, log out, and log back\r\nin using the link above. Please do not repeatedly refresh the screen.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">How\r\ncan I be sure that I have submitted the assessment successfully?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">You\'ll\r\nsee a confirmation page at the end of the assessment and receive an email\r\nconfirmation within a few minutes of your submission.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Best regards,<br>\r\n<b>Amazon Recruiting Team</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Amazon is an equal opportunity employer. Protecting your privacy and the\r\nsecurity of your data are longstanding top priorities for Amazon. If you are an\r\nexternal candidate, please consult our <a href=\"https://g3s6mz1j.r.us-west-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Famazon.jobs%2Fprivacy%2Fglobal/1/0101019e8925a443-2f67c7b6-8ec8-4cd6-b524-f30aac24a286-000000/yBB5OBac8FifAuggnUyC8mjO7ns=474\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Notice</a> to know more about how we collect, use,\r\nand transfer the personal data of our candidates. You can let us know if you do\r\nnot want to be contacted for recruitment purposes. Please refer to the\r\n\"What are my rights under applicable data protection laws?\" section\r\nof the <a href=\"https://g3s6mz1j.r.us-west-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Famazon.jobs%2Fprivacy%2Fglobal/2/0101019e8925a443-2f67c7b6-8ec8-4cd6-b524-f30aac24a286-000000/Yfbosc2upNmiI7hWgUlGQE0QQls=474\" target=\"_blank\">Notice</a> for more information. If you are an internal\r\ncandidate, please consult the <a href=\"https://g3s6mz1j.r.us-west-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.amazon.jobs%2Fen%2Finternal%2Fprivacy_page/1/0101019e8925a443-2f67c7b6-8ec8-4cd6-b524-f30aac24a286-000000/6va4Fgx8jh-VzyUg225neGBmS9Y=474\" target=\"_blank\">Employee Privacy Notice</a>.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><i><span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Please don\'t\r\nreply to this email, as we can\'t review or respond to messages at this address.<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>', '2026-06-02', '00:45:00', '01:45:00', '2026-06-02 19:49:30', '2026-06-02 20:39:18', 49, '2026-06-02 19:11:19', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-561@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
