have passed the CISA or CISSP exam and are actively\r\n  working toward full certification or endorsement.</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">You will work closely with senior auditors\r\n  and managers to review client evidence, test controls, prepare workpapers,\r\n  and help keep engagements organized.</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">This position is hybrid and is\r\n  currently based out of our office at:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n  &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">3020 Old Ranch Pkwy, Ste 300<br>\r\n  Seal Beach, CA 90740</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Candidates must be able to reliably work\r\n  on-site in Seal Beach as scheduled.</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">What You’ll Do</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Assist with SOC 2\r\n  audit engagements from evidence collection through testing and documentation.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Review client-submitted audit\r\n       evidence for completeness, relevance, and accuracy.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Test controls under\r\n       supervision, including access controls, change management, vendor\r\n       management, security monitoring, incident response, and policy controls.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Maintain organized audit\r\n       workpapers, trackers, evidence folders, and testing notes.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Identify missing, incomplete,\r\n       or unclear evidence and draft follow-up requests.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Document exceptions,\r\n       observations, and open items for senior auditor review.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Assist with control\r\n       walkthrough notes and internal audit preparation.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Support audit-related\r\n       administrative tasks, including scheduling, reminders, status updates,\r\n       and file organization.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Learn and apply SOC 2 Trust\r\n       Services Criteria and ConstellationGRC audit methodology.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Required Qualifications</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n  margin-left:.5in;text-indent:0in;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#222222\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-heigh