    cybersecurity, IT controls, audit, risk, or compliance.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong attention to detail\r\n       and ability to follow structured audit procedures.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Clear written communication\r\n       skills.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Comfortable reviewing\r\n       screenshots, system exports, policies, tickets, logs, and access\r\n       reports.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in;line-height:1.5rem;\r\n       align-self: start\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Proficiency with\r\n       spreadsheets, Google Workspace or Microsoft 365, and common business\r\n       tools.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#222222;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\n       auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:li