0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">NA<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"397\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Senior\r\n  SAP FSCD Business AnalystLocation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Hybrid\r\n  onsite 3 days per week from one of the following office <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Locations:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Charlotte, NC<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Conshohocken, PA<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Alpharetta, GA<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Chicago, IL<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Denver, CO<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Fargo, ND<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Houston, TX<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Lubbock, TX<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Mt. Juliet, TN<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Preferred\r\n  location:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Charlotte, NC<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Candidates\r\n  must be comfortable working onsite from day one. This team currently operates\r\n  in a hybrid environment, though there is potential for a full onsite schedule\r\n  in the future.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Compensation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Targeting\r\n  approximately $80/hr depending on experience and overall alignment.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Position\r\n  Overview<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">An\r\n  enterprise insurance organization is seeking a Senior SAP FSCD Business\r\n  Analyst to support ongoing SAP financial systems initiatives focused on\r\n  collections, disbursements, and enterprise financial operations.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">This\r\n  is a highly visible role supporting long term SAP initiatives within a large\r\n  scale enterprise environment. The team is looking for someone with strong SAP\r\n  FS-CD expertise combined with business analysis, stakeholder communication,\r\n  configuration, and documentation experience.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Responsibilities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Support enterprise SAP FS-CD initiatives within a large insurance environment<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Gather, document, and validate business and functional requirements<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Support collections, disbursements, payments, broker reporting, account\r\n  maintenance, and related FS-CD functions<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Lead and support UAT planning, testing, and validation activities<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Assist with SAP configuration and functional analysis efforts<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Partner closely with business stakeholders, technical teams, QA teams, and\r\n  leadership groups<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Create and maintain process documentation, workflows, and functional\r\n  specifications<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Help improve and streamline financial operations and reporting processes<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Required\r\n  Experience<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Strong hands on SAP FS-CD experience<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Experience working as a Business Analyst within enterprise SAP environments<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Experience supporting collections, disbursements, payments, account\r\n  maintenance, broker reporting, or related FS-CD functions<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Strong requirements gathering and documentation experience<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Experience supporting UAT planning and execution<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Ability to communicate effectively with both technical and non technical\r\n  stakeholders<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Strong professionalism and communication skills within enterprise\r\n  environments<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Preferred\r\n  Experience<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Insurance industry experience strongly preferred<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Banking or broader financial services experience may also be considered<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Experience with General Ledger (GL) processes is a plus<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  8+ years of overall SAP experience preferred<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  Bachelor’s Degree required<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•\r\n  MBA or advanced degree preferred<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-03', '19:30:00', '20:00:00', '2026-06-03 13:28:12', '2026-06-03 14:00:35', 32, '2026-06-03 13:25:01', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-564@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
