 border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1152\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:864.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">NA<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1152\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:864.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:\r\n   0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:0in;mso-yfti-tbllook:\r\n     1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n     <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;\r\n      height:60.75pt\">\r\n      <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 21.0pt 0in;height:60.75pt\">\r\n      <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n      color:#222222\">Microsoft Teams meeting<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n      <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n      color:#222222\">Join: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/283604087322556?p=aFJLnjVKf8W6y1UUAR\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/283604087322556?p=aFJLnjVKf8W6y1UUAR</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n      <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n      color:#222222\">Meeting ID: 283 604 087 322 556<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n      <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n      color:#222222\">Passcode: ik7k4nP7<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1152\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:864.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">POSITION\r\n  SUMMARY</span></u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The <i>Product\r\n  Cost Specialist - Switchgear </i>primary focus is to support the SWGR\r\n  Cost Manager - UL to hit product cost targets through collaboration with\r\n  Engineering, Procurement, and Operations to position our product costs below\r\n  that of competition. Reporting to the Global Product Management Director, and\r\n  following day to day guidance of the SWGR Cost Manager, this role supports\r\n  the overall process of Product Cost reporting, review, and prioritized cost\r\n  improvement action execution for the assigned group of products. Supporting a\r\n  robust product costing program, this role will ensure that Vertiv is able to\r\n  manufacture best cost-competitive products with a focus on: (1) Driving\r\n  reduction in product cost, closely collaborating with Regional Strategy\r\n  (quotations team), Order Engineering, R&amp;D, Procurement, Operations, and\r\n  Finance to position our products below that of our competition, and (2)\r\n  Ensuring offering managers and other business stakeholders have a clear\r\n  understanding of product costs and the elements of those costs including\r\n  material and manufacturing costs. (3) Support reporting on R&amp;D\r\n  development projects as it pertains to cost estimates and project cost\r\n  controlling. (4) Work closely with operations and procurement to ensure that\r\n  the functional design building blocks are properly costed and represented in\r\n  the CPQ Configuration tool. (5) Support the Cost Manager and report on list\r\n  price activities and price realization associated with VCM (variable cost\r\n  margin) calculations. (6) Support the Cost Manager’s activities associated\r\n  with VAVE (Value Add Value Engineer) activities across the business with key\r\n  stakeholders and action owners.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Responsibilities:</span></u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Support product cost reporting capability and cadence of\r\n  review. (Continual cost &amp; margin monitoring). Link this back to monthly\r\n  VCM measures.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Perform cost variance reporting. Understand product cost\r\n  structure, identify, and analyze quarterly variances.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Establish product cost comparison among different\r\n  manufacturing plants internally and externally, including outside\r\n  purchase/manufacturing options.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Work with product cross-functional team (notably Regional\r\n  Strategy (pricing), Order Engineering, R&amp;D, Procurement, Operations and\r\n  Finance) to identify and drive product cost improvement metrics and actions.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Coordinating the identification, reporting, and execution\r\n  of VAVE (Value Analysis/Value Engineering) cost reduction projects and their\r\n  financial impact.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Reviewing and advising on target product cost as part of\r\n  NPDI and throughout the lifecycle of the product.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Report on R&amp;D budgets including time, material and lab\r\n  test time. Ensure financially that projects stay on track and under budget.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Requirements:</span></u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">B.S. in Engineering or General Management preferred,\r\n  equivalent experience in product engineering and manufacturing. Financial\r\n  experience in the greater NEMA Electrical Manufacturing space.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Demonstratable experience in Engineering / Supply Chain or\r\n  Manufacturing Operations and working with cross-functional teams to identify\r\n  and execute priority actions.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience in analyzing and driving improvement in data\r\n  reporting with Finance and IT systems.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Ability to deliver effective presentations of findings and\r\n  recommendations by creating visual summaries of quantitative cost\r\n  information. Build and continually improve dashboards to provide insight.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Ability to drive and accept change, continuous improvement\r\n  processes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Must have demonstratable skills with Microsoft office\r\n  applications, particularly Excel. Smartsheet and Power BI experience\r\n  beneficial. Oracle knowledge is a plus.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Be curious and self-motivated for training opportunities\r\n  based on job requirements and ancillary topics. Lifelong learner.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Preferred Qualifications:&nbsp;</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Comfortable working autonomously.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Excellent interpersonal skills and the ability to\r\n  influence work colleagues at all levels.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience in introducing new processes to an existing\r\n  organization.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Proven problem-solving abilities.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">PLM Process (product lifecycle management) and launch as\r\n  well as phase out products.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Power distribution industry experience (electrical\r\n  apparatus equipment 600V and below) or similar experience.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list 1.0in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Courier New&quot;;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">o<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Electrical components knowledge in the power distribution\r\n  space (breakers, meters, transformers, etc.) is another nice to have but now\r\n  a must.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">PHYSICAL\r\n  &amp; ENVIRONMENTAL DEMANDS</span></u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">No special physical requirements<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">TIME\r\n  TRAVEL REQUIRED</span></u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:20.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&lt;5%<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The\r\n  successful candidate will embrace Vertiv’s Core Principals &amp; Behaviors to\r\n  help execute our Strategic Priorities.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">OUR\r\n  CORE PRINCIPALS:&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Safety.&nbsp; Integrity.&nbsp; Respect.&nbsp;\r\n  Teamwork.&nbsp; Diversity &amp; Inclusion.</i><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">OUR\r\n  STRATEGIC PRIORITIES<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Customer Focus</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Operational Excellence</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  High-Performance Culture</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Innovation</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Financial Strength</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">OUR\r\n  BEHAVIORS<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Own It</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Act With Urgency</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Foster a Customer-First Mindset</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Think Big and Execute</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Lead by Example</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Drive Continuous Improvement</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">•&nbsp;\r\n  Learn and Seek Out Development</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  Vertiv<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Vertiv\r\n  is a $10.2 billion global critical infrastructure and data center\r\n  technology company. &nbsp;We ensure customers’ vital applications run\r\n  continuously by bringing together hardware, software, analytics, and ongoing\r\n  services. &nbsp;Our portfolio includes power, cooling and IT infrastructure\r\n  solutions and services that extends from the cloud to the edge of the\r\n  network. Headquartered in Columbus, Ohio, USA, Vertiv employs around 20,000\r\n  people and does business in more than 130 countries. Visit Vertiv.com to\r\n  learn more. &nbsp; &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Work\r\n  Authorization<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">No\r\n  calls or agencies please. Vertiv will only employ those who are legally\r\n  authorized to work in the United States. This is not a position for which\r\n  sponsorship will be provided. Individuals with temporary visas such as E,\r\n  F-1, H-1, H-2, L, B, J, or TN or who need sponsorship for work authorization\r\n  now or in the future, are not eligible for hire.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Equal\r\n  Opportunity Employer<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Vertiv\r\n  is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer. We promote equal\r\n  opportunities for all with respect to hiring, terms of employment, mobility,\r\n  training, compensation, and occupational health, without discrimination as to\r\n  age, race, color, religion, creed, sex, pregnancy status (including\r\n  childbirth, breastfeeding, or related medical conditions), marital status,\r\n  sexual orientation, gender identity / expression (including transgender\r\n  status or sexual stereotypes), genetic information, citizenship status,\r\n  national origin, protected veteran status, political affiliation, or\r\n  disability. If you have a disability and are having difficulty accessing or\r\n  using this website to apply for a position, you can request help by sending\r\n  an email to </span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><a href=\"mailto:help.join@vertiv.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>help.join@vertiv.com</i></a><i>.</i><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">#LI-RB1</span></i><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  the Team<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Work\r\n  Authorization</span></u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">No\r\n  calls or agencies please. Vertiv will only employ those who are legally\r\n  authorized to work in the United States. This is not a position for which\r\n  sponsorship will be provided. Individuals with temporary visas such as E,\r\n  F-1, H-1, H-2, L, B, J, or TN or who need sponsorship for work authorization\r\n  now or in the future, are not eligible for hire.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Equal\r\n  Opportunity Employer</span></u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">We\r\n  promote equal opportunities for all with respect to hiring, terms of\r\n  employment, mobility, training, compensation, and occupational health,\r\n  without discrimination as to age, race, color, religion, creed, sex,\r\n  pregnancy status (including childbirth, breastfeeding, or related medical\r\n  conditions), marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity / expression\r\n  (including transgender status or sexual stereotypes), genetic information,\r\n  citizenship status, national origin, protected veteran status, political affiliation,\r\n  or disability.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-04', '02:00:00', '02:30:00', '2026-06-04 21:32:35', '2026-06-04 21:32:44', 0, '2026-06-04 13:54:57', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-596@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
