 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p>4 Jun, 2026&nbsp; 11:30 to 12:15 PM EST&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Round Of Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">1st Round Technical</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">JD-What We\'re Looking For:<br>\r\n  We\'re thrilled to embark on the search for a seasoned Senior/Lead Data\r\n  Solution Engineer to join our vibrant team. This pivotal role offers an\r\n  exciting opportunity to shape the future of technology within our\r\n  organization. As a key member, you\'ll be tasked with designing and\r\n  implementing scalable data solutions and managing complex data migration\r\n  within our Business Applications Team.<br>\r\n  At Meltwater, it\'s not merely about the role you hold—it\'s an invitation to\r\n  delve into a world filled with personal and professional growth prospects.\r\n  Immerse yourself in an environment crafted to nurture skill refinement, where\r\n  mentorship thrives, and inclusive leadership reigns supreme. Engage closely\r\n  with seasoned professionals and inspirational leaders committed to guiding\r\n  you through every phase of your journey. Join our vibrant community, where\r\n  your individuality is honored, and you\'re empowered to unleash your utmost\r\n  potential. Together, let\'s embark on this journey and revolutionize our\r\n  approach to driving new business at Meltwater!<br>\r\n  What You’ll Do:<br>\r\n  Design and Implement Scalable Data Solutions<br>\r\n  Lead the design and implementation of innovative, scalable data solutions\r\n  using Snowflake and other cloud platforms, ensuring the data infrastructure\r\n  meets current and future business needs.<br>\r\n  Build and maintain data models, integrating data from CRM, product usage,\r\n  marketing, support, and finance systems to provide a unified and trusted view\r\n  of customers.<br>\r\n  Churn Modeling &amp; Analysis: Develop and implement models (including\r\n  predictive analytics and AI/ML approaches) to identify patterns and signals.<br>\r\n  BI &amp; Dashboard Development: Create and maintain high-impact dashboards,\r\n  reports, and alerts using BI tool (Tableau) to provide real-time visibility\r\n  into customer behavior, engagement metrics for leadership and business\r\n  stakeholders.<br>\r\n  Automation &amp; Workflow Optimization: Design and implement automated\r\n  workflows to trigger proactive interventions, such as alerts.<br>\r\n  Cross-Functional Collaboration: Partner closely with Sales, Marketing,\r\n  Customer Success, Product, and Finance teams to translate business needs into\r\n  technical data solutions.<br>\r\n  Analytics Insights<br>\r\n  Design and deliver analytics solutions to support Sales, Marketing, FP&amp;A\r\n  and Customer Success teams.<br>\r\n  Data Governance &amp; Quality: Establish common metric definitions and ensure\r\n  high data integrity, accuracy, and consistency across all data sources to\r\n  build trust and reliability in reporting.<br>\r\n  Build and maintain data pipelines: Own ingestion, transformation, and syncing\r\n  of CRM data, product-usage telemetry, billing data, and third-party\r\n  enrichment data in Redshift to support analytics workstreams.<br>\r\n  Ship dashboards, alerts, and decision-making tools: Improve telemetry into\r\n  business performance by building dashboards to track things.<br>\r\n  Own the BizApps roadmap: Partner with business teams to maintain a backlog of\r\n  technology engineering work. Proactively identify the next set of\r\n  capabilities that are needed.<br>\r\n  What You’ll Bring:<br>\r\n  Expert-level knowledge of Snowflake, AWS RDS, MySQL, and data modeling.<br>\r\n  Demonstrated ability to architect end-to-end scalable cloud data platforms,\r\n  supporting analytics, AI/ML, and operational use cases.<br>\r\n  Experience enabling and supporting AI/ML workflows, including feature\r\n  engineering, data preparation for models, and integration of predictive\r\n  insights into analytics platforms.<br>\r\n  Hands-on or working knowledge of Snowflake Cortex, including leveraging\r\n  native LLM and ML capabilities for use cases such as customer insights, churn\r\n  signals, text analysis, and automation.<br>\r\n  Proficient in SQL and Tableau with experience in building data sources and\r\n  dashboards for high-level business insights.<br>\r\n  Hands-on experience with ETL processes and tools (e.g., Fivetran, Boomi).<br>\r\n  Strong understanding of data security, compliance, and governance frameworks.<br>\r\n  Proven experience in cloud cost optimization and performance tuning.<br>\r\n  Capable of leading cross-functional teams and projects in a remote/offshore\r\n  environment.<br>\r\n  Expertise in Salesforce CRM, including designing and managing robust\r\n  integrations with Snowflake to support analytics use cases.<br>\r\n  Advanced proficiency in Tableau Analytics, with experience building\r\n  dashboards, data products, and self-service analytics solutions.<br>\r\n  Proven experience designing and implementing AI/ML-driven solutions within\r\n  modern data architectures, translating advanced analytics into actionable\r\n  business insights.<br>\r\n  Strong leadership skills with a focus on mentorship, strategic\r\n  decision-making, and driving innovation<br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <h3 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:3.75pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222;font-weight:normal\">Round And Mode- technical\r\n  on Zoom.</span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#0B1F28;font-weight:normal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></h3>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '2026-06-04', '21:00:00', '21:45:00', NULL, NULL, 45, '2026-06-04 14:57:02', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-600@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
