width:261.35pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:16.75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Education Details</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"622\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:466.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-right:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:16.75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Master of Science in Computer Science Wright State\r\n  University, Dayton, Ohio, USA<br>\r\n  Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science and Engineering Saveetha School of\r\n  Engineering, Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5;height:17.45pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"348\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:261.35pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:17.45pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Present Company s Address</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"622\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:466.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-right:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:17.45pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>JP Morgan Chase ,OH USA</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6;height:18.7pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"348\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:261.35pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:18.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Vendor Company s Name</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"622\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:466.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-right:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:18.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Goldman Sachs, USA</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n   <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;\r\n    height:4.0pt\">\r\n    <td width=\"626\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:469.5pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;\r\n    height:4.0pt\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:24.65pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"348\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:261.35pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:24.65pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Client Details and Location for the applied position</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"622\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:466.85pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-right:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:24.65pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Goldman Sachs, USA</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Total\r\nCandidate Experience 4+ years</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5pt;\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 249.3pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in; height: 23.6pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>JP Morgan Chase</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:249.3pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Aug 2024- Present</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:249.3pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Capgemini</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"332\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:249.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-right:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:23.55pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Jul 2020 - Jul 2023</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><u><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><br>\r\nJob Description&nbsp;</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> <br>\r\n<b>Skills</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Effective Communication Skills, both written and verbal, sufficient\r\n     for success in a largely asynchronous and distributed work environment.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Highly skilled in designing, developing, testing and deploying\r\n     enterprise web applications using Java, J2EE technologies.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Extensive knowledge and experience in using REST APIs to build\r\n     server side applications with micro services based architecture.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Skilled and experienced in effectively using version control\r\n     systems like GIT and SVN during software development<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Knowledge and experience in using build tools like Gradle and Maven\r\n     to manage build life cycle.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong knowledge of coding best practices, design patterns and\r\n     anti-patterns is must.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Demonstrated capacity to clearly and concisely communicate about\r\n     complex technical, architectural, and/or organizational problems and\r\n     propose thorough iterative solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Comfortable working in a highly agile, intensely iterative software\r\n     development process.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience of owning a project from concept to production,\r\n     including proposal, discussion, and execution.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Self-motivated and self-managing, with excellent organizational\r\n     skills.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience of developing and managing cloud native application,\r\n     would be preferred.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience working on Agile processes (Scrum, Kanban).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Experience with Docker and Kubernetes in production use cases.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Extensive Linux experience, comfortable with shell scripting.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Knowledge on Infrastructure-As-code would good to have.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Positive and solution oriented mindset.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Work\r\nExperience</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">More than 3 years of Software Development experience in Java / J2EE\r\n     related technologies.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">At least 2 years of hands on experience, working in micro service\r\n     architecture.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">At least 2 years of hands on experience, working with Spring\r\n     framework.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">At least 2 years of hands on experience with SQL and any\r\n     Relational/Columnar database.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Working experience on messaging systems like Kafka, Rabbit-MQ is\r\n     preferable.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong knowledge of Data Structures, Algorithms and CS fundamentals\r\n     is a must.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Strong coding and problem solving skills are essential.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Qualification:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Bachelor’s or master’s degree in computer science or related\r\n     technical discipline.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-06-04', '23:30:00', '00:30:00', '2026-06-04 19:32:21', '2026-06-04 19:32:30', 0, '2026-06-04 16:24:39', 4000.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-605@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(606, 8, 243, 9, 1, 4, 'FW: Interview Support (Hiral Lunkad - Digital Marketing Analyst )- 04 June 2026 - ( 2:15 pm – 3:15 pm ET )', '<span data-teams=\"true\"><p><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><strong>Job Description</strong></span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">Strategist, Digital: Marketing Insights &amp; Data Democratization</span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><strong>The Role</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">The Strategist, Digital will support a GM brand with dashboard development, reporting, and advanced analytics focused on performance and operational metrics at both Brand and Dealer levels. This role partners closely with marketing, digital, and analytics stakeholders to translate complex data into clear, actionable insights that enable business decisions. The position plays a key role in understanding brand performance, site behavior, and funnel effectiveness across digital channels. While responding to ad hoc requests, the strategist will also focus on improving efficiency through streamlined data processes and automated reporting solutions.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Partner with cross functional stakeholders to understand business objectives and translate requirements into analytic solutions and reporting deliverables</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Analyze complex data sets and convert insights into clear, business focused narratives that support decision making</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Produce recurring monthly reporting covering brand and site metrics, leads, sales, clickstream data, funnel performance, and trends over time</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Compare performance and behavioral trends across brands, sites, and digital touchpoints to identify opportunities and risks</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Analyze site behavior including mobile versus desktop usage, CTA engagement, heatmaps, clickstream paths, and content engagement</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Support ad hoc analytical requests while identifying opportunities to standardize, automate, and democratize access to data</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Work independently across teams with minimal guidance while managing multiple priorities and deadlines</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><strong>Your Skills &amp; Abilities (Required Qualifications)</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Bachelor’s degree in Math, Economics, Computer Science, Data Science, MIS, or a related quantitative field</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• 3+ years of experience in analytics, digital analytics, or data insights roles</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Strong proficiency in SQL for querying and managing large data sets</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Hands on experience with Adobe Analytics for web and digital performance tracking</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Deep understanding of clickstream data and user behavior analysis</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Proven ability to translate highly technical insights into clear, actionable recommendations for non technical audiences</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Strong data storytelling, communication, and presentation skills</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Curiosity, creativity, and a proactive mindset for researching patterns, trends, and optimization opportunities</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><strong>What Will Give You a Competitive Edge (Preferred Qualifications)</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Experience using Python for analytics, automation, or data transformation</span><br><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">• Familiarity with Azure and or Databricks environments for data processing and analysis</span></p></span>', '2026-06-04', '23:45:00', '00:29:00', '2026-06-04 18:41:25', '2026-06-04 19:29:46', 48, '2026-06-04 16:27:34', 6800.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-606@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
