></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Technology|AI Hyperscalers|AWS\r\n  Agentic AI Services<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Technical Skills 2<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Technology|Cloud Platform|AWS Core\r\n  services<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Technical Skills 3<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Technology|Full stack|Java Full stack<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Technical Skills 4<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Technology|OpenSystem|Python -\r\n  OpenSystem<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Overview</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The Infosys Financial Services unit\r\n  is a global leader in driving digital transformation for financial\r\n  institutions. We specialize in leveraging advanced technologies such as AI,\r\n  cloud, and data-led innovation to help our clients accelerate growth and unlock\r\n  business value. Our AI-driven solutions empower financial institutions to\r\n  make smarter decisions, enhance customer experiences, and achieve operational\r\n  excellence. Join us to be part of a pioneering team that is at the forefront\r\n  of financial services transformation. You\'ll have the opportunity to work\r\n  with cutting-edge AI technologies, collaborate with industry experts, and\r\n  contribute to transformative projects across banking, wealth management, and\r\n  insurance sectors. If you\'re passionate about AI and eager to make a\r\n  significant impact, the Infosys Financial Services unit is the perfect place\r\n  for you to grow and excel.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">In the assigned Job Role of\r\n  Technology Consultant 2, your Area Of Responsibility will be as below:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Contribute to the requirements elicitation process by documenting assigned\r\n  parts of business requirements, in line with guidance provided<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Facilitate software application design discussions, and document design\r\n  decisions to guide the technical team towards building software solutions<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Participate in coding and integrate new features or updates into existing\r\n  applications, with a focus on maintaining system stability<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Conduct code reviews, do changes to the codebase and maintain code\r\n  repositories<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Implement test strategies, analyse results, and coordinate bug fixes to\r\n  uphold the software quality standards<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Develop user training programs, documentation, and support frameworks to\r\n  ensure a smooth transition to new software applications<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Actively participate in resolving production issues and recommend preventive\r\n  strategies to enhance system reliability<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Maintain detailed records of code, testing techniques, and support activities\r\n  to enrich the knowledge base and assist other similar projects<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Your contribution to the team:</b><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A\r\n  collaborative spirit and excellent communication skills.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> The\r\n  ability to handle end to end SDLC phases from requirement gathering to\r\n  implementation.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A\r\n  knack for translating complex requirements into actionable development tasks.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A\r\n  passion for design and hands-on coding experience<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A\r\n  proactive approach to testing, troubleshooting, and refining our\r\n  applications.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> The\r\n  ability to work with cross-functional teams and do software integration.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Required Skill and Experience</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Experience in Core AWS services such as S3, ECS Fargate, EC2, DynamoDB,\r\n  SQS/SNS, Route53, Secrets Manager, Lambda, CloudWatch, AWS Step Functions,\r\n  and API Gateway<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Experience in AWS service APIs, AWS CLI, and SDKs to write applications.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Experience in building applications using AI tools such as GHCP &amp; Kiro,\r\n  integrate with LLM’s etc<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Experience with Docker and database modeling.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Exposure to microservices architecture and serverless frameworks.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Knowledge of monitoring, logging, and security best practices in cloud\r\n  environments.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Preferred Skill and Experience</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Proficiency in developing applications and microservices using Java/ Python<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Experience in front-end technologies including Angular, TypeScript, and Node.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Additional Required Qualifications</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">• Bachelor’s degree or foreign\r\n  equivalent required from an accredited institution. Will also consider three\r\n  years of progressive experience in the specialty in lieu of every year of\r\n  education.<br>\r\n  • This position may require relocation and/or travel to work/project\r\n  location.<br>\r\n  • Candidates authorized to work for any employer in the United States without\r\n  employer-based visa sponsorship are welcome to apply. Infosy