</tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"980\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:735.2pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Overview</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The Infosys Retail, Consumer Goods,\r\n  and Logistics unit stands as a globally respected partner of choice,\r\n  dedicated to helping clients achieve their business goals through\r\n  cutting-edge technology and seamless services. Our unit offers a dynamic\r\n  forum where projects and teams can effectively learn, adopt, and excel in all\r\n  technologies. We foster a vibrant community that leverages shared skills and\r\n  experiences to deliver high-quality, value-enhanced solutions. Join us and\r\n  become part of a team that drives innovation, operational efficiency, and\r\n  sustainable growth in the retail, consumer goods, and logistics sector.\r\n  Together, we can shape the future of these industries and achieve remarkable\r\n  success.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">In the assigned Job Role of\r\n  Technology Consultant 2, your Area Of Responsibility will be as below:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Contribute to the requirements elicitation process by documenting assigned\r\n  parts of business requirements, in line with guidance provided<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Facilitate software application design discussions, and document design\r\n  decisions to guide the technical team towards building software solutions<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Participate in coding and integrate new features or updates into existing\r\n  applications, with a focus on maintaining system stability<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Conduct\r\n  code reviews, do changes to the codebase and maintain code repositories<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Implement test strategies, analyse results, and coordinate bug fixes to\r\n  uphold the software quality standards<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Develop user training programs, documentation, and support frameworks to\r\n  ensure a smooth transition to new software applications<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Actively participate in resolving production issues and recommend preventive\r\n  strategies to enhance system reliability<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">\r\n  Maintain detailed records of code, testing techniques, and support activities\r\n  to enrich the knowledge base and assist other similar projects<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Your contribution to the team:</b><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A\r\n  collaborative spirit and excellent communication skills.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> The\r\n  ability to handle end to end SDLC phases from requirement gathering to\r\n  implementation.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A\r\n  knack for translating complex requirements into actionable development tasks.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A\r\n  passion for design and hands-on coding experience<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A\r\n  proactive approach to testing, troubleshooting, and refining our\r\n  applications.<br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">⦁</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> The\r\n  ability to work with cross-functional teams and do software integration.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Required Skill and Experience</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Experience in Python programming and\r\n  applied experience with a range of LLMs.<br>\r\n  Experience in applying and extending AI agent frameworks (Google ADK,\r\n  LangChain, etc.)<br>\r\n  Hands-on experience developing, deploying, and operating AI agents in\r\n  production<br>\r\n  Experience deploying AI systems in large-scale, hybrid environments with a\r\n  focus on performance and reliability<br>\r\n  Experience in writing SQLils about Core Technical and Domain Skills<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Preferred Skill and Experience</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">A portfolio of deployed agentic\r\n  systems that have delivered significant, measurable impact.<br>\r\n  Experience in evaluation frameworks for AI agents.<br>\r\n  Proven years of software development or machine learning experience.<br>\r\n  Proven expertise in optimizing AI agents for latency, scalability, and cost.<br>\r\n  Experience in Big data would be an added advantage<br>\r\n  A track record of thought leadership or contributions to the field of agentic\r\n  AI.<br>\r\n  M.S. or PhD in computer science, machine learning, or a related field or\r\n  equivalent practical experience<br>\r\n  Understanding of Agile software development frameworks<br>\r\n  Ability to work in teams in a diverse, multi-stakeholder environment\r\n  comprising of Business and Technology teams<br>\r\n  Experience and desire to work in a global delivery environment<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Additional Required Qualifications</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">• Bachelor’s degree or foreign\r\n  equivalent required from an accredited institution. Will also consider three\r\n  years of progressive experience in the specialty in lieu of every year of\r\n  education.<br>\r\n  • This position may require relocation and/or travel to work/project\r\n  location.<br>\r\n  • Candidates authorized to work for any employer in the United States without\r\n  employer-based visa sponsorship are welcome to apply. Infosys is unable to\r\n  provide immigration sponsorship for this role now or in the future.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-05', '01:30:00', '02:30:00', '2026-06-05 19:00:16', '2026-06-05 20:03:39', 63, '2026-06-05 14:19:28', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-622@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
