026, 5:30 PM – 6:15 PM EDT</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Interviewer Details:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:239.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#222222\"><a href=\"mailto:notification@jobvite.com\">notification@jobvite.com</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Detail<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:239.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/wqm-dian-qzu\" target=\"_blank\">https://meet.google.com/wqm-dian-qzu</a><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"320\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:239.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Senior\r\n  Fullstack Engineer: Agentic Infrastructure Team</span></u></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Internet\r\n  Brands is looking for a Senior Fullstack Engineer to join our Agentic AI\r\n  team. You\'ll help build our AI capabilities from the ground up, designing and\r\n  shipping tools, services, and intelligent agents that power AI experiences\r\n  across our entire product ecosystem.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\"><br>\r\n  <b>What You\'ll Do</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Build and ship full-stack AI\r\n       applications: Create frontend experiences and backend systems that power\r\n       real AI capabilities, iterating based on performance and user feedback<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Own the full lifecycle: Take\r\n       projects from idea through production deployment, ensuring quality,\r\n       reliability, and scalability<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Build foundational infrastructure:\r\n       Develop search/retrieval services, tool execution layers (MCP servers),\r\n       workflows, and intelligent agents<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Establish measurement systems:\r\n       Create feedback loops and performance tracking to continuously improve\r\n       AI system behavior<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Solve complex problems: Debug\r\n       issues across the stack, identify root causes, and implement robust\r\n       solutions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">What\r\n  We\'re Looking For</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Foundation\r\n  (Required):<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">5+ years shipping\r\n       production code (frontend and backend)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Strong programming fundamentals:\r\n       We’ll primarily use JavaScript, Python and PHP, but value\r\n       problem-solving skills over specific language expertise<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Backend development experience:\r\n       Building workflows, APIs, state management, and async systems<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Database knowledge: Working with\r\n       both SQL and NoSQL databases<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Frontend skills: Building\r\n       responsive interfaces with modern frameworks (React, Vue, Angular,\r\n       Svelte, etc.)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Experience applying AI/ML in\r\n       production: You\'ve worked with LLMs or ML models in real applications,\r\n       not just tutorials<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Working\r\n  Style:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Ownership mindset: You identify\r\n       problems, take initiative, and see things through<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Pragmatic and adaptable: You\r\n       choose the right tool for the job and aren\'t afraid to learn new\r\n       technologies<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Systematic problem-solver: You can\r\n       debug complex systems and think through tradeoffs<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Good\r\n  to Have:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Knowledge of AI evaluation, error\r\n       analysis, and building feedback loops<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Experience with agentic frameworks\r\n       (LangGraph, Google ADK) or Model Context Protocol (MCP)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none\">Background in information\r\n       retrieval or search systems<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">Sound\r\n  Like You?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\"><br>\r\n  Even if you don\'t check every box, we encourage you to apply. We value\r\n  problem-solving ability, learning agility, and ownership over perfect resume\r\n  matches. If you\'re excited about building production AI systems and have\r\n  strong fullstack fundamentals, we want to hear from you.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">At\r\n  Internet Brands, we carefully consider a wide range of factors when\r\n  determining compensation, including your background and experience. These\r\n  considerations can cause your compensation to vary. We expect the\r\n  compensation for this role to be in the low $100ks<br>\r\n  &nbsp;<br>\r\n  In addition to our awesome culture, we offer a comprehensive benefits package\r\n  designed to support the health and well-being of you and your family. Our\r\n  benefits include health insurance options such as medical, dental, and vision\r\n  coverage, flexible spending accounts (FSA) for medical and dependent care,\r\n  short-term and long-term disability insurance, and life and AD&amp;D\r\n  insurance. We also provide a 401(k) retirement savings plan with a company\r\n  match, paid time off (PTO), paid holidays, commuter benefits as well as\r\n  access to our Employee Assistance Program (EAP) and well-being coaching\r\n  services. In addition, employees can take advantage of voluntary benefits\r\n  such as home, auto and pet insurance, and discounted legal and financial\r\n  services. For more details, feel free to inquire during the interview\r\n  process.<br>\r\n  &nbsp;<br>\r\n  Internet Brands®, headquartered in El Segundo, Calif, is a fully integrated\r\n  online media and software services company focused on four high-value\r\n  vertical categories: Health, Automotive, Legal, and Home/Travel. The\r\n  company\'s properties and platforms include the WebMD, Medscape, and Henry\r\n  Schein ONE networks, which are the global leaders in their markets; Nolo,\r\n  Avvo, and Martindale, which form the largest consumer information provider in\r\n  the legal market; and CarsDirect, Fodor\'s Travel, and many others which are\r\n  leaders in their key vertical markets. Internet Brands\' award-winning\r\n  consumer websites lead their categories and serve more than 250 million\r\n  monthly visitors, while a full range of web presence offerings has\r\n  established deep, long-term relationships with SMB and enterprise clients.\r\n  The company\'s powerful, proprietary operating platform provides the\r\n  flexibility and scalability to fuel the company\'s continued growth. Internet\r\n  Brands is a portfolio company of KKR and Warburg Pincus.<br>\r\n  &nbsp;<br>\r\n  Internet Brands is an equal opportunity employer, and we welcome applicants\r\n  from all backgrounds. We comply with all applicable laws and regulations,\r\n  including the City of Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance\r\n  (FCIHO).<br>\r\n  &nbsp;<br>\r\n  Notice to California residents: you can find information about our privacy\r\n  practices, on: <a href=\"https://www.internetbrands.com/work-with-us/cpra\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.internetbrands.com/work-with-us/cpra</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-05', '03:00:00', '03:45:00', '2026-06-05 21:12:24', '2026-06-05 21:55:57', 43, '2026-06-05 14:22:02', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-624@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `client_id`, `candidate_id`, `poc_id`, `task_type_id`, `status_id`, `title`, `description`, `due_date`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `task_start_time`, `task_end_time`, `duration`, `created_at`, `total_amount`, `payment_status_id`, `payment_mode`, `paid_at`, `reference_no`, `payment_notes`, `email_thread_id`, `invoice_id`, `billing_status`) VALUES
(625, 5, 195, 4, 6, 5, 'FW: Technical Assessment Support -Sahithya kengaigar - Software Engineer, Platform - Speechify - before  06/05/2026', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello Mr. Dipesh, <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">Hope you are doing well. <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">We\r\nrequest you to assign the technical support person to my candidate <b>Sahithya\r\nkengaigar</b> for her technical assessment with the</span><span style=\"font-size:22.5pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:#39424E\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Software Engineer,\r\nPlatform </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">, </span></b><span style=\"color:black\">for the post</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(15, 108, 189); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(15, 108, 189); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Speechify,</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\"> </span></b><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;please find the candidate and Assessment details in\r\nthe format. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Sir, </span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">I kindly request that the assessment be completed\r\ntomorrow, as she is available from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM PST.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(15, 108, 189); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Assessment\r\nDetails</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:.1in\">\r\n  <td width=\"894\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 670.2pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(191, 191, 191); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 0.1in;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Candidate Details:</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:.1in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:.1in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Candidate Name</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:.1in\">\r\n  <h3 style=\"line-height: 15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>Sahithya kengaigar<o:p></o:p></b></h3>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2;height:.1in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:.1in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Technology</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:.1in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">MERN Full Stack Developer<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:3;height:.1in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:.1in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Personal Email id </b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:.1in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"mailto:Kengaigar.sahithya@gmail.com\">Kengaigar.sahithya@gmail.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:4;height:.1in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:.1in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Personal Number (WhatsApp) </b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:.1in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">+ 1 (240) 268 9099<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5;height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"894\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:670.2pt;border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Assessment Details:</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6;height:15.6pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:15.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Deadline </b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:15.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">06/05/2026<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Round of Interview</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Technical Assessment<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:15.6pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:15.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Name of Vendor</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:15.6pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Speechify<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:19.2pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:19.2pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Name of the client</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:19.2pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Speechify<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:329.75pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:329.75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Joining Details</b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:329.75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Hi Sahithya Kengaigar,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Thank you so much for applying to Speechify.\r\n  &nbsp;We\'re excited to invite you to the first round of our technical\r\n  assessment for Tech Lead, Web Core Product &amp; Chrome Extension (USA)\r\n  :&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Here\'s the link to get started:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6IlJLRDlDZ1VBQVo2RWItWmFVMTRjOU4teEJ2Um54UT09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vY29kaW5ndGVzdC5zcGVlY2hpZnkud2Vic2l0ZS9zY2hlZHVsZT9lbWFpbD1zYWhpdGh5YS5rZW5nYWlnYXJAb3V0bG9vay5jb21cdTAwMjZ0eXBlPWxsbS13ZWItdGVzdCIsImludG\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">https://codingtest.speechify.website/schedule?email=sahithya.kengaigar@outlook.com&amp;type=llm-web-test</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">This link is specially generated for you, so\r\n  please don\'t share it with anyone else. Please schedule your assessment as\r\n  soon as possible.&nbsp; Once it’s scheduled, simply return to the same link\r\n  at your test time and you’ll be automatically redirected to the test page.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">If you run into any issues or would prefer to\r\n  receive the test link manually, feel free to reach out before your scheduled\r\n  time and we’ll be happy to assist.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">What to Expect</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">You will be given access to a <b>full-stack\r\n  web application</b> built as a monorepo with a modern\r\n  JavaScript/TypeScript stack. Your task is to <b>implement some new\r\n  frontend feature</b> that integrates with the existing application\r\n  architecture.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">This is not a whiteboard exercise or a take-home\r\n  toy project. You will be working in a production-style monorepo with multiple\r\n  apps, shared packages, and established conventions. Your job is to understand\r\n  the codebase, work within the frontend layer, and deliver a complete,\r\n  well-integrated feature.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">You are encouraged to use any AI or LLM tools</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  EN-IN\"> (Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot, Cursor, etc.) during the assessment.\r\n  We care about what you deliver, not whether you typed every character\r\n  yourself.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Format</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Environment:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Your local\r\n       development setup (Node.js, pnpm)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Deliverable:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> A working feature\r\n       committed with clear, atomic commits<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">What We Evaluate</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n   <thead>\r\n    <tr>\r\n     <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n     <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Criteria<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n     </td>\r\n     <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n     <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">What we\'re looking for<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n     </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n   </thead>\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Functional completeness</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n    EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Does the feature work end-to-end? Can we\r\n    interact with it as expected?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n   <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Frontend fluency</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n    EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Can you build a polished, well-structured UI\r\n    with modern tools and patterns?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n   <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Monorepo awareness</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n    EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Do you understand how shared packages, build\r\n    tools, and workspaces fit together?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n   <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Code quality</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n    12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Is the code well-typed, lint-clean, and\r\n    consistent with the project\'s conventions?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n   <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Testing</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n    font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n    mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Did you write meaningful tests for your new\r\n    work?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Prerequisites</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Have the following installed and ready <b>before</b> the\r\n  assessment begins. Setup issues should not eat into your working time.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Node.js</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> — v22+ (LTS\r\n       recommended). Verify with node --version<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">pnpm</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> — latest stable\r\n       version. Install via npm install -g pnpm and verify\r\n       with pnpm --version<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Git</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> — for cloning the\r\n       repo and committing your work, it is recommended you go through <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6IlJLRDlDZ1VBQVo2RWItWmFVMTRjOU4teEJ2Um54UT09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZHJpdmUuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS9maWxlL2QvMTl1WWI5WmFtaXdKdzBNRDdPVFhiblNFUjlabllDOENXL3ZpZXciLCJpbnRlcm5hbCI6ImEwZmQwYTA0OTU2ZmQ2OTgwOCIsImxpbmtfaW\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">this guide</span></a> for optimal\r\n       experience.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">A code editor</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> — VS Code\r\n       recommended, but use whatever you\'re fastest in<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">A modern browser</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> — Chrome or Firefox\r\n       for testing<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Any AI tools you plan to\r\n       use</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> —\r\n       have them logged in and ready (Claude, Copilot, Cursor, etc.)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Tip:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> After\r\n  installing Node and pnpm, test your setup by cloning any pnpm-based monorepo,\r\n  running pnpm install, and confirming it builds and runs cleanly.\r\n  Monorepo projects can have slower initial installs — knowing your environment\r\n  works ahead of time will give you a head start.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Note:</b> If you are prefer an online environment to take the test,\r\n  feel free to setup the necessary environment with the tools mentioned above\r\n  to avoid any loss of time.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">How to Prepare</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">1. Be comfortable with TypeScript in strict mode<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The entire codebase uses TypeScript with strict\r\n  type checking. You should be comfortable defining types and interfaces,\r\n  working with generics, handling nullable types, and letting the compiler\r\n  guide you. If you\'re used to any or loose typing, tighten up before\r\n  the assessment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">2. Know your way around a monorepo<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The project uses a monorepo structure with\r\n  multiple apps and shared packages managed by a workspace tool and a build\r\n  orchestrator. You should understand how dependencies are shared between\r\n  packages, how builds are cached and orchestrated, and how to add or modify\r\n  shared code without breaking other consumers.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">3. Be proficient with a modern React framework<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The frontend uses React with a modern\r\n  meta-framework. Be comfortable with server-side rendering concepts,\r\n  file-based or configured routing, server functions, and data loading\r\n  patterns. You should know how to build interactive components, manage\r\n  client-side state, and handle form submissions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">4. Understand how to consume APIs<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The application has an existing backend API. You\r\n  should be comfortable calling APIs from the frontend, handling\r\n  loading/error/success states, and wiring response data into your UI. You\r\n  won\'t be building the backend — but you need to understand how to work with\r\n  one.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">5. Be comfortable adapting to the project\'s\r\n  styling conventions<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The project will have an established approach to\r\n  styling components. Rather than preparing for one specific library, focus on\r\n  being adaptable — be ready to read the codebase, understand how existing\r\n  components are styled, and follow suit. Consistency matters more than\r\n  preference.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">6. Know how to write tests<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">The project includes both unit tests and\r\n  end-to-end tests. Be prepared to write tests for your new code — at minimum,\r\n  unit tests for business logic and ideally E2E tests for critical user flows.\r\n  Familiarity with modern testing frameworks for JavaScript/TypeScript is\r\n  expected.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">7. Use AI tools effectively<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Since AI tools are permitted, practice using them\r\n  for navigating unfamiliar codebases, scaffolding boilerplate across the\r\n  stack, debugging type errors, and understanding existing patterns. The best\r\n  candidates use AI to move faster, not to avoid understanding.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Tips for Assessment Day</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Read the brief carefully.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Understand the full\r\n       scope of the feature before touching any code.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Explore the codebase\r\n       first.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n       mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Spend\r\n       time understanding the project structure — where apps live, how shared\r\n       packages work, and how existing features are structured. Trace one\r\n       existing feature to understand how the UI connects to the rest of the\r\n       system.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Work incrementally.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Get a basic version\r\n       of the feature rendering and functional before adding polish. A feature\r\n       that works simply beats a half-finished feature that handles many edge\r\n       cases.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Follow existing patterns.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Look at how existing\r\n       features are structured and mirror that approach. Don\'t introduce new\r\n       libraries or paradigms.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Commit atomically.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"> Separate commits for\r\n       distinct pieces of work show clear thinking.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Suggested Study Resources</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">TypeScript handbook\r\n       (strict mode, generics, utility types)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Monorepo tooling\r\n       (workspace managers, build orchestrators)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Modern React patterns\r\n       (server components, data loading, mutations)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Common component styling\r\n       approaches in React<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">API consumption patterns\r\n       (fetching, caching, state management)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">JavaScript/TypeScript\r\n       testing frameworks (unit and E2E)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">During the test, we require both <b>camera</b> and <b>full\r\n  screen sharing</b> to ensure transparency and authenticity. As the test\r\n  is conducted online without an interviewer, these measures are essential to\r\n  prevent misrepresentation.&nbsp; Please note that the test output, including\r\n  the video recording, will be shared with our internal review team, especially\r\n  in cases where additional context or clarification is needed. Rest assured,\r\n  all recordings are kept strictly confidential and are used solely for\r\n  evaluation purposes by the review team.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">When you\'re done, we\'ll review your results. If\r\n  you pass, you\'ll have a technical interview with an engineer on our team,\r\n  with whom you can also ask any technical questions that you might have. After\r\n  that, our final round interview is with our CEO, Cliff.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">If all goes well, you\'ll receive an offer 1-2\r\n  weeks after you take your first-round technical assessment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Congratulations again, and we look forward\r\n  to reviewing your first-round interview submission.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">PS: Please watch this <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6IlJLRDlDZ1VBQVo2RWItWmFVMTRjOU4teEJ2Um54UT09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8veW91dHUuYmUveWZBTFpKY3VyWnc_c2k9R3Z6UFp5QzlqQUZmQmNRUSIsImludGVybmFsIjoiYTBmZDBhMDQ5NTZmZDY5ODA4IiwibGlua19pZCI6MTV9/f6ace789e8cd716c84966365b2ae68450d395251f43806e92d970fa01ac7cd85\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e.customeriomail.com/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6IlJLRDlDZ1VBQVo2RWItWmFVMTRjOU4teEJ2Um54UT09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8veW91dHUuYmUveWZBTFpKY3VyWnc_c2k9R3Z6UFp5QzlqQUZmQmNRUSIsImludGVybmFsIjoiYTBmZDBhMDQ5NTZmZDY5ODA4IiwibGlua19pZCI6MTV9/f6ace789e8cd716c84966\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">video</span></a> to learn more about Cliff and\r\n  Speechify.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Best Regards,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Speechify Recruiting Team<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:\r\n  0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Job Description: </b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"681\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:510.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.5in\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Description<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Design, develop, and maintain\r\n       robust public and internal APIs for TTS, payments, subscriptions,\r\n       authentication, and consumption tracking.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Oversee and optimize the backend\r\n       API landscape for performance and maintainability.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Build backend services that\r\n       support business and scalability requirements.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Collaborate on B2B solutions for\r\n       enterprise customization and integration needs.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Work closely with\r\n       cross-functional teams to align backend architecture with product\r\n       strategy and user experience.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Contribute to backend services\r\n       related to payments, analytics, subscriptions, new products, text to\r\n       speech, and external APIs.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Requirements<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Proven experience in\r\n       backend development with TS/Node is required.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Direct experience with\r\n       Google Cloud Platform (GCP) is required.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Knowledge of AWS, Azure, or\r\n       other cloud providers.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Ability to ideate and implement\r\n       efficiently while prioritizing work by urgency and impact.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Experience with Docker and\r\n       containerized deployments is preferred.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Experience deploying\r\n       high-availability applications on Kubernetes is preferred.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Strong work ethic and solid\r\n       communication skills.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Ability to thrive in a\r\n       fast-paced, strategic, product-oriented environment.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Benefits<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Competitive compensation of\r\n       $140,000-$200,000 USD per year.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Bonus and stock eligibility\r\n       depending on experience.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">A 100% distributed,\r\n       async-friendly work culture with no office.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Autonomy and room for creativity\r\n       and focus.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Opportunity to make a\r\n       significant impact on a product that helps people with learning\r\n       differences.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">Work on an AI and audio product\r\n       in a rapidly evolving domain.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:\r\n       list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n       &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;letter-spacing:.05pt\">A welcoming atmosphere and a\r\n       company culture that values innovation and drive.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '2026-06-05', '00:00:00', '01:00:00', NULL, NULL, 60, '2026-06-05 14:32:06', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-625@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `client_id`, `candidate_id`, `poc_id`, `task_type_id`, `status_id`, `title`, `description`, `due_date`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `task_start_time`, `task_end_time`, `duration`, `created_at`, `total_amount`, `payment_status_id`, `payment_mode`, `paid_at`, `reference_no`, `payment_notes`, `email_thread_id`, `invoice_id`, `billing_status`) VALUES
(626, 9, 120, 6, 1, 4, 'FW: Technical Interview With WS Development for LOKESH KOLLEPARA - Friday, June 05 - 10:30 AM – 11:00 AM ET', '<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Hello Team,</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Below are the details of the technical interview we received from </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">WS Development</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">for </span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">LOKESH KOLLEPARA</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">. Please assist him with\r\ninterview preparation and support</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Tomorrow\r\n• 10:30 AM – 11:00 AM</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Lokesh\r\nKollepara and Jeff Reichlen<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\r\n id=\"_x0000_t75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\"\r\n path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\r\n <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\r\n <v:formulas>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\r\n </v:formulas>\r\n <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\r\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"x_Picture_x0020_3\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\r\n alt=\"https://www.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/images/calendar/daynumberillustrations/day_number_illustration_05.png\"\r\n style=\'width:71.5pt;height:71.5pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/Admin1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.jpg\"\r\n  o:href=\"cid:image004.jpg@01DCF43B.E389F7F0\"/>\r\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><img width=\"95\" height=\"95\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"height:.993in;width:.993in\" alt=\"https://www.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/images/calendar/daynumberillustrations/day_number_illustration_05.png\" border=\"0\" v:shapes=\"x_Picture_x0020_3\"><!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span class=\"xmsohyperlink\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=https%3A%2F%2Fcalendly.com%2Fevents%2Fde968301-9e5b-4e49-bc58-a792d93348e5%2Fmicrosoft_teams\" target=\"_blank\">https://calendly.com/events/de968301-9e5b-4e49-bc58-a792d93348e5/microsoft_teams</a></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Reichlen,\r\nJeff - Organizer<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">On your\r\nGoogle Calendar</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Conflict\r\nwith Daily Touchpoint at 10:30 AM – 11:00 AM<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Need to\r\nmake changes to this event?</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> <a href=\"https://calendly.com/cancellations/a28f5a3b-39da-4949-afdd-927faea396c8\" target=\"_blank\">Cancel</a> <a href=\"https://calendly.com/reschedulings/a28f5a3b-39da-4949-afdd-927faea396c8\" target=\"_blank\">Reschedule</a><br>\r\n<b>Powered by</b> <a href=\"https://calendly.com/booking-badge?utm_medium=product_referral&amp;utm_source=calendar_invitation&amp;utm_campaign=invitee_html_emails&amp;utm_content=try_calendly_free\" target=\"_blank\">Calendly</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">________________________________________________________________________________<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Microsoft Teams meeting</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Join: </b><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/269006156833749?p=ROh9qTe2hWv7ijbn83\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/269006156833749?p=ROh9qTe2hWv7ijbn83</a><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Meeting ID: 269 006 156 833 749<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">Passcode: tF6qr7Pk<span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"1\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</span></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US\" target=\"_blank\">Need help?</a> | <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MWE3ZmI0NTktMDlkZS00ZjFlLWE4NDQtYThhZDkxN2UyMWYx%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2247a6fd2a-9e58-41ea-93c6-a5fc1bf48cc0%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%223e96083d-cd0f-438a-a8bc-c47993a4504e%22%7d\" target=\"_blank\">System reference</a><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\">For organizers: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId=3e96083d-cd0f-438a-a8bc-c47993a4504e&amp;tenantId=47a6fd2a-9e58-41ea-93c6-a5fc1bf48cc0&amp;threadId=19_meeting_MWE3ZmI0NTktMDlkZS00ZjFlLWE4NDQtYThhZDkxN2UyMWYx@thread.v2&amp;messageId=0&amp;language=en-US\" target=\"_blank\">Meeting options</a><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Job\r\nDescription </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">What\r\nYou’ll Do</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Design\r\nand build AI solutions end-to-end from discovery and scoping through production<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">deployment\r\nand iteration with clear success metrics tied to real business outcomes.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Partner\r\nclosely with stakeholders across leasing, finance, operations, development,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">legal, and\r\nother departments to identify inefficiencies and translate them into concrete\r\nAI<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">and\r\nautomation use cases.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Design\r\nand deploy agentic systems for business workflows, including orchestration\r\nlogic,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">tool and\r\nAPI integrations, retrieval patterns (RAG), guardrails, and human-in-the-loop<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">flows.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Develop\r\ninternal AI applications that put new capabilities directly in the hands of<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">business\r\nteams tools that people actually use, and that change how they work.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Build\r\nrobust evaluation and observability into AI systems, ensuring they stay\r\nreliable and<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">performant\r\nin production across quality, latency, and cost dimensions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Help WS\r\nscale AI responsibly on proprietary data by contributing to governance<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">frameworks,\r\nguardrails, and responsible use practices.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">•\r\nCommunicate clearly with both technical and non-technical audiences, making AI<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">systems\r\nunderstandable, trustworthy, and well-used across the organization.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Create\r\nreusable patterns, templates, and shared infrastructure that enable business<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">units to\r\nprototype safely and accelerate AI adoption company wide.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">What\r\nYou’ll Bring</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">•\r\nBachelor’s or Master’s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, or\r\na<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">related\r\nfield or equivalent experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• 3+ years\r\nbuilding and deploying software, data, or AI/ML solutions in production<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">environments.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Strong\r\nPython skills and comfort integrating APIs and external services.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Hands-on\r\nexperience using modern LLMs and AI frameworks (e.g., Anthropic, OpenAI,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">LangGraph,\r\nor similar) to build production applications.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">•\r\nExperience implementing Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) patterns.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">•\r\nExperience designing and deploying agentic architectures, including multi-step<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">workflows,\r\ntool use, and orchestration logic.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">•\r\nExperience with evaluation pipelines, observability tooling, and feedback loops\r\nto<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">measure AI\r\nsystem quality and performance.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Comfort\r\nworking with enterprise data realities: permissions, sensitive data, messy\r\ninputs,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">and\r\ngovernance requirements.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• Fluency\r\nwith AI coding assistants (e.g., Claude Code) to accelerate development and<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">build more\r\neffective solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">• A\r\nbuilder’s mindset: you’re energized by hard problems, comfortable with\r\nambiguity, and<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">genuinely\r\nexcited about what’s possible in this field.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">•\r\nExcellent communication and stakeholder partnership skills — you know how to\r\nwork<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">directly\r\nwith non-technical business teams, scope problems well, and deliver solutions<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">that land.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Why\r\nThis Role</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">This isn’t\r\nan AI role where you’re maintaining pipelines or building proofs-of-concept\r\nthat never<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">ship.\r\nYou’ll be doing real applied AI work building systems that handle real data,\r\nserve real<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">users, and\r\nsolve problems that matter to a sophisticated organization. You’ll have\r\nautonomy,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">visibility\r\nto senior leadership, and the satisfaction of seeing your work make a\r\nmeasurable<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">difference.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">You’ll\r\nalso be joining at the right moment. WS is a company with deep roots and a\r\nserious<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">commitment\r\nto doing this right, not just fast. The Data &amp;amp; Analytics team is\r\nearly-stage enough<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">that your\r\ncontributions will shape the culture and architecture and established enough\r\nthat you’ll<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">have the\r\nresources and organizational support to actually execute. It’s a rare\r\ncombination.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">If you\r\nwant to do the best work of your career at a company that values craft, takes a\r\nlong view,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">and is\r\ngenuinely committed to using AI to build something exceptional we’d love to\r\nhear from<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">you.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Details:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"925\" style=\"width: 693.5pt;\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:27.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"311\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.25pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 27pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">First\r\n  Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"601\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:450.9pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:27.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Lokesh<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"317\" style=\"width:237.75pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-left:\r\n  none;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:27.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:13.8pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"311\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.25pt;border:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Last\r\n  Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"601\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:450.9pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-right:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">Kollepara<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"317\" style=\"width:237.75pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;border-right:solid #ABABAB 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;height:13.8pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-