ign=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">3.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Fair and competitive\r\n  compensation.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">4.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Career development\r\n  and mentoring and opportunities to grow.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 12pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">5.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Holiday, personal\r\n  and vacation days.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Summary/Objective:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">The Senior Security Analyst is responsible for protecting\r\n  the organization\'s information assets by proactively identifying, analyzing,\r\n  and responding to security threats and vulnerabilities. This role requires\r\n  advanced technical expertise, excellent analytical skills, and the ability to\r\n  collaborate with various teams to ensure a strong and resilient security\r\n  posture. The Senior Security Analyst will also provide guidance and\r\n  mentorship to junior security team members.</span></b><span style=\"color:\r\n  black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Duties and Responsibilities:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Threat Detection\r\n  &amp; Incident Lifecycle Management - Lead end-to-end incident response by\r\n  correlating multi-platform telemetry, coordinating cross-functional war\r\n  rooms, mapping adversary behavior to MITRE ATT&amp;CK, and delivering\r\n  executive-level risk and impact reporting.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Privileged Access\r\n  Management (PAM) &amp; Identity Threat Protection - Administer and mature\r\n  enterprise PAM controls by enforcing secrets rotation, eliminating stale and\r\n  orphaned privileged identities, and aligning identity governance to NIST, ISO\r\n  27001, and CIS standards.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">AI Security &amp;\r\n  Detection Engineering – Establish AI Security guardrails for safe adoption of\r\n  AI models within the organization. This includes public AI models and\r\n  homegrown agentic AI models.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Threat Detection\r\n  &amp; Response using AI – Leverage embedded or custom AI agents to drive\r\n  threat detection and response at scale. Implement SOAR to enhance\r\n  signal-detection automation.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Cloud &amp; SaaS\r\n  Security Operations - Secure cloud and SaaS environments by monitoring\r\n  identity anomalies, enforcing DLP and Conditional Access policies, and\r\n  strengthening cloud governance and threat visibility controls.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Metrics, Reporting\r\n  &amp; Governance - Produce executive-ready security metrics and compliance\r\n  evidence while continuously improving MTTD, MTTR, identity risk indicators,\r\n  and overall detection quality aligned to NIST CSF.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Other duties as\r\n  assigned.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Working Conditions:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Primarily working\r\n  indoors, home and in office environment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">May sit for several\r\n  hours at a time.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Prolonged exposure\r\n  to computer screens.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Repetitive use of\r\n  hands to operate computers, printers, and copiers.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Qualifications:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Education –\r\n  Bachelor’s degree in Cybersecurity, Information Technology, Computer Science,\r\n  or a related discipline (or equivalent experience).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Experience – 4+\r\n  years in security operations, red team/blue‑team functions, incident\r\n  response, privileged access management, and identity threat protection.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Experience in global\r\n  enterprise environments preferred.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Technical Toolkit –\r\n  Hands‑on experience with platforms that support the following: Endpoint\r\n  Detection Response, Identity Protection, SIEM, PAM, Data Loss Prevention,\r\n  Email Security, SOAR platforms, securing AI systems by protecting models and\r\n  training data, implementing governance safeguards to ensure resilient,\r\n  compliant, and auditable AI operations.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Framework Fluency –\r\n  Working knowledge of NIST CSF 2.0, MITRE ATT&amp;CK, ISO 27001, and CIS\r\n  Critical Security Controls.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Certifications\r\n  (Anyone) – CISSP, CEH, CAISP, GCIA, GCED, CySA+, Azure Security Engineer, PAM\r\n  related certifications, cloud security certifications or equivalent.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Soft Skills –\r\n  Exceptional written and verbal communication, ability to brief technical and\r\n  executive audiences, strong cross‑functional collaboration, mentorship\r\n  mindset, structured documentation approach, metrics‑driven and governance‑focused\r\n  execution<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Essential Functions:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 3pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">1.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Perform detailed\r\n  risk assessments and execute tests of data processing system to ensure\r\n  functioning of data processing activities and security measures. Develop and\r\n  implement strategies to manage identified risks efficiently.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 3pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">2.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Develop, implement,\r\n  and oversee Lippert’s security policies and procedures, ensuring they comply\r\n  with legal and regulatory requirements.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 3pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">3.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Regularly review and\r\n  update policies to reflect the changing threat landscape.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 3pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">4.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Serve as the primary\r\n  point of contact during security incidents, coordinating response efforts to\r\n  minimize impact. Develop and maintain an incident response plan and recovery\r\n  procedures to ensure prompt and effective action in the event of a security\r\n  breach.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 3pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">5.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Create and\r\n  administer training programs for staff to ensure that they understand their\r\n  roles and responsibilities related to security, are aware of policy, and are\r\n  equipped to follow best practices.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 3pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">6.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Assess and select\r\n  security technologies and products.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 3pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">7.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Manage relationships\r\n  with vendors to ensure that services and products meet the organization’s\r\n  security requirements and standards.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in 3pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">8.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Communicate complex\r\n  security risks and recommendations to non-technical stakeholders.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Competencies:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">1.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Excellent\r\n  analytical, problem-solving, and decision-making skills.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">2.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Strong\r\n  organizational skills<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">3.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Effective\r\n  communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to present complex\r\n  information to both technical and non-technical audiences.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">4.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Strong time\r\n  management skills<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">5.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">A strong commitment\r\n  to staying current with industry trends, emerging threats, and best practices\r\n  in information security.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Supervisory Responsibility:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">This position does not have supervisory responsibilities\r\n  upon hire.</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Physical Demands:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">While performing the duties of this job, the Team Member\r\n  is regularly required to talk and hear. Specific vision abilities required by\r\n  this job include close vision, distance vision, color vision, peripheral\r\n  vision, depth perception and ability to adjust focus.</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Position Type/Expected Hours of Work:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">This is a full-time salary position with a work-from-home\r\n  option. The position is required to be available 24x7x365 as needed to\r\n  respond to security threats, incidents, and breaches affecting the\r\n  organization.</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Travel:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Travel will be moderate and will include domestic and\r\n  international.</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Preferred Education and Experience:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;color:black\">1.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: