r-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Vendor Company\r\n  &amp; Name&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"430\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 322.35pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Syntax Data</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:24.1pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"255\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 190.95pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 24.1pt; background-color: rgba(171, 171, 171, 0.125);\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Client Details and\r\n  Location for the applied position&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"430\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 322.35pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 0.75pt 0in; height: 24.1pt; background-color: rgba(171, 171, 171, 0.125);\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Syntax Data</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Total No. Of years\r\nExperience : 5+ years</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\nFluentSystemIcons;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_m_-5279587616180519410m_-1285426568286734177x_x_table_0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:41.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 234.25pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 41.25pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:FluentSystemIcons;color:#242424\">PayPal</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"345\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 258.7pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 41.25pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:FluentSystemIcons;color:#242424\">Jan\r\n  2024 – Present</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 234.25pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:FluentSystemIcons;color:#242424\">Deloitte</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"345\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 258.7pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:FluentSystemIcons;color:#242424\">Jan\r\n  2020 – Dec 2022</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:FluentSystemIcons;\r\ncolor:#242424;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 19.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Job\r\nDescription :</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About\r\nSyntax Data</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Syntax\r\nis a financial data and technology company that codifies business models into a\r\nrelational system called Affinity® Data. Using its patented FIS® technology\r\ninspired by the systems sciences, Affinity® Data offers the most comprehensive,\r\ngranular, and accurate product line revenue data available on public companies\r\nin the market. This technology is leveraged to classify and analyze private\r\nmarkets at scale.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Syntax\r\nDirect℠, is an index modelling and analysis platform that uses this abundance\r\nof data to facilitate the near instantaneous creation and ongoing management of\r\nboundless direct indexing solutions and rules-based equity portfolios through a\r\nfully automated platform. Syntax Indices provides customized and proprietary\r\nindices, including core global benchmarks and micro- and macro-thematic, smart\r\nbeta, defined outcome, and target volatility indices. These indices are\r\nfoundational for a range of financial products, such as ETFs, UITs, and\r\nstructured products.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">About\r\nthe Role</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Syntax’s\r\nSoftware Engineering team is a group of highly motivated people with a passion\r\nfor technology. As a Mid-Level or Senior Software Engineer you will be\r\nresponsible for developing, maintaining and innovating on Syntax’s financial\r\nsoftware and data products. You will be tasked with writing optimized,\r\nperformant code, and be expected to contribute to the planning and design of\r\nour products. Your work will contribute to the development of web\r\napplications, data pipelines and third party integrations. You will mentor\r\npeers, conduct code reviews, and provide direct feedback into Syntax’s software\r\nengineering process and improve the efficiency of the team.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Responsibilities\r\nwill include:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Designing, enhancing and maintaining large\r\n     financial databases for use in web applications</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Developing and maintaining database systems\r\n     supporting the construction of performant, complex queries</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Writing well-designed APIs and working with\r\n     backend services</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Creating flexible and intuitive client-facing\r\n     JSON APIs for streaming data</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Implementing dynamic front-end layouts to design\r\n     specifications</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ensuring that mission critical systems and\r\n     services operate smoothly by triaging and resolving operational issues as\r\n     part of a team of on-call engineers</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Collaborating with cross-functional teams to\r\n     identify and solve complex problems</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">The\r\nideal candidate will have:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">A bachelor’s degree or higher in computer science\r\n     or a related discipline</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Proficiency in relational database systems such\r\n     as Postgresql</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Familiarity with JavaScript and at least one\r\n     modern front-end framework</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">An eye for code quality, familiarity with design\r\n     patterns and best practices</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability\r\n     to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced, agile\r\n     environment</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong communication skills and the ability to\r\n     articulate technical concepts effectively to both technical and\r\n     non-technical audiences</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:19.5pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;Preferred\r\nskills:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Experience with python and a dataframe library\r\n     such as Polars or Pandas</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n     19.5pt;mso-lis