e=\"width: 198.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.25pt;\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#242424\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 198.7pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(171, 171, 171) rgb(171, 171, 171) currentcolor; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 33.25pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xelementtoproof\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><u><span style=\"color:black\">Job Description</span></u><span style=\"color:black\"> -&nbsp;</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Responsibilities</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">The\r\n  IT Security Engineer II is a key member of Orrick’s security team, reporting\r\n  to the Director of Threat Response Operations and collaborating daily with\r\n  senior engineers. This position primarily focuses on the security of the\r\n  firm’s business operations and client information. The IT Security Engineer\r\n  II exercises discretion and independent judgment in order to identify,\r\n  investigate, and resolve security incidents, as well as to develop and refine\r\n  security protocols that align with Orrick’s core values and client service\r\n  standards.</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Assess security\r\n  alerts and investigate security incidents. Escalate high-risk findings.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Assess, configure, and troubleshoot intrusion\r\n       detection tools and systems.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Assist in projects to deploy and configure new or\r\n       enhanced security solutions.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Document IT security process, procedure, and incident\r\n       findings.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Stay current with industry trends, emerging threats,\r\n       evolving security tools. Use knowledge to recommend and help implement\r\n       improvements to firm’s security posture.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Assist in maintaining up-to-date and secure baseline\r\n       configurations for firm devices. Document current or future-state\r\n       configurations and exceptions.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Participate in the design and execution of\r\n       vulnerability assessments, penetration tests, and security audits.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">As part of an on-call team, support end users and\r\n       other IT staff with security-related matters.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\"><br>\r\n  Qualifications</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Three or more years\r\n  of experience in the field of IT security.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Ability to interpret and follow incident response\r\n       procedures in a fast-paced environment.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Knowledge of endpoint security, cloud security and\r\n       networking protocols.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Experience with data analysis tools in support of\r\n       incident investigation and reporting.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Strong analytic and communication skills.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Ability to advance goals independently and in\r\n       collaboration with other team members or teams.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Demonstrated commitment to continuous learning and\r\n       ability to evolve with new practices.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Associate or bachelor’s degree in technology or\r\n       cybersecurity a plus.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Experience in the legal, financial, or business\r\n       services industries a plus.<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; align-self: start;\">Industry certifications a plus(e.g., CompTIA\r\n       Security+, CompTIA Network+, CCNA, Microsoft Certifications, CEH).<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Additional\r\n  Requirement</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color:black\">Ability to work\r\n  flexible hours if needed and respond to basic security-related issues under\r\n  supervision.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">Who\r\n  is Orrick? Orrick is a global law firm focused on delivering innovative\r\n  solutions for four sectors: Technology &amp; Innovation, Energy &amp;\r\n  Infrastructure, Finance and Life Sciences &amp; HealthTech. Founded more than\r\n  150 years ago in San Francisco, Orrick today has offices in 25+ markets. We\r\n  are recognized globally for delivering the highest-quality legal advice and\r\n  for our culture of innovation and collaboration.&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-positi