=\"width:1081.85pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:15.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:\r\n    .15pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n    color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.15pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"98\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:73.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description: <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"1457\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:1092.9pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><br>\r\n  JD :</span> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4404441355/?alternateChannel=search&amp;eBP=NON_CHARGEABLE_CHANNEL&amp;trk=d_flagship3_search_srp_jobs&amp;refId=O1rhTgwDgtsklFb%2BMLAw6Q%3D%3D&amp;trackingId=YLRIZkoQlWWAWyE2CgJh7A%3D%3D\">https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4404441355/?alternateChannel=search&amp;eBP=NON_CHARGEABLE_CHANNEL&amp;trk=d_flagship3_search_srp_jobs&amp;refId=O1rhTgwDgtsklFb%2BMLAw6Q%3D%3D&amp;trackingId=YLRIZkoQlWWAWyE2CgJh7A%3D%3D</a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  About the job<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">To help keep everyone safe, we encourage all applicants to\r\n  pay close attention to protect themselves during their job search. When\r\n  applying for a position online you are at risk of being targeted by malicious\r\n  actors looking for personal data. Please be aware we will only reach out via\r\n  email using the domain quanata.com. Anything that does not match those\r\n  domains should be ignored and considered a security risk.</span></i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  Us<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Quanata\r\n  is on a mission to help ensure a better world through context-based insurance\r\n  solutions. We are an exceptional, customer centered team with a passion for\r\n  creating innovative technologies, digital products, and brands. We blend some\r\n  of the best Silicon Valley talent and cutting-edge thinking with the\r\n  long-term backing of leading insurer, State Farm.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Learn\r\n  more about us and our work at quanata.com Our Team From data scientists and\r\n  actuaries to engineers, designers and marketers, we’re a world class team of\r\n  tech-minded professionals from some of the best companies in Silicon Valley,\r\n  and around the world. We’ve come together to create the context-based\r\n  insurance solutions and experiences of the future. We know that the key to\r\n  our success isn\'t just about nailing the technology—it’s hiring the talented\r\n  people who will help us continue to make a quantifiable impact. The role<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">We’re\r\n  looking for an accomplished and well-rounded SDET (Software Development\r\n  Engineer in Test) to join our great team, which is making a huge impact by\r\n  delivering new-age insurance solutions to modern society. You\'ll build robust\r\n  automated test frameworks for API components and data platforms. Our friendly\r\n  team of highly experienced SDETs loves to learn and create. We encourage\r\n  bringing highly efficient solutions that ensure high quality from end to end.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Your\r\n  day-to-day<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Follow agile methodologies and\r\n  participate in scrum meetings and software quality audits for all the phases\r\n  of SDLC.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Responsible for test creation,\r\n  testing a large module or a large component and designing a feature, set of\r\n  features, or whole feature area.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Perform business requirement\r\n  analysis by thoroughly understanding Project Design Document and Business\r\n  Requirement Document.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Develop scalable and robust test\r\n  automation frameworks and scripts using Python, Pytest, BDD frameworks, and\r\n  PyCharm; executes integration, regression, and performance testing using\r\n  industry standard tools. <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Research new or better alternate\r\n  automated testing tools.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Extensively use TestRail Test\r\n  Management tool or equivalent to maintain the test suites, manage the\r\n  automation test results and analyze the test failures.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Works independently and\r\n  collaborates across teams to drive quality initiatives and lead detailed\r\n  software quality discussions.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Demonstrates clarity of thought\r\n  designing end to end test scenarios to work through limited information and\r\n  vague problem definitions; mentor other quality engineers.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  you<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bachelor’s degree or equivalent\r\n  relevant experience and;<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">3 - 5 years of\r\n  relevant experience<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience working with Data\r\n  Platforms, Machine Learning, APIs <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience in integrating\r\n  testing artifacts with CI/CD pipeline. <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">P&amp;C Insurance domain knowledge<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bonus\r\n  points<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Knowledge of Linux,\r\n  databases/SQL/Postgresql, shell scripting <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Knowledge of AWS, DevOps and AI<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong problem solving abilities\r\n  and capable of articulating specific technical topics or assignments<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Desire to automate everything and\r\n  reduce the time required to manually test products<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Salary:\r\n  $156,000 to $209,000*<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">*Please\r\n  note that the final salary offered will be determined based on the selected\r\n  candidate\'s skills, and experience, as well as the internal salary\r\n  structure at Quanata. Our aim is to offer a competitive and equitable\r\n  compensation package that reflects the candidate\'s expertise and\r\n  contributions to our organization.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Additional\r\n  Details: <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Benefits: We provide a wide\r\n  variety of health, wellness and other benefits.These include medical, dental,\r\n  vision, life insurance and supplemental income plans for you and your\r\n  dependents, a Headspace app subscription, monthly wellness allowance and a\r\n  401(k) Plan with a company match.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Work from Home Equipment: Given\r\n  our virtual environment— in order to set you up for success at home, a\r\n  one-time payment of $2K will be provided to cover the purchase of in-home\r\n  office equipment and furniture at your discretion. Also, our teams work with MacBook\r\n  Pros, which we will deliver to you fully provisioned prior to your first day.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Paid Time Off: All employees\r\n  accrue four weeks of PTO in their first year of employment. New parents\r\n  receive twelve weeks of fully paid parental leave which may be taken within\r\n  one year after the birth and/or adoption of a child. The twelve weeks is applicable\r\n  to both birthing and non-birthing parent.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Personal and Professional\r\n  Development: We’re committed to investing in and helping our people grow\r\n  personally and professionally. All employees receive up to $5000 each year\r\n  for professional learning, continuing education and career development. All\r\n  team members also receive LinkedIn Learning subscriptions and access to\r\n  multiple different coaching opportunities through BetterUp.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Location: We are a remote-first\r\n  company for most positions so you may work from anywhere you like in the U.S,\r\n  excluding U.S. territories. <i>For most positions, occasional travel may be\r\n  requested or encouraged but is not required. Some positions might require\r\n  travel per the job description provided to the employee.</i> Employees based\r\n  in the San Francisco Bay Area or in Providence, Rhode Island may commute to\r\n  one of our local offices as desired. <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Hours: We maintain core meeting\r\n  hours from 9AM - 2PM Pacific time for collaborating with team members across\r\n  all time zones. <o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-08', '23:30:00', '00:30:00', '2026-06-08 18:47:21', '2026-06-08 18:48:09', 0, '2026-06-08 14:36:09', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-652@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
