order-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">06/08/2026 – 1:30 PM EST<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Round of Interview<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"426\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:319.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">3<sup>rd</sup> Round <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Client Details<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"426\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:319.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Reinforcelabs.ai<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Joining Details<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"426\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:319.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><br>\r\n  Interview<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Location: This is a Google Meet web\r\n  conference.<br>\r\n  You can join this meeting from your computer, tablet, or smartphone.<br>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fcalendly.com%2Fevents%2F891ad36a-4230-43c5-ac52-b50d2da429f9%2Fgoogle_meet&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Px5Tw3hSVZoQaWIDsuWjk\" target=\"_blank\">https://calendly.com/events/891ad36a-4230-43c5-ac52-b50d2da429f9/google_meet</a><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"426\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:319.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  the docs we answered<br>\r\n  We recommend spending no more than 60 - 90 minutes on it. We\'re less\r\n  interested in perfect answers and more interested in how you think through\r\n  problems, identify risks, communicate tradeoffs, and make decisions. We may\r\n  ask follow-up questions that challenge some of your assumptions, so please\r\n  optimize for clarity of reasoning rather than completeness.Job description<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">About\r\n  Reinforce Labs<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">We\'re\r\n  an early-stage startup disrupting how companies evaluate their AI systems.\r\n  Our customers care deeply about safety, trust, compliance, and revenue\r\n  impact. We help them launch AI confidently: catching regressions before\r\n  customers do, measuring if their systems meet the bar and tying it to\r\n  business outcomes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">We\'re\r\n  small, technical, and agile. The eval space is changing weekly, and we intend\r\n  to define the category. If you want to take part in something from the early\r\n  stages, read on.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><br>\r\n  About the Role<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">We\'re\r\n  hiring a Technical Project Manager to drive execution across the engineering\r\n  organization. You\'ll own the delivery of high-stakes, cross-functional\r\n  programs that span engineering, AI/ML infrastructure, data, and product,\r\n  keeping multiple teams aligned, dependencies unblocked, and leadership\r\n  informed at every step.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">This\r\n  is not a process-for-process\'s-sake role. We\'re looking for someone who can\r\n  sit in a room with engineers, understand the technical tradeoffs being\r\n  debated, identify the real risks, and drive the team to a decision. You\'ll be\r\n  measured on outcomes: did the program ship, did it ship on time, and did it\r\n  ship at the quality bar our users deserve.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">What\r\n  You\'ll Do<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Own end-to-end delivery of cross-functional engineering\r\n  programs from kickoff through launch and post-launch measurement.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Build the plan, then defend it. Break ambiguous objectives\r\n  into milestones, dependencies, and clear owners. Pressure-test scope with\r\n  engineering and product leads. Re-plan when reality changes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Drive rhythm. Run sprint planning, standups, demos,\r\n  retros, and steering committees for the programs you lead. Make every meeting\r\n  earn its place on the calendar.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Surface and unblock risks before they become slips. Track\r\n  dependencies across teams (engineering, data, vendors), escalate cleanly, and\r\n  propose mitigations rather than just flagging problems.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Improve how we work. Identify patterns across programs and\r\n  propose changes to tooling, process, or org design. Pilot, measure, scale\r\n  what works, kill what doesn\'t.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Partner on incident response and post-mortems for the\r\n  programs you own and make sure we learn and the fix actually ships.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">What\r\n  We\'re Looking For<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Required<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Curiosity and ambition<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Program/project management experience in a high-growth\r\n  software environment.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Track record of shipping concrete examples of programs you\r\n  owned end-to-end, the constraints you operated under, and what you delivered.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Technical fluency: ask the right follow-up questions, and\r\n  call out unrealistic estimates.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Outstanding written communication. You can compress a\r\n  complicated status into a paragraph and a complicated plan into a page.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  3.0pt;margin-left:0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt;mso-ligatures:none\">Bonus</span></b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt;\r\n  mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;margin-top:3.0pt;margin-bottom:\r\n       3.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       letter-spacing:.05pt;mso-ligatures:none\">Experience at a AI/ML product\r\n       company.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;margin-top:3.0pt;margin-bottom:\r\n       3.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       letter-spacing:.05pt;mso-ligatures:none\">Background in software\r\n       engineering, data engineering, or technical product management before\r\n       moving into TPM.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;margin-top:3.0pt;margin-bottom:\r\n       3.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       letter-spacing:.05pt;mso-ligatures:none\">Familiarity with AI/ML delivery\r\n       such as agent orchestration, eval pipelines, data labeling workflows.d<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#3C4043;margin-top:3.0pt;margin-bottom:\r\n       3.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n       letter-spacing:.05pt;mso-ligatures:none\">Experience standing up a TPM\r\n       function or program from scratch.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n  3.0pt;margin-left:0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Roboto;\r\n  color:#3C4043;letter-spacing:.05pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-08', '23:00:00', '23:45:00', '2026-06-08 18:39:17', '2026-06-08 18:48:21', 9, '2026-06-08 15:01:30', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-656@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
