span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Round Of Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Initial\r\n  round</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Screening</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview Meeting link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/257918531162803?p=LUQbEY6uQ6a3p1po0v\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/257918531162803?p=LUQbEY6uQ6a3p1po0v</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:29.25pt\">\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;\r\n  height:29.25pt;overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;height:29.25pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Job\r\n  Description</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Waste\r\n  Management (WM), a Fortune 250 company, is the leading provider of\r\n  comprehensive waste and environmental services in North America. We are\r\n  strongly committed to a foundation of operating excellence, professionalism\r\n  and financial strength. WM serves nearly 25 million customers in residential,\r\n  commercial, industrial and municipal markets throughout North America through\r\n  a network of collection operations, transfer stations, landfills, recycling\r\n  facilities and waste-based energy production projects.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">I. Job\r\n  Summary</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">This\r\n  position requires an individual with ambition and curiosity as well as\r\n  engineering technical skills. You will begin your professional journey under\r\n  the mentorship of experienced technical staff and managers. You will dive\r\n  into understanding waste management processes, including landfill operations,\r\n  regulatory permitting and compliance, construction, and environmental\r\n  management systems. In addition to the technical engineering aspects, the\r\n  role is diverse and ever interesting as it requires creativity and active\r\n  participation in multiple functions of the business such as project planning\r\n  and budgeting, accounting, contract negotiations, regulatory interaction,\r\n  construction oversight and operations.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">This is\r\n  an on-site role working at the landfill. Partially in office, partially\r\n  field-based work.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">II.\r\n  Essential Job Duties and Responsibilities</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">To\r\n  perform this job successfully, an individual must be able to perform each\r\n  essential duty satisfactorily. Other minor duties may be assigned. Essential\r\n  duties and responsibilities include the following:</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Develops\r\n  an understanding of all permits governing the construction and operation of\r\n  landfill disposal sites and other operations, such as waste transfer\r\n  stations, collection operations and material recovery facilities, in an\r\n  assigned area.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Works\r\n  with professional consulting firms in preparing regulatory documents, such as\r\n  permit applications, for adherence to regulatory requirements and\r\n  consistency. with site conditions, with an eye toward improving efficiencies\r\n  in safety, design, constructability, quality, compliance and cost savings.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Assists\r\n  and works alongside with senior level WM engineers on construction projects.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Works\r\n  with operation teams to ensure compliance with permits and to prevent or\r\n  resolve operational issues.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Assists\r\n  in the preparation and/or review of engineering, monitoring and environmental\r\n  reports.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Assists\r\n  in environmental reviews and audits.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Works\r\n  with landfill managers to formulate short-term and long-term goals and action\r\n  plans in alignment with WM objectives.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Assists\r\n  in estimating the cost of identified site capital needs and follow-through\r\n  with inclusion in annual budget exercises.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Interacts\r\n  with state and local agencies to foster positive working relationships and to\r\n  insure efficient and effective compliance with regulations.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Reviews\r\n  and understands WM engineering and technical directives and Best Management\r\n  Practices and implement at sites in your assigned area.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Provides\r\n  technical support to operations and environmental staff, such as landfill gas\r\n  technicians, and other functional areas.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Participates\r\n  in continuing education opportunities to maintain and enhance personal skill\r\n  sets and continually look for opportunities to integrate new knowledge,\r\n  technologies and innovations into WM operations.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">III.\r\n  Supervisory Responsibilities</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">This job\r\n  has no supervisory duties.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">IV.\r\n  Qualifications</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">The\r\n  requirements listed below are representative of the qualifications necessary\r\n  to perform the job.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">A.\r\n  Education and Experience</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Education:\r\n  Bachelor\'s Degree (accredited) in Engineering.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Experience:\r\n  No previous years of experience (in addition to education requirement).</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">B.\r\n  Certificates, Licenses, Registrations or Other Requirements</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">None\r\n  Required</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">C. Other\r\n  Knowledge, Skills or Abilities Required</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Possess\r\n  effective written and verbal communication skills.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Ability\r\n  to define problems, collect and interpret data and draw valid conclusions.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Ability\r\n  to interpret documents such as contracts, regulations, permit documents,\r\n  procedural manuals, contracts and safety rules.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Ability\r\n  to follow established procedures and follow directions with minimal\r\n  supervision.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Ability\r\n  to draft reports or data submittals at state and local levels.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Proficiency\r\n  in Microsoft Windows, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, etc.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">V. Work\r\n  Environment</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Listed\r\n  below are key points regarding the work environment of the job. Reasonable\r\n  accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform\r\n  the essential job functions.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Required\r\n  to use motor coordination with finger dexterity (such as keyboarding, tablet\r\n  data entry, office machine operation, etc.).</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Ability\r\n  to exert physical effort in handling objects less than 30 pounds.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Site\r\n  work may involve exposure to physical occupational risks associated with\r\n  chemicals, fuels, wastewater, and construction operations such as dirt,\r\n  odors, noise, weather extremes and/or similar.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Travel\r\n  up to 50% of time within your assigned area.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">Benefits</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Roboto;color:#434343\">At Waste\r\n  Management, each eligible employee receives a competitive total compensation\r\n  package including Medical, Dental, Vision, Life Insurance and Short Term\r\n  Disability. As well as a Stock Purchase Plan, Company match on 401K, and\r\n  more! Our employees also receive Paid Vacation, Holidays, and Personal Days.\r\n  Please note that benefits may vary by site.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-08', '23:00:00', '23:30:00', '2026-06-08 19:37:11', '2026-06-08 20:16:43', 39, '2026-06-08 15:58:34', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-661@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
