 is your official notice period or how soon can you join\r\n  us?<br>\r\n  Work Setup: Are you comfortable with the hybrid setup requiring 3 days a\r\n  office ?<br>\r\n  Scheduling: Are you comfortable with the required shift timings for this role\r\n  - PST ?<br>\r\n  Annual Salary Expectations : What is your current and expected annual Salary\r\n  in US Dollars ?<br>\r\n  VISA What is your current Visa status ?<br>\r\n  Offers: Do you currently have any other active offers in hand?<br>\r\n  Career Goals: What is your primary motivation for leaving your current/past\r\n  role, and what specific growth or changes are you seeking at Genista\r\n  Biosciences?</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:15.0pt;\r\n  margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Kind regards,<br>\r\n  Himani</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:15.0pt;\r\n  margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">4</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:15.0pt;\r\n  margin-left:.5in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#222222\">Dear Candidate,</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-se