\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Deep\r\nunderstanding of object oriented programming principles, constrained random\r\nstimulus, and a coverage driven verification approach.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Scripting\r\nexperience (Python, Perl, TCL, shell programming) highly-desirable.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Interest\r\nto explore AI architectures for convolution, transformer and other kinds of\r\nworkloads</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Self-starter\r\nand highly-motivated to work in a dynamic start-up environment.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">B.S.\r\n(M.S. preferred) degree in Electrical or Computer engineering (or similar\r\nfield).</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Reasons to consider joining Recogni:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ground\r\nfloor opportunity with the team; be part of shaping one of the most exciting\r\nnew companies.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Learning and development\r\nopportunities from a highly diverse and talented peer group, including experts\r\nin a wide range of fields, from Artificial Intelligence &amp; Computer Vision\r\nto Systems &amp; Device Engineering.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Competitive benefits package\r\nincluding Medical, Vision, Dental</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Perks including meals, snacks,\r\ndrinks and us!</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Sharp, motivated co-workers in a\r\nfun office environment</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Flexible work hours &amp; generous\r\nPTO policy</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Recogni\'s culture was built on the following values that are equally\r\nimportant to us as business:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Put\r\npeople first. We only succeed when our people succeed.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ethics and integrity always; Being\r\nopen, honest, and respectful of everyone.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Think Big. Be ambitious and have\r\naudacious goals.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Aim for excellence. Quality and\r\nexcellence count in everything we do.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Own it and get it done. Results\r\nmatter!</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Make Each Person Better together\r\nthan they would be as an individual.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Embrace each others’ differences.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\ncolor:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp; </span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Embrace that there will be\r\ndifferences.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-06-09', '23:00:00', '23:30:00', '2026-06-09 17:32:01', '2026-06-09 18:18:39', 46, '2026-06-09 15:31:29', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-673@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
