eft:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:#313131\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;height:29.25pt;\r\n  overflow:hidden\">\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Title:\r\n  Sr Product Manager</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Location:\r\n  Madison, WI</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Employment\r\n  Type: Contract</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Compensation</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Pay\r\n  Range: $55.00-$58.00 Per HR</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Job\r\n  Summary</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;This\r\n  position is based in Madison, WI, and is a contract role.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;The\r\n  responsibilities include managing product roadmaps, collaborating with\r\n  cross-functional teams, and ensuring product delivery aligns with business\r\n  objectives.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;The\r\n  role requires proficiency in product management methodologies and\r\n  tools.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Description</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;Collaborate\r\n  with product and business teams to define solutions that meet customer\r\n  needs.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;Define\r\n  and drive the product roadmap and end-to-end delivery for a specific product\r\n  area.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;Lead\r\n  business requirement gathering and define user stories and acceptance\r\n  criteria.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;Support\r\n  product teams by contributing to projects of medium complexity.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;Engage\r\n  with stakeholders to ensure their needs are met and delivery teams are\r\n  supported.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;Communicate\r\n  product strategy and roadmap to stakeholders and manage expectations.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">&nbsp;Mentor\r\n  and guide junior team members.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#313131\">Key\r\n  Responsibilities</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#31313