ype:\r\n  W2 Contract</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Duration: 2\r\n  Months&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Location:\r\n  Mountain View CA (Li- Hybrid)</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Pay Range:\r\n  $40.00 - $50.00 Per Hour</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">#LP</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:\r\n  0in\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Job Summary:</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">This role is\r\n  pivotal in transforming AI-native platform through a complete overhaul of its\r\n  delivery, deployment, and operational layers. You will spearhead the product\r\n  strategy to significantly boost developer velocity by making the entire outer\r\n  loop AI-native, from deployment pipelines to autonomous incident resolution.\r\n  The focus is on a fundamental reconstruction of software delivery and\r\n  maintenance for the AI era, not incremental improvements.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  color:black\">Key Responsibilities:</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"m