-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">You\r\n  love change, and living in the gray is energizing to you<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">You\r\n  can\'t wait to get out of bed in the morning &amp; get on with your day<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Segoe UI&quot;;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;\r\n  padding:0in\">Overview </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">We are seeking an experienced Senior DevOps Engineer to\r\n  join our engineering team at RAZR Marketing. In this role, you will be\r\n  responsible for maintaining and optimizing our AWS infrastructure, ensuring\r\n  system reliability, and implementing disaster recovery strategies. Working\r\n  with our enterprise-scale Fibonacci NX monorepo containing 50+ applications\r\n  and libraries, you will focus on operational excellence, system maintenance,\r\n  and AWS best practices to support our customer-facing loyalty platform and banking\r\n  integrations. We are looking for someone that is passionate about maintaining\r\n  reliable and resilient systems in AWS, enjoy implementing operational best\r\n  practices, and thrive in a collaborative environment supporting\r\n  enterprise-scale applications.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in\">Responsibilities </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Infrastructure as Code:<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Design,\r\n  implement, and maintain infrastructure using Pulumi.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Automate\r\n  infrastructure provisioning and configuration management.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Manage\r\n  environment configurations across dev, staging, and production.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Implement\r\n  version control and code review processes for infrastructure changes.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span sty