uot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Monitoring\r\n  and Alerting:<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n  <!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Maintain\r\n  comprehensive monitoring solutions using CloudWatch, application logs, and\r\n  custom metrics.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Configure\r\n  and tune alerting thresholds for infrastructure and application health.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n  </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\r\n  inherit;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;\">Participate\r\n  in on-call rotation for production incidents.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:\r\n  .5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:list .5in;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font', '2026-06-09', '01:00:00', '01:30:00', '2026-06-09 19:32:32', '2026-06-09 20:05:39', 33, '2026-06-09 18:28:44', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-682@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
