nk\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/244103741121839?p=xGvV6SVrSQ9gfQACPb</a><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Meeting ID: 244 103 741 121 839<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Passcode: Rv6rL28F<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"198\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:148.2pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Job Description<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"426\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:319.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Data\r\n  Quality Analyst- Oncology Analytics<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Job\r\n  Description<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">We\r\n  are seeking a Data Quality Analyst to join our Data Governance team.&nbsp;\r\n  This role will partner closely with Data Operations team and play a critical\r\n  role in ensuring data quality, integrity, and usability across our enterprise\r\n  data ecosystem. This position will support initiatives around data\r\n  validation, monitoring, profiling, and governance, enabling our organization\r\n  to deliver trusted data products aligned with the “data as a product” model.<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Responsibilities:<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\r\n  <h2 style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;\r\n  tab-stops:list .5in\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-size:14.