height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Present<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\"> </span>Location<span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n  -.25pt\"> </span>with<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\"> </span>zip<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\"> </span>code</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Company Name</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p>THRIFTBOOK<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Date &amp; Time</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p>Wednesday, June 10, 2026 1:00<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM\r\n  - 1:45<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>PM EST<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Round Of Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Final Round</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\n  Description<br>\r\n  ThriftBooks is the world\'s largest used book retailer! We believe in a\r\n  workplace where respect for our employees matters, where promoting from\r\n  within is how we grow, and where safety comes first in all our decisions and\r\n  planning. At ThriftBooks, your work will help get inexpensive books into the\r\n  hands of people who need them instead of going into landfill. We strive to\r\n  create a friendly work environment with high standards of performance and\r\n  rewards for excellence. We started out small and remember that encouraging\r\n  people to do their best is how we expanded to our current scale.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  If you want to learn about the intersection of technology, innovation, and\r\n  good old-fashioned teamwork, we might be a good fit for you. Wherever you\r\n  start in the company, our hope is that it is a launching point to higher\r\n  achievement. At ThriftBooks, your success is up to you.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  We are looking for a highly analytical and business-focused Senior Financial\r\n  Analyst to support a fast-paced e-commerce environment. This role sits at the\r\n  intersection of Finance, Data, and Operations, driving visibility into\r\n  revenue, margin, and operational performance while partnering directly with\r\n  senior leadership. Operating in a performance-driven environment, this role\r\n  provides exposure to the full company P&amp;L with a strong focus on\r\n  profitability, cash flow, and operational execution.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  &nbsp;<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  WHAT YOU WILL DO:<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Own weekly and monthly financial reporting, delivering clear, actionable\r\n  insights on revenue, margin, and operating income trends<br>\r\n  Build, enhance, and maintain robust financial models to support forecasting,\r\n  planning, and operational decision-making<br>\r\n  Play a key role in annual budgeting, forecasting, and long-range planning,\r\n  with ownership of key P&amp;L components and ongoing performance tracking<br>\r\n  Develop scenario analyses to support pricing, revenue growth, and cost\r\n  optimization (shipping, fulfillment, and supply chain)<br>\r\n  Analyze key operational drivers such as average order value, units per order,\r\n  shipping cost per order, and inventory flow<br>\r\n  Partner cross-functionally with Operations, Supply Chain, and Marketing to\r\n  evaluate initiatives and improve profitability<br>\r\n  Leverage SQL, Snowflake, Mode Analytics, and Power BI to build scalable\r\n  analytics and deliver insights across large datasets<br>\r\n  Prepare and present executive-level reporting, clearly articulating\r\n  performance drivers, risks, and opportunities<br>\r\n  Lead ad hoc analyses and special projects requiring strong financial and\r\n  business acumen .&nbsp; &nbsp;<br>\r\n  <b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">WHAT YOU WILL NEED:<br>\r\n  </span></b><u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">Experience\r\n  &amp; Education</span></u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">5–8+\r\n       years of experience in FP&amp;A, finance, or a related analytical role,\r\n       with exposure to data-driven environments<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong\r\n       foundation in financial analysis, modeling, and accounting principles\r\n       (GAAP)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Advanced\r\n       SQL skills with hands-on experience working with large-scale datasets\r\n       (Snowflake or similar)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Experience\r\n       with Mode Analytics, Power BI, and Planful (or similar planning tools)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Proven\r\n       ability to connect financial results to operational drivers in an\r\n       e-commerce or high-volume environment<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Excellent\r\n       communication and presentation skills with the ability to influence\r\n       senior leadership<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Highly\r\n       self-directed with strong attention to detail and ability to operate in\r\n       a fast-paced environment<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bachelor’s\r\n       degree in Finance, Accounting, or related field (MBA/CPA/CFA a plus, but\r\n       not required)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">What\r\n  You Need to Succeed</span></u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <ul type=\"disc\">\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">A\r\n       true business partner who goes beyond reporting to drive insight and\r\n       decision-making<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Strong\r\n       ownership mindset with the ability to operate across the full business,\r\n       not just within a function<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n   <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Ability\r\n       to simplify complex analyses into clear, actionable recommendations for\r\n       leadership<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', '2026-06-10', '22:30:00', '23:15:00', '2026-06-10 16:54:08', '2026-06-10 17:49:15', 55, '2026-06-10 14:27:36', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-688@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
