(691, 9, 272, 6, 1, 4, 'FW: Technical Interview With Fifth Third Bank for Sony Singh Dewakar | SAP Security Consultant/IT Business Controls Associate  | Wednesday, Jun 10th 2026, 03:30 PM ET - 04:00 PM ET', '<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:\r\nblack;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Hello Team,</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Below are the details of\r\nthe Technical interview we received from Fifth Third Bank for <b>Sony<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">Singh </span>Dewakar</b>.\r\nPlease assist her with interview preparation and support.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Hello Sony,</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">I have attached your interview\r\nschedule for the <b>IT Business Controls Associate - Digital Channels</b> role.\r\nYour video interviews are scheduled for <b>Wednesday, June 10<sup>th</sup>,\r\n2026. </b>The interviewers will reach out to you using the Teams room link\r\nlisted in the interview schedule. I have also provided the Teams information\r\nbelow:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b>Victoria Bolotaeva\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2:30\r\nPM – 3:00 PM\r\nCST&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\nMeeting ID: 275 665 353 156 578 &nbsp;Passcode: 79336293</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b>Vice President\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b>Business Controls\r\nSenior Manager</b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Please create a Teams account prior\r\nto your interviews and download the software to your computer or the app to\r\nyour mobile device. Your device of choice will need to have a\r\nwebcam. The website is <a href=\"https://teams.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://teams.com/</a> and\r\nthere is no charge to create an account.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Please use\r\nthis Teams link for your time with <b>Victoria</b>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Microsoft\r\nTeams meeting</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Join: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/275665353156578?p=399233992923776679\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meeting join\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/275665353156578?p=399233992923776679</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Meeting\r\nID: 275 665 353 156 578<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Passcode: 79336293<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US\" target=\"_blank\">Need help?</a> | <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MjE4ZDVlN2MtMDkxZS00MWMzLWE2ODktODQ0NmRmMTk5MzBm%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22cfddba29-ca2a-450c-a415-595e7fcce8e5%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%2268ec725e-3dfd-4394-98eb-16792b086cea%22%7d\" target=\"_blank\">System reference</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Dial in\r\nby phone</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"tel:+15133589999,,963342031\" target=\"_blank\">+1 513-358-9999,,963342031#</a> United\r\nStates, Madisonville<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/eed15a89-79af-44b7-981d-e85463c09449?id=963342031\" target=\"_blank\">Find a local number</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Phone\r\nconference ID: 963 342 031#<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Join on\r\na video conferencing device</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Tenant\r\nkey: <a href=\"mailto:53@m.webex.com\" target=\"_blank\">53@m.webex.com</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Video\r\nID: 111 623 386 8<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><a href=\"https://www.webex.com/msteams?confid=1116233868&amp;tenantkey=53&amp;domain=m.webex.com\" target=\"_blank\">More info</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">For\r\norganizers: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId=68ec725e-3dfd-4394-98eb-16792b086cea&amp;tenantId=cfddba29-ca2a-450c-a415-595e7fcce8e5&amp;threadId=19_meeting_MjE4ZDVlN2MtMDkxZS00MWMzLWE2ODktODQ0NmRmMTk5MzBm@thread.v2&amp;messageId=0&amp;language=en-US\" target=\"_blank\">Meeting options</a> | <a href=\"https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/usp/pstnconferencing\" target=\"_blank\">Reset\r\ndial-in PIN</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Please\r\nconfirm that you have received this schedule. If you are unable to meet for any\r\nreason, let me know and I will reschedule the interview. If the interviewers\r\nhave scheduling issues and will not be able to conduct the interview, we will\r\nbe in touch with you and I will reschedule the interviews.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-IN\">The use\r\nof AI tools during interviews is strictly prohibited at all times, unless a\r\nprior reasonable accommodation based on a medical condition has been formally\r\nrequested and granted.</span></i><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-IN\">This\r\nprohibition includes, but is not limited to:</span></i><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Real-time\r\ntranscription or translation tools</i>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>AI-generated\r\nresponses or prompts</i>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Remote\r\nassistance or coaching software</i>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Any\r\nform of identity masking or voice alteration</i>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Any\r\nother form of assistance in understanding or responding to queries</i>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-IN\">This\r\nensures we are properly evaluating each candidate’s skills and abilities.</span></i><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">If you\r\nhave any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact me or your\r\nrecruiter, <b>Bridgette Baker</b>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Details:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"925\" style=\"width: 693.5pt; border-spacing: 0px;\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_m_-5279587616180519410m_-1285426568286734177x_x_x_x_table_0\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:27.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"311\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 233.25pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(171, 171, 171); border-image: initial; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 27pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">First\r\n  Name&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n