id windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Round Of Interview</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:34.75pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">1st Round Technical</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:8;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Person</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:9;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Type</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:10;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview Link</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"></td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:11;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Interview JD</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"265\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:198.7pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:33.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\n  Description<br>\r\n  Amazon is seeking a Senior Financial Analyst (SFA) to join the Amazon Photo’s\r\n  Finance team. Amazon Photos empowers consumers to preserve and relive their\r\n  cherished memories. As part of this mission, our service offers unlimited\r\n  photo storage for Prime members and is accessible through multiple platforms\r\n  including iOS, Android, Web, Desktop, Fire Tablet, and Fire TV. Integrated\r\n  with Alexa-enabled devices like the Echo Show and Echo Spot, Amazon Photos\r\n  emerges as a next-generation digital service, building on the successful\r\n  launches of Amazon Music and Amazon Video. We have ambitious goals to scale\r\n  growth and adoption of the service around the world and delight our customers\r\n  with a great product.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  The core of Amazon Photo’s Finance is to build financial models for new and\r\n  ambiguous business opportunities and to clearly articulate the mechanics,\r\n  risks, opportunities, and tradeoffs to business partners. The role is\r\n  responsible for end-to-end financial support for major investments across a\r\n  diverse set of categories including new device hardware investments, software\r\n  services, monetization initiatives, and cost controllership. The SFA will\r\n  support dedicated verticals within the Amazon Photo’s business with the\r\n  opportunity to work with experienced leaders and teams across the world.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  The successful candidate will have shown experience in past roles influencing\r\n  business partners and supporting decision making in rapidly evolving\r\n  environments. The candidate incorporates data into their decision-making\r\n  frameworks and has a strong desire to learn new models while enacting change\r\n  across the business. The role requires a self-starter with the ability to be\r\n  both strategic and analytical in their support of the business, with high\r\n  expectations and room for growth.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Key job responsibilities<br>\r\n  • Lead sales and marketing analysis efforts, providing data-driven insights\r\n  on revenue performance, customer trends, and marketing effectiveness to drive\r\n  strategic decision-making and growth.<br>\r\n  • Support the core financial processes for the business, including: annual\r\n  operating plan, three-year strategic plan, monthly and quarterly business\r\n  reviews.<br>\r\n  • Create, improve and maintain financial models to promote efficient use of\r\n  resources.<br>\r\n  • Perform financial reporting, ad-hoc project analysis and financial modeling\r\n  for a variety of business initiatives and new business models.<br>\r\n  • Lead customer analysis efforts to uncover key insights on behavior,\r\n  retention, and lifetime value.<br>\r\n  • Conduct comprehensive cost-benefit analysis; identifying and communicating\r\n  key drivers to support investment decisions.<br>\r\n  • Educate business partners on financial and non-financial trade-offs, and\r\n  support them to make judgement calls in ambiguous environments where data may\r\n  be scarce or difficult to procure.<br>\r\n  • Communicate information/data in a clear, concise, and unambiguous manner.\r\n  Articulate financial story clearly by adjusting style for different\r\n  audiences. Your clarity in communication will be instrumental in facilitating\r\n  informed decisions.<br>\r\n  • Manage competing priorities, communicate status updates, and drive projects\r\n  to completion.<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Basic Qualifications<br>\r\n  - Bachelor\'s degree in finance, accounting, business, economics, or a related\r\n  analytical field (e.g., engineering, math, computer science)<br>\r\n  - 3+ years of tax, finance or a related analytical field experience<br>\r\n  - Experience in financial modeling, P&amp;L management or analysis<br>\r\n  - Experience applying key financial performance indicators (KPIs) to analyses<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Preferred Qualifications<br>\r\n  - MBA, or CPA<br>\r\n  - 3+ years of building financial and operational reports/data sets that\r\n  inform business decision-making experience<br>\r\n  - Experience delivering forecasting, budgeting, and variance analysis, and\r\n  data interpretation of results, or experience in tax, finance or a related\r\n  analytical field<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Amazon is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the\r\n  basis of protected veteran status, disability, or other legally protected\r\n  status.&nbsp; &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '2026-06-10', '00:30:00', '01:30:00', '2026-06-10 18:21:58', '2026-06-10 19:06:04', 44, '2026-06-10 14:45:59', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-693@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
