herit; font-feature-settings: inherit; outline: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Roboto;color:#494949;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">·\r\nCollaborative and cross-functional working style.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; outline: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Roboto;color:#494949;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">· Successful\r\ndeployment of quadruped robotics in pilot plant(s).</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; outline: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Roboto;color:#494949;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">· Delivery of\r\nminimum viable fleet management platform.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; outline: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Roboto;color:#494949;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">· Integration\r\nof robotic outputs into enterprise maintenance systems.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; outline: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Roboto;color:#494949;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">· Deployment\r\nof at least one AI-based predictive model in production.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; outline: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:Roboto;color:#494949;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">· Presentation\r\nof executive-level roadmap for robotics and AI scale strategy.</span><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:inherit;color:#494949;\r\nborder:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0in;padding:0in;\r\nmso-ansi-la