span style=\"color:black\">Sep\r\n  2024 - Current</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"264\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 2.75in; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">KPMG, India</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 2.5in; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0.75pt 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:12.45pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Jul\r\n  2020 -&nbsp; Aug 2023</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Job Description:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\"><br>\r\nFifth Third Bank is on an exciting <b>digital modernization journey</b>,\r\ntransforming how millions of customers bank through innovative digital\r\nchannels, cloud-native platforms, and modern engineering practices. We are\r\nlooking for an <b>Associate-level team member</b> to support our <b>Digital\r\nChannels and cloud-based platforms</b>, including AWS-powered customer-facing\r\nand enabling services.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">This role sits at the intersection of <b>digital product delivery, cloud\r\ntechnology, and enterprise risk management</b>, partnering closely with product\r\nand technology teams to ensure innovation happens <b>securely, responsibly, and\r\nwithin risk appetite</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">GENERAL\r\nFUNCTION:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">As first line of defense, conducts analysis related to identifying,\r\nassessing, mitigating, and managing risks necessary to comply with new or\r\nchanging laws, regulations, regulatory guidance, and best practices, with a\r\nprimary focus on <b>Digital Channels, cloud platforms, and supporting\r\ntechnologies</b>. Supports Business Controls in advancing <b>risk management\r\nstructures, processes, and tools</b> in support of the organization’s\r\nEnterprise Risk Management (ERM) framework.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">This role partners with stakeholders across Digital, Technology,\r\nProduct, Legal, Compliance, Enterprise Risk, and Audit to support transparency\r\nand understanding of <b>digital operating issues, technology risks, and control\r\neffectiveness</b>. Transforms data into business intelligence by developing and\r\npresenting information and insights to stakeholders. Monitors and manages risks\r\nto ensure compliance and validation of program effectiveness for assigned lines\r\nof business, functional areas, and Bancorp initiatives.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-IN\">Responsible and accountable for risk by openly exchanging ideas and\r\nopinions, elevating concerns, and personally following policies and procedures\r\nas defined. Accountable for doing the right thing for customers and colleagues,\r\nensuring actions and behaviors support a secure, resilient, and positive <b>digital\r\ncustomer experience</b>. While operating within the Bank’s and LOB’s risk\r\nappetites, supports effective identification, assessment, monitoring, and\r\nreporting of risks of all types.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">ESSENTIAL\r\nDUTIES AND RESPONSIBILITIES:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assists Business Controls leadership with the\r\n     development and execution of strategies, controls, policies, and\r\n     procedures to increase effectiveness and efficiency related to <b>digital\r\n     channels, cloud platforms, and technology-enabled processes</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Provides analysis and subject matter support\r\n     related to the identification, assessment, control, monitoring, testing,\r\n     and reporting of <b>technology, cloud, product, third-party, and\r\n     operational risks</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Investigates and assists with root cause analysis\r\n     in instances of actual or potential operational loss, including those\r\n     related to <b>digital platforms or technology processes</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Gathers, analyzes, aggregates, and reports risk\r\n     and control data to support solutions to analytical, implementation, and\r\n     execution challenges.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Prepares reports, dashboards, and presentations\r\n     to communicate key milestones, risks, control gaps, and remediation status\r\n     to management and internal partners.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Maintains awareness of industry best practices,\r\n     regulatory guidance, and emerging risks related to <b>digital\r\n     banking, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and technology operations</b>,\r\n     including OCC Heightened Standards.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Supports the resolution of internal audit,\r\n     compliance, and risk management issues that may impact the classification,\r\n     availability, integrity, or resiliency of <b>digital and cloud-based\r\n     processes</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Identifies and escalates control breakdowns,\r\n     inadequate processes, or unexpected events, and supports corrective action\r\n     efforts in partnership with Business Controls leadership.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Builds effective working relationships with\r\n     internal business control groups and the Second and Third Lines of Defense\r\n     (Legal, Compliance, Enterprise Risk, Cybersecurity, and Audit).</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Collaborates with teams responsible for\r\n     information barriers and data governance to ensure appropriate controls\r\n     over the flow of sensitive information.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assists in the execution of regulatory change\r\n     management activities impacting <b>digital delivery, technology\r\n     platforms, data, and cloud services</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Partners with business and technology managers to\r\n     support issue remediation in alignment with the Bancorp’s issue management\r\n     framework.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assists with maintenance and updates to risk and\r\n     control systems and repositories (e.g., OpenPages, PPM, or similar tools).</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Supports Risk and Control Self‑Assessment (RCSA)\r\n     activities, including facilitation support, documentation, and ratings.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Assists with identification of inherent risks and\r\n     controls for <b>digital products, platforms, and processes</b>, and\r\n     supports governance alignment.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">May assist with associating loss events to\r\n     applicable risks/processes and coordinating root cause analysis and action\r\n     plan development.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Partners with Support Functions and Risk Experts\r\n     to identify applicable Enterprise and Risk Appetite indicators related\r\n     to <b>technology and digital risk</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Supports threshold evaluation, proposed indicator\r\n     changes, and documentation in appropriate tools or systems.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Actively participates in issue remediation and\r\n     validation activities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Executes assigned components of the ERM Scenario\r\n     Analysis program, including <b>technology, cyber, and digital\r\n     disruption scenarios</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Supports development and maintenance of <b>digital\r\n     product and platform inventories</b> and assists with ERM product\r\n     risk review activities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Performs additional duties as assigned, including\r\n     support for special projects, new risk programs, regulatory initiatives,\r\n     or acquisition-related activities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">MINIMUM\r\nKNOWLEDGE, SKILLS AND ABILITIES REQUIRED</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Bachelor’s degree in a related field or\r\n     equivalent experience required; degree in <b>Computer Science, Cyber\r\n     Security, Information Systems, or a technology-related field</b> preferred.\r\n     Master’s degree preferred.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">3–5 years of experience in financial services,\r\n     risk management, business controls, technology risk, or compliance.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Strong analytical skills with the ability to\r\n     interpret and apply policies, standards, and regulations across a complex,\r\n     technology-driven organization.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Working knowledge of <b>digital platforms,\r\n     cloud computing concepts, and technology-enabled business processes</b>.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Ability to communicate effectively, both verbally\r\n     and in writing, with discretion and professionalism.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Collaborative, approachable, and able to build\r\n     trusted relationships across business and technology teams.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"xelementtoproof\" style=\"color: black; margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n     mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">Comfortable working in a fast-paced, evolving\r\n     environment with shifting priorities.</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o: