ght=\"100\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"height:1.041in;width:1.041in\" alt=\"Image removed by sender.\" border=\"0\" v:shapes=\"Picture_x0020_2\"><!--[endif]--></span> <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black\">To streamline the process, I have attached </span><b>Srinivas </b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">resume for your reference.\r\nYour support in expediting the RUC for </span><b>Srinivas</b> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">is highly valued, and I\r\nbelieve it will contribute to a smoother onboarding experience.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black\">If you have any questions or need additional information, please\r\nfeel free to reach out. Thank you in advance for your prompt attention to this\r\nmatter.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black\">NOTE: [ Candidate Full Name:</span></strong><b>Srinivasa Phani\r\nMadhav Marupudi</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b>&nbsp;<b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">]</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [ Candidate Number:</span></strong><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>+1 (940) 290-1405</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">]</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:black\">Thank you,<br>\r\nJinesh</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '2026-06-10', '01:00:00', '01:30:00', '2026-06-10 19:30:29', '2026-06-10 20:08:46', 38, '2026-06-10 19:29:44', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-703@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(704, 8, 279, 9, 4, 2, 'FW: RUC - Jay Sunil Pakale - Financial Analyst', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Team,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I hope you’re doing well.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of my candidates,<b>Jay Sunil Pakale - Financial Analyst</b>,would like\r\nto schedule a <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Aptos\">Resume Understanding Session</span></strong>. I\r\nwould greatly appreciate your assistance in helping him with this.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos\">Candidate Contact Information:</span></strong><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;\">📞</span> Phone:&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n+1 (857) 364-7235<br>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;\">📧</span> Email:\r\n<a href=\"mailto:jay.p@mycvscout.com\" target=\"_blank\">jay.p@mycvscout.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nAptos\">Availability: He is available Today evening time and Tomorrow\r\nmorning time&nbsp;</span></strong><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;\r\n  height:.75pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:1.25in;padding:0in .75pt 0in .75pt;\r\n  height:.75pt\"></td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 0in 10.5pt;height:.75pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br clear=\"all\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-06-10', '02:30:00', '03:00:00', NULL, NULL, 30, '2026-06-10 20:18:50', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-704@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed'),
(705, 17, 280, 12, 8, 3, 'FW: Mock Interview Request', '<p>Hi Sir,<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please arrange mock interview call for AT&amp;T Interview for the Raja\r\nSekhar Chigurupati below at the earliest.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Candidate Name:&nbsp; Raja Sekhar Chigurupati <br>\r\nContact Number:&nbsp; 3144592868<br>\r\nEmail ID: <a href=\"mailto:sekharchigurupati7@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">sekharchigurupati7@gmail.com</a><br>\r\nRole -&nbsp;&nbsp;AI Training Manager<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kindly coordinate with the candidate and schedule the mock calls\r\naccordingly.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nRegards<o:p></o:p></p>', '2026-06-10', '02:30:00', '03:00:00', '2026-06-10 21:15:02', NULL, 30, '2026-06-10 21:06:52', 0.00, 1, 'UPI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'task-705@bsquareg', NULL, 'completed');
