(411, 543, 7, 'Calvin mentioned that I explained my approach and reasoning clearly before starting the implementation. However, after reviewing the output, he pointed out that the solution was not producing the expected result and was still far from a working implementation.\n\nHis feedback was that I should have focused on solving the core problem and getting one working function for the given example first. Instead of moving into thresholds and enhancements, he wanted to see a correct baseline solution before discussing optimizations or edge cases.', '2026-06-01 19:12:01'),
