(115, 402, 0, '1', 'Goldman Sachs', 'Harisha', 3, 3, 3, 2, 'Yes', 'interview went average overall. The candidate initially made mistakes in the coding implementation, and later the support person took access to the candidate’s system, corrected the code, and helped pass all the test cases.\n\nApart from that, the interviewer asked the candidate to dry run the solution and walk through the code step by step with different test cases, but the explanation was not very clear and lacked confidence during the discussion.\n\nThe interviewer also focused on understanding the candidate’s problem-solving approach, edge cases, pointer movement logic, and reasoning behind the algorithm, but the candidate struggled to explain the logic properly in some scenarios.', 'NA', 2.75, '2026-05-21 15:39:33', '2026-05-21 15:39:33');
