(120, 413, 0, '2', 'RealPage', 'N/A', 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Yes', 'The candidate came across as strong, collaborative, and genuinely experienced in end-to-end product management. He communicated clearly, gave practical real-world examples around discovery, roadmap planning, Agile execution, UX collaboration, and go-to-market strategy, and showed a good balance of strategic thinking and hands-on execution without sounding overly rehearsed.\n\nThe next step would typically be a panel-style case study round with Product, UX, and Engineering leadership, where the candidate will walk through a recent project covering roadmap planning, customer discovery, prioritization, execution, go-to-market, metrics, and lessons learned from the overall product lifecycle.', '', 4.00, '2026-05-21 19:53:43', '2026-05-21 19:53:43'),
