(143, 240, 0, '2', 'Lonza', 'N/A', 3, 3, 3, 4, 'Yes', 'The candidate came across as strong and practical, with solid hands-on experience in SAP, forecasting, and variance analysis. He explained concepts clearly, connected well with the interviewerâ€™s workflow, and showed a good balance of technical understanding and business context. Next steps would likely be a second round focusing deeper on SAP specifics, S&OP cycles, and stakeholder scenarios, or a panel interview with team members to assess real-world problem solving and fit within cross-functional teams.', '', 3.25, '2026-05-21 22:29:01', '2026-05-21 22:29:01'),
