(232, 515, 0, '1', 'Addison', 'N/A', 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Yes', 'Interview went well. James presented good communication skills, professionalism, and a positive attitude throughout the interview. He showed a growth-oriented mindset, was receptive to learning new skills, and effectively highlighted his transferable experience in leadership, teamwork, and stakeholder coordination.\nNext Steps: The candidate will be reviewed alongside other second-round applicants by the hiring team. If selected to move forward, he will be contacted regarding the next stage of the process, which will include an orientation discussion and confirmation of start date availability.', '', 4.00, '2026-05-29 22:10:02', '2026-05-29 22:10:02'),
(233, 431, 0, 'Loop Round.', 'Latitude AI', 'Yasmine Concilio, Brandon Schabell', 3, 3, 3, 3, 'Yes', 'Both interviews went well. The first interview was mainly focused on project-based questions, and the second interview was a coding round. Throughout both interviews, we help the candidate with answers to every question.\nFeedback for the candidate:\nThe candidate needs to improve their basic technical knowledge. During the interview, whenever the support person provided an answer, the candidate repeated the exact same answer. Additionally, while reading the answers, the candidate skipped important keywords and explained other words incorrectly, which changed the intended meaning. The candidate should focus on improving technical understanding, communication, and attention to key terms while answering questions.', '--', 3.00, '2026-05-29 22:26:02', '2026-05-29 22:26:02'),
