(238, 505, 0, 'Loop Round', 'Latitude AI', 'Jack Lepird, Mrigesh Kalvani, Parul Kothari', 3, 3, 3, 3, 'Yes', 'All three Round 2 interviews went well, but the third one did not go as smoothly.\nIn the first round, the interviewer asked behavioral questions. We helped the candidate with the answers, and the candidate was able to respond accurately and confidently.\nThe second round was a coding round where the interviewer asked three SQL questions. We assisted the candidate in solving all the questions successfully.\nIn the third round, the interviewer asked a design question related to drawing charts. However, the interviewer did not provide clear instructions about what was expected. Despite this, the candidate was not able to communicate properly and not handle the discussion well.', '--', 3.00, '2026-05-29 22:32:09', '2026-05-29 22:32:09'),
(239, 488, 0, 'Interview', 'Venture global', 'Ngoni Murandu', 3, 2, 3, 3, 'Yes', 'The candidate needs to strengthen their technical skills and improve their ability to handle interview questions independently, as they required extra time during the interview while receiving support.', '--', 2.75, '2026-05-29 22:33:52', '2026-05-29 22:33:52'),
(240, 482, 0, '1st Round.', 'Adobe', '--', 3, 2, 3, 3, 'Yes', 'The candidate needs to strengthen their technical skills and improve their ability to handle interview questions independently, as they required time during the interview while receiving support.', '--', 2.75, '2026-05-29 22:35:19', '2026-05-29 22:35:19'),
(241, 461, 0, '1st Round', 'Thomsonreuters', 'Scott Arnott, Chelsea Wallace', 3, 3, 3, 3, 'Yes', 'The interview went well, and the candidate was able to answer all the questions. However, the candidate appeared to rely on another AI tool to generate responses during the interview rather than preferring the answers from the support person.', '--', 3.00, '2026-05-29 22:38:59', '2026-05-29 22:38:59'),
(242, 441, 0, '2nd Round', 'Wipro', 'Krishna', 3, 3, 2, 3, 'Yes', 'The interview went well. The interviewer asked several in-depth technical questions throughout the interview. We provided support to the candidate with answers during the interview, and the candidate responded by combining their own answer with the support person answer.', '--', 2.75, '2026-05-29 22:44:22', '2026-05-29 22:44:22'),
(243, 462, 0, '1st Round', 'Photon', '--', 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Yes', 'None.', '--', 4.00, '2026-05-29 22:45:47', '2026-05-29 22:45:47'),
(244, 459, 0, '1st Round', 'TCS', '--', 2, 2, 2, 2, 'Yes', 'The interview went okay. The interviewer asked several deep technical questions throughout the interview. The candidate primarily provided their own responses during the interview; however, many of the answers lacked accuracy and depth. Although support and were provided, the candidate did not consistently follow or incorporate the suggested answers effectively.', '--', 2.00, '2026-05-29 22:49:28', '2026-05-29 22:49:28'),
(245, 490, 0, '3rd Round', 'Wipro', '--', 3, 3, 2, 2, 'Yes', 'The interview went okay. Throughout the session, the interviewer asked several in-depth technical questions. We provided support and suggested answers to help the candidate; however, the candidate often chose to give their own responses instead of referring to the guidance provided. As the interview progressed, the candidate appeared to become nervous and struggled to answer questions effectively.\n\nDuring the coding section, the candidate demonstrated gaps in basic technical knowledge. Even when assistance was provided, the candidate had difficulty understanding and implementing the suggested solution correctly. The candidate would benefit from strengthening their fundamental technical skills and coding knowledge before attending similar interviews in the future.', '--', 2.50, '2026-05-29 22:54:42', '2026-05-29 22:54:42'),
