(265, 538, 0, '2nd', 'Integra connect', 'Nate McCasland', 4, 2, 4, 3, 'Yes', 'The interview went well overall. The interviewer was impressed with the answers provided and even compared the candidate with other candidates, mentioning that while many candidates tend to give only general answers, this candidate gave more detailed responses by mentioning specific concepts, examples, and technical terminology, which reflected relevant experience and understanding of the work.\nFrom my side, a few areas of improvement would be helpful for the next round. First, the candidate should thoroughly review the skills and technologies mentioned in the resume, as there were moments where he was unable to answer without support from the provided document. Second, there should be more energy and interest while answering to reflect confidence and engagement. Lastly, avoid repeating the same phrases such as “as per my experience” or “based on my knowledge” before every response and instead speak more directly with stronger technical points. Overall, there may be one or two more rounds, and most likely the candidate will be selected for the next round.', 'https://infinitisyncglobal-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/bhadresh_bedgetechinc_com/IQCx_pk2-fiTSLVMiH_1V6BxAQ-p9Lq8s2C1Tc8UoLsTrog?nav=eyJyZWZlcnJhbEluZm8iOnsicmVmZXJyYWxBcHAiOiJPbmVEcml2ZUZvckJ1c2luZXNzIiwicmVmZXJyYWxBcHBQbGF0Zm9ybSI6IldlYiIsInJlZmVycmFsTW9kZSI6InZpZXciLCJyZWZlcnJhbFZpZXciOiJNeUZpbGVzTGlua0NvcHkifX0&e=NVSjGG', 3.25, '2026-06-01 20:52:09', '2026-06-01 20:52:09'),
(266, 545, 0, 'Hiring Manager Round', 'Box', 'Elham Rastkhadivmasouleh', 4, 4, 5, 4, 'Yes', 'Interview went well overall. Pranita communicated clearly throughout the discussion and was able to explain her project responsibilities, team structure, and technical contributions confidently. She handled follow-up questions well and maintained a good conversational flow during the interview.', '', 4.25, '2026-06-01 21:01:15', '2026-06-01 21:01:15'),
