(286, 552, 0, '1st Round', 'Keystone', 'Anna Lischke', 3, 3, 2, 3, 'Yes', 'The interview went well. The interviewer asked several scenario-based questions, and we provided support for answering each one.\n\nHowever, during the interview, it appeared that the candidate was frequently looking to the side of the laptop while referring to answers. The candidate should be more mindful of this, as it may give the impression of reading from external notes.\n\nAdditionally, the candidate\'s answer delivery needs improvement. The responses were not always presented confidently or accurately. The candidate should focus on improving confidence, communication skills, and the accuracy of responses during interviews.', '--', 2.75, '2026-06-03 14:19:01', '2026-06-03 14:19:01'),
