(296, 578, 0, 'Technical-3', 'Nordstrom', 'Frederick Lloyd', 3, 3, 3, 3, 'Yes', 'Good understanding of Spring Boot, REST APIs, Kubernetes, Dependency Injection, and OOP concepts. Candidate was able to explain technical concepts with practical examples from projects and communicated clearly throughout the discussion. Areas to improve include providing more detailed project-specific examples, deeper explanation of design decisions, and stronger understanding of framework internals and advanced Java concepts. Overall, a good candidate with solid backend experience and good problem-solving approach.', '', 3.00, '2026-06-03 21:04:50', '2026-06-03 21:04:50'),
(297, 579, 0, 'Technical-2', 'Nordstrom', 'NA', 3, 4, 3, 3, 'Yes', 'Need to spend less time exploring files and more time tracing data flow from the source action to the reducer.\n\nShould quickly identify Redux state ownership and locate where state mutations happen.\n\nNeed stronger understanding of React state management patterns including Context API vs Redux, Compound Components, RTK Query, and frontend architecture concepts.\n\nWhile debugging, focus on following the action dispatch path first instead of inspecting multiple components.\n\nCommunication was clear, but answers could be more concise and confident during conceptual React discussions.', '', 3.25, '2026-06-03 21:06:31', '2026-06-03 21:06:31'),
