(299, 581, 0, 'Screening Round', 'THRIFTBOOK', 'N/A', 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Yes', 'Interview went well. Gauri presented herself confidently throughout the discussion and demonstrated a strong blend of FP&A knowledge, business acumen, and technical skills. She communicated well, connected financial analysis to business decisions, showed comfort with executive-facing presentations, and effectively explained how her SQL and analytics background supports her finance work.\n\nNext Steps: Proceed to the next interview round with the FP&A team and senior leadership. The candidate appears to have the analytical mindset, communication skills, and business-oriented approach needed for the role; the next stage should focus on deeper technical assessment around SQL, financial modeling, and e-commerce business case analysis.', '', 4.00, '2026-06-03 21:38:23', '2026-06-03 21:38:23'),
(300, 583, 0, '1', 'VSP', 'No', 4, 1, 3, 1, 'Yes', 'She explains things confidently based on the answers provided by the support team. There are just a few areas where she needs to improve, such as developing a better understanding of her skills and resume. Once she becomes more familiar with these aspects, she will feel even more confident while explaining things.', 'No', 2.25, '2026-06-03 21:41:08', '2026-06-03 21:41:08'),
