(342, 633, 0, '2', 'AtoB', 'NO', 2, 2, 2, 2, 'Yes', 'It was the first round of the interview. She explained her answers well and communicated clearly throughout the discussion. She also presented a dashboard that she had created on her own.\n\nThe interviewer mentioned that they would share and discuss the dashboard with their manager for further evaluation.', 'https://infinitisyncglobal-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/bhadresh_bedgetechinc_com/IQD6X9q2KhTIS5mrW33_x9miAQCkA_gVLvBsCz1pQpiKYgE?nav=eyJyZWZlcnJhbEluZm8iOnsicmVmZXJyYWxBcHAiOiJPbmVEcml2ZUZvckJ1c2luZXNzIiwicmVmZXJyYWxBcHBQbGF0Zm9ybSI6IldlYiIsInJlZmVycmFsTW9kZSI6InZpZXciLCJyZWZlcnJhbFZpZXciOiJNeUZpbGVzTGlua0NvcHkifX0&e=74kONc', 2.00, '2026-06-08 16:11:57', '2026-06-08 16:11:57'),
(343, 649, 0, 'Screening', 'McDonald', 'N/A', 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Yes', 'The candidate was not advanced due to current work authorization restrictions, as the position requires transferable H1B status or permanent work authorization. Based on the screening discussion, he would be a strong candidate for future opportunities once he meets the company\'s visa eligibility requirements.', '', 4.00, '2026-06-08 16:44:43', '2026-06-08 16:44:43'),
